('ANIME', 'One-Punch Man', 'One Punch Man', 'ワンパンマン', 'Saitama has a rather peculiar hobby, being a superhero, but despite his heroic deeds and superhuman abilities, a shadow looms over his life. He''s become much too powerful, to the point that every opponent ends up defeated with a single punch.

