('ANIME', 'A Silent Voice', 'Koe no Katachi', '聲の形', 'After transferring into a new school, a deaf girl, Shouko Nishimiya, is bullied by the popular Shouya Ishida. As Shouya continues to bully Shouko, the class turns its back on him. Shouko transfers and Shouya grows up as an outcast. Alone and depressed, the regretful Shouya finds Shouko to make amends.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"disability","bullying","rehabilitation","language-barrier","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","school","heterosexual","female-protagonist","pov","photography"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '130', '2016', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 722332, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20954-sYRfE5jQRtSB.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20954-f30bHMXa5Qoe.jpg', '#5dbbe4', 20954, '28851', '{"Kyoto Animation"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20954-f30bHMXa5Qoe.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Sy4bPCuzfiQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sy4bPCuzfiQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shouko Nishimiya", "native": "西宮硝子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b80243-RzxE51iUU5eq.png"}, {"name": "Shouya Ishida", "native": "石田将也", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b80491-NK6pxb6oH61P.png"}, {"name": "Yuzuru Nishimiya", "native": "西宮結絃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89335-3fy5a7Qa9h9J.jpg"}, {"name": "Naoka Ueno", "native": "植野直花", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124026-KcQmX7heg7im.jpg"}, {"name": "Miyako Ishida", "native": "石田美也子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124030-YoZ0Drg5cHXX.jpg"}, {"name": "Maria Ishida", "native": "石田マリア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124031-ErVGKjxFH56V.jpg"}, {"name": "Miki Kawai", "native": "川井みき", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124033-UThOFdQGZjq7.jpg"}, {"name": "Satoshi Mashiba", "native": "真柴智", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124034-94AX4zhTaQZB.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '20954'),
('ANIME', 'Your Name.', 'Kimi no Na wa.', '君の名は。', 'Mitsuha Miyamizu, a high school girl, yearns to live the life of a boy in the bustling city of Tokyo—a dream that stands in stark contrast to her present life in the countryside. Meanwhile in the city, Taki Tachibana lives a busy life as a high school student while juggling his part-time job and hopes for a future in architecture.

One day, Mitsuha awakens in a room that is not her own and suddenly finds herself living the dream life in Tokyo—but in Taki''s body! Elsewhere, Taki finds himself living Mitsuha''s life in the humble countryside. In pursuit of an answer to this strange phenomenon, they begin to search for one another.

Kimi no Na wa. revolves around Mitsuha and Taki''s actions, which begin to have a dramatic impact on each other''s lives, weaving them into a fabric held together by fate and circumstance.', '{"Drama","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"urban-fantasy","coming-of-age","memory-manipulation","environmental","urban","rural","gender-bending","primarily-teen-cast","mythology","male-protagonist","heterosexual"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '107', '2016', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 719692, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21519-SUo3ZQuCbYhJ.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21519-1ayMXgNlmByb.jpg', '#0da1e4', 21519, '32281', '{"CoMix Wave"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21519-1ayMXgNlmByb.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k4xGqY5IDBE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4xGqY5IDBE"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/0fffaee7712406fb5dcebb4d6e1805fc1660866426_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Your Name."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/ce4001b091149df6a34f565657c61f561765651420_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - your name."}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mitsuha Miyamizu", "native": "宮水三葉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121514-MGI7JRluscpz.png"}, {"name": "Taki Tachibana", "native": "立花瀧", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121516-kuPVJLNsH5uE.png"}, {"name": "Tsukasa Fujii", "native": "藤井司", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121517-JHgyJZkaxYiW.jpg"}, {"name": "Yotsuha Miyamizu", "native": "宮水四葉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121518-wB61TbuDbqOc.jpg"}, {"name": "Hitoha Miyamizu", "native": "宮水一葉", "role":