('ANIME', 'My Hero Academia Season 2', 'Boku no Hero Academia 2', '僕のヒーローアカデミア２', 'Taking off right after the last episode of the first season. The school is temporarily closed due to security. When U.A. restarts, it is announced that the highly anticipated School Sports Festival will soon be taking place. All classes: Hero, Support, General and Business will be participating. Tournaments all round will decide who is the top Hero in training.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy"}', '{"super-power","superhero","shounen","primarily-teen-cast","school","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast","urban-fantasy","cultivation","primarily-male-cast"}', '25', NULL, NULL, '24', '2017', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 659221, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21856-gutauxhWAwn6.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21856-wtSHgeHFmzdG.jpg', '#e48643', 21856, '33486', '{"bones"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21856-wtSHgeHFmzdG.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tEPneR3KFK8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tEPneR3KFK8"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/6e3a2f0dc647baf6e2e8c1ef09e0d8e31728710159_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 159 - Battle Without a Quirk"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/994f86bfc94acd6e787095bc2fbe098a1728108402_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 158 - A Girl''s Ego"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/460041070a2508747fa15c0830d8475f1727510005_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 157 - I Am Here"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/d75be54b3feba7246243b202d9989ece1726905127_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 156 - It''s a Small World"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/45a70fd2c3849d4bcaba9b6d425e21