('ANIME', 'Chainsaw Man', 'Chainsaw Man', 'チェンソーマン', 'Denji is a teenage boy living with a Chainsaw Devil named Pochita. Due to the debt his father left behind, he has been living a rock-bottom life while repaying his debt by harvesting devil corpses with Pochita.

One day, Denji is betrayed and killed. As his consciousness fades, he makes a contract with Pochita and gets revived as "Chainsaw Man" — a man with a devil''s heart.', '{"Action","Drama","Horror","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","monster-boy","urban-fantasy","male-protagonist","gore","shapeshifting","body-horror","psychosexual","urban","henshin","shounen","monster-girl"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '25', '2022', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 639716, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx127230-DdP4vAdssLoz.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/127230-o8IRwCGVr9KW.jpg', '#6b1a1a', 127230, '44511', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/127230-o8IRwCGVr9KW.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/v4yLeNt-kCU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4yLeNt-kCU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Denji", "native": "デンジ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130102-FO1VHNnEnLlB.png"}, {"name": "Power", "native": "パワー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137079-6yLEUYR3bmpr.png"}, {"name": "Makima", "native": "マキマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137080-UHcynYNjb5ZU.png"}, {"name": "Aki Hayakawa", "native": "早川アキ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137081-TSrUR3mUJL6r.png"}, {"name": "Pochita", "native": "ポチタ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b170266-bBXPkNJnd3mg.png"}, {"name": "Himeno", "native": "姫野", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144596-kvL6SD2litJu.png"}, {"name": "Kishibe", "native": "岸辺", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144593-hdCTT9t54z0s.png"}, {"