('ANIME', 'Assassination Classroom', 'Ansatsu Kyoushitsu', '暗殺教室', 'The students of class 3-E have a mission: kill their teacher before graduation. He has already destroyed the moon, and has promised to destroy the Earth if he can not be killed within a year. But how can this class of misfits kill a tentacled monster, capable of reaching Mach 20 speed, who may be the best teacher any of them have ever had?', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Supernatural"}', '{"assassins","school","teacher","primarily-teen-cast","shounen","ensemble-cast","aliens","anti-hero","super-power","male-protagonist","episodic","guns"}', '22', NULL, NULL, '23', '2015', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 632456, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20755-dWrhs569YGUO.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20755-D4ipww9U8YkC.jpg', '#f1e45d', 20755, '24833', '{"Lerche"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20755-D4ipww9U8YkC.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vAuTJFzjNLs/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vAuTJFzjNLs"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/187816b65d4fa9e042e08ad0e25b68b51472882912_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Assassination Time"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/0a8398efd8cd0b7d0102ee07fa6565431472881972_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Baseball Time"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/bf1fd015c726b2d807f8468150bb077e1472884806_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Karma Time"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/22104387b7165edc1eaf7ea22dfdd7bf1472884504_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Grown-Up Time"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a853a31a3145826c3037214c50fefd651472884925_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "c