('ANIME', 'Steins;Gate', 'Steins;Gate', 'シュタインズ・ゲート', 'Self-proclaimed mad scientist Okabe Rintarou lives in a small room in Akihabara, where he invents "future gadgets" with fellow lab members Shiina Mayuri, his air-headed childhood friend, and Hashida Itaru, an otaku hacker. The three pass the time by tinkering with their latest creation, a "Phone Microwave" that can be controlled through text messages. 

The lab members soon face a string of mysterious incidents that lead to a game-changing discovery: the Phone Microwave can send emails to the past and thus alter history. Adapted from the critically acclaimed visual novel by 5pb. and Nitroplus, Steins;Gate takes Okabe to the depths of scientific theory and human despair as he faces the dire consequences of changing the past.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Thriller"}', '{"time-loop","male-protagonist","urban","primarily-adult-cast","chuunibyou","dissociative-identities","cosmic-horror","tsundere","otaku-culture","heterosexual","femboy","ensemble-cast"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2011', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 599359, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n9253-JIhmKgBKsWUN.jpg', '#ffd6ae', 9253, '9253', '{"WHITE FOX"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n9253-JIhmKgBKsWUN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/27OZc-ku6is/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27OZc-ku6is"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/5b45600ea630f84863be018ed4f441681301790416_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Prologue to the Beginning and End"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/10e9c80b4198f1a929960ca7f0a217b61302629556_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Time Travel Paranoia"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/77905f6d15c138a40287b53762a3c1241303159026_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Parallel Process Paranoia"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/0bf71acbf6c9391ad608ac83c8c75cb81303525699_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Interpreter Rendezvous..."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/a03f7f1e881e475a71ebb8