('ANIME', 'Kaguya-sama: Love is War', 'Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai: Tensaitachi no Renai Zunousen', 'かぐや様は告らせたい～天才たちの恋愛頭脳戦～', 'Known for being both brilliant and powerful, Miyuki Shirogane and Kaguya Shinomiya lead the illustrious Shuchiin Academy as near equals. And everyone thinks they’d make a great couple. Pride and arrogance are in ample supply, so the only logical move is to trick the other into instigating a date! Who will come out on top in this psychological war where the first move is the only one that matters?', '{"Comedy","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school","heterosexual","tsundere","primarily-teen-cast","school-club","surreal-comedy","kuudere","ojou-sama","episodic","slapstick","parody","female-protagonist"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 563111, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101921-ufrjLzhSz7L1.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101921-GgvvFhlNhzlF.jpg', '#e45086', 101921, '37999', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101921-GgvvFhlNhzlF.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IwpJJiQkZzI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IwpJJiQkZzI"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/f3178517627e7c3bc07e5e2d9629e3551547303791_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - I Will Make You Invite Me to a Movie / Kaguya Wants to Be Stopped / Kaguya Wants It"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/83a6a11ce7ffea4af4792326a035c4c71547911382_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Kaguya Wants to Trade / Chika Wants to Go Somewhere / Miyuki Wants to Hide His Ignorance"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/deb541047d5119172fb6bee72d8eab9a1548495969_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Miyuki Shirogane Still 