('ANIME', 'Dr. STONE', 'Dr. STONE', 'Dr.STONE', 'After five years of harboring unspoken feelings, high-schooler Taiju Ooki is finally ready to confess his love to Yuzuriha Ogawa. Just when Taiju begins his confession however, a blinding green light strikes the Earth and petrifies mankind around the world— turning every single human into stone.

Several millennia later, Taiju awakens to find the modern world completely nonexistent, as nature has flourished in the years humanity stood still. Among a stone world of statues, Taiju encounters one other living human: his science-loving friend Senkuu, who has been active for a few months. Taiju learns that Senkuu has developed a grand scheme—to launch the complete revival of civilization with science. Taiju''s brawn and Senkuu''s brains combine to forge a formidable partnership, and they soon uncover a method to revive those petrified.

However, Senkuu''s master plan is threatened when his ideologies are challenged by those who awaken. All the while, the reason for mankind''s petrification remains unknown.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"post-apocalyptic","survival","lost-civilization","educational","male-protagonist","shounen","urban-fantasy","environmental","kingdom-management","ensemble-cast","primarily-teen-cast"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 558750, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx105333-GybuoSoOZfpH.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105333-KWKGvBM8Hyga.jpg', '#c9d678', 105333, '38691', '{"TMS Entertainment"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105333-KWKGvBM8Hyga.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pon9R5n5dMk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pon9R5n5dMk"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/35ffbee5054aba6dce08ae9d34bc28881753966230_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 16 - Medusa Mechanism"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/6c3d9e316ea504970bcb569e2ce15d071753363899_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15 - The Escape"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/2b6c079624473da320f75a1564b204951752759800_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14 - EARTH RACE"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/59a9f1268d2776c68e1a5759df20b4c71752156995_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 13 - Watching the Same Moon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/903fb7df11440f86a55e0872d3a1b8991743078217_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 12 - Reunion"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/d90a32ccf9a00477919f3741e741f3491742476048_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 11 - Those Who Know the Rules; Those Who Make Them"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/204a9df650e4579df829d8ae0527a80c1741873761_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Dirty Roads"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/17fc82798bdc3c91073e7b6d3ad0fe1b1741269540_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Light of Science"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/3e3ca06285a7ec859be9e4d8b53d06c11740664890_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - LOCK ON"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/91134b5e466e9fde1c735904ff2693c41740057867_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - The Two Scientists"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Senkuu Ishigami", "native": "石神千空", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124142-XUO1g7wRqkaT.png"}, {"name": "Kohaku", "native": "コハク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124143-DABUFs3cPNrP.png"}, {"name": "Tsukasa Shishiou", "native": "獅子王司", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124144-KOjcmhunbvYn.png"}, {"name": "Chrome", "native": "クロム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124145-EEvQmsj8jku4.png"}, {"name": "Taiju Ooki", "native": "大木大樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124146-TeXd4r0upuIX.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuzuriha Ogawa", "native": "小川杠", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124147-y3uE9rBepdad.jpg"}, {"name": "Suika", "native": "スイカ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124162-htFFNeC04bzw.jpg"}, {"name": "Gen Asagiri", "native": "あさぎりゲン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127445-oUCyS7Tl8l5D.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '105333'),
('ANIME', 'Violet Evergarden', 'Violet Evergarden', 'ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン', 'A certain point in time, in the continent of Telesis. The great war which divided the continent into North and South has ended after four years, and the people are welcoming a new generation. Violet Evergarden, a young girl formerly known as “the weapon”, has left the battlefield to start a new life at CH Postal Service. There, she is deeply moved by the work of “Auto Memories Dolls”, who carry people''s thoughts and convert them into words. Violet begins her journey as an Auto Memories Doll, and comes face to face with various people''s emotions and differing shapes of love. There are words Violet heard on the battlefield, which she cannot forget. These words were given to her by someone she holds dear, more than anyone else. She does not yet know their meaning but she searches to find it.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"}', '{"rehabilitation","writing","female-protagonist","coming-of-age","kuudere","war","work","orphan","disability","episodic","military","philosophy"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2018', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 551368, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21827-ubzq619ZA2E9.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21827-ROucgYiiiSpR.jpg', '#3586e4', 21827, '33352', '{"Kyoto Animation"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21827-ROucgYiiiSpR.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_grmduuECm4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_grmduuECm4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Violet Evergarden", "native": "ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90169-4wr1Zehnsac8.png"}, {"name": "Cattleya Baudelaire", "native": "カトレア・ボードレール", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124787-1HuZGawvoejp.j