('ANIME', 'Bleach', 'BLEACH', 'BLEACH', 'Ichigo Kurosaki is a rather normal high school student apart from the fact he has the ability to see ghosts. This ability never impacted his life in a major way until the day he encounters the Shinigami Kuchiki Rukia, who saves him and his family''s lives from a Hollow, a corrupt spirit that devours human souls. 

