('ANIME', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Entertainment District Arc', 'Kimetsu no Yaiba: Yuukaku-hen', '鬼滅の刃 遊郭編', 'After visiting the Rengoku residence, Tanjirou and his comrades volunteer for a mission within the Entertainment District, a place where desires are sold and demons dwell. They journey alongside the flashy Sound Hashira, Tengen Uzui, in search of a monstrous foe terrorizing the town. Sworn to slay creatures of the night, the hunt continues.

- The first episode aired with a runtime of ~47 minutes.

- The last episode aired with a runtime of ~33 minutes.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","swordplay","shounen","male-protagonist","oiran","curses","primarily-teen-cast","polyamorous","super-power","gore","primarily-male-cast","ninja"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 488379, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx142329-kET1PIXJv2eW.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/142329-i413SzLmToZN.jpg', '#f19350', 142329, '47778', '{"ufotable"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/142329-i413SzLmToZN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XoJCOAU_72U/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XoJCOAU_72U"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/db617c3bb6a6097394baf707239ff1091554542829_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Cruelty"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/086240450f344f53dbc50765c0ba80cc1555138178_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Trainer Sakonji Urokodaki"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/249734bc86fa3b6c96697b4c0fb623671555745937_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Sabito and Makomo"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/4558b0fe17cec9f89c4e49142be8841a1556355701_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Final Selection"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ef38749be1f8c847f6cf3c543f731d861556965651_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - My Own Steel"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/130e542a4c0e9b2a641f415b307c061c1557582919_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Swordsman Accompanying a Demon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/e37f49ef0692223e459b05861a988bd71558163856_full.jpg",