('ANIME', 'Fire Force', 'Enen no Shouboutai', '炎炎ノ消防隊', 'Year 198 of the Solar Era in Tokyo, special fire brigades are fighting against a phenomenon called spontaneous human combustion where human beings are turned into living infernos called "Infernals.” While the Infernals are first-generation cases of spontaneous human combustion, later generations possess the ability to manipulate flames while retaining human form. Shinra Kusakabe, a youth who gained the nickname Devil’s Footprints for his ability to ignite his feet at will, joins the Special Fire Force Company 8 which composes of other flames users as they work to extinguish any Infernals they encounter. As a faction that is creating Infernals appears, Shinra begins to uncover the truth behind a mysterious fire that caused the death of his family twelve years ago.', '{"Action","Drama","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"firefighters","urban-fantasy","super-power","shounen","demons","urban","religion","male-protagonist","post-apocalyptic","rescue","steampunk","work"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 487348, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx105310-2PKUvoaA6fTn.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105310-ygGL9yweZM2Q.jpg', '#f1bb28', 105310, '38671', '{"david production"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105310-ygGL9yweZM2Q.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Dpae4acLLeA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dpae4acLLeA"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/1e471b8ed579ee8a99daf9cec6e3df651750442231_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 12 - The Madness of the Distant Past"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/5d4b0e8efc2bd6a4634ea3ef659c776e1749837462_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 11 - The Great Kaiju Battlefront"}, 