('ANIME', 'Spirited Away', 'Sen to Chihiro no Kamikakushi', '千と千尋の神隠し', 'On the way to their new home, 10-year-old Chihiro Ogino''s family stumbles upon a deserted theme park. Intrigued, the family investigates the park, though unbeknownst to them, it is secretly inhabited by spirits who sleep by day and appear at night. When Chihiro''s mother and father eat food from a restaurant in the street, angry spirits turn them into pigs. Furthermore, a wide sea has appeared between the spirit world and the human one, trapping Chihiro, the sole human, in a land of spirits. Luckily for her though, a mysterious boy named Haku appears, claiming to know her from the past. Under his instructions, Chihiro secures a job in the bathhouse where Haku works. With only her courage and some new found friends to aid her, Chihiro embarks on a journey to turn her parents back to their original forms and return home.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"female-protagonist","youkai","coming-of-age","curses","magic","mythology","work","isekai","urban-fantasy","gods","witch"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '125', '2001', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 483804, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx199-sWefXJvXkDOb.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/199-Sm2RU5PSqw7T.jpg', '#e45d5d', 199, '199', '{"Studio Ghibli"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/199-Sm2RU5PSqw7T.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ByXuk9QqQkk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ByXuk9QqQkk"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chihiro Ogino", "native": "荻野千尋", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b384-AoWCsQyG0WI7.png"}, {"name": "Haku", "native": "ハク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b385-pKGCy3oYWxRa.png"}, {"name": "Yubaba", "native": "湯婆婆", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4716-8uiG2k2xQKvN.png"}, {"name": "Rin", "native": "リン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5465-ZWJpBoYKPbAY.png"}, {"name": "Kaonashi", "native": "カオナシ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8298-ATUVKng0oyHR.png"}, {"name": "Akio Ogino", "native": "荻野明夫", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8299-0Dcu7zi6ZU9Q.png"}, {"name": "Yuuko Ogino", "native": "荻野悠子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8300-R6Xzdnj5qXJE.png"}, {"name": "Kamajii", "native": "釜爺", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8301-ASa313sbbcI3.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '199'),
('ANIME', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure (TV)', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken (TV)', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 (TV)', 'Beginning its tale in 19th century England, young aristocrat Jonathan Joestar finds himself locked in bitter rivalry with Dio Brando, a low-born boy who Jonathan''s father took under his wing after the death of Dio''s father. Discontent with his station in life, Dio''s fathomless lust to reign over all eventually leads him to seek the supernatural powers of an ancient Aztec stone mask in the Joestar''s possession—an artifact that will forever change the destiny of Dio and Jonathan for generations to come.

Fifty years later, in 1938 New York City, Jonathan''s grandson Joseph Joestar must take up his grandfather''s mission and master the abilities necessary to destroy the stone mask and its immensely powerful creators who threaten humanity''s very existence, the Pillar Men.', '{"Action","Adventure","Supernatural"}', '{"male-protagonist","super-power","primarily-male-cast","urban-fantasy","shounen","cultivation","foreign","primarily-adult-cast","gore","body-horror","historical","travel"}', '26', NULL, NULL, '24', '2012', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 482254, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx14719-VT5dRzTBSZ0w.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14719-m7Hv2AxcNNjM.jpg', '#e49343', 14719, '14719', '{"david production"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14719-m7Hv2AxcNNjM.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/b876abc578c8bf0fab25a4591280cffa1396473017_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Dio the Invader"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/3bdeca2f5d15da22bc6ed241b57c4b2f1396469746_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - A Letter From the Past"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/85f5bb3b8dda19db872851c7c79befda1396472551_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Youth with Dio"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/a2db8fcad13092165dac3ad32ce2e6021396470761_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Overdrive"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/62b14c01ce1ed349afe737cb29acc5141396470873_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - The Dark Knights"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/44da223cfa0e0e42ac2a3d4f7b71a54b1396470452_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Tomorrow''s Courage"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-t