('ANIME', 'That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime', 'Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken', '転生したらスライムだった件', 'Lonely thirty-seven-year-old Satoru Mikami is stuck in a dead-end job, unhappy with his mundane life, but after dying at the hands of a robber, he awakens to a fresh start in a fantasy realm...as a slime monster! As he acclimates to his goopy new existence, his exploits with the other monsters set off a chain of events that will change his new world forever!', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","magic","found-family","super-power","shapeshifting","economics","ensemble-cast","clone","politics","monster-boy","medieval","henshin"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2018', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 467566, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101280-tDxCVJm714nt.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101280-9t7J3774n955.jpg', '#5daef1', 101280, '37430', '{"8-bit"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101280-9t7J3774n955.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QsS7AzXCwKA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QsS7AzXCwKA"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/96743d3dee910bb13b97d3634d2fb0861727450157_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 72 - After the Festival"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/3ddb986a655c0f72b979ff0ce15753121726845050_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 71 - The Labyrinth Is Opened"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/d6bc82d62c6dd3e55f8feefc28d2319f1726223235_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 70 - Settling the Score with the Hero"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/0ffc7c231bd9ffdf5174dcd353d32c0c1725633117_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 69 - The Martial Arts Tournament"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunc