('ANIME', 'Kakegurui', 'Kakegurui', '賭ケグルイ', 'During daylight hours, an exclusive, elite private school prepares its illustrious students for careers in business, politics, and high society. But when darkness falls, the halls of this esteemed establishment transform into an underground gambling den where bright-eyed youngsters learn the timeless art of bluffing, backdoor dealings and social manipulation. In this school for the rich and elite, money is power, and the tyrant of the betting books rules with an iron fist. So when the beautiful Yumeko Jabami upsets the academy hierarchy with her voracious appetite for the thrill of the gamble, the entire student body mobilizes to send her house of cards tumbling down.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological"}', '{"gambling","female-protagonist","school","primarily-female-cast","primarily-teen-cast","ojou-sama","poker","anti-hero","body-horror","school-club","bullying","shounen"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '25', '2017', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 458628, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b98314-TSJykxVwCCQN.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98314-gwgiHiJOj2ls.jpg', '#e44328', 98314, '34933', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98314-gwgiHiJOj2ls.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/v2xJDuM9ZDM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v2xJDuM9ZDM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yumeko Jabami", "native": "蛇喰夢子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121889-ABsurpy5SjOW.png"}, {"name": "Mary Saotome", "native": "早乙女芽亜里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122687-jl1wk9rjO57e.png"}, {"name": "Ryouta Suzui", "native": "鈴井涼太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122688-DdMMQtWRdchY.png"}, {"name": "Sayaka Igarashi", "native": "五十嵐清華", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122690-BgoAty3EQ2GW.png"}, {"name": "Midari Ikishima", "native": "生志摩妄", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122691-ze4qKEiCv2Lz.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaede Manyuda", "native": "豆生田楓", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122692-R27bMvrrWUAW.jpg"}, {"name": "Kirari Momobami", "native": "桃喰綺羅莉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122693-qg2NIaq5h1VD.png"}, {"name": "Yuriko Nishinotouin", "native": "西洞院百合子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/122694-3jxZQhslUVLK.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98314'),
('ANIME', 'Sword Art Online II', 'Sword Art Online II', 'ソードアート・オンライン II', 'One year after the SAO incident, Kirito is approached by Seijiro Kikuoka from Japan''s Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications Department "VR Division" with a rather peculiar request.

That was an investigation on the "Death Gun" incident that occurred in the gun and steel filled VRMMO called Gun Gale Online (GGO). "Players who are shot by a mysterious avatar with a jet black gun lose their lives even in the real world..." Failing to turn down Kikuoka''s bizarre request, Kirito logs in to GGO even though he is not completely convinced that the virtual world could physically affect the real world.



Kirito wanders in an unfamiliar world in order to gain any clues about the "Death Gun." Then, a female sniper named Sinon who owns a gigantic "Hecate II" rifle extends Kirito a helping hand. With Sinon''s help, Kirito decides to enter the "Bullet of Bullets," a large tournament to choose the most powerful gunner within the realm of GGO, in hopes to become the target of the "Death Gun" and make direct contact with the mysterious avatar.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"virtual-world","video-games","male-protagonist","battle-royale","primarily-female-cast","guns","isekai","primarily-teen-cast","swordplay","female-protagonist","death-game","kuudere"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2014', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 454539, '65', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx20594-FhRgZ1H9Istt.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20594-BZOLwqidcS1G.jpg', '#e42843', 20594, '21881', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20594-BZOLwqidcS1G.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K0Ghr_rbJmQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K0Ghr_rbJmQ"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c289e7781e8676b0b88a417ccfefad141432077321_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The World of Swords"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f2620abbec420f275e919e480e82222f1432079867_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Beater"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/6d82a4a5622a6dc02bc072f47258ed011432076330_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Red Nosed Reindeer"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/8f86346833247a7dd0be7225a8f6c07d1432081748_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - The Black Swordsman"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/