('ANIME', 'Solo Leveling', 'Ore dake Level Up na Ken', '俺だけレベルアップな件', 'They say whatever doesn’t kill you makes you stronger, but that’s not the case for the world’s weakest hunter Seong Jin-U. After being brutally slaughtered by monsters in a high-ranking dungeon, Jin-U came back with the System, a program only he could see, that’s leveling him up in every way. Now, he’s inspired to discover the secrets behind his powers and the dungeon that spawned them.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy","super-power","magic","cultivation","survival","shounen","gore","swordplay"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2024', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 452122, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx151807-it355ZgzquUd.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151807-37yfQA3ym8PA.jpg', '#35bbf1', 151807, '52299', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151807-37yfQA3ym8PA.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HkIKAnwLZCw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HkIKAnwLZCw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/5f581a5a1659cd92fa40fe530206b7f41743261371_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 25 - On to the Next Target"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/58a7fe907f22d3001e3afea92c7cb6a01742658638_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 24 - Are You the King of Humans"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/498a19937f80f45b460db38226731b2e1742054666_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 23 - It''s Going to Get Even More Intense"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/d909160a8e78313e1530ed881d57831d1741451245_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 22 - We Need a Hero"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/8be7a55