('ANIME', 'Classroom of the Elite', 'Youkoso Jitsuryoku Shijou Shugi no Kyoushitsu e', 'ようこそ実力至上主義の教室へ', 'Koudo Ikusei Senior High School is a leading school with state-of-the-art facilities. The students there have the freedom to wear any hairstyle and bring any personal effects they desire. Koudo Ikusei is like a utopia, but the truth is that only the most superior students receive favorable treatment.

Kiyotaka Ayanokouji is a student of D-class, which is where the school dumps its "inferior" students in order to ridicule them. For a certain reason, Kiyotaka was careless on his entrance examination, and was put in D-class. After meeting Suzune Horikita and Kikyou Kushida, two other students in his class, Kiyotaka''s situation begins to change.', '{"Drama","Psychological"}', '{"school","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast","survival","blackmail","female-harem","kuudere","battle-royale","boarding-school","coming-of-age","coastal"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2017', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 451305, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98659-WNyPLIZDpGGY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98659-u46B5RCNl9il.jpg', '#bbf1a1', 98659, '35507', '{"Lerche"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98659-u46B5RCNl9il.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iYsx6w5PNno/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iYsx6w5PNno"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/1534c9fb80791aec609a7a69a646ba9a1499855007_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - What is evil? Whatever springs from weakness."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/baed8721c7eb199a3510f5480a85daf61500455126_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - It takes a great talent and skill to conceal one''s talent and skill."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/3567e8e02102088cce9729592c4913f31501036435_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Man is an animal that makes bargains: no other animal does this - no dog exchanges bones with another."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/c8ac32874631ac71df0dce8cac56ef751501537596_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - We should not be upset that others hide the truth from us, when we hide it so often from ourselves."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/72c8a01b2a35d2009ec82e27ebc8971d1502233395_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Hell is other people"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/50787a27e4ad4bc1abb02ca06010fcc51502856899_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - There are two kinds of lies; one concerns an accomplished fact, the other concerns a future duty."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/7667c5006cce53d12ba118edbe8bb8901503443247_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Nothing is as dangerous as an ignorant friend; a wise enemy is to be preferred"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/49651088d9dc22d9344527273d61b97d1504092728_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Abandon all hope, ye who enter here."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/a442c72cdc17055413d0175ff4f92fad1504694413_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Man is condemned to be free."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/43dfdd4172641a4f26c4892d93a29e671505296430_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Every man has in himself the most dangerous traitor of all"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kiyotaka Ayanokouji", "native": "綾小路清隆", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123212-ewZgUQr9vvEM.png"}, {"name": "Suzune Horikita", "native": "堀北鈴音", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123213-jUfrGBXfW7BL.png"}, {"name": "Kikyou Kushida", "native": "櫛田桔梗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123214-Ym9cldopi3yR.png"}, {"name": "Airi Sakura", "native": "佐倉愛里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123215-sMQJk35TqQv4.jpg"}, {"name": "Honami Ichinose", "native": "一之瀬帆波", "r