('ANIME', 'Attack on Titan Final Season Part 2', 'Shingeki no Kyojin: The Final Season Part 2', '進撃の巨人 The Final Season Part 2', 'The war for Paradis zeroes in on Shiganshina just as Jaegerists have seized control. After taking a huge blow from a surprise attack led by Eren, Marley swiftly acts to return the favor. With Zeke’s true plan revealed and a military forced under new rule, this battle might be fought on two fronts. Does Eren intend on fulfilling his half-brother’s wishes or does he have a plan of his own?', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Psychological"}', '{"military","survival","kaiju","male-protagonist","foreign","primarily-male-cast","super-power","henshin","gore","ensemble-cast","primarily-adult-cast","cgi"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 444721, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx131681-5ooUqvqNtee1.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131681-3tNurPRsqsfz.jpg', '#35a1e4', 131681, '48583', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131681-3tNurPRsqsfz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EIVVnLlhzr0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EIVVnLlhzr0"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/b199406edeebc19a7f4e4412d6e1dfcc1365964779_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - To You, 2,000 Years in the Future -The Fall of Zhiganshina (1)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/b9fbee83c6c9a6353383a36b81d861211365965650_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - That Day - The Fall of Zhiganshina (2)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/c7b6627f8880562f34268096f9c55c051366564160_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - A Dim Light in the Darkness of Despair - Humanity Rises Again (1)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/