('ANIME', 'JUJUTSU KAISEN 0', 'Jujutsu Kaisen 0', '呪術廻戦 0', 'Yuta Okkotsu is a nervous high school student who is suffering from a serious problem—his childhood friend Rika has turned into a curse and won''t leave him alone. Since Rika is no ordinary curse, his plight is noticed by Satoru Gojo, a teacher at Jujutsu High, a school where fledgling exorcists learn how to combat curses. Gojo convinces Yuta to enroll, but can he learn enough in time to confront the curse that haunts him?', '{"Action","Supernatural"}', '{"curses","demons","male-protagonist","shounen","urban-fantasy","super-power","urban","magic","cultivation","martial-arts","exorcism","body-horror"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '105', '2021', 'FALL', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 440891, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx131573-rpl82vDEDRm6.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131573-3veuVz5p0z2I.jpg', '#f1c95d', 131573, '48561', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131573-3veuVz5p0z2I.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2docezZl574/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2docezZl574"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/1ef057fb7fd088de798cc4a6571cc4a21605858787_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Ryomen Sukuna"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/4d53a19f3832834b5eeb58494362672f1606459212_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - For Myself"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/16220c7eddb784fbaace05b1e570e3f41607083878_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Girl of Steel"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/dbce9a0bc0e84830bad8048ba7f7f0d11607697009_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Curse Womb Must Die"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/fc26d630619ec