('ANIME', 'Charlotte', 'Charlotte', 'Charlotte(シャーロット)', 'The story centers around the special abilities that occur among a small percentage of boys and girls in puberty. Yuu Otosaka uses his power without others knowing, and lives a fairly normal, average school life. Before him suddenly appears a girl, Nao Tomori. Due to his meeting with her, the fate of special power-users will be exposed.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","urban-fantasy","primarily-teen-cast","urban","school-club","male-protagonist","school","tsundere","female-protagonist","memory-manipulation"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2015', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 437017, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20997-axVYrsIfjtYJ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20997-nE9VyUa08vS0.jpg', '#f1c9a1', 20997, '28999', '{"P.A.WORKS"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20997-nE9VyUa08vS0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hfmRxXVvFYA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hfmRxXVvFYA"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/e08c22f701ca7a3eeda1edd411d663be1435976690_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - I think about others"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/354b66055a79d9fb661c46e2cb1747bf1436467405_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Melody of Despair"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/051cd13f52b676e6fae08bf61d5dbec81437160278_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Love and Flame"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/e8021046afa531841c12e4e8891cc49d1437690619_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Moment of Earnest"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/27c6db9f18fcac58866ecbe2ff992e541438195185_full.jpg", "ki