('ANIME', 'My Hero Academia Season 5', 'Boku no Hero Academia 5', '僕のヒーローアカデミア５', 'The rivalry between Class 1-A and Class 1-B heats up in a joint training battle. Eager to be a part of the hero course, brainwashing buff Shinso is tasked with competing on both sides.

