('ANIME', 'Anohana: The Flower We Saw That Day', 'Ano Hi Mita Hana no Namae wo Bokutachi wa Mada Shiranai.', 'あの日見た花の名前を僕達はまだ知らない。', 'Jinta Yadomi and his group of childhood friends have become estranged after a tragic accident split them apart. Now in their high school years, a sudden surprise forces each of them to confront their guilt over what happened that day and come to terms with the ghosts of their past.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"coming-of-age","hikikomori","male-protagonist","rural","primarily-teen-cast","heterosexual","female-protagonist"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '22', '2011', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 396476, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9989-hImMg6kCMm6I.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9989-pyr6rXlV1oAm.jpg', '#0d78e4', 9989, '9989', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9989-pyr6rXlV1oAm.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oDWkt8wcYh8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oDWkt8wcYh8"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/b4a169079d0628fe2d4e12eceaaf55921574028126_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Super Peace Busters"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f3b77b580184ac2b80077debd67844631574028370_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Hero Menma"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/390cb85f5dfbbfa0ad1876bb2848f0a61574028489_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Menma Search Party"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/b346e0ebaf22f7d117c64b115ca9e3601574028669_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - A White Dress, A Blue Ribbon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/8cb620a96a9dee45da147f630892c0871574028791_full.jpg", "kind": "episode"