('ANIME', 'My Teen Romantic Comedy SNAFU', 'Yahari Ore no Seishun Love Come wa Machigatteiru.', 'やはり俺の青春ラブコメはまちがっている。', 'This romantic comedy revolves around an antisocial high school student named Hikigaya Hachiman with a distorted view on life and no friends or girlfriend. When he sees his classmates talking excitedly about living their adolescent lives, he mutters: "They''re a bunch of liars." When he is asked about his future dreams, he responds: "Not working." A teacher gets Hachiman to join the ''Volunteer Service'' club, which happens to have the school''s prettiest girl: Yukinoshita Yukino.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school","school-club","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","philosophy","anti-hero","heterosexual","love-triangle","kuudere","hikikomori","meta","satire"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2013', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 384959, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx14813-3mNvcKNEQcDs.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14813-urImBxyWJUEw.jpg', '#e4780d', 14813, '14813', '{"Brain''s Base"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/14813-urImBxyWJUEw.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u-bpwWPNEpE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u-bpwWPNEpE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hachiman Hikigaya", "native": "比企谷八幡", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67065-Dhec6tE2yWA9.png"}, {"name": "Yukino Yukinoshita", "native": "雪ノ下雪乃", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67067-gqhgjlni0Bcf.png"}, {"name": "Yui Yuigahama", "native": "由比ヶ浜結衣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67069-6B3xnHfJUO0F.png"}, {"name": "Saika Totsuka", "native": "戸塚彩加", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn