('ANIME', 'Fairy Tail', 'FAIRY TAIL', 'FAIRY TAIL', 'Across the Fiore kingdom, wizards join guilds and make their pay by filling magical needs—but one guild has a reputation as the roughest, rowdiest, most dangerous of all: Fairy Tail!

When four young Fairy Tail members unite, their bond is forged by a power found in neither muscle nor magic and grows stronger with every mission. Whatever you do, don''t mess with these friends or you''ll get a taste of Natsu''s flaming fist or Gray''s ice hammer, suffer a painful blow from one of Lucy''s celestial spirits or catch the edge of Erza''s mighty blade! Whether they''re stopping demons from devastating the world or wrestling in the mess hall, this mystical team manages to inflict as much damage to their rivals as they do to the surrounding area!', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","shounen","fairy-tale","found-family","ensemble-cast","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","dragons","anthropomorphism","super-power","work","travel"}', '175', NULL, NULL, '24', '2009', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 382538, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b6702-KI4qgSMyI8Pm.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6702-VSHyctSAeUBS.jpg', '#e45d50', 6702, '6702', '{"Satelight","A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6702-VSHyctSAeUBS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mAAKPx-ndAg/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mAAKPx-ndAg"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/00aacbb8bcfe784b3c8e728b269af0821644957412_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Fairy Tail"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/32624e79a0157116628372a652c3cdfc1644957369_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Fire Dragon, Monkey, and Bull"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/739da031a91aa12c2b43a12965b5abb71644957421_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Infiltrate the Everlue Mansion"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/194008a9d1e304079d1b535e3278ee3c164