('ANIME', 'I Want to Eat Your Pancreas', 'Kimi no Suizou wo Tabetai', '君の膵臓をたべたい', 'Spring time in April and the last of the cherry blossoms are still in bloom. The usually aloof bookworm with no interest in others comes across a book in a hospital waiting room. Handwritten on the cover are the words: "Living with Dying." He soon discovers that it is a diary kept by his very popular and genuinely cheerful classmate, Sakura Yamauchi, who reveals to him that she is secretly suffering from a pancreatic illness and only has a limited time left. It is at this moment that she gains just one more person to share her secret.

Trying to maintain a normal life as much as possible, Sakura is determined to live her life to the fullest until the very last day. As her free spirit and unpredictable actions throw him for a loop, his heart begins to gradually change.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","male-protagonist","philosophy","female-protagonist","heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","classic-literature","rehabilitation"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '108', '2018', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 378144, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx99750-pNyly9d3MEgV.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99750-KPFW2Jv03b2B.jpg', '#f1c9f1', 99750, '36098', '{"Studio VOLN"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99750-KPFW2Jv03b2B.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MmoBvmJA9XI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MmoBvmJA9XI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Haruki Shiga", "native": "志賀春樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127116-u2fIKMSYDdVj.png"}, {"name": "Sakura Yamauchi", "native": "山内桜良", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127118-XEvgt4yHSkQv.jpg"}, {"name": "Issei Miyata", "native": "宮田一晴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133276-4KX7vtZ6oQfN.png"}, {"name": "Takahiro", "native": "隆弘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133277-yBGHCfo77UUv.png"}, {"name": "Haruki no Haha", "native": "春樹の母", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134460-PVwi6xwYXqTS.png"}, {"name": "Kyouko Takimoto", "native": "滝本恭子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134461-0JqcCi30rN45.png"}, {"name": "Haruki no Chichi", "native": 