('ANIME', 'Dororo', 'Dororo', 'どろろ', 'Dororo, a young orphan thief, meets Hyakkimaru, a powerful ronin. Hyakkimaru''s father, a greedy feudal lord, had made a pact with 12 demons, offering his yet-unborn son''s body parts in exchange for great power. Thus, Hyakkimaru - who was born without arms, legs, eyes, ears, a nose or a mouth - was abandoned in a river as a baby. Rescued and raised by Dr. Honma, who equips him with artificial limbs and teaches him sword-fighting techniques, Hyakkimaru discovers that each time he slays a demon, a piece of his body is restored. Now, he roams the war-torn countryside in search of demons.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","revenge","disability","curses","swordplay","samurai","estranged-family","youkai","orphan","war","male-protagonist","parenthood"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 377347, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101347-TGaDwEYqLfm1.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n101347-tHurKfTlhtFl.jpg', '#d6bb6b', 101347, '37520', '{"MAPPA","Tezuka Productions"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n101347-tHurKfTlhtFl.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CPG64L4bSkI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CPG64L4bSkI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hyakkimaru", "native": "百鬼丸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14864-MMntDWi2EkyR.png"}, {"name": "Dororo", "native": "どろろ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18130-qD7dREeDAkLE.png"}, {"name": "Biwamaru", "native": "琵琶丸", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n24843-aemlGiDa6lk8.png"}, {"name": "Kagemitsu Daigo", "native": "醍醐景光", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcd