('ANIME', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Swordsmith Village Arc', 'Kimetsu no Yaiba: Katanakaji no Sato-hen', '鬼滅の刃 刀鍛冶の里編', 'Tanjiro’s journey leads him to the Swordsmith Village, where he reunites with two Hashira, members of the Demon Slayer Corps’ highest-ranking swordsmen - Mist Hashira Muichiro Tokito and Love Hashira Mitsuri Kanroji. With the shadows of demons lurking near, a new battle begins for Tanjiro and his comrades.

• The first episode has a runtime of ~49 minutes, and received an early premiere in cinemas worldwide as part of a special screening alongside the final two episodes of Kimetsu no Yaiba: Yuukaku-hen.

• The final episode has a runtime of ~52 minutes.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","shounen","swordplay","male-protagonist","super-power","curses","gore","monster-girl","body-horror","cgi","historical"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '24', '2023', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 376962, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx145139-rRimpHGWLhym.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145139-V01Prh6UzfRk.jpg', '#1aaed6', 145139, '51019', '{"ufotable"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145139-V01Prh6UzfRk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/a9tq0aS5Zu8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a9tq0aS5Zu8"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/db617c3bb6a6097394baf707239ff1091554542829_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Cruelty"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/086240450f344f53dbc50765c0ba80cc1555138178_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Trainer Sakonji Urokodaki"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/249734bc86fa3b6c96697b4c0fb623671555745937_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Sabito and Makomo"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/4558b0fe17cec9f89c4e49142be8841a1556355701_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Final Selection"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ef38749be1f8c847f6cf3c543f731d861556965651_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - My Own Steel"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/130e542a4c0e9b2a641f415b307c061c1557582919_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Swordsman Accompanying a Demon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/e37f49ef0692223e459b05861a988bd71558163856_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "cap