('ANIME', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Mugen Train Arc', 'Kimetsu no Yaiba: Mugen Ressha-hen (TV)', '鬼滅の刃 無限列車編 (TV)', 'In Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Mugen Train Arc, Tanjiro Kamado and his fellow Demon Slayer members embark on a mission aboard the Infinity Train. Their new mission is to investigate a series of mysterious disappearances, carried out by a demon that has been terrorizing passengers and killing the demon slayers who oppose it.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","swordplay","shounen","male-protagonist","curses","trains","primarily-teen-cast","body-horror","primarily-male-cast"}', '7', NULL, NULL, '23', '2021', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 364185, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129874-g6ZKXB94Hui1.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129874-3ipZzS50i9Ta.jpg', '#f1a15d', 129874, '49926', '{"ufotable"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129874-3ipZzS50i9Ta.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/t6MXHczeEqc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t6MXHczeEqc"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/db617c3bb6a6097394baf707239ff1091554542829_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Cruelty"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/086240450f344f53dbc50765c0ba80cc1555138178_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Trainer Sakonji Urokodaki"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/249734bc86fa3b6c96697b4c0fb623671555745937_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Sabito and Makomo"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/4558b0fe17cec9f89c4e49142be8841a1556355701_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Final Selection"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ef38749be1f8c847f6cf3c