('ANIME', 'Weathering With You', 'Tenki no Ko', '天気の子', 'High school student Hodaka leaves his home on an isolated island and moves to Tokyo, but he immediately becomes broke. He lives his days in isolation, but finally finds a job as a writer for a shady occult magazine. After he starts his job, the weather has been rainy day after day. In a corner of the crowded and busy city, Hodaka meets a young woman named Hina. Due to certain circumstances, Hina and her younger brother live together, but have a cheerful and sturdy life. Hina also has a certain power: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"urban-fantasy","urban","environmental","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","found-family","coming-of-age","prophecy","family-life","heterosexual","magic","work"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '115', '2019', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 358791, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx106286-5COcpd0J9VbL.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106286-3oKwiwjd7Wkm.jpg', '#5dbbe4', 106286, '38826', '{"CoMix Wave"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106286-3oKwiwjd7Wkm.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q6iK6DjV_iE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6iK6DjV_iE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hodaka Morishima", "native": "森嶋帆高", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139709-LipsW9CYvlu1.png"}, {"name": "Hina Amano", "native": "天野陽菜", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139710-EnN2wXd5YeDb.png"}, {"name": "Nagi Amano", "native": "天野凪", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139703-A9GVtE2EscpF.png"}, {"name": "Fumi Tachibana", "native": "立花冨美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139704-wtkqueYgLPMw.png"}, {"name": "Natsumi Suga", "native": "須賀夏美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139705-65t4At2MN9q8.png"}, {"name": "Takai", "native": "高井", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139706-aOA7CZxlfjPV.png"}, {"name": "Keisuke Suga", "native": "須賀圭介", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139707-xeFrO3OsCoYC.jpg"}, {"name": "Detective Yasui", "native": "安井", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139708-iZk1c6rKJatW.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '106286'),
('ANIME', 'PSYCHO-PASS', 'PSYCHO-PASS', 'PSYCHO-PASS サイコパス', 'Justice, and the enforcement of it, has changed. In the 22nd century, Japan enforces the Sibyl System, an objective means of determining the threat level of each citizen by examining their mental state for signs of criminal intent, known as their Psycho-Pass. Inspectors uphold the law by subjugating, often with lethal force, anyone harboring the slightest ill-will; alongside them are Enforcers, jaded Inspectors that have become latent criminals, granted relative freedom in exchange for carrying out the Inspectors'' dirty work.

Into this world steps Akane Tsunemori, a young woman with an honest desire to uphold justice. However, as she works alongside veteran Enforcer Shinya Kougami, she soon learns that the Sibyl System''s judgments are not as perfect as her fellow Inspectors assume. With everything she has known turned on its head, Akane wrestles with the question of what justice truly is, and whether it can be upheld through the use of a system that may already be corrupt.', '{"Action","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Thriller"}', '{"detective","police","crime","cyberpunk","philosophy","primarily-adult-cast","urban","female-protagonist","augmented-reality","terrorism","guns","male-protagonist"}', '22', NULL, NULL, '23', '2012', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 358518, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx13601-i42VFuHpqEOJ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/13601-YrCmS1oY4uBZ.jpg', '#288686', 13601, '13601', '{"Production I.G"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/13601-YrCmS1oY4uBZ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b_A_wsT5WQE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b_A_wsT5WQE"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/2500c7be823dc2b599d448e334b72c371473351779_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Crime Coefficient"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/7ac7075ffad1871af9e6761a0f0e06e21473360519_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Those Capable"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/ba8cdbeda648daecda2092ad44917c2a1473354320_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Rearing Conventions"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/d3975a92b9a1908b6329d95b72deca1e1473357703_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Nobody Knows Your Mask"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i