('ANIME', 'Devilman Crybaby', 'DEVILMAN crybaby', 'DEVILMAN crybaby', 'The protagonist Akira Fudou learns from his best friend, Ryou Asuka, that an ancient race of demons has returned to take back the world from humans. Ryou tells Akira that the only way to defeat the demons is to incorporate their supernatural powers, and suggests that he unite with a demon himself. Akira succeeds in transforming into Devilman, who possesses both the powers of a demon and the soul of a human. The battle of Devilman and Akira Fudou begins.', '{"Action","Drama","Horror","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","body-horror","psychosexual","gore","urban-fantasy","shapeshifting","nudity","male-protagonist","cosmic-horror","philosophy","monster-boy","curses"}', '10', NULL, NULL, '25', '2018', 'WINTER', 'ONA', 'FINISHED', 355079, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98460-bLtH2c3jd6sV.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98460-PwSHquwVu89n.jpg', '#f1e4c9', 98460, '35120', '{"Science SARU"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98460-PwSHquwVu89n.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/g4LjvxtFieE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g4LjvxtFieE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Akira Fudou", "native": "不動明", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2456-rTjIXMLPHTu2.jpg"}, {"name": "Ryo Asuka", "native": "飛鳥了", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4092-63yxC7cCrWke.png"}, {"name": "Miki Makimura", "native": "牧村美樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7968-te8U6niaAoKk.png"}, {"name": "Psycho Jenny", "native": "サイコジェニー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7966-nh5ZbkAioYaz.jpg"}, {"name": "Tare Makimura", "native": "村健タレ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7967-EytwuXK0gbru.jpg"}, {"name": "Miki Kuroda", "native": "黒田ミキ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7971-mjwR42qPcQ5N.jpg"}, {"name": "Amon", "native": "アモン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7972-ro7f4Rjp7Bll.png"}, {"name": "Silene", "native": "シレーヌ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18590-uSU2YjJWxWgJ.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98460'),
('ANIME', 'Hyouka', 'Hyouka', '氷菓', 'Energy-conservative high school student Houtarou Oreki ends up with more than he bargained for when he signs up for the Classic Literature Club at his sister''s behest—especially when he realizes how deep-rooted the club''s history really is. Begrudgingly, Oreki is dragged into an investigation concerning the 45-year-old mystery that surrounds the club room.

Accompanied by his fellow club members, the knowledgeable Satoshi Fukube, the stern but benign Mayaka Ibara, and the ever-curious Eru Chitanda, Oreki must combat deadlines and lack of information with resourcefulness and hidden talent, in order to not only find the truth buried beneath the dust of works created years before them, but of other side cases as well.

Based on the award-winning Koten-bu light novel series, and directed by Yasuhiro Takemoto of Suzumiya Haruhi no Shoushitsu, Hyouka shows that normal life can be full of small mysteries, be it family history, a student film, or even the withered flowers that make up a ghost story.', '{"Mystery","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school-club","detective","school","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","coming-of-age","bowling","episodic","classic-literature","heterosexual"}', '22', NULL, NULL, '26', '2012', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 354336, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12189-zj5AWUYO53Fv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12189-TG0peUcKFqur.jpg', '#f1e4bb', 12189, '12189', '{"Kyoto Animation"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12189-TG0peUcKFqur.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9nfs-qYVv0o/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9nfs-qYVv0o"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/5ae456065caff9f47c8ccd87e5b1d2051526535555_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Return of the Time-Honored Classic Lit Club"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/907536ab550c8927a4b459df5aa8322f1526535924_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Prestigious Classic Lit Club''s Activities"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/4fa11ed8807d3b4adaaf6f734e7aa1fd1526537826_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - The Circumstances of the Classic Lit Club''s Scion"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/eab16eb3267f7ae6ae956c21f611fc201526537442_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - The Classic Lit Club''s Glorious Days of Yore"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/1a474e844809bcc1b1cec341e50b622b1526538698_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - The Truth About the Historic Classic Lit Club"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/d480c064775cd5bb4d70ec3a7bbe0d2f1526539384_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Committing a Cardinal Sin"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/5bdc188fae48f4b96bf9227782bbf0ab1526540246_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Upon Seeing the True Nature"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/59652216b1bce7169bdfe308984eb0521526541627_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Let''s Go To the Screening!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ae71e4254818a9a8c388b3347d992d571526541507_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - The Case of the Furuoka Deserted Village Murder"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/5769cc26989b3b2e5d889021e98938de1526585360_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Blind Spot to All"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Houtarou Oreki", "native": "折木奉太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b55131-ypodHQCyHbzD.png"}, {"name": "Eru Chitanda", "native": "千反田える", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b55133-S7lRrP0gKXpX.png"}, {"name": "Satoshi Fukube", "native": "福部里志", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b55135-rSgLOX86JRSO.png"}, {"name": "Mayaka Ibara", "native": "伊原摩耶花", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b55137-PO5CLLnbTwyg.png"}, {"name": "Fuyumi Irisu", "native": "入須冬実", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b56157-UmLhSFREXcme.png"}, {"name": "Youko Itoigawa", "native": "糸魚川養子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b56159-aq16wg33oWAn.png"}, {"name": "Tomoe Oreki", "native": "折木供恵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b56161-ERypdOyVLgHb.png"}, {"name": "Masashi Tohgaito", "native": "遠垣内将司", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b56163-cdGK815DAoog.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '12189'),
('ANIME', 'Fate/Zero', 'Fate/Zero', 'Fate/Zero', 'With the promise of granting any wish, the omnipotent Holy Grail triggered three wars in the past, each too cruel and fierce to leave a victor. In spite of that, the wealthy Einzbern family is confident that the Fourth Holy Grail War will be different; namely, with a vessel of the Holy Grail now in their grasp. Solely for this reason, the much hated "Magus Killer" Kiritsugu Emiya is hired by the Einzberns, with marriage to their only daughter Irisviel as binding contract.

Kiritsugu now stands at the center of a cutthroat game of survival, facing off against six other participants, each armed with an ancient familiar, and fueled by unique desires and ideals. Accompanied by his own familiar, Saber, the notorious mercenary soon finds his greatest opponent in Kirei Kotomine, a priest who seeks salvation from the emptiness within himself in pursuit of Kiritsugu.

Based on the light novel written by Gen Urobuchi, Fate/Zero depicts the events of the Fourth Holy Grail War—10 years prior to Fate/stay night. Witness a battle royale in which no one is guaranteed to survive.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"battle-royale","magic","mythology","ensemble-cast","anti-hero","death-game","urban-fantasy","primarily-adult-cast","philosophy","war","religion","assassins"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2011', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 350108, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10087-M4Hd9qrHGrXk.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10087-32MFY9VnJQ7I.jpg', '#e4d65d', 10087, '10087', '{"ufotable"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10087-32MFY9VnJQ7I.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/n-7PFiut1HI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n-7PFiut1HI"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/20b0cf76c93471975a17485d44ac79391432957314_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Summoning of Heroes"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/89ccfd21b6c8de64044868824cd000351432958177_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Fake First Shot"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/7c97ab678da6a4f34d7b8b68989666b91432955033_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Fuyuki City"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/0740146d02d5e5c0b55642be53ba734f1433031493_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Spearhead"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/ed30ff054b652604d2831a4d79f14d651432953997_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - A Wicked Beast''s Roar"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/d8ca3b50e9cc8fc793af6a270a7159e11432954008_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption":