('ANIME', 'Monster', 'MONSTER', 'MONSTER', 'Dr. Kenzo Tenma is a renowned Japanese brain surgeon working at a leading hospital in Germany. One night, Dr. Tenma risks his reputation and career to save the life of a critically wounded young boy over that of the town mayor who had been planning to support the hospital financially. A string of mysterious murders begin to occur soon after the operation, and Dr. Tenma emerges as the primary suspect despite no incriminating evidence. 

A doctor is taught to believe that all life is equal; however, when another series of murders occur in the surgeon''s vicinity, Dr. Tenma''s beliefs are shaken as his actions that night are shown to have much broader consequences than he could have imagined. Leaving behind his life as a surgeon he embarks on a journey across the country to unravel the mystery of the boy he saved.', '{"Drama","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Thriller"}', '{"crime","seinen","detective","philosophy","ensemble-cast","primarily-adult-cast","noir","twins","revenge","urban","adoption","police"}', '74', NULL, NULL, '24', '2004', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 345172, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx19-gtMC64182sm4.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19-kJhwsB0Z97tL.jpg', NULL, 19, '19', '{"MADHOUSE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19-kJhwsB0Z97tL.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kenzou Tenma", "native": "天馬賢三", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b718-b6ZZVp822lw0.png"}, {"name": "Johan Liebert", "native": "ヨハン・リーベルト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b719-y984mDWyGf5n.jpg"}, {"name": "Anna Liebert", "native": "アンナ・リーベルト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b720-VFo5SzZsVfzl.png"}, {"name": "Heinrich Runge", "native": "ハインリッヒ・ルンゲ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b721-VSOxZHBedxtD.png"}, {"name": "Eva Heinemann", "native": "エヴァ・ハイネマン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6123-kLLVgdI8Elv4.jpg"}, {"name": "Wolfgang Grimmer", "native": "ヴォルフガング・グリマー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3096-qCXXA8G0J8rk.png"}, {"name": "Dieter", "native": "ディーター", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6329-1EP0t4paLi3y.jpg"}, {"name": "Roberto", "native": "ロベルト", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/8611.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '19'),
('ANIME', 'Bakemonogatari', 'Bakemonogatari', '化物語', 'First season of the Monogatari Series, part 1/6. Contains the arcs Hitagi Crab, Mayoi Snail, Suruga Monkey, Nadeko Snake, and Tsubasa Cat from the Bakemonogatari light novels.

Thanks to Meme Oshino, Koyomi Araragi, a high school student, is able to remain a human after coming across a female vampire... However, since the incident, Koyomi seems to meet girls who have an apparition-related issue. Hitagi Senjougahara doesn’t weigh anything, Suruga Kanbaru’s right arm becomes like that of a monkey’s, and a young girl, Mayoi, cannot find her way home no matter how many times she tries. Koyomi, a Mr. Nice Guy, ends up helping each and every girl solve her problem with the help of Meme Oshino.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"youkai","ensemble-cast","urban-fantasy","surreal-comedy","male-protagonist","philosophy","coming-of-age","vampire","primarily-female-cast","satire","meta","heterosexual"}', '15', NULL, NULL, '24', '2009', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 344486, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5081-9GocceQ5Z865.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n5081-0Zcn5GOFYHMc.jpg', '#4393e4', 5081, '5081', '{"Shaft"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n5081-0Zcn5GOFYHMc.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X63_YYZjKxA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X63_YYZjKxA"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/0c04588785851d184602c930502764031347406127_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Hitagi Crab, Part 1"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/c945ecb00e19f3f8c8f6cec78becbe931347671890_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Hitagi Crab, Part 2"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/1047a8e578cf3d4f3c1e11a714d7d8311348509559_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Mayoi Mai Mai, Part 1"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/79dc832508379795fbb4ab18a432fdd71348812377_full.jpg", "kind": "episode",