('ANIME', 'Dr. STONE: STONE WARS', 'Dr. STONE: STONE WARS', 'Dr.STONE STONE WARS', 'Armed with the power of science and a genius intellect, Senkuu is determined to save humanity. However, Tsukasa’s empire goes on the offensive to halt the progress of science. Bolder choices are made as these two start a war that rocks the Stone World.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"post-apocalyptic","survival","educational","male-protagonist","war","lost-civilization","shounen","environmental","ensemble-cast"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '24', '2021', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 337626, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx113936-D4eYd4XwslVI.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113936-PpMtCY9kCwwV.jpg', '#e4bb50', 113936, '40852', '{"TMS Entertainment"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113936-PpMtCY9kCwwV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QqgqrrFbw3g/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QqgqrrFbw3g"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/35ffbee5054aba6dce08ae9d34bc28881753966230_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 16 - Medusa Mechanism"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/6c3d9e316ea504970bcb569e2ce15d071753363899_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15 - The Escape"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/2b6c079624473da320f75a1564b204951752759800_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14 - EARTH RACE"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/59a9f1268d2776c68e1a5759df20b4c71752156995_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 13 - Watching the Same Moon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/903fb7df11440f86a55e0872d3a1b8991743078217_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 12 - Reunion"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.c