('ANIME', 'OSHI NO KO', '[Oshi no Ko]', '【推しの子】', 'When a pregnant young starlet appears in Gorou Amemiya’s countryside medical clinic, the doctor takes it upon himself to safely (and secretly) deliver Ai Hoshino’s child so she can make a scandal-free return to the stage. But no good deed goes unpunished, and on the eve of her delivery, he finds himself slain at the hands of Ai’s deluded stalker — and subsequently reborn as Ai’s child, Aquamarine Hoshino! The glitz and glamor of showbiz hide the dark underbelly of the entertainment industry, threatening to dull the shine of his favorite star. Can he help his new mother rise to the top of the charts? And what will he do when unthinkable disaster strikes?', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"acting","idol","revenge","twins","male-protagonist","urban","heterosexual","ensemble-cast","female-protagonist","pregnancy","tsundere","filmmaking"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '24', '2023', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 332559, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx150672-WqmmwZ4nMzAy.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/150672-ISwoA0eS722H.jpg', '#ff35c9', 150672, '52034', '{"Doga Kobo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/150672-ISwoA0eS722H.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gKWEUJ4r5do/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gKWEUJ4r5do"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Aquamarine Hoshino", "native": "星野アクアマリン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b183885-HOmw8CqcJdv3.jpg"}, {"name": "Ruby Hoshino", "native": "星野ルビー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b183884-iyo3BmTuhJ0l.jpg"}, {"name": "Kana Arima", "native": "有馬かな", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188783-77orwP7vNuNg.png"}, {"name": "Akane Kurokawa", "native": "黒川あかね", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b203384-YuSppFDMw2wn.png"}, {"name": "Ai Hoshino", "native": "星野アイ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b172759-cccVhJ2fQA92.png"}, {"name": "MEM-cho", "native": "MEMちょ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b205434-AuBcR4M05f6s.png"}, {"name": "Miyako Saitou", "native": "斉藤ミヤコ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b223870-60FglagpVtHe.png"}, {"name": "Taishi Gotanda", "native": "五反田泰志", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b245519-yrjlimcCUdrk.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '150672'),
('ANIME', 'The Apothecary Diaries', 'Kusuriya no Hitorigoto', '薬屋のひとりごと', 'Maomao lived a peaceful life with her apothecary father. Until one day, she’s sold as a lowly servant to the emperor’s palace. But she wasn’t meant for a compliant life among royalty. So when imperial heirs fall ill, she decides to step in and find a cure! This catches the eye of Jinshi, a handsome palace official who promotes her. Now, she’s making a name for herself solving medical mysteries!', '{"Drama","Mystery"}', '{"female-protagonist","medicine","ancient-china","drugs","historical","detective","politics","royal-affairs","work","foreign","primarily-adult-cast","heterosexual"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '23', '2023', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 332066, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx161645-QLbzHXiYRgV2.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/161645-oqzTZYIvviWI.jpg', '#f1865d', 161645, '54492', '{"OLM","TOHO animation STUDIO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/161645-oqzTZYIvviWI.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oyHqh8ue4zw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oyHqh8ue4zw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/684f1e23301186ac476d81dccfcf0d9f1751641470_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 48 - The Beginning"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/e3c0ecacad4d061e52f12e9dc7a92e3f1751029483_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 47 - The Shi Clan"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/6f5547c8cf0bf16af678f001f4b76ef91749828530_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 46 - Royal Guard"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/04a6ed5db2e73d5d4cc406ade92edb471749226051_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 45 - Taibon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/4855905b