/character/large/b120974-cZHsjS8DX9WW.png"}, {"name": "Fafnir", "native": "ファフニール", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120971-7XdpFZNKMBuM.png"}, {"name": "Riko Saikawa", "native": "才川リコ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120972-fEzG6QIFQnXp.png"}, {"name": "Shouta Magatsuchi", "native": "真ヶ土翔太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120973-lNsOIwMrH8xo.png"}, {"name": "Quetzalcoatl", "native": "ケツァルコアトル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120975-oOyfRbMSpSpy.png"}, {"name": "Makoto Takiya", "native": "滝谷真", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120976-qUDSgLQ61tGQ.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '21776'),
('ANIME', 'SPY x FAMILY Cour 2', 'SPY×FAMILY Part 2', 'SPY×FAMILY 第2クール', 'With Anya Forger successfully enrolled at the renowned Eden Academy, Operation Strix advances to its second phase. To investigate Ostanian politician Donovan Desmond, Anya must either befriend his son Damian or collect eight Stella Stars to become an Imperial Scholar. Fortunately, Anya has already acquired her first star. In celebration, her adoptive father, Loid, decides to fulfill her wish to adopt a dog.

During their canine search, Loid receives new orders from his superiors, who have found that a band of Berlint University students is plotting to assassinate Westalis'' Minister Brantz using bombs worn by trained dogs. While Loid tries to stop their plans, Anya stumbles upon the terrorists'' base of operations. There, she befriends a kindhearted, clairvoyant dog who the family later names Bond.

Although the Forgers continue to lead their individual lives in secrecy, the family—with a new fluffy addition—remains united through all of the unusual obstacles thrown their way.', '{"Action","Comedy","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"family-life","episodic","found-family","espionage","urban","ensemble-cast","urban-fantasy","assassins","foreign","adoption","female-protagonist","school"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 331552, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx142838-26JrqcFU1ljB.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/142838-tynuN00wxmKO.jpg', '#28bbfe', 142838, '50602', '{"WIT STUDIO","CloverWorks"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/142838-tynuN00wxmKO.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Dv3ZhzxtbQY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dv3ZhzxtbQY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Loid Forger", "native": "ロイド・フォージャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138101-7NCB0Md8zA6G.png"}, {"name": "Yor Forger", "native": "ヨル・フォージャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138102-ZOAu9jI2d5ke.png"}, {"name": "Anya Forger", "native": "アーニャ・フォージャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138100-4Li0tWRCa5bQ.png"}, {"name": "Becky Blackbell", "native": "ベッキー・ブラックベル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150423-RxXwrHzeLCss.jpg"}, {"name": "Damian Desmond", "native": "ダミアン・デズモンド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150424-4B4psF6I4dgO.png"}, {"name": "Yuuri Briar", "native": "ユーリ・ブライア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150425-mP852peLh9eS.jpg"}, {"name": "Sylvia Sherwood", "native": "シルヴィア・シャーウッド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157887-P66pD0ilpmtZ.png"}, {"name": "Franky Franklin", "native": "フランキー・フランクリン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157888-zkSfIT5Z8y2S.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '142838'),
('ANIME', 'Seraph of the End: Vampire Reign', 'Owari no Seraph', '終わりのセラフ', 'The story takes place in a world where an unknown virus has killed the entire human population except for children under 13. Those children were then enslaved by vampires. The manga centers on Yuichiro Hyakuya, a human who dreams of becoming strong enough to kill all vampires.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","post-apocalyptic","urban-fantasy","male-protagonist","shounen","military","war","demons","swordplay","lost-civilization","primarily-teen-cast","pandemic"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2015', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 331041, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20829-pgsXVjrfyI5V.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20829-1BRrVJAxlEKT.jpg', '#e4a15d', 20829, '26243', '{"WIT STUDIO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20829-1BRrVJAxlEKT.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9AMtVwWS0fM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9AMtVwWS0fM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuuichirou Hyakuya", "native": "百夜優一郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83015-XmUdY42WSKRG.png"}, {"name": "Shinoa Hiiragi", "native": "柊シノア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83017-XXdnbunnBdTd.png"}, {"name": "Mikaela Hyakuya", "native": "百夜ミカエラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87287-cBUVUJNbvfvT.png"}, {"name": "Shihou Kimizuki", "native": "君月士方", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88912-HVslXuJNgNQc.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoichi Saotome", "native": "早乙女与一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88988-ioriKKJJQNat.png"}, {"name": "Guren Ichinose", "native": "一瀬グレン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88993-YNw36YYleasn.png"}, {"name": "Mitsuba Sanguu", "native": "三宮三葉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135250-fCoUY2wGYLUw.png"}, {"name": "Ashuramaru", "native": "阿朱羅丸", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88888-4JoZHEeFDtOo.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '20829'),
('ANIME', 'Wotakoi: Love is Hard for Otaku', 'Wotaku ni Koi wa Muzukashii', 'ヲタクに恋は難しい', 'Having slept through all four of her alarms, the energetic Narumi Momose finds herself running late for her first day of work at a new office. As she races to catch her train, she makes a promise to herself that none of her coworkers will find out about her dark secret: that she is an otaku and a fujoshi. Her plan goes instantly awry, though, when she runs into Hirotaka Nifuji, an old friend from middle school. Although she tries to keep her secret by inviting him out for drinks after work, her cover is blown when he casually asks her whether or not she will be attending the upcoming Summer Comiket. Luckily for her, the only witnesses—Hanako Koyanagi and Tarou Kabakura—are otaku as well.

Later that night, the pair go out for drinks so that they can catch up after all the years apart. After Narumi complains about her previous boyfriend breaking up with her because he refused to date a fujoshi, Hirotaka suggests that she try dating a fellow otaku, specifically himself. He makes a solemn promise to always be there for her, to support her, and to help her farm for rare drops in Monster Hunter. Blown away by the proposal, Narumi agrees immediately. Thus the two otaku start dating, and their adorably awkward romance begins.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"otaku-culture","primarily-adult-cast","josei","office-lady","female-protagonist","video-games","work","episodic","male-protagonist","office","urban","kuudere"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '23', '2018', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 330555, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx99578-oO5KChtfhzln.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99578-8orFGgDq7NS8.jpg', '#d6936b', 99578, '35968', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99578-8orFGgDq7NS8.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FnM1TDuG9f4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FnM1TDuG9f4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hirotaka Nifuji", "native": "二藤宏高", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122189-ai5CYyRv1CAH.png"}, {"name": "Narumi Momose", "native": "桃瀬成海", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122190-3VC3pxCguyu7.png"}, {"name": "Hanako Koyanagi", "native": "小柳花子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122191-sigwgpeam2U1.png"}, {"name": "Tarou Kabakura", "native": "樺倉太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122192-qnLmMg3YaGNd.png"}, {"name": "Naoya Nifuji", "native": "二藤尚哉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/122193-fRNWPtZ1iLdG.jpg"}, {"name": "Kou Sakuragi", "native": "桜城光", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124023-5EE8eXTKDGyg.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoshiki Ichijou", "native": "一条良樹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179958-WigSemwnUGdS.png"}, {"name": "Doumoto", "native": "堂元", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179959-Z0rIyNJyGzVl.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '99578'),
('ANIME', 'Puella Magi Madoka Magica', 'Mahou Shoujo Madoka☆Magica', '魔法少女まどか☆マギカ', 'One night, 14-year-old Madoka Kaname has a terrible nightmare - against the backdrop of a devastated city, she witnesses a girl fight a losing battle against a dreadful being lingering above, while a cat-like magical creature tells Madoka the only way to change such tragic outcome is for her to make a contract with him and become a magical girl. 

The next day, the teen''s dream seemingly becomes reality as the girl she saw in her dream - Homura - arrives at Mitakihara Middle School as a transfer student, mysteriously warning Madoka to stay just the way she is; but when later on she and her best friend Sayaka encounter the same cat-like magical creature from her dream - who introduces himself as Kyubey - the pair discovers that magical girls are real, and what''s more, they can choose to become one. All they must do is sign a contract with Kyubey and agree to take on the duty to fight abstract beings called ''witches'' that spread despair to the human world, and in return, each one of them will be granted any single wish they desire. However, as Homura''s omen suggests, there might be far more to becoming a magical girl than Madoka and Sayaka realize... 

- Due to the 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami, the broadcasts of episodes 11 and 12 were delayed and were later aired as a double feature on April 21, 2011.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mahou Shoujo","Psychological","Thriller"}', '{"magic","female-protagonist","witch","primarily-female-cast","urban-fantasy","primarily-teen-cast","philosophy","henshin","coming-of-age","primarily-child-cast","urban","kuudere"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2011', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 329293, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9756-QnUGwlwwnsuN.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9756-d5M8NffgJJHB.jpg', '#f1c95d', 9756, '9756', '{"Shaft"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9756-d5M8NffgJJHB.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6CTHwEZK2JA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CTHwEZK2JA"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/bf73f7c400692086100d7893a93720961328753177_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - I First Met Her in a Dream… or Something."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/9bf2c1a92862a468a4c7be3f47c7e4811329761891_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - That Would Be Truly Wonderful"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/e3a47f86bcf6c9f8bf1fb973136e96a71329879325_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - I''m Not Afraid of Anything Anymore"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/3e513fce3a7508a118edd00d0a26415e1330564188_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Miracles and Magic Are Real"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/792401ef0b5500fb303eead24e4ad29c1331741739_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - There''s No Way I''ll Ever Regret It"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/d7b02fc