('ANIME', 'To Your Eternity', 'Fumetsu no Anata e', '不滅のあなたへ', 'In the beginning, an "orb" is cast unto Earth. "It" can do two things: change into the form of the thing that stimulates "it"; and come back to life after death. "It" morphs from orb to rock, then to wolf, and finally to boy, but roams about like a newborn who knows nothing. As a boy, "it" becomes Fushi.

Through encounters with human kindness, Fushi not only gains survival skills but grows as a "person". But his journey is darkened by the inexplicable and destructive enemy Nokker and cruel partings with the people he loves.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"shapeshifting","coming-of-age","travel","philosophy","rural","ensemble-cast","body-horror","shounen","medieval","animals"}', '20', NULL, NULL, '25', '2021', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 319651, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx114535-y3NnjexcqKG1.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114535-ASUprf4AsNwC.jpg', '#f1d6a1', 114535, '41025', '{"Brain''s Base"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114535-ASUprf4AsNwC.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0S0ty44JPao/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0S0ty44JPao"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/16b199fb94ed3ff84838d06d313802341622456167_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Last One"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/63734877437c1140082d0fb1c44326cb1623065955_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - A Rambunctious Girl"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/e94dc439de7c6ce232eb82c93351cabd1623661518_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - A Small Evolution"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/2ae860df0f9be44ed8e47a040ae5e50a1624283646_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - A Large Vessel"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/dea68f9c2b3dd03194bbb1826d3fbb1e1624890316_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Those Who Follow"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/d3e56b7962e48b67a24546be8d9599c31625486407_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Our Goals"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/f5431e82c104d24e11452bc776036ae71626097871_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - The Boy Who Wants to Change"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/2ab6e19b73caa20db232d2b9971089d41626701165_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Monster Brothers"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/7fb74e276d804ee8ef44a6db7115d19a1627306270_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Deep Memories"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/0c3986f164c63bf125c70211e533a8fc1627927751_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - New Family"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Fushi", "native": "フシ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136548-FjWExC5ScBqW.jpg"}, {"name": "March", "native": "マーチ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136541-gXKd6OtbuffL.png"}, {"name": "Parona", "native": "パロナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136544-LGUvcdc4cyPY.jpg"}, {"name": "Hayase", "native": "ハヤセ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136545-KsqBpXbhEUCd.png"}, {"name": "Tonari", "native": "トナリ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136550-fJiwFtdKLyCf.jpg"}, {"name": "Rean Cropp", "native": "リーン・クロップ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136551-DgY4fAbFcW6A.jpg"}, {"name": "Sander", "native": "サンデル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136552-xiLFH6HRjLTE.jpg"}, {"name": "Kansatsu-sha", "native": "観察者", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136553-9LprfeXY6qYP.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '114535'),
('ANIME', 'The Eminence in Shadow', 'Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!', '陰の実力者になりたくて！', 'Some people just aren’t suited to playing the part of the flashy, in-your-face hero or the dastardly, mustache-twirling villain with larger-than-life panache. Instead, they operate in the shadows and pull the strings of society through wit and cleverness. That’s the role Cid wants to play when he’s transported to another world. Cid spins a yarn or three and becomes the unlikely leader of the underground Shadow Garden organization that fights against a menacing cult (which he totally made up). However, there’s a catch even his wild imagination didn’t see coming: the cult he concocted actually exists, and they’re beyond displeased that his power fantasy just got in the way of their evil plans!', '{"Action","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","chuunibyou","male-protagonist","parody","anti-hero","magic","cult","swordplay","primarily-female-cast","meta","satire","female-harem"}', '20', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 318090, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx130298-YMdcKHytpWNH.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/130298-9yxFlFvKMwRk.jpg', '#d61a1a', 130298, '48316', '{"Nexus"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/130298-9yxFlFvKMwRk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L7LgAbGF-WY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L7LgAbGF-WY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Cid Kagenou", "native": "シド・カゲノー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136837-3WR22FYet8Hv.jpg"}, {"name": "Alpha", "native": "アルファ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162246-IbbxkhNJFDN5.png"}, {"name": "Beta", "native": "ベータ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162247-R6OrAuT1