('ANIME', 'Rent-a-Girlfriend', 'Kanojo, Okarishimasu', '彼女、お借りします', 'Kinoshita Kazuya is a 20-year-old failure of a college student. He managed to kiss his girlfriend once, but was dumped after a month. "Ugh... Damn it. I never want to go through that again." 

Completely spiteful, Kazuya uses a certain method to date a girl. He goes to their meeting place and suddenly hears, "You''re Kazuya-kun, right?" A beautiful girl brushing her long, black hair behind her ear was there, smiling at him. Her name was Mizuhara Chizuru. Something real is born after just a single rental! A reckless rom-com filled with love and excitement is about to begin!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"male-protagonist","unrequited-love","fake-relationship","heterosexual","slapstick","primarily-female-cast","shounen","primarily-adult-cast","tsundere","work","college","acting"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2020', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 310451, '65', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx113813-SnljeXpU3Pw7.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113813-Al8VofQuNQHV.jpg', '#f1c950', 113813, '40839', '{"TMS Entertainment"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113813-Al8VofQuNQHV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jZFEtc3CKHs/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jZFEtc3CKHs"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/b74908e485dddbb21e8b7eed6533cb6a1753779489_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 41 - Promised Time and Girlfriend"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a5339a2212d8c38f1ab14239face88821753186046_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 40 - Decision and Girlfriend"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/5b8268b73a4df4a68dfae04a0bf3a5711752587663_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 39 - Daikanyama and Girlfriend"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/41fdbc64b6f7697badb1360ce394f9261751979338_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 38 - Sigh and Girlfriend"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/a8fa3206e8679f4c28b90f1b8