('ANIME', 'Fire Force Season 2', 'Enen no Shouboutai: Ni no Shou', '炎炎ノ消防隊 弐ノ章', 'Shinra and Company 8 have figured out the Evangelist’s goal: to gather Adolla Bursts from Shinra and Shou. After learning more about his past from Captain Burns, Shinra becomes more motivated to discover the truth about his mother and save Shou again.

