('ANIME', 'Clannad', 'CLANNAD', 'ＣＬＡＮＮＡＤ -クラナド-', 'Tomoya is a bitter, third year high school student. His mother passed away, causing his father to resort to alcohol and gambling. Tomoya is distant with his father and has become a delinquent in the years since his mother''s death. Walking to school, he meets Nagisa Furukawa who is a year older but is repeating the grade due to illness. She is alone, as most of her friends have moved on. The two begin hanging out, and as time goes by, Tomoya finds his life shifting in a new direction.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"coming-of-age","school","ensemble-cast","family-life","male-protagonist","heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","school-club","urban-fantasy","female-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","fairy-tale"}', '23', NULL, NULL, '24', '2007', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 302588, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx2167-pSDBcyc0vjej.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2167.jpg', '#bbbbff', 2167, '2167', '{"Kyoto Animation"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2167.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9ZseZTshl2k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ZseZTshl2k"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tomoya Okazaki", "native": "岡崎朋也", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4606-61r9h3WUrkA9.png"}, {"name": "Nagisa Furukawa", "native": "古河渚", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4604-YFJiWeuGSIYf.png"}, {"name": "Fuuko Ibuki", "native": "伊吹風子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4601-ndvzx7vVREJU.jpg"}, {"name": "Kotomi Ichinose", "native": "一ノ瀬ことみ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4602-L9sSmkyQhZeC.jpg"}, {"name": "Tomoyo