('ANIME', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Stardust Crusaders - Battle in Egypt', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Stardust Crusaders - Egypt-hen', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 スターダストクルセイダース エジプト編', 'After 30 days of travel across the world, plagued with countless battles, Jotaro and his companions have finally arrived in Egypt! Now only the strongest "Stand" users remain to rebuff our heroes'' final march on Cairo: The Nine Egyptian Gods, Dio''s most zealous servants. Will the Joestar line fall to the monstrous vampire, or can Jotaro defeat Dio and save his mother''s life?', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","primarily-male-cast","male-protagonist","travel","shounen","foreign","ensemble-cast","desert","urban-fantasy","primarily-adult-cast","gore","vampire"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2015', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 293420, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20799-S1eyqBDlx51E.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20799-Fc9I1XG4TWtJ.jpg', '#6b281a', 20799, '26055', '{"david production"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20799-Fc9I1XG4TWtJ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kaSio11XVhM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kaSio11XVhM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Joutarou Kuujou", "native": "空条承太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4003-gWDSEGbeOAll.png"}, {"name": "Dio Brando", "native": "ディオ・ブランドー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4004-w0OtWuvjhftG.png"}, {"name": "Joseph Joestar", "native": "ジョセフ・ジョースター", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6356-RImEfUfHpC58.png"}, {"name": "Mohammed Avdol", "native": "モハメド・アヴドゥル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8946-BumWgNGkPP9W.jpg"}, {"name": "Noriaki Kakyouin", "native": "花京院典明", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/8945-gyPfrVpCb5CF.jpg"}, {"name": "Jean-Pierre Polnareff", "native": "ジャン＝ピエール・ポルナレフ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4368-1KToX8uSi1U1.png"}, {"name": "Iggy", "native": "イギー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21089.jpg"}, {"name": "Hol Horse", "native": "ホル・ホｰス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16557-Kw9mRwSaq6ut.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '20799'),
('ANIME', 'Terror in Resonance', 'Zankyou no Terror', '残響のテロル', 'Painted in red, the word "VON" is all that is left behind after a terrorist attack on a nuclear facility in Japan. The government is shattered by their inability to act, and the police are left frantically searching for ways to crack down the perpetrators. The public are clueless—until, six months later, a strange video makes its way onto the internet. In it, two teenage boys who identify themselves only as "Sphinx" directly challenge the police, threatening to cause destruction and mayhem across Tokyo. Unable to stop the mass panic quickly spreading through the city and desperate for any leads in their investigation, the police struggle to act effectively against these terrorists, with Detective Kenjirou Shibazaki caught in the middle of it all.

Zankyou no Terror tells the story of Nine and Twelve, the two boys behind the masked figures of Sphinx. They should not exist, yet they stand strong in a world of deception and secrets while they make the city fall around them, all in the hopes of burying their own tragic truth.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Thriller"}', '{"terrorism","anti-hero","detective","crime","male-protagonist","orphan","urban","police","politics","primarily-male-cast","female-protagonist"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '23', '2014', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 293272, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20661-aCR7QgzDfOSI.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20661-JwMKrCzeSTZ7.png', '#aee4e4', 20661, '23283', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20661-JwMKrCzeSTZ7.png", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nLVy50LnLMM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nLVy50LnLMM"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/09c42ed8286a58c09eace2ebad599ef51481231233_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Falling"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/e73c3798d10cc644af45bcfec0d382a11481219419_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Call & Response"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/8b8f504a891808df4d11d9dbc026249f1481218701_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Search & Destroy"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/cb2530f91efd6a6b37124e2fea98cd2e1481220476_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Break Through"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/4c4322815452a5a91b491bce7e7ed4fa1481220129_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Hide & Seek"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/98eda43c8620cb0b11cb47b14a211b371481220926_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Ready or Not"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/c4c212625dc642225c995dbbb234e74b1481221974_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Deuce"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/faf4678f1ac92303b0255e0d538b35741481223398_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - My Fair Lady"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/e9ef53612c9f1e829c19083b2130f9a41481224328_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Highs & Lows"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/2e95c9fdee450a985f702b4ae125c1701481215148_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Helter Skelter"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nine", "native": "ナイン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88094-rwletczjtSE1.jpg"}, {"name": "Lisa Mishima", "native": "三島リサ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88095.jpg"}, {"name": "Twelve", "native": "ツエルブ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88096-SljWAMO10C6l.jpg"}, {"name": "Kenjirou Shibasaki", "native": "柴崎健次郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88302.jpg"}, {"name": "Five", "native": "ハイヴ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88301-eE4IbqlBkRYi.png"}, {"name": "Mukasa", "native": "六笠", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157966-Sv3e1Dg0w9VN.jpg"}, {"name": "Souta Aoki", "native": "青木宗太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157968-ST91iBfMA7Ln.jpg"}, {"name": "Kurahashi", "native": "倉橋", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157970-WyG7Kfe3pgER.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '20661'),
('ANIME', 'MASHLE: MAGIC AND MUSCLES', 'MASHLE', 'マッシュル-MASHLE-', 'This is a world of magic. This is a world in which magic is casually used by everyone.

In a deep, dark forest in this world of magic, there is a boy who is singlemindedly working out. His name is Mash Burnedead, and he has a secret. He can’t use magic. 

All he wanted was to live a quiet life with his family, but people suddenly start trying to kill him one day and he somehow finds himself enrolled in Magic School. There, he sets his sights on becoming a “Divine Visionary,” the elite of the elite. 

 Will his ripped muscles work against the best and brightest of the wizarding world? The curtain rises on this off-kilter magical fantasy in which the power of being jacked crushes any spell!', '{"Action","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","male-protagonist","shounen","parody","school","fitness","slapstick","primarily-teen-cast","super-power","primarily-male-cast","kuudere","aromantic"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2023', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 292215, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx151801-XxVf22Le6C8o.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151801-zBFaJMIJFWfS.jpg', '#f1bb5d', 151801, '52211', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151801-zBFaJMIJFWfS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zl0Kiv0kuQQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zl0Kiv0kuQQ"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/1198dd18ff9c0872646c859baf619cf51685127507_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Mash Burnedead and the Body of the Gods"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/592ba26818640da23fcf37b9e3a8d0d11681483434_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Mash Burnedead and the Mysterious Maze"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/9e5e522d4f6cabc7bb306321f15b9d261682093425_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Mash Burnedead and the Baleful Bully"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c6d0f99fbc177edf4b09e22025d3c7241682695593_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Mash Burnedead and the Challenging Magic User"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/ceb50612f2cd10272082807d0f9fb6111683302181_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Mash Burnedead and the Unpopular Classmate"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/