('ANIME', 'Sword Art Online: Alicization', 'Sword Art Online: Alicization', 'ソードアート・オンライン アリシゼーション', 'Kirito awakens in a vast, fantastical forest filled with towering trees. In his search for clues to the truth of his surroundings, he encounters a young boy who seems to know him. He ought to be a simple NPC, but the depth of his emotions seem no different than a human. As they search for the boy''s parents, Kirito finds a peculiar memory returning to him. A memory from his own childhood, of this boy and a girl, too, with golden hair, and a name he should have never forgotten - Alice.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"virtual-world","male-protagonist","swordplay","artificial-intelligence","isekai","primarily-female-cast","heterosexual","medieval","class-struggle","primarily-teen-cast"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2018', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 290974, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx100182-KctPmCJ2smHQ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100182-8iGTeJ2kYRDt.jpg', '#50fefe', 100182, '36474', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100182-8iGTeJ2kYRDt.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wHaHh_sX1IM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wHaHh_sX1IM"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c289e7781e8676b0b88a417ccfefad141432077321_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The World of Swords"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f2620abbec420f275e919e480e82222f1432079867_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Beater"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/6d82a4a5622a6dc02bc072f47258ed011432076330_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Red Nosed Reindeer"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/8f86346833247a7dd0be7225a8f6c07d