('ANIME', 'Maid-Sama!', 'Kaichou wa Maid-sama!', '会長はメイド様!', 'Being the first female student council president isn''t easy, especially when your school just transitioned from an all boys high school to a co-ed one. Aptly nicknamed "Demon President" by the boys for her strict disciplinary style, Misaki Ayuzawa is not afraid to use her mastery of Aikido techniques to cast judgment onto the hordes of misbehaving boys and defend the girls at Seika High School.

Yet even the perfect Ayuzawa has an embarrassing secret—she works part-time as a maid at a maid café to help her struggling family pay the bills. She has managed to keep her job hidden from her fellow students and maintained her flawless image as a stellar student until one day, Takumi Usui, the most popular boy in school, walks into the maid café. He could destroy her reputation with her secret... or he could twist the student council president around his little finger and use her secret as an opportunity to get closer to her.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"shoujo","female-protagonist","school","maids","work","tsundere","unrequited-love","urban","ensemble-cast","heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","otaku-culture"}', '26', NULL, NULL, '24', '2010', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 290057, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx7054-GW4D7VAZG19W.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7054-iTfiX8juTvRV.jpg', '#780d28', 7054, '7054', '{"J.C.STAFF"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7054-iTfiX8juTvRV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Takumi Usui", "native": "碓氷拓海", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14523-yFjXVeK6c6IE.png"}, {"name": "Misaki Ayuzawa", "native": "鮎沢美咲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14941-qh15JS5cEQDL.jpg"}, {"name": "Aoi Hyoudou", "native": "兵藤葵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16614-kYZByrhYdCJe.jpg"}, {"name": "Shouichirou Yukimura", "native": "幸村祥一郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/19286.jpg"}, {"name": "Hinata Shintani", "native": "深谷陽向", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19985-sHzQhMUrLHvJ.jpg"}, {"name": "Soutarou Kanou", "native": "叶爽太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27667-mHj9LXkj4jyu.png"}, {"name": "Tora Igarashi", "native": "五十嵐虎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27717-SUpDLRWbi5Hm.jpg"}, {"name": "Kanade Maki", "native": "真木奏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27718-txH0amJZuXw1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '7054'),
('ANIME', 'Kuroko''s Basketball', 'Kuroko no Basket', '黒子のバスケ', 'Teikou Junior High School''s basketball team is crowned champion three years in a row thanks to five outstanding players who, with their breathtaking and unique skills, leave opponents in despair and fans in admiration. However, after graduating, these teammates, known as "The Generation of Miracles", go their separate ways and now consider each other as rivals.

At Seirin High School, two newly recruited freshmen prove that they are not ordinary basketball players: Taiga Kagami, a promising player returning from the US, and Tetsuya Kuroko, a seemingly ordinary student whose lack of presence allows him to move around unnoticed. Although Kuroko is neither athletic nor able to score any points, he was a member of Teikou''s basketball team, where he played as the "Phantom Sixth Man," who easily passed the ball and assisted his teammates.

Kuroko no Basket follows the journey of Seirin''s players as they attempt to become the best Japanese high school team by winning the Interhigh Championship. To reach their goal, they have to cross pathways with several powerful teams, some of which have one of the five players with godlike abilities, whom Kuroko and Taiga make a pact to defeat.', '{"Comedy","Sports"}', '{"basketball","male-protagonist","shounen","primarily-male-cast","school-club","tomboy","ensemble-cast","primarily-teen-cast","school"}', '25', NULL, NULL, '24', '2012', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 288428, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx11771-uvr44RAwRxPw.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11771-Bjm9Q0ow0nEh.jpg', '#50aefe', 11771, '11771', '{"Production I.G"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11771-Bjm9Q0ow0nEh.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FTUIs_SuQfw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTUIs_SuQfw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/b7ba56e26b4ee34a9b35e8c0402fd9b71333735955_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - I Am Kuroko"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/ff896749c823ad4d2f8baada232ec1f51334103558_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - I''m Serious"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/3a29f67aebf57718c52434da6c6008d71334595584_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - It''s Better If I Can''t Win"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/9e97352274230b5718598063a91eb5231335550814_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Take Care of the Counter Attack!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/53439f55f91d44933eaa6b5fda2fc98b1335397025_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Your Basketball"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak