('ANIME', 'Kaiju No. 8', 'Kaijuu 8-gou', '怪獣８号', 'With the highest kaiju-emergence rates in the world, Japan is no stranger to attack by deadly monsters. Enter the Japan Defense Force, a military organization tasked with the neutralization of kaiju. Kafka Hibino, a kaiju-corpse cleanup man, has always dreamed of joining the force. But when he gets another shot at achieving his childhood dream, he undergoes an unexpected transformation. How can he fight kaiju now that he’s become one himself?!', '{"Action","Sci-Fi"}', '{"kaiju","monster-boy","shapeshifting","male-protagonist","super-power","shounen","henshin","urban-fantasy","military","rescue","work","primarily-adult-cast"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2024', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 286235, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx153288-25FBfFJzEQ5O.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153288-JNsWuMPMAuJL.jpg', '#f1e4ae', 153288, '52588', '{"Production I.G"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153288-JNsWuMPMAuJL.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7n_mFVPeApw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7n_mFVPeApw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/a2b47c9deadc246c19b9003ca54e12351754139469_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15 - The Strongest Division"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/95d294e16fa9cb880ce74f8c017b0a4b1753523711_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14 - The Next Generation''s Trial"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/5406d24ae05747d9f7a0da87ab5fff411752922098_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 13 - Kaiju Weapon"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/6265e4a166ec9d3f8205307855f1c80e1751711380_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Hoshina''s Day Off"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kafka Hibino", "native": "日比野カフカ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180692-rPGXuxhcKw5N.png"}, {"name": "Reno Ichikawa", "native": "市川レノ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180694-Q0Ocr4aqBu4k.png"}, {"name": "Kikoru Shinomiya", "native": "四ノ宮キコル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b183889-2Ar6AHPx2mre.png"}, {"name": "Mina Ashiro", "native": "亜白ミナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180693-i9RZuHTDwXov.png"}, {"name": "Soushirou Hoshina", "native": "保科宗四郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b205579-FRvVyrOIG8Yz.jpg"}, {"name": "Iharu Furuhashi", "native": "古橋伊春", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308020-IeQN9Kr4qV2j.png"}, {"name": "Gen Narumi", "native": "鳴海弦", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b241577-Sx4ZUByR8tE2.jpg"}, {"name": "Isao Shinomiya", "native": "四ノ宮功", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257340-jUgXEvKOSVfW.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '153288'),
('ANIME', 'Call of the Night', 'Yofukashi no Uta', 'よふかしのうた', 'Wracked by insomnia and wanderlust, Kou Yamori is driven onto the moonlit streets every night in an aimless search for something he can’t seem to name. His nightly ritual is marked by purposeless introspection — until he meets Nazuna, who might just be a vampire! Kou’s new companion could offer him dark gifts and a vampire’s immortality. But there are conditions that must be met before Kou can sink his teeth into vampirism, and he’ll have to discover just how far he’s willing to go to satisfy his desires before he can heed the Call of the Night!', '{"Comedy","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","urban-fantasy","urban","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","heterosexual","coming-of-age","primarily-female-cast","shounen","psychosexual","hikikomori","primarily-teen-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '23', '2022', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 285528, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx141391-M3ZgUKTPENUk.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/141391-JErChZ8G3b49.jpg', '#5d5de4', 141391, '50346', '{"LIDENFILMS"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/141391-JErChZ8G3b49.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ukO-ZdWS3j8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ukO-ZdWS3j8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nazuna Nanakusa", "native": "七草ナズナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168774-zoB9InjmXYq2.png"}, {"name": "Kou Yamori", "native": "夜守コウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168866-zf5bb7rmZpxX.png"}, {"name": "Akira Asai", "native": "朝井アキラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175663-JGx6M5mT9OiT.png"}, {"name": "Kiyosumi Shirakawa", "native": "白河清澄", "role":