('ANIME', 'Beyond the Boundary', 'Kyoukai no Kanata', '境界の彼方', 'They should never have met. They shouldn''t even exist. But when they come together, the entire world will change. The last surviving member of her clan, Mirai Kuriyama is cursed with the terrifying ability to control and manipulate blood, a power so heretical that she is shunned even by those with the ability to understand her "gift". Akihito Kanbara is only half human, but while the monstrous other half of his lineage seems to have doomed him to a life alone, it has also given him near invulnerability in the form of rapid healing. Alone, their futures seem bleak, but when a chance encounter brings them together, it becomes clear that they share more than just an unexpected bond. Together they share a destiny and a mission that only the two of them together may be strong enough to survive.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","urban-fantasy","demons","school","primarily-teen-cast","heterosexual","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast","magic","swordplay"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2013', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 281275, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx18153-oDqA9zQzQPOq.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/18153-Pw3uKfv6ZNqP.jpg', '#1a86ff', 18153, '18153', '{"Kyoto Animation"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/18153-Pw3uKfv6ZNqP.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BnfeVrAAS2k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BnfeVrAAS2k"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mirai Kuriyama", "native": "栗山未来", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b81751-nUEIrhRFlkKc.png"}, {"name": "Mitsuki Nase", "native": "名瀬美月", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b81753-lsPYVQvvD1TZ.png"}, {"name": "Akihito Kanbara", "native": "神原秋人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b81757-qrft6an7FZ4F.png"}, {"name": "Hiroomi Nase", "native": "名瀬博臣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b81763-inhly5z6unnV.png"}, {"name": "Miroku Fujima", "native": "藤真弥勒", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87624-znHH4g6yLxFp.png"}, {"name": "Sakura Inami", "native": "伊波桜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87625-nzrSmKvS0uC9.png"}, {"name": "Izumi Nase", "native": "名瀬泉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87626-nGSW5LVpisZh.png"}, {"name": "Ai Shindou", "native": "新堂愛", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87627-S3ZtpKf7OGWS.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '18153'),
('ANIME', 'K-ON!', 'K-ON!', 'けいおん!', 'Hirasawa Yui, a young, carefree girl entering high school, has her imagination instantly captured when she sees a poster advertising the ‘Light Music Club’. Being the carefree girl that she is, she quickly signs up. However, Yui has a problem, she is unable to play an instrument.

When Yui goes to the clubroom to explain, she''s greeted by the other members: Ritsu, Mio and Tsumugi. Although disheartened at Yui’s lack of musical know-how, they still try to convince her to stay to prevent the club’s disbandment. After playing Yui a short piece which re-ignites her imagination, they succeed in keeping their new member and guitarist.

Along with the tasks of school and homework, Yui begins to learn the guitar with the help of the other band members, experiencing many mishaps along the way. However, with the school-festival drawing near and Yui getting stuck with her practice, will the Light Music Club be ready in time for their debut?', '{"Comedy","Music","Slice of Life"}', '{"cute-girls-doing-cute-things","school-club","band","primarily-female-cast","female-protagonist","school","primarily-teen-cast","iyashikei","episodic","rock-music","coming-of-age","ensemble-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2009', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 281200, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5680-r3AI3Cwfv0Aq.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5680-Mc9n4eFI4i0Y.jpg', '#e47843', 5680, '5680', '{"Kyoto Animation"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5680-Mc9n4eFI4i0Y.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mFHue76hqt0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mFHue76hqt0"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/264984ba4a4a76d309d774ff12d3fa731613458509_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/d621813488c11342599814171d11711b1613458685_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/95dc5b4ce94ad226a2a906c70d9941831613458812_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c8d3a8d7ceb0a4deb31be87c6e78ead41613459051_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ebd9a5bbd26feed77342f820966a2bb61613459072_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/358986bdcd5af8db7e284bb08c9299291613459309_full.jpg"