('ANIME', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Hashira Training Arc', 'Kimetsu no Yaiba: Hashira Geiko-hen', '鬼滅の刃 柱稽古編', 'The Hashira, the Demon Slayer Corps'' highest ranking swordsmen and members. The Hashira Training has begun in order to face the forthcoming battle against Muzan Kibutsuji. Each with their own thoughts and hopes held in their hearts, a new story for Tanjiro and the Hashira begins.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","shounen","swordplay","cultivation","curses","male-protagonist","super-power","revenge","gore","rural","historical"}', '8', NULL, NULL, '30', '2024', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 280643, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx166240-PBV7zukIHW7V.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/166240-YdxoEhrfwNk0.jpg', '#e4d6ae', 166240, '55701', '{"ufotable"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/166240-YdxoEhrfwNk0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7w5Vfjozzb8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7w5Vfjozzb8"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/db617c3bb6a6097394baf707239ff1091554542829_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Cruelty"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/086240450f344f53dbc50765c0ba80cc1555138178_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Trainer Sakonji Urokodaki"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/249734bc86fa3b6c96697b4c0fb623671555745937_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Sabito and Makomo"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/4558b0fe17cec9f89c4e49142be8841a1556355701_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Final Selection"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ef38749be1f8c847f6cf3c543f731d861556965651_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption":