('ANIME', 'The Pet Girl of Sakurasou', 'Sakurasou no Pet na Kanojo', 'さくら荘のペットな彼女', 'The first time he saw her, it was love at first sight. Unfortunately for Sorata Kanda, "she" was a cat named Hikari and his school''s rules forbid keeping pets in the regular dorms. As a result, Sorata is banished to the infamous Sakura Hall alongside other troublesome and unusual students like Jin, overzealous playboy, Ryuunosuke, the reclusive hermit, and Mashiro, a brilliant artist who''s so unfocused and clueless about the real world that dorm supervisor Ms. Sengoku assigns Sorata the task of taking care of her along with his ever-growing collection of stray cats!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"kuudere","school","heterosexual","coming-of-age","found-family","ensemble-cast","love-triangle","work","drawing","yandere","cohabitation","disability"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2012', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 278967, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx13759-xNf0gJK4Axt2.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n13759-nBjdu6f8aLbz.jpg', '#e4506b', 13759, '13759', '{"J.C.STAFF"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n13759-nBjdu6f8aLbz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ab4fs9No18g/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ab4fs9No18g"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mashiro Shiina", "native": "椎名ましろ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b61371-rhWX0wz2DDs3.jpg"}, {"name": "Misaki Kamiigusa", "native": "上井草美咲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b64165-vQLqcAuaxxtA.png"}, {"name": "Nanami Aoyama", "native": "青山七海", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b64167-qMxw0Sijwc18.png"}, {"name": "Sorata Kanda", "native": "神田空太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://