('ANIME', 'My Teen Romantic Comedy SNAFU TOO!', 'Yahari Ore no Seishun Love Come wa Machigatteiru. Zoku', 'やはり俺の青春ラブコメはまちがっている。続', 'Yahari Ore no Seishun Love Comedy wa Machigatteiru. Zoku picks up immediately after the events of the first season, continuing the adventures of the Volunteer Service Club—the dispassionate Hachiman Hikigaya, the cheerful Yui Yuigahama, and the competitive Yukino Yukinoshita—as it dedicates itself to helping any student with issues that they may face.

With the rift among his own group widening, Hachiman begins to realize that his knack for quickly getting to the root of other people''s troubles is a double-edged sword: sometimes the best solution is not necessarily the most appropriate one.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"philosophy","school","male-protagonist","school-club","kuudere","love-triangle","coming-of-age","primarily-teen-cast","heterosexual","hikikomori","anti-hero"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2015', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 278696, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20698-YZIYor2zW3Ta.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20698-iw7Sh61XPXt3.jpg', '#e4bb93', 20698, '23847', '{"feel."}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20698-iw7Sh61XPXt3.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/b6cmXXm89cI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b6cmXXm89cI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hachiman Hikigaya", "native": "比企谷八幡", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67065-Dhec6tE2yWA9.png"}, {"name": "Yukino Yukinoshita", "native": "雪ノ下雪乃", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67067-gqhgjlni0Bcf.png"}, {"name": "Yui Yuigahama", "native": "由比ヶ浜結衣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67069-6B3xnHfJUO0F.png"}, {"name": "Iroha Isshiki", "native": "一色いろは", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88727-K9H1teOxoSLP.png"}, {"name": "Saika Totsuka", "native": "戸塚彩加", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67071-3tO9QQA9x0hV.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoshiteru Zaimokuza", "native": "材木座義輝", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67073-tz4d7ubdZrhP.png"}, {"name": "