('ANIME', 'DON''T TOY WITH ME, MISS NAGATORO', 'Ijiranaide, Nagatoro-san', 'イジらないで、長瀞さん', '"A girl in a lower grade just made me cry!"

One day, Senpai visits the library after school and becomes the target of a super sadistic junior! The name of the girl who teases, torments, and tantalizes Senpai is "Nagatoro!" She''s annoying yet adorable. It''s painful, but you still want to be by her side. This is a story about an extremely sadistic and temperamental girl and you''ll feel something awaken inside of you.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"male-protagonist","slapstick","bullying","school","heterosexual","tsundere","episodic","primarily-teen-cast","tanned-skin","primarily-female-cast","gyaru","school-club"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2021', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 269545, '69', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx120697-BA2TqxB1I5bJ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/120697-EuMfBYXLANeS.jpg', '#e4bb5d', 120697, '42361', '{"Telecom Animation Film"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/120697-EuMfBYXLANeS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4rQ1CJQZvzQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4rQ1CJQZvzQ"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/87a892e567bff71329eeba2293b4ea531641918672_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Senpai is a bit... / Senpai, don''t you ever get angry?"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/ff98e38400ec1dbe23aaf5c3656884e01642508286_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - You Got Your Wish, Senpai! / ''Sup, Senpai?!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/9b41593f4e3dabb4dde759fe042f425e1643131509_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Let''s Play Again, Senpai / Over Here, Senpai"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/2f51da67f01dbd04252df2dd6b7baa4e1643734988_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - You''re All Red, Senpai / Senpai, You Coul