('ANIME', 'The Misfit of Demon King Academy: History’s Strongest Demon King Reincarnates and Goes to School with His Descendants', 'Maou Gakuin no Futekigousha: Shijou Saikyou no Maou no Shiso, Tensei shite Shison-tachi no Gakkou e Kayou', '魔王学院の不適合者 ～史上最強の魔王の始祖、転生して子孫たちの学校へ通う～', 'Anos, the Demon King of Tyranny, has defeated humans, spirits, and gods alike. But even demon kings get tired of all the fighting sometimes! Hoping for a more peaceful life, Anos decides to reincarnate himself. When he wakes two thousand years later, though, he finds the world has become too peaceful--his descendants have grown weak and magic is in serious decline. Intending to reclaim his rightful place, he enrolls in Demon King Academy, where he finds that his magical power is off the charts. Literally. And because they can''t measure his power, the faculty and other students regard Anos as a misfit. With the support of Misha, the one student he manages to befriend, the misfit (Demon King) begins his climb up the demon ranks!', '{"Action","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"demons","magic","male-protagonist","school","super-power","swordplay","heterosexual","kuudere","tsundere","primarily-teen-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2020', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 269240, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx112301-f88Fs2es4pSr.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/112301-e50SRjhGDGUu.jpg', '#865de4', 112301, '40496', '{"SILVER LINK."}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/112301-e50SRjhGDGUu.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9qJyDlZst8c/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9qJyDlZst8c"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/e62b0f3fc248a333988a298de79165ed1599326900_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Misfit of Demon King Academy"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/c988526bd20f81b15d22c16f60f403531599894369_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Witch of Destruction"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/cbb7ff1acb48ee2972b098bb5188f49f1600513629_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Sasha''s True Intentions"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/242c0ea0f94ee498a6445a2186d1d4ba1601120530_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - 15th Birthday"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/c4185073f9ac4006c324a5ed3180336e1601713695_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - The Transfer Student"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f9e84924e958e3b5abde1f1d6d0f80b31602319507_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Magic Sword Tournament"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/1dd0ff4c584ebb28b5f35bba7468a4af1602947228_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Mother''s Words"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/13a8f0a30910896b0ec76bc91752ba341603560129_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - The Final Duel"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/a737aa13f5c4a56fbd4f005c637d2d481604166195_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - The Mystery of the Hero Academy"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/35d9e02ec94db6b16feeaaade9a8cb411604750536_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Inter-Academy Exams"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Anos Voldigoad", "native": "アノス・ヴォルディゴード", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138595-Z6j0gP9s7avX.png"}, {"name": "Misha Necron", "native": "ミーシャ・ネクロン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138596-vH3vzyBOd1gO.png"}, {"name": "Sasha Necron", "native": "サーシャ・ネクロン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139562-DAiieWEILhKa.png"}, {"name": "Kanon", "native": "カノン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138598-RwaddULdjak7.png"}, {"name": "Izabella", "native": "イザベラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139557-xBMACEOta7IF.jpg"}, {"name": "Emilia Ludowell", "native": "エミリア・ルードウェル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139558-8mO2HyNir1u0.png"}, {"name": "Zepes Indu", "native": "ゼペス・インドゥ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139559-9VEDUPxmDGzT.png"}, {"name": "Gusta Raizeo", "native": "グスタ・ライゼオ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139560-xpPvpE7PrIp1.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '112301'),
('ANIME', 'BOCCHI THE ROCK!', 'Bocchi the Rock!', 'ぼっち・ざ・ろっく！', 'Hitori Gotou, “Bocchi-chan,” is a girl who’s so introverted and shy around people that she’d always start her conversations with “Ah...”

During her middle school years, she started playing the guitar, wanting to join a band because she thought it could be an opportunity for even someone shy like her to also shine. But because she had no friends, she ended up practicing guitar for six hours every day all by herself. After becoming a skilled guitar player, she uploaded videos of herself playing the guitar to the internet under the name “Guitar Hero” and fantasized about performing at her school’s cultural festival concert. But not only could she not find any bandmates, before she knew it, she was in high school and still wasn’t able to make a single friend!

She was really close to becoming a shut-in, but one day, Nijika Ijichi, the drummer in Kessoku Band, reached out to her. And because of that, her everyday life started to change little by little...', '{"Comedy","Music","Slice of Life"}', '{"band","female-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","primarily-teen-cast","rock-music","cute-girls-doing-cute-things","coming-of-age","hikikomori","rehabilitation","surreal-comedy","meta","mixed-media"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 268675, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx130003-HTDmeL4RGeJ4.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/130003-5F90a7BtsPQN.jpg', '#e4bb50', 130003, '47917', '{"CloverWorks"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/130003-5F90a7BtsPQN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SyMMZF5zNW4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SyMMZF5zNW4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hitori Gotou", "native": "後藤ひとり", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257562-Ru35NYPfsqhY.png"}, {"name": "Nijika Ijichi", "native": "伊地知虹夏", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b261674-a8tJYvtzqWgC.png"}, {"name": "Ryou Yamada", "native": "山田リョウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264529-BvEusZnJLD2Y.png"}, {"name": "Ikuyo Kita", "native": "喜多郁代", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266041-1HKgjJGP2MmM.png"}, {"name": "Seika Ijichi", "native": "伊地知星歌", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289054-UnScwd5RkqBk.png"}, {"name": "Kikuri Hiroi", "native": "廣井きくり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291639-VYrixXvuwLqx.png"}, {"name": "PA-san", "native": "PAさん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289055-khOP70WdXl2V.jpg"}, {"name": "Futari Gotou", "native": "後藤ふたり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289059-AbMjfO2YoThz.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '130003'),
('ANIME', 'Overlord II', 'Overlord II', 'オーバーロードⅡ', 'Continuing his quest to rule this new world, Ains begins to put the pieces in place for his conquest. But between a Lizard Man tribe uprising, and performing missions as adamantite adventurer Lord Momon, Ains has his work cut out for him! Thankfully he has his most loyal and willing subordinates to do his bidding. Nothing and no one can stop the supreme and mighty Overlord in his quest to rule all!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","anti-hero","skeleton","male-protagonist","magic","butler","ensemble-cast","super-power","politics","kingdom-management","virtual-world","demons"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2018', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 268362, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98437-5q0GWqHhNAgJ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98437-yZXtJz59UMAo.jpg', '#285d78', 98437, '35073', '{"MADHOUSE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98437-yZXtJz59UMAo.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/c3Jt_EXwGBc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c3Jt_EXwGBc"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/b0b4730ef0a27db3125ce574d83a0ee81494830437_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - End and Beginning"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/f6b7803c41748f4814b2a6a26914a7ed1494830450_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Floor Guardians"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/f8be8e5c6098724d8f4c8e420081b80e1494831102_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Battle at Carne Village"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/f914d7d54c4a3d2d42b8007bb6fee24e1494832194_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Ruler of Death"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/7d6bd0278981a627933