('ANIME', 'Fullmetal Alchemist', 'Hagane no Renkinjutsushi', '鋼の錬金術師', 'The rules of alchemy state that to gain something, one must lose something of equal value. Alchemy is the process of taking apart and reconstructing an object into a different entity, with the rules of alchemy to govern this procedure. However, there exists an object that can bring any alchemist above these rules, the object known as the Philosopher''s Stone. The young Edward Elric is a particularly talented alchemist who through an accident years back lost his younger brother Alphonse and one of his legs. Sacrificing one of his arms as well, he used alchemy to bind his brother''s soul to a suit of armor. This lead to the beginning of their journey to restore their bodies, in search for the legendary Philosopher''s Stone.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"alchemy","philosophy","magic","male-protagonist","military","coming-of-age","shounen","travel","body-horror","steampunk","disability"}', '51', NULL, NULL, '25', '2003', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 267992, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx121-zjmixZ428Mwv.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/121-t5K7c8WRuPWl.jpg', '#e4bb43', 121, '121', '{"bones"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/121-t5K7c8WRuPWl.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/35cs5zFr2h8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=35cs5zFr2h8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Edward Elric", "native": "エドワード・エルリック", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11-TA5Nuk7EDUZG.jpg"}, {"name": "Alphonse Elric", "native": "アルフォンス・エルリック", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12-tCKu8yK5kFL5.jpg"}, {"name": "Winry Rockbell", "native": "ウィンリィ・ロックベル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/63-xloedtYxiJ2E.jpg"}, {"name": "Pinako Rockbell", "native": "ピナコ・ロックベル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65-Yw7j20Y9uewh.png"}, {"name": "Scar", "native": "スカー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66-bLbGWXrmDqfV.png"}, {"name": "Izumi Curtis", "native": "イズミ・カーティス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67-ggB3aC6DzQqB.png"}, {"name": "Roy Mustang", "native": "ロイ・マスタング", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b68-moBLY2WO2am3.png"}, {"name": "Maes Hughes", "native": "マース･ヒューズ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b69-MRetSG8Qevvu.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '121'),
('ANIME', 'Fate/stay night: Unlimited Blade Works', 'Fate/stay night: Unlimited Blade Works', 'Fate/stay night [Unlimited Blade Works]', 'Fuyuki City - a city surrounded by the sea and mountains becomes the setting for an ancient ritual. Seven masters are given control of heroic spirits in order to realize the mythical Holy Grail, which is said to grant its owner any wish. These heroic spirits or servants represent legendary heroes of various classes: "Saber," "Lancer," "Archer," "Rider," "Caster," "Assassin," and "Berserker." Each master will enter into a contract with their chosen servant and battle the others to the death until only one pair remains... This is the "Holy Grail War."

The young and capable mage, Rin Tohsaka, prepares for her long-awaited Fifth Holy Grail War to begin... With her servant Archer, Rin enters the Holy Grail War as the sole heir to the prestigious Tohsaka family after her father''s death. But when Shirou Emiya, a boy from Rin''s school, unwittingly becomes a Master and is fatally wounded in battle, she has no choice but to save him. With Shirou and his servant Saber, Rin sets out to strike down the conspiracies surrounding the Holy Grail War. Will the Holy Grail bless Rin and Shirou''s path toward victory or will they be cursed with defeat?

- Includes Prologue.

- The first, second and last episodes aired with a runtime of ~48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.

- Based on the second route from TYPE-MOON''s visual novel, Fate/stay night.', '{"Action","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"magic","battle-royale","death-game","super-power","urban-fantasy","mythology","spearplay","swordplay","tsundere","heterosexual","philosophy","urban"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2014', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 267098, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx19603-ycT0pyEgDVQu.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19603.jpg', '#e4a135', 19603, '22297', '{"ufotable"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19603.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/61RuoLIlCUM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=61RuoLIlCUM"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/ae00b085b0ad23ee0da4611d110611fb1412428104_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 0 - Prologue"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/a2be2d40e4720ca07d02a5d51146404f1412892339_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Winter Days, A Fateful Night"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/28f64d99d57203ca0dd9635a00a4d1d11413582331_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Curtain Goes Up"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/5ff5a4dc6f97f07700698972be9e63ff1414218206_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - The First Battle"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/3235818976259d3cfdfb22837206001d1414848143_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Finding the Will to Fight"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/87b77fb025792060407d4b993f3518841415409542_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Dancing After School"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/48139eb3765e9575dbdd7a58015479f41416017227_full.jpg", "kind": "episode