('ANIME', 'Classroom of the Elite Season 2', 'Youkoso Jitsuryoku Shijou Shugi no Kyoushitsu e 2nd Season', 'ようこそ実力至上主義の教室へ 2nd Season', 'Tokyo Metropolitan Advanced Nurturing High School seems like a paradise, but in reality, it is an extreme meritocracy. In the class of underachievers, Kiyotaka has begun working with Suzune, who seeks to ascend higher. After a survival test on an uninhabited island, they get to enjoy a luxury liner, but a new class-scrambling test will begin.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological"}', '{"school","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","female-harem","battle-royale","ensemble-cast","delinquents","gyaru","coming-of-age","athletics","tsundere","kuudere"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 264221, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx145545-DGl3LVvFlnHi.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145545-XeHhS7dJJLlj.jpg', '#bbe4f1', 145545, '51096', '{"Lerche"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145545-XeHhS7dJJLlj.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0mM3lQytac4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0mM3lQytac4"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/1534c9fb80791aec609a7a69a646ba9a1499855007_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - What is evil? Whatever springs from weakness."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/baed8721c7eb199a3510f5480a85daf61500455126_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - It takes a great talent and skill to conceal one''s talent and skill."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/3567e8e02102088cce9729592c4913f31501036435_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Man is an animal that makes bargains: no other animal does this - no dog exchanges bones with another."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/c8ac32874631ac71df0dce8cac56ef751501537596_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - We should not be upset that others hide the truth from us, when we hide it so often from ourselves."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/72c8a01b2a35d2009ec82e27ebc8971d1502233395_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Hell is other people"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/50787a27e4ad4bc1abb02ca06010fcc51502856899_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - There are two kinds of lies; one concerns an accomplished fact, the other concerns a future duty."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/7667c5006cce53d12ba118edbe8bb8901503443247_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Nothing is as dangerous as an ignorant friend; a wise enemy is to be preferred"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/49651088d9dc22d9344527273d61b97d1504092728_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Abandon all hope, ye who enter here."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/a442c72cdc17055413d0175ff4f92fad1504694413_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Man is condemned to be free."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/43dfdd4172641a4f26c4892d93a29e671505296430_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Every man has in himself the most dangerous traitor of all"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kiyotaka Ayanokouji", "native": "綾小路清隆", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123212-ewZgUQr9vvEM.png"}, {"name": "Suzune Horikita", "native": "堀北鈴音", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123213-jUfrGBXfW7BL.png"}, {"name": "Kei Karuizawa", "native": "軽井沢恵", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141122-6Zk52eU3VK3O.png"}, {"name": "Kakeru Ryuuen", "native": "龍園翔", "role": "MAIN",