('ANIME', 'The Irregular at Magic High School', 'Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei', '魔法科高校の劣等生', 'Magic is a product of neither legends nor fairy tales, but instead has become a technology of reality since a time unknown to people. Supernatural power became a technology systematized through magic, while magic became a technical skill. A "Supernatural Power User" became a "Magic Technician." Magic Technicians (in short, Magicians) are nurtured through Magic High Schools and Universities.

This is a story about: 

Tatsuya, a defective elder brother low achiever.

Miyuki, a perfect, flawless younger sister high achiever.

After both siblings entered a Magic High School,

The stage of daily turbulence was unveiled—.', '{"Action","Romance","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"magic","school","male-protagonist","military","incest","guns","primarily-teen-cast"}', '26', NULL, NULL, '23', '2014', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 261335, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20458-tGh343Ew10yU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20458-6sHThFCwyd1T.jpg', '#5dbbe4', 20458, '20785', '{"MADHOUSE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20458-6sHThFCwyd1T.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U-gkwdGooDU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U-gkwdGooDU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Miyuki Shiba", "native": "司波深雪", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b55741-FX0mwEYDYZmw.png"}, {"name": "Tatsuya Shiba", "native": "司波達也", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b55743-g5JD7Dj6iP7R.png"}, {"name": "Erika Chiba", "native": "千葉エリカ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b72311-dfnWHh76AnU9.png"}, {"name": "Azusa Nakajou", "native": "中条あずさ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b72563-E0zvek4ZgDGC.png"}, {"name": "Haruka Ono", "native": "小野遥", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b72569-HA0ZIHUdrlCn.png"}, {"name": "Harunobu Kazama", "native": "風間玄信", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b73187-rHGDN4FCLdjS.png"}, {"name": "Katsuto Juumonji", "native": "十文字克人", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b73471-o0yGvY0Zeigz.png"}, {"name": "Yakumo Kokonoe", "native": "九重八雲", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/