('ANIME', 'Ouran High School Host Club', 'Ouran Koukou Host Club', '桜蘭高校ホスト部', 'Fujioka Haruhi wins a scholarship to attend Ouran Academy, a school reserved for only the most rich and prestigious. Despite what other students may think of her, she cares little for physical appearances or the fact that she is a commoner.

Unfortunately for Haruhi, her high school days take a sudden turn when she stumbles upon the Host Club, an elite club filled with super rich and beautiful boys who use their specific traits and charms to entertain young ladies. Even worse, Haruhi accidentally breaks an 8-million yen vase in the club. Since she is unable to repay her debt with money, Haruhi finds herself with no choice but to work for the Host Club, becoming a male host herself.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school-club","shoujo","crossdressing","parody","surreal-comedy","school","male-harem","female-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","ensemble-cast","primarily-male-cast","cute-boys-doing-cute-things"}', '26', NULL, NULL, '24', '2006', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 259680, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx853-fiUtW8yohsSF.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/853-03VYT300hMaf.jpg', '#f1f1c9', 853, '853', '{"bones"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/853-03VYT300hMaf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZM8a3QYtOfA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZM8a3QYtOfA"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f2053a335651d4c7b02a8e7b44ee75941510604866_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Starting Today, You Are a Host!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/e8000bef69f24d14e984d3a56a7f55d81510605403_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Job of a High School Host!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/2d07dbeb5e0a2f1538530667b33d60361510609466_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Beware the Physical Exam!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/0d635764e2890e97dca69d7c22bf75ca1510606692_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Attack of the Lady Manag