('ANIME', 'Serial Experiments Lain', 'serial experiments lain', 'serial experiments lain', 'We''re all connected... There is the world around us, a world of people, tactile sensation, and culture. There is the wired world, inside the computer, of images, personalities, virtual experiences, and a culture all of its own. The day after a classmate commits suicide, Lain, a 14-year-old girl, discovers how closely the two worlds are linked when she receives an e-mail from the dead girl: I just abandoned my body. I still live here...

Has the line between the real world and the wired world begun to blur?', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"denpa","philosophy","augmented-reality","female-protagonist","artificial-intelligence","cyberpunk","conspiracy","suicide","religion","meta","urban","primarily-female-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '23', '1998', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 255285, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx339-xF2wp1NQuQ4r.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/339-Lh0tuuwRLRgI.jpg', '#e4a1d6', 339, '339', '{"Triangle Staff"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/339-Lh0tuuwRLRgI.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lpv7Wv-sDAo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lpv7Wv-sDAo"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/62c59371c7a636841f0befa25f65b2201496058196_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Weird"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/6fec98070cadc5ca83caa3de5c06979f1496064265_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Girls"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/89e48a1342d739b2830029b3618987e61496065850_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Psyche"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/d9046c1403fff322dd4e71ed424e80471496066585_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Religion"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/9c5ec6d9e3559b683f0cabcf472f4de81496066136_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Distortion"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/da78eea90d238fa5fbf98df6cba254331496066314_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Kids"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/b4bf05c67dbaf3ad6cd8d5a9051d91931496067187_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption":