('ANIME', '5 Centimeters per Second', 'Byousoku 5 Centimeter', '秒速５センチメートル', 'Tohno Takaki and Shinohara Akari, two very close friends and classmates, are torn apart when Akari''s family is transferred to another region of Japan due to her family''s job. Despite separation, they continue to keep in touch through mail. When Takaki finds out that his family is also moving, he decides to meet with Akari one last time.

As years pass by, they continue down their own paths, their distance slowly growing wider and their contact with one another fades. Yet, they keep remembering one another and the times they have shared together, wondering if they will have the chance to meet once again.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","heterosexual","denpa","travel","trains","male-protagonist","female-protagonist"}', '3', NULL, NULL, '22', '2007', 'WINTER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 251822, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1689-rJKhjLEjQHSy.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1689.jpg', '#d6a178', 1689, '1689', '{"CoMix Wave"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1689.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iPsu_sk-e7Q/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iPsu_sk-e7Q"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/6484754e13e0727f2875960f2fdca21d1488979795_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "5 Centimeters per Second (Subtitled)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/bd0d9ca6ead5963cdcdca1a265318aaf1488973676_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "5 Centimeters per Second (Dubbed)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/10f9779644982efe3144cabf756c323b1765651240_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - 5 Centimeters per Second"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Takaki Tohno", "native": "遠野貴樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1810-mqwzwrC5XnOW.png"}, {"name": "Akari Shinohara", "native": "篠原明里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1811-6uPM6WpVt20k.png"}, {"name": "Kanae Sumida", "native": "澄田花苗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/1812.jpg"}, {"name": "Kanae no Ane", "native": "花苗の姉", "rol