('ANIME', 'Deadman Wonderland', 'Deadman Wonderland', 'デッドマン・ワンダーランド', 'Ganta is the only survivor after a mysterious man in red slaughters a classroom full of teenagers. He''s framed for the carnage, sentenced to die, and locked away in the most twisted prison ever built: Deadman Wonderland. And then it gets worse. 

At Deadman Wonderland, convicts are forced into brutal deathmatches for the amusement of the masses, the cheers of the crowd drowning out the screams of the dismembered. Even when Ganta befriends Shiro, an unusual female inmate, his dark fate crushes all hope —until he discovers the strange ability to wield his spilled blood as a weapon. Ganta learns his new skill might be related to the murderous man in red and uncovers disturbing secrets that could expose those who stole his freedom. He''s determined to see justice served —but first he''ll have to fight for his life in a prison that holds a million ways to die.', '{"Action","Drama","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"prison","survival","super-power","gore","death-game","anti-hero","shounen","male-protagonist","dissociative-identities","urban-fantasy"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2011', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 251330, '67', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx6880-qZ1jIqIYpST2.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6880-eq4JajOW0HOd.jpg', NULL, 6880, '6880', '{"Manglobe"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6880-eq4JajOW0HOd.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BA_fnEQ5PEk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BA_fnEQ5PEk"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/dbafb53ef093a544d94b76b630fc95cf1481813904_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Death Row Inmate"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/322124983b90d90e27b828313cb830781481815314_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Antidote - Candy"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/440e11fe53e7c61626319c73e4d4b8a81481816767_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - G Block"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/96fd1fea6c69ab2187c1eb259ee8f8db1481817379_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Crow Claw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/c3e80106295eef84854cc2922c27eed31481817502_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Carnival Corpse"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/0cceaee9f0eb7d45d7e9999f703f7a771481818522_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Hummingbird"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/9333df47f1017aa969666151c80f145d1481819842_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Wretched Egg"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/977cf543d8fb0739000897e847c499081481832530_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Scar Chain"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/920f06136615e0cfb88c80d5ebfc996d1481821072_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Worm Eater"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/c2f47deef48f631803a0f30b1ae0ad4e1481862746_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Undertaker"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ganta Igarashi", "native": "五十嵐丸太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8630-Yv2hK4ye8lqW.png"}, {"name": "Shiro", "native": "シロ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8631-c6VT3zQUGAU5.jpg"}, {"name": "Kiyomasa Senji", "native": "千地清正", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12944-W5b3uu7HEGez.png"}, {"name": "You Takami", "native": "鷹見羊", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/15842.jpg"}, {"name": "Minatsuki Takami", "native": "鷹見水名月", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b15843-bFwfZZHUdGfw.png"}, {"name": "Karako Koshio", "native": "興緒唐子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/15844.jpg"}, {"name": "Nagi Kengamine", "native": "剣ヶ峰凪", "role": "S