('ANIME', 'The Garden of Words', 'Kotonoha no Niwa', '言の葉の庭', 'Some people revel and play in the rain; others dread it and hide at the first drop. For high school student Takao, a summer shower is a source of artistic inspiration… but when he skips school in order to sketch in a rainy garden, Takao finds an even greater muse in Yukino, an older woman who seems adrift in the world. Despite the difference in their ages and lives, they strike up a comfortable relationship that slowly evolves as they randomly meet in the same garden whenever it rains. But with the rainy season coming to a close, Takao wonders if there''s enough time left to put his feelings into actions and words.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","heterosexual","male-protagonist","urban","drawing"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '46', '2013', 'SPRING', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 249274, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx16782-qpFGk18UqaHn.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16782.jpg', '#93e450', 16782, '16782', '{"CoMix Wave"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/16782.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/udDIkl6z8X0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udDIkl6z8X0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Takao Akizuki", "native": "秋月孝雄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/79463.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukari Yukino", "native": "雪野百香里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n79465-9RmwiUdbYlo9.png"}, {"name": "Shouko Aizawa", "native": "相沢硝子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/79573.jpg"}, {"name": "Matsumoto", "native": "松本", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/79575.jpg"}, {"name": "Satou", "native": "佐藤", "role":