('ANIME', 'The Rising of the Shield Hero Season 2', 'Tate no Yuusha no Nariagari Season 2', '盾の勇者の成り上がり Season 2', 'With another Wave happening in a week, Naofumi Iwatani and his party have no time to waste. However, when bat familiars raid Lurolona Village and the Wave countdown comes to a halt, the Four Cardinal Heroes reconvene with the queen, Mirelia Q Melromarc, for a quick briefing. The queen presumes that the odd occurrences are linked to the Spirit Tortoise—a threatening creature that has awakened from its slumber, back to cause havoc once again. A plan to put the Spirit Tortoise to rest is devised—but out of the four men, only the cursed Shield Hero agrees to help.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","male-protagonist","magic","travel","medieval","cgi","kemonomimi","slavery","female-harem","kingdom-management"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 247669, '65', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx111321-dIr3dEKOIPer.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/111321-nnetF1qONAcE.jpg', '#e47835', 111321, '40356', '{"Kinema Citrus","DR Movie"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/111321-nnetF1qONAcE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gMZDGyihTyc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMZDGyihTyc"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/4b7dc586ab907d262783726d6227a95c1753876069_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Entrusted Power"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/733a0bb881baf70512c8cb1afd83edb71753268667_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - A True People"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/b7a374941d6251dbf79c416c13b59ad11752668662_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Official Welcome"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.co