('ANIME', 'Masamune-kun''s Revenge', 'Masamune-kun no Revenge', '政宗くんのリベンジ', 'As an overweight child, Makabe Masamune was mercilessly teased and bullied by one particular girl, Adagaki Aki. Determined to one day exact his revenge upon her, Makabe begins a rigorous regimen of self-improvement and personal transformation.

Years later, Masamune re-emerges as a new man. Handsome, popular, with perfect grades and good at sports, Masamune-kun transfers to Aki''s school, and is unrecognizable to her. Now, Masamune-kun is ready to confront the girl who bullied him so many years ago and humiliate her at last. But will revenge be as sweet as he thought?', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"male-protagonist","revenge","tsundere","school","primarily-female-cast","ojou-sama","bullying","heterosexual","kuudere","female-harem","fitness"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2017', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 245771, '66', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21857-haPDVD7DKDpg.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21857-k7r362xG7420.png', '#a1c9e4', 21857, '33487', '{"SILVER LINK."}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21857-k7r362xG7420.png", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XmfXcVLA1d8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XmfXcVLA1d8"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/9dd47fe077065faf20e70514056d8e371483616570_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Boy Who Was Called Pig''s Foot"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/d83b73f2b0134b36bfbb98b7a119db021484084298_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Cinderella Doesn''t Smile"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/a22be3cf30b4a32f28de4545d90454321484704661_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Yoshino''s Magic Show"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/10ff77cd626412f59db7e099226207ab1485219408_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Clear and Present Danger"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/b577c3a317a27cc4a1f2611795dc06c01485815285_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Mysterious Ca