('ANIME', 'Guilty Crown', 'Guilty Crown', 'ギルティクラウン', 'Shuu''s entire world was shattered after a meteorite crashed into Japan, unleashing the lethal Apocalypse Virus. The chaos and anarchy born of the outbreak cost Shuu his family and reduced him to a timid, fearful shell of the boy he''d once been. His life took another unexpected turn after a chance encounter with the stunning pop star, Inori. This mysterious beauty introduced Shuu to the King''s Right Hand: a genetic mutation that allows him to reach into hearts of mortals and turn them into weapons.

Shuu finds himself caught in the crossfire between those who desperately seek his newfound strength. On one side lurks a clandestine government agency, and on the other, Inori and the spirited band of rebels known as Funeral Parlor. The choice is Shuu''s to make - and the world is his to change.', '{"Action","Drama","Mecha","Psychological","Romance","Sci-Fi"}', '{"super-power","terrorism","dystopian","pandemic","post-apocalyptic","anti-hero","real-robot","female-protagonist","urban","nekomimi","politics","kuudere"}', '22', NULL, NULL, '24', '2011', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 242555, '69', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10793-KCysCbrVNqK9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10793-xmJErpujAeD7.jpg', '#2893a1', 10793, '10793', '{"Production I.G"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10793-xmJErpujAeD7.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JToS6gmWzgw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JToS6gmWzgw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/fb4a0934bc67343f5d77a33a2f18afb61672780927_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - genesis (Outbreak)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/09a598f7ffb9a79937d10446aeadf9271672781117_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - survival of the fittest (The Fit)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/250528fe3448ace6006c46c58068a7031672781106_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - void-sampling (Phanerosis)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/27c82c458acd60a84b04a4570e27adf31672781169_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - flux (Indecision)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/a77d3c18b930ec94d7f0f00d0425092d1672781226_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - a preparation (Training)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/051a3b8e1dc79867dbc59e0dceec414c1672781350_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - leukocytes (Cage)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/ced6a502b7f3407ae528a6f7990bfba41672781528_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - temptation (Round Dance)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/de1297e5bb3efd6bd2e215ffc6ecfd981672781646_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - courtship behavior (Hot Summer Day)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/a5eac8d2f5cdedbf9eae8235e7b7fe011672781706_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - prey (Predation)"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/4a22eafde72f3336204e8cf93f1bee011672781828_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - retraction (Degeneration)"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shuu Ouma", "native": "桜満集", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43278-qtyFTwAaLiLb.jpg"}, {"name": "Inori Yuzuriha", "native": "楪いのり", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43280-dxRTpIioqSg7.png"}, {"name": "Gai Tsutsugami", "native": "恙神涯", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43279-LFT3GGDngMoH.png"}, {"name": "Ayase Shinomiya", "native": "篠宮綾瀬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43281-KRzz5zmmrcC5.png"}, {"name": "Tsugumi", "native": "ツグミ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43282-kYrfRKACKpkD.png"}, {"name": "Hare Menjou", "native": "校条祭", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/46083.jpg"}, {"name": "Yahiro Samukawa", "native": "寒川谷尋", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46085-aLRBe7odTpBy.png"}, {"name": "Souta Tamadate", "