('ANIME', 'Toilet-bound Hanako-kun', 'Jibaku Shounen Hanako-kun', '地縛少年 花子くん', '"Hanako-san, Hanako-san... are you there?"

At Kamome Academy, rumors abound about the school''s Seven Mysteries, one of which is Hanako-san. Said to occupy the third stall of the third floor girls'' bathroom in the old school building, Hanako-san grants any wish when summoned. Nene Yashiro, an occult-loving high school girl who dreams of romance, ventures into this haunted bathroom... but the Hanako-san she meets there is nothing like she imagined! Kamome Academy''s Hanako-san... is a boy!', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"ghost","youkai","mythology","school","female-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy","episodic","shounen","exorcism","ensemble-cast"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2020', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 240053, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx108463-u03vrYnyB3L9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108463-pJ5XS6oJwvKh.jpg', '#e48628', 108463, '39534', '{"Lerche"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108463-pJ5XS6oJwvKh.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CKnXq1qaTG0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CKnXq1qaTG0"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/8ee88928c3fbf88078b55e77c075819e1754206685_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 17 - Aoi and Akane"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/efd81aeb76b178223c63015e6cc098841753601696_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 16 - Sumire"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/f6e94e14679069d593a3413f7e20297c1752997850_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15 - The Reaper''s Sacrifice"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/885ce7fd9fa943063e18c3a50c89c6181752392371_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14 - The Near Shore and the Far Shore"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll