('ANIME', 'Kakegurui xx', 'Kakegurui ××', '賭ケグルイ××', 'At Hyakkao Private Academy, Yumeko Jabami’s star rises just as the student council’s reputation starts to dim. In the shadows of the council’s dwindling power, discord reigns supreme. In a bold effort to rebalance the social scales, student council president Kirari Momobami intends to place her bet on the election for the council’s next president. Everyone starts with a single chip, and at the end of 30 days, the whoever holds the most becomes the president of the Momobami Clan. But chips aren’t the only things students can wager as they fight tooth and nail to ascend to the council presidency, and Yumeko Jabami intends to clean house no matter the prizes she must risk in the betting pool.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological"}', '{"gambling","school","female-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","anti-hero","primarily-teen-cast","yandere","death-game","slavery","villainess","shounen"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 238646, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100876-RfvmpW1B8bDQ.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n100876-gqt1fZKTubPm.jpg', '#8650e4', 100876, '37086', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n100876-gqt1fZKTubPm.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8fCIcho7N4k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fCIcho7N4k"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yumeko Jabami", "native": "蛇喰夢子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121889-ABsurpy5SjOW.png"}, {"name": "Mary Saotome", "native": "早乙女芽亜里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122687-jl1wk9rjO57e.png"}, {"name": "Ryouta Suzui", "native": "鈴井涼太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122688-DdMMQtWRdch