('ANIME', 'Grand Blue Dreaming', 'Grand Blue', 'ぐらんぶる', 'A new life begins for Kitahara Iori as he begins his college career near the ocean in Izu city, full of excitement for his new life. He will be moving into his Uncle''s diving store "Grand Blue." There he finds the beautiful ocean, beautiful women, and men that love diving and alcohol. Will Iori be able to live his dream college life?', '{"Comedy","Slice of Life","Sports"}', '{"school-club","coastal","slapstick","nudity","college","primarily-adult-cast","seinen","male-protagonist","surreal-comedy","female-protagonist","scuba-diving","ensemble-cast"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2018', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 237764, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100922-uxEhaCsqMMp3.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100922-ef1bBJCUCfxk.jpg', '#5daee4', 100922, '37105', '{"Zero-G"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100922-ef1bBJCUCfxk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m-nN3SlHwZk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m-nN3SlHwZk"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/a32a424250dea3901631ca5586a321e41754324104_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - First Time at a Women''s University"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/7d6517b05728835e3408c46ab344a7511753710649_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Ticket Scramble"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/b7a0d15bd060efc98f2bb98f13b46a261753113817_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Association"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/4e5fe4f360d29f563c9fb08de156d00f1752510150_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Brother"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/f1c6c639f46f295b36f643b6e28881bd1751902293_full.jpg", "k