('ANIME', 'The Quintessential Quintuplets 2', 'Go-toubun no Hanayome ∬', '五等分の花嫁∬', 'Through their tutor Fuutarou Uesugi''s diligent guidance, the Nakano quintuplets'' academic performance shows signs of improvement, even if their path to graduation is still rocky. However, as they continue to cause various situations that delay any actual tutoring, Fuutarou becomes increasingly involved with their personal lives, further complicating their relationship with each other.

On another note, Fuutarou slowly begins to realize the existence of a possible connection between him and the past he believes to have shared with one of the five girls. With everyone''s feelings beginning to develop and overlap, will they be able to keep their bond strictly to that of a teacher and his students—or will it mature into something else entirely?', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"twins","female-harem","male-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","ensemble-cast","heterosexual","school","teacher","tsundere","shounen","primarily-teen-cast","kuudere"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2021', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 235530, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx109261-65rKxMDlcU9r.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/109261-UfxQjnmmfAOp.jpg', '#50aee4', 109261, '39783', '{"Bibury Animation Studios"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/109261-UfxQjnmmfAOp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cj6NGP9nNwI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cj6NGP9nNwI"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/4af2bfc0975916473c2d6bd9467134e91547154171_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Quintessential Quintuplets"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c8fb184801daa47c3891908fb4997ac01547741220_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Rooftop Confession"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/aeded9a5d5d5ae5abe8735028f6859fc1548320545_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - A Mountain of Problems"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/0b0ba7b6fd08ce31fd95639589097c061548970006_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - A Day Off"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f9b09eadee24d0957b6d58313ee87dc81549535037_full.jpg", "k