('ANIME', 'Yuri!!! on ICE', 'Yuuri!!! on ICE', 'ユーリ!!! on ICE', 'Yuri Katsuki makes his way to the Grand Prix ice skating competition as Japan’s top representative with his eyes on the prize. However, instead of celebrating, Yuri walks away defeated and ready to retire for good. But a run-in with champion Viktor Nikiforov and rising star Yuri Plisetsky ignites a new fire within him. With the two of them close by his side, Yuri will take to the ice once more.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Sports"}', '{"ice-sports","primarily-male-cast","male-protagonist","foreign","boys-love","bisexual","primarily-adult-cast","rotoscoping","coming-of-age","cute-boys-doing-cute-things","ballet"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2016', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 232797, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21709-aqPBDxJPruYR.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21709-5AqBq4m5bE7S.jpg', '#1a86e4', 21709, '32995', '{"MAPPA"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21709-5AqBq4m5bE7S.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r5BL6gBZjOI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5BL6gBZjOI"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/706ca4e1a318de3b12382be5d86523841475689126_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Easy as Pirozhki!! The Grand Prix Final of Tears"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/65d9adbf2373bf3eddfea48386a5ce291476124474_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Two Yuris?! Drama at Yu-topia"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a7b3e009a5ecf1107a80837c10c2211a1476887308_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - I Am Eros, and Eros Is Me?! Face-Off! Hot Springs on Ice"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/bac1a2097370fe7f3862a871e7bbe1901477508040_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Epi