('ANIME', 'Arifureta: From Commonplace to World''s Strongest', 'Arifureta Shokugyou de Sekai Saikyou', 'ありふれた職業で世界最強', 'When a classroom of students is transported to another world to act as its saviors, Hajime Nagumo finds himself the weakest link. As his friends and classmates are granted strong classes and impressive abilities due to their existing skills, he is given the weak title of Synergist. When a dungeon quest leaves him separated from his group, Hajime must discover his own talents or be left to rot in this world forever.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Psychological"}', '{"isekai","male-protagonist","magic","dungeon","anti-hero","cgi","nudity","medieval","exiled","cosmic-horror","female-harem","primarily-female-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 231980, '65', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx100668-DvOn5bMOt4cy.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100668-9ZQSB5x5St7c.jpg', NULL, 100668, '36882', '{"WHITE FOX","Asread"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100668-9ZQSB5x5St7c.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xoIaPNWLxy0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xoIaPNWLxy0"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/e51568dd26229be891adde17ec5139b21739793876_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 16 - The Key to the World"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/46afea30121b2088b6f893cfa4704d931739202613_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15 - What Makes a Hero"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/d7053261565574e5e3a53a9791afd8af1738591739_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14 - The Overpowered Vampire Princess and the Godlike Rabbit''s Grand Battle"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/a3f81104edff4127f15c13eb70d6db