('ANIME', 'No Game, No Life Zero', 'No Game No Life Zero', 'ノーゲーム・ノーライフ ゼロ', 'Six thousand years before Sora and Shiro were even a blink in the history of Disboard, war consumed the land, tearing apart the heavens, destroying stars, and even threatening to wipe out the human race. Amid the chaos and destruction, a young man named Riku leads humanity toward the tomorrow his heart believes in. One day, in the ruins of an Elf city, he meets Schwi, a female exiled "Ex Machina" android who asks him to teach her what it means to have a human heart.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"war","gods","post-apocalyptic","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","espionage","dystopian","class-struggle","magic","board-game","elf","kuudere"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '110', '2017', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 231563, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21875-ybSgx75MgRMM.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21875-WWkiWSnNcdbt.jpg', '#50aee4', 21875, '33674', '{"MADHOUSE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21875-WWkiWSnNcdbt.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0i1AxFdlu0M/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0i1AxFdlu0M"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Schwi Dola", "native": "シュヴィ・ドーラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123690-dqDSiX7eEypZ.png"}, {"name": "Riku Dola", "native": "リク・ドーラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123691-veqBVhK2NhGn.png"}, {"name": "Couronna Dola", "native": "コローネ・ドーラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123692-3SbwcDXLetz6.png"}, {"name": "Sora", "native": "空", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b82523-JB9oevKyXWfc.png"}, {"name": "Shiro", "native": "白", "rol