('ANIME', 'DAN DA DAN Season 2', 'Dandadan 2nd Season', 'ダンダダン 第2期', 'While the mission to exorcise Jin "Jiji" Enjouji''s family home is underway, things are not going as expected. Momo Ayase narrowly evades an attempted abduction while Ken "Okarun" Takakura and Jiji are ambushed by the Kitou family—the unsettling landlords of the cursed estate. The trio''s efforts threaten the foundation of this enigmatic town shrouded in legends and mysteries.

As Momo, Okarun, and Jiji are drawn deeper into the maze of folklore and supernatural entities, they must each utilize their unique powers if they want to survive and unravel the secrets of the uncanny town.', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Romance","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"youkai","ghost","shounen","aliens","surreal-comedy","urban-fantasy","female-protagonist","heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","henshin","unrequited-love"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2025', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 229980, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx185660-uB8RUMBGovGr.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185660-NdXFgzcYmcDz.jpg', '#f1ae28', 185660, '60543', '{"Science SARU"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185660-NdXFgzcYmcDz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/F2utpez5t3g/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F2utpez5t3g"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/26cf61beea38f75cd93ff550699058851753972446_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 17 - We Can All Stay There Together!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/0c09a38b4014fe2a51ab56f29a29dcc51753369763_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 16 - That''s, Like, Way Deadly"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/ed0cef3e966b0d5fd5e2d4112827fde91752765059_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15 - You Won''t Get Away with This!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/94726726b14192079456dc62491fc48e1752160129_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14 - The Evil Eye"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/18e1fa11eebd18e47332034e44605a931751553922_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 13 - Like, This Is the Legend of the Giant Snake"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ken Takakur