('ANIME', 'Delicious in Dungeon', 'Dungeon Meshi', 'ダンジョン飯', 'When young adventurer Laios and his company are attacked and soundly thrashed by a dragon deep in a dungeon, the party loses all its money and provisions...and a member! They''re eager to go back and save her, but there is just one problem: If they set out with no food or coin to speak of, they''re sure to starve on the way! But Laios comes up with a brilliant idea: "Let''s eat the monsters!" Slimes, basilisks, and even dragons...none are safe from the appetites of these dungeon-crawling gourmands!', '{"Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","food","magic","primarily-adult-cast","ensemble-cast","elf","medieval","environmental","dragons","lost-civilization","female-protagonist","chimera"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '25', '2024', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 228392, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx153518-IVXPDY5ph3kO.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153518-7uRvV7SLqmHV.jpg', '#e48650', 153518, '52701', '{"TRIGGER"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153518-7uRvV7SLqmHV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RtpYObV4c1Y/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RtpYObV4c1Y"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Laios Thorden", "native": "ライオス・トーデン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126818-vWeIwxSERSHd.png"}, {"name": "Marcille Donato", "native": "マルシル・ドナトー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127292-MAWgxbS0Cbrs.png"}, {"name": "Chilchuck Tims", "native": "チルチャック・ティムズ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130509-NFZ7xFt1kLqd.png"}, {"name": "Senshi", "native": "センシ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127689-SC65fBVrUx8v.png"}, {"name": "Fali