('ANIME', 'Summer Time Rendering', 'Summer Time Render', 'サマータイムレンダ', 'A sci-fi, summer story filled with suspense set on a small island with Shinpei Aijiro, whose childhood friend Ushio Kofune died. He returns to his hometown for the first time in two years for the funeral. Sou Hishigata, his best friend, suspects something''s off with Ushio''s death, and that someone can die next. 

A sinister omen is heard as an entire family next door suddenly disappears the following day. Furthermore, Mio implicates a "shadow" three days before Ushio''s death.', '{"Action","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"urban-fantasy","primarily-teen-cast","super-power","rural","coastal","ensemble-cast","shounen","orphan","male-protagonist","religion","guns","denpa"}', '25', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 228165, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129201-HJBauga2be8I.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129201-eeCsKFrCSQPS.jpg', '#2886e4', 129201, '47194', '{"OLM"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129201-eeCsKFrCSQPS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_JgOMtS2FkE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_JgOMtS2FkE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shinpei Ajiro", "native": "網代慎平", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155703-1CNh5yTk8xWO.jpg"}, {"name": "Mio Kofune", "native": "小舟澪", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155706-guouOSwrSqso.jpg"}, {"name": "Hizuru Minakata", "native": "南方ひづる", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155711-VwaqEhjhI0FL.png"}, {"name": "Ushio Kofune", "native": "小舟潮", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155712-zMvjVpfc4WQN.png"}, {"name": "Haine", "native": "ハイネ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155704-2cdpcDFmNmXw.jpg"}, {"name": "Tokiko Hishigata", "native": "菱形朱鷺子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155705-odov1kqX0KEr.jpg"}, {"name": "Shiori Kobayakawa", "native": "小早川しおり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/fil