('ANIME', 'My Teen Romantic Comedy SNAFU Climax!', 'Yahari Ore no Seishun Love Come wa Machigatteiru. Kan', 'やはり俺の青春ラブコメはまちがっている。完', 'As the members of the Service Club band together to host a school prom, Hachiman, Yukino and Yui will have to put their feelings into words and truly learn to understand each other at long last… if the Service Club can even stay afloat, that is!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"love-triangle","coming-of-age","philosophy","school-club","school","heterosexual","male-protagonist","kuudere","anti-hero","primarily-teen-cast","hikikomori"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2020', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 226314, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx108489-yGmYCE6dhFta.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108489-z4DheppQdxo4.jpg', '#f1c9ae', 108489, '39547', '{"feel."}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108489-z4DheppQdxo4.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M0CsMI-qqmI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M0CsMI-qqmI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hachiman Hikigaya", "native": "比企谷八幡", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67065-Dhec6tE2yWA9.png"}, {"name": "Yukino Yukinoshita", "native": "雪ノ下雪乃", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67067-gqhgjlni0Bcf.png"}, {"name": "Yui Yuigahama", "native": "由比ヶ浜結衣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67069-6B3xnHfJUO0F.png"}, {"name": "Saika Totsuka", "native": "戸塚彩加", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67071-3tO9QQA9x0hV.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoshiteru Zaimokuza", "native": "材木座義輝", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67073-tz4d7ubdZrhP.png"}, {"name": "Komachi Hiki