('ANIME', 'Ranking of Kings', 'Ousama Ranking', '王様ランキング', 'Unable to hear, speak, or wield a sword, Prince Bojji doesn’t seem like a typical heir to the throne—and his kingdom agrees. But his fateful encounter with Kage, a shadow on the ground, gives him his first true friend. The two set off on a grand adventure and, together, form a bond that can overcome any obstacle...even being king.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"disability","coming-of-age","fairy-tale","male-protagonist","language-barrier","ensemble-cast","medieval","swordplay","bullying","primarily-male-cast","seinen","magic"}', '23', NULL, NULL, '23', '2021', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 225823, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx113717-9sNnN8WRgK15.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113717-XFiGSPtNJQWv.jpg', '#e4935d', 113717, '40834', '{"WIT STUDIO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113717-XFiGSPtNJQWv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_6ix0EBf2z0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_6ix0EBf2z0"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/fe2ab30aa62da3af20a6cc57ed31d2e11641092344_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The Prince''s New Clothes"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/2063f07266e7cdb47d87151b93b70a8e1641092474_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Prince and Kage"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/baa1f9e93fe7fa29def6051e40c2487f1641092539_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - The New King"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/263003d28c2159fadf192d9291bdad251641092646_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - His First Journey"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/464cacc19ffd4cf0520cbf24eb71edda1641092708_full.jpg