('ANIME', 'SAKAMOTO DAYS', 'SAKAMOTO DAYS', 'SAKAMOTO DAYS', 'When Sakamoto meets Aoi, the convenience store clerk, it’s love at first sight — and just like that, he retires.

Sakamoto gets married, has a daughter, opens a mom-and-pop store in a quiet town, and completely transforms … into a plus-size man. To ensure a peaceful life with his beloved family, the legendary ex–hit man bands together with comrades to face off against the looming threat of assassins.', '{"Action","Comedy"}', '{"assassins","urban","found-family","konbini","crime","primarily-adult-cast","super-power","male-protagonist","family-life","slapstick","gangs","guns"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '24', '2025', 'WINTER', 'ONA', 'FINISHED', 223556, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx177709-e5Qx6RlsBgD5.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/177709-yeZ7ciQULJRx.jpg', '#c9f1f1', 177709, '58939', '{"TMS Entertainment"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/177709-yeZ7ciQULJRx.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CdnMoPIgC5s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CdnMoPIgC5s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tarou Sakamoto", "native": "坂本太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196522-phOzXgufOs7R.png"}, {"name": "Shin Asakura", "native": "朝倉シン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196521-bedknWj9u7s2.png"}, {"name": "Shaotang Lu", "native": "ルー・シャオタン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207272-qQ7YZOKtbzzZ.png"}, {"name": "Aoi Sakamoto", "native": "坂本葵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212302-OG58WeogzshB.png"}, {"name": "Heisuke Mashimo", "native": "眞霜平助", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b252687-nLmp7FlEkm5d.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoichi Nagumo", "native": "南雲", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264336-W5eQ