('ANIME', 'Shikimori''s Not Just a Cutie', 'Kawaii dake ja Nai Shikimori-san', '可愛いだけじゃない式守さん', 'The ultimate "heartthrob girlfriend" appears! Naturally unlucky high school student Izumi''s girlfriend is his classmate Shikimori. She has a beautiful smile and kind personality and always seems happy when she''s with Izumi. She''s a pretty, cute, and loving girlfriend, but when Izumi''s in trouble… she transforms into a super cool "heartthrob girlfriend!" The fun lives of the cute and cool Shikimori, Izumi, and their good friends never end!', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","school","tomboy","coming-of-age","episodic","athletics","kuudere"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '23', '2022', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 218428, '68', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx127911-qfJDzUt0qCna.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/127911-YRSP7vuUy801.jpg', '#1aaee4', 127911, '45613', '{"Doga Kobo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/127911-YRSP7vuUy801.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SB1kaI89rfM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SB1kaI89rfM"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/35062b93f3b5116f7fa44d9b68a156a81649524312_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - My Girlfriend Is Super Cute"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/7643442e5accdd81d17eaa94c8baa3d91650109817_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Wind and Clouds, Ball Sports Tournament!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f72d39cc0ff2281c5d36d9095ac3ca601650711895_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Misfortune, Followed by Sunshine"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/6d33837d203168d4b77c4afac55005be1651330995_full.jpg", "ki