('ANIME', 'Tengoku Daimakyo', 'Tengoku Daimakyou', '天国大魔境', 'In the year 2024, the world has collapsed. Grotesque monsters lurk amongst the ruins of Japan, while remaining people scrape together what they can to survive. Kiruko, an odd-job girl in Nakano, accepts a mysterious woman''s dying wish to take a boy named Maru to a place called Heaven.', '{"Adventure","Mystery","Sci-Fi","Thriller"}', '{"dystopian","post-apocalyptic","survival","seinen","travel","conspiracy","male-protagonist","orphan","gore","denpa","unrequited-love","demons"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2023', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 214873, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx155783-YosKbsmZzuDE.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/155783-MXHfdquIBoHA.jpg', '#286bbb', 155783, '53393', '{"Production I.G"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/155783-MXHfdquIBoHA.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Sld5uW_BJU4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sld5uW_BJU4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Maru", "native": "マル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289824-7LdKeeZkpEjF.png"}, {"name": "Kiruko", "native": "キルコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289828-021nDZVsvAP5.png"}, {"name": "Tokio", "native": "トキオ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289825-HuPBhMJyVI7Q.png"}, {"name": "Mimihime", "native": "ミミヒメ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289826-RVPbwpkNF38n.png"}, {"name": "Kuku", "native": "クク", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289827-QU0JNSpZ4nEt.png"}, {"name": "Robin Inazaki", "native": "稲崎露敏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/c