('ANIME', 'The Fragrant Flower Blooms With Dignity', 'Kaoru Hana wa Rin to Saku', '薫る花は凛と咲く', 'Chidori High is a boys’ school that takes in the dregs of society with the lowest grades. Next door stands Kikyo Girls’ High, where the wealthy, high-class families send their precious daughters. Chidori second-year Rintarou, who has a fierce face but a gentle heart, is helping at his family’s patisserie when he meets a girl named Kaoruko. The two hit it off right away…but this blissful peace is quickly disturbed when Rintarou discovers that Kaoruko is actually a student at Kikyo. Worse, she doesn’t seem to realize what a huge problem this really is! Will these two be able to forge a path for themselves, and sidestep the traps (metaphorical and literal) laid by their classmates?', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","school","female-protagonist","iyashikei","coming-of-age","food","urban","shounen","ensemble-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2025', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 213929, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx181444-Ut9DDUZdfHwg.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/181444-SBhwJNPxjHrr.jpg', '#6baed6', 181444, '59845', '{"CloverWorks"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/181444-SBhwJNPxjHrr.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wMDwbC-cAQg/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wMDwbC-cAQg"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kaoruko Waguri", "native": "和栗薫子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268676-aQmqvqj0DNoJ.png"}, {"name": "Rintarou Tsumugi", "native": "紬凛太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268677-APMPGH67QqPr.jpg"}, {"name": "Subaru Hoshina", "native": "保科昴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270095-Z5KpvacVXp1S.jpg"}, {"name": "Shohei Usami", "native": "宇佐美翔平", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272240-1okw3miy0dPX.png"}, {"name": "Saku Natsusawa", "native": "夏沢朔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272241-6NHTwQDIUXQk.png"}, {"name": "Ayato Yorita", "native": "依田絢斗", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272243-i9xYmuUQaI3q.png"}, {"name": "Kyouko Tsumugi", "native": "紬杏子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286245-iZhNiS29Mw2B.jpg"}, {"name": "Keichiro Tsumugi", "native": "紬圭一郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b299398-Xs4z2ZR8lywB.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '181444'),
('ANIME', 'Lycoris Recoil', 'Lycoris Recoil', 'リコリス・リコイル', '“LycoReco” is a café with a traditional Japanese twist located in downtown Tokyo. But the delicious coffee and sugary sweets are not the only orders this café takes! From delivering packages short distances, to pick-ups and drop-offs on the lonely streets at night, to zombies and giant monster extermination…?! Whatever your problem, we''re here to help! We will solve any kind of "trouble" you may have!

Waiting for you are the ever-smiling poster-girl and the cool, serious newcomer. A petite girl who never wants to work and a young woman approaching thirty who wants to get married. And the manager is a nice guy who’s obsessed with Japan!

Whatever your order is, leave it all up to us♪', '{"Action","Slice of Life"}', '{"female-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","guns","urban","found-family","work","kuudere","orphan","restaurant","yuri","lgbtq-themes","ensemble-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2022', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 212818, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx143270-rfkyiYXhek5w.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/143270-Ivjs2nVpARtS.jpg', '#e45078', 143270, '50709', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/143270-Ivjs2nVpARtS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rvu_s7Vp4KE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvu_s7Vp4KE"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/332281bd6e8c18bab1ef705b698683de1747805156_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Brief respite"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/8997b92892c59776031d7ce900892bbc1747222115_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Bittersweet First Love"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/6058f343b95f7e91beae6874701072ff1746616596_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Watch out!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/a5cfd5b9436af266707b5dcd8f3832621746005062_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Scintillation of genius"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/be1736ce2d66de9b9a45a87c9a53d3101745385971_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Miles away"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/b9f3e08145a45aaa7ebe3f303a7413ee1744804109_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Take it easy"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chisato Nishikigi", "native": "錦木千束", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b260329-1Z5n1QgViEBI.png"}, {"name": "Takina Inoue", "native": "井ノ上たきな", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b260328-GVvi4r6RKivm.png"}, {"name": "Mika", "native": "ミカ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268459-ULNF0KcGlJHT.png"}, {"name": "Mizuki Nakahara", "native": "中原ミズキ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268457-c5VS7Jrolcop.jpg"}, {"name": "Kurumi", "native": "クルミ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268458-OlcSEyl1KFRS.jpg"}, {"name": "Shinji Yoshimatsu", "native": "吉松シンジ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282068-MwtadRNotePz.jpg"}, {"name": "Fuki Harukawa", "native": "春川フキ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282694-sThZXxGJbHxl.jpg"}, {"name": "Sakura Otome", "native": "乙女サクラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282695-VL3gXrm0yrFQ.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '143270'),
('ANIME', 'given', 'Given', 'ギヴン', 'Tightly clutching his Gibson guitar, Mafuyu Satou steps out of his dark apartment to begin another day of his high school life. While taking a nap in a quiet spot on the gymnasium staircase, he has a chance encounter with fellow student Ritsuka Uenoyama, who berates him for letting his guitar''s strings rust and break. Noticing Uenoyama''s knowledge of the instrument, Satou pleads for him to fix it and to teach him how to play. Uenoyama eventually agrees and invites him to sit in on a jam session with his two band mates: bassist Haruki Nakayama and drummer Akihiko Kaji.

Satou''s voice is strikingly beautiful, filling Uenoyama with the determination to make Satou the lead singer of the band. Though reticent at first, Satou takes the offer after an emotional meeting with an old friend. With the support of his new friends, Satou must not only learn how to play guitar, but also come to terms with the mysterious circumstances that led him to be its owner.', '{"Drama","Music","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"band","boys-love","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","primarily-male-cast","lgbtq-themes","primarily-teen-cast","rehabilitation","rock-music","cute-boys-doing-cute-things","school","urban"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '23', '2019', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 212384, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx108430-UdruJPro4vDK.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108430-L8rZPUpXjDzv.jpg', '#e4a15d', 108430, '39533', '{"Lerche"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108430-L8rZPUpXjDzv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Dwv4MiB08TY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dwv4MiB08TY"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/26fb5ebc40e102807c7b68638cdbf0b61562868110_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Boys in the Band"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/aed3cf26c28a6f00838c513280d242c61563469957_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Like Someone In Love"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/9cf6c6885788ebc6625a4d4a000a76d41564081967_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Somebody Else"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/17247e842deb09db0b2df9c742139ff21564659917_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Fluorescent Adolescent"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/236382fbe451e6746f1726561738e8051565