('ANIME', 'The Case Study of Vanitas', 'Vanitas no Carte', 'ヴァニタスの手記', 'It’s 19th-century Paris, and young vampire Noé hunts for the Book of Vanitas. Attacked by a vampire driven insane, a human intercedes, rescues Noé, and heals the sick creature. Commanding the book and calling himself Vanitas, this doctor tempts Noé with a mad crusade to “cure” the entire vampire race. Allying with one who wields arcane power so easily may be dangerous, but does he have a choice?', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","male-protagonist","foreign","steampunk","primarily-adult-cast","anti-hero","tsundere","anachronism","historical"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '23', '2021', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 211954, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx131646-cuyGfKcekZ62.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131646-ewbYrSfyUyp6.jpg', '#f1c950', 131646, '48580', '{"bones"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/131646-ewbYrSfyUyp6.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S7mL2DI_X9s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7mL2DI_X9s"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/3ef3d438505584690fbf55603c8ce9331640071985_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - In the Event of Rusty Hopes"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/92a4eb879ecca30774c231ef0eafb12c1640072286_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - In the City of Flowers"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/3c777b941cc846b11b8006b5086638a21640072546_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Fangs That Lay Bare Blood"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/da086e4497a35a50744b04ebd4f4a4881640072601_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Night of Mocking Masks"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/fac9670e53ed046e5638574a4b2dc1f81640072647_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Friends"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/8f8293175b789d31e1db952714488cd71640072771_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Questions"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a6ab6837432da29e8aa9b08253ed53481640072916_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Love"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/cf039341c65fde459763d912b394cc2a1640072940_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Where Death Slumbers"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/10079d9ab64dfd81774261751d1569021640073133_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Those Who Hunt Crimson"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/93d0715b7c5378a2a33ff1a29eeadcc41640073250_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Number 69"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Vanitas", "native": "ヴァ二タス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89590-K3RdKR4VnYM4.png"}, {"name": "Noé Archiviste", "native": "ノエ・アルシヴィスト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89835-xnAJMex6Uq0U.png"}, {"name": "Jeanne", "native": "ジャンヌ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89836-xLr4mkxojjc3.png"}, {"name": "Dominique de Sade", "native": "ドミニク・ド・サド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139553-Ni2xZ2U8aPii.jpg"}, {"name": "Murr", "native": "ムル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b146015-TTM14WCYx74X.jpg"}, {"name": "Louis de Sade", "native": "ルイ・ド・サド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b146017-Ne3YSTuBIAI7.png"}, {"name": "Lucius Oriflamme", "native": "ルキウス・オリフラム", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b153506-DC5iKSUyp1Sp.png"}, {"name": "Naenia", "native": "ネーニア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155248-TIy6LhGqTb4W.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '131646'),
('ANIME', 'BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War', 'BLEACH: Sennen Kessen-hen', 'BLEACH 千年血戦篇', 'Was it all just a coincidence, or was it inevitable?

Ichigo Kurosaki gained the powers of a Soul Reaper through a chance encounter. As a Substitute
Soul Reaper, Ichigo became caught in the turmoil of the Soul Society, a place where deceased
souls gather. But with help from his friends, Ichigo overcame every challenge to become even
stronger.

When new Soul Reapers and a new enemy appear in his hometown of Karakura, Ichigo jumps
back into the battlefield with his Zanpakuto to help those in need. Meanwhile, the Soul Society
is observing a sudden surge in the number of Hollows being destroyed in the World of the Living.
They also receive separate reports of residents in the Rukon District having gone missing. Finally,
the Seireitei, home of the Soul Reapers, comes under attack by a group calling themselves the
Wandenreich.

Led by Yhwach, the father of all Quincies, the Wandenreich declare war against the Soul Reapers
with the following message: "Five days from now, the Soul Society will be annihilated by the
Wandenreich."

The history and truth kept hidden by the Soul Reapers for a thousand long years is finally brought
to light.

