('ANIME', 'My Love Story with Yamada-kun at Lv999', 'Yamada-kun to Lv999 no Koi wo Suru', '山田くんとLv999の恋をする', 'Akane Kinoshita, a female college student, faces the absolute worst situation when she ends up breaking up with her boyfriend after he has an affair with a woman he met playing an online game. While relieving her stress by rampaging through the open hunting grounds of an online game, Akane spills everything about her heartbreak to “Yamada”, a player she met by chance who happens to be in the same guild. “I don''t care,” is his curt reply. But when Akane gets a makeover and joins an offline event to get back at her ex-boyfriend, she hears those dreadful words again. And that was Akane''s fateful encounter with “Yamada”─！', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","kuudere","video-games","heterosexual","shoujo","otaku-culture","primarily-adult-cast"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2023', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 208522, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx154965-vZbBRjtmLp7S.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/154965-9AwJG3nVokqG.jpg', '#e4935d', 154965, '53126', '{"MADHOUSE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/154965-9AwJG3nVokqG.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Mk8gEBzunD8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mk8gEBzunD8"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f8861bd2d8fb882e4e48ae04428ab45f1680362830_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - This is Why I Can''t Stand Gamer Guys!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/b5db93b6873f5140bcb003d052dc36be1680971481_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - It''s Almost Time For the Boss to Spawn so..."}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/b036e130d9a0cf5d7201e2b6d1d9d0361681573904_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "capti