('ANIME', 'Alya Sometimes Hides Her Feelings in Russian', 'Tokidoki Bosotto Rossiya-go de Dereru Tonari no Alya-san', '時々ボソッとロシア語でデレる隣のアーリャさん', 'Alya is a transfer student enjoying popularity at her new high school, often sporting a cold shoulder while earning high marks in class. She ignores her nerdy classmate, Kuze Masachika, except for when she blurts out a flirtatious line to him in Russian. Little does she know, Kuze understands Russian, though he pretends not to. Let’s see where this wacky love story takes them!', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school","primarily-teen-cast","heterosexual","tsundere","male-protagonist","school-club","primarily-female-cast","female-protagonist","kuudere","urban","otaku-culture"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '25', '2024', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 208372, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx162804-TBeptcAfvqTd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/162804-NwvD3Lya8IZp.jpg', '#d6ae78', 162804, '54744', '{"Doga Kobo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/162804-NwvD3Lya8IZp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pBX6TtOlYow/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pBX6TtOlYow"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/b6d7c6461afe2ac39a95cb67e70302221726655832_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 12 - Chin Up and Face Forward"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ae29f0274c5f2643b4bd107a9670cae11726053299_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 11 - An Unexpected Curtain-Raiser"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/ee8e4eb7d7fe40eab425d9fef8b9cfda1725460782_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Birthday Party, Much Belated"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/1f75ffce05bdfc495657c050ceed82c01724837384_full.jpg", "kind": "epis