('ANIME', 'Welcome to the N-H-K', 'NHK ni Youkoso!', 'N・H・Kにようこそ！', 'Satou’s life – or what’s left of it – is a paranoid mess of conspiracy theories and social anxieties. He’s terrified of the outside world; his apartment is overflowing with the remnants of cheap take-out food; and his retinas have been permanently scarred by a steady diet of internet porn. But maybe it’s not all his fault. After all, the nefarious N-H-K is out there, and they’re determined to turn society’s fringe-dwellers into a brainwashed lot of jobless, hopeless, futureless recluses.

Enter Misaki – a mysterious girl-next-door type who is Satou’s last chance to beat down his inner demons and venture out into the light of day. She’s ready to help him overcome his crippling phobias, but Satou would rather cower in his existential foxhole and pretend to work on the demo for his virtual sex game.

He’s afraid to face the world. She’s strangely desperate to fix a total stranger. Maybe together they can be normal.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"hikikomori","rehabilitation","otaku-culture","male-protagonist","denpa","conspiracy","philosophy","primarily-adult-cast","coming-of-age","psychosexual","satire"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2006', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 205009, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1210-2XotjcgqdcaX.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1210-M5oFyKfKm2zT.jpg', '#5dd6e4', 1210, '1210', '{"GONZO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1210-M5oFyKfKm2zT.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/awEVT7CtkFc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=awEVT7CtkFc"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/1c73f397255350d66903af39fe090d461506491374_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Welcome to the Project!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/31115dce22fa41511c29726bb56dc9f91506491691_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Welcome to the Creator!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/5256a30765a1974fda31fe9e1e893d5b1506492033_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Welcome to the Beautiful Girls!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/55891af3bbfbad21d81450cc0fed629f1506492361_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Welcome to the New World!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/ce26f1b5ba9ae142b2b9adea9222de171506492723_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Welcome to Counseling!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a2330a0b8e6b3c2775bbc99e06a863ed1506492920_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Welcome to the Classroom!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/1e6739dd72dc7738c3852ebb3925efe41506493338_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Welcome to the Moratorium!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/4f54162b8ecdc6beecb61e36e725f8231506493653_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 8 - Welcome to China Town!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/95f1a39f0389d3f4bb12f72e29630c511506493877_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 9 - Welcome to a Summer Day!"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/93b6188488da4842c6e9599eef2d64391506495356_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 10 - Welcome to the Dark Side!"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tatsuhiro Satou", "native": "佐藤達広", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1839-siyzvmskIwLk.png"}, {"name": "Misaki Nakahara", "native": "中原岬", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2552-KCehpCmmitMV.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaoru Yamazaki", "native": "山崎薫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2866-s8og7KAyexA4.png"}, {"name": "Hitomi Kashiwa", "native": "柏瞳", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5953-x7ltfGnpq8Mn.png"}, {"name": "Shizue Satou", "native": "佐藤シヅエ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10580-G7dzis59AYGC.png"}, {"name": "Megumi Kobayashi", "native": "小林恵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11941-md6d4xiwm3vW.png"}, {"name": "Nanako Midorikawa", "native": "緑川七菜子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14823-JPbfMhVYXV7W.png"}, {"name": "Akira Jougasaki", "native": "城ヶ崎彰", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/25437.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '1210'),
('ANIME', 'Grave of the Fireflies', 'Hotaru no Haka', '火垂るの墓', 'In the aftermath of a World War II bombing, two orphaned children struggle to survive in the Japanese countryside. To Seita and his four-year-old sister, the helplessness and indifference of their countrymen is even more painful than the enemy raids. Through desperation, hunger and grief, these children''s lives are as heartbreakingly fragile as their spirit and love is inspiring.', '{"Drama"}', '{"orphan","survival","war","family-life","historical","primarily-child-cast","homeless","rural","male-protagonist","military","female-protagonist"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '88', '1988', 'SPRING', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 204217, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx578-vU6XcOlb1XFU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/578.jpg', '#e4bb5d', 578, '578', '{"Studio Ghibli"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/578.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4vPeTSRd580/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4vPeTSRd580"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Seita", "native": "清太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b494-9sbHCvWiD9py.png"}, {"name": "Setsuko", "native": "節子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b495-vzUTVQ5RMiJN.png"}, {"name": "Seita Setsuko no Haha", "native": "清太・節子の母", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133870-kfO1GVk2plls.png"}, {"name": "Isha", "native": "医者", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b319245-lUSb8LLP96lD.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '578'),
('ANIME', 'Kiznaiver', 'Kiznaiver', 'キズナイーバー', 'The fictional Japanese city named Sugomori City is built on reclaimed land. But as the years go by, the city''s population is decreasing. One day, Sonozaki tells her classmate Katsuhira: "You have been selected to be a Kiznaiver." The Kizuna System, which allows Katsuhira to share his wounds, connects him to the classmates whose lives and personalities completely differ from his. The Kizuna System is an incomplete system for the implementation of world peace that connects people through wounds. All those who are connected to this system are called Kiznaivers. When one Kiznaiver is wounded, the system divides and transmits the wound among the other Kiznaivers.', '{"Drama","Romance","Sci-Fi"}', '{"ensemble-cast","primarily-teen-cast","love-triangle","unrequited-love","human-experimentation","coming-of-age","urban","rehabilitation","philosophy","heterosexual","kuudere","male-protagonist"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2016', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 203852, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21421-5y8ryXsMB7aJ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21421-FmiHiyoRPDOp.png', '#e4e45d', 21421, '31798', '{"TRIGGER"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21421-FmiHiyoRPDOp.png", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SGe7iT5pbII/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SGe7iT5pbII"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/763e6d6d3319cf1d61a1aeb3d6d29bf21449739319_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "PV 1"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/0d69ff68dedcdd033dbbf6282ed2e8d21450423573_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Voice Actor 01: Yuki Kaji as Katsuhira Agata"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a471efe8af2c8a961a2c288c2cb67e301450423615_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "capti