('ANIME', 'Akashic Records of Bastard Magic Instructor', 'Rokudenashi Majutsu Koushi to Akashic Records', 'ロクでなし魔術講師と禁忌教典(アカシックレコード)', 'In the "action fantasy" story, Glenn is a part-time teacher at a magic school who is inclined to write "self-study" on the blackboard and then take a nap. One of his students, Sistine, gets angry and challenges him to a duel and he is easily defeated. However, when a terrible incident threatens the school, Glenn shows intense dedication to protecting his students.', '{"Action","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","school","teacher","male-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","tsundere","anti-hero"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '25', '2017', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 202023, '68', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21700-HhTEXPZKxupP.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21700-3JaMOphL8VGr.jpg', '#5da1e4', 21700, '32951', '{"LIDENFILMS"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21700-3JaMOphL8VGr.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nzlblisGahI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nzlblisGahI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Glenn Radars", "native": "グレン レーダス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121638-ZqD3QJgOJR9M.jpg"}, {"name": "Sistine Fibel", "native": "システィーナ フィーベル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121639-ptCs3mEtYCoL.jpg"}, {"name": "Rumia Tingel", "native": "ルミア ティンジェル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/121640-xYH4xEMQDdHO.jpg"}, {"name": "Re=L Rayford", "native": "リィエル＝レイフォード", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122239-rUQJeXrDSR2b.png"}, {"name": "Celica Arfonia", "native": "セリカ＝アルフォネア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/la