('ANIME', 'Cautious Hero: The Hero Is Overpowered but Overly Cautious', 'Shinchou Yuusha: Kono Yuusha ga Ore TUEEE Kuse ni Shinchou Sugiru', '慎重勇者～この勇者が俺ＴＵＥＥＥくせに慎重すぎる～', 'The goddess Rista summons a hero to help her hard mode video game-like world. The hero, Seiya, is exceptional in every way, but he is incredibly cautious to the point of buying three sets of armor (one to wear, a spare, and a spare for the spare) and going full power against weak slimes (just in case).', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","parody","magic","cultivation","gods","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","anti-hero","demons","medieval","manzai"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2019', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 201625, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx105156-ZVtxISdoUqnY.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105156-AER446HoeuJZ.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 105156, '38659', '{"WHITE FOX"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105156-AER446HoeuJZ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JkEH0nyKK7U/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JkEH0nyKK7U"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/07babf88a24f584ef45f12c0fc59b13b1643360668_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - This Hero Is Too Arrogant"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/ecf469afcc506e31d5f3ca4b23b955371643361187_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Too Much For a Novice Goddess to Bear"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/c1e4097b43d584b20e50be46e882739f1643361546_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - This Hero Is Too Self-Serving"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/2d1fbf5b6c85802d57dd95fdf373d9211643361667_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - I So Don''t Need Any Allies"}, {"url": "https://im