('ANIME', 'Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III', 'Dungeon ni Deai wo Motomeru no wa Machigatteiru Darou ka III', 'ダンジョンに出会いを求めるのは間違っているだろうかⅢ', 'When Bell encounters a frightened little girl in the dungeon, he doesn’t think twice to help. But this simple act of kindness has consequences. The girl is a monster and proof that monsters can be eerily human. And not everyone can accept this...', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"gods","male-protagonist","dungeon","monster-girl","magic","mythology","swordplay","ensemble-cast","primarily-female-cast","female-harem"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2020', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 201138, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx112124-ZmoOntBuiSUU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/112124-l3o8KJMaOCW0.jpg', '#1a4378', 112124, '40454', '{"J.C.STAFF"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/112124-l3o8KJMaOCW0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zw1T05givfE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zw1T05givfE"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/5d7b2110239eb17f2952fcc300f55e421741181273_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 15"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/f5e7e3e9a27f0777bc968dea2d95a3e11740549886_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 14"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/329566d1c622b8e61f3a417c5bb3b10b1738904498_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 13"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/dd6c42b91d662b3814ca02ea39ea5bca1738904315_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 12"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/eb4a6a28822f7b3f10e63ae15448af2a1734609697_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 11"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.c