('ANIME', 'Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 3', 'Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu 3rd Season', 'Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活 3rd season', 'A year has passed since Subaru’s victory at the Sanctuary. He savors a life of fulfillment while Emilia’s camp stands united for the royal selection—until a fateful letter arrives. Anastasia, a royal selection candidate, has invited Emilia to the Watergate City of Priestella. But as the party begins its journey, crisis stirs beneath the surface and Subaru meets a cruel fate once again.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"}', '{"time-loop","cult","magic","male-protagonist","royal-affairs","gore","politics","witch","ensemble-cast","elf","interspecies","seinen"}', '16', NULL, NULL, '24', '2024', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 199943, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163134-CqaXjXVivwJ5.jpg', '#bbd6f1', 163134, '54857', '{"WHITE FOX"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163134-CqaXjXVivwJ5.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qMJNdQFPaHk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qMJNdQFPaHk"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Emilia", "native": "エミリア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88572-IzTwXEHSobRs.jpg"}, {"name": "Subaru Natsuki", "native": "ナツキ・スバル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88573-F8yMTK9GhnTA.png"}, {"name": "Reinhard van Astrea", "native": "ラインハルト・ヴァン・アストレア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88577-nrwzPBVwqAfO.png"}, {"name": "Beatrice", "native": "ベアトリス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90181-wRPm0OEaucmw.png"}, {"name": "Felt", "native": "フ