('ANIME', 'Seraph of the End: Battle in Nagoya', 'Owari no Seraph: Nagoya Kessen-hen', '終わりのセラフ　名古屋決戦編', 'Yuuichirou has reunited with Mikaela at the Shinjuku Battle. But Mikaela was turned into a vampire... To save the "family," and to protect his fellow members, Yuuichirou needed to gain knowledge and power. He searched for ways to bring back vampire to human beings, and at the same time, trained hard working on the Cursed Gear. 

Meanwhile, Kureto calls Guren and tells him a shocking truth. That in one month, the main unit of the vampire will start attacking Tokyo. To get a head start against vampires, Kureto orders Guren to go to Nagoya. The noble extermination mission is about to open fire!', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"lost-civilization","vampire","post-apocalyptic","demons","military","war","male-protagonist","shounen","urban-fantasy","rotoscoping","swordplay"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '23', '2015', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 199115, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20993-c34UTma2bCcv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20993-pZacVGnE1F2L.jpg', '#f1bb5d', 20993, '28927', '{"WIT STUDIO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20993-pZacVGnE1F2L.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KRYkpjKW9sQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KRYkpjKW9sQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuuichirou Hyakuya", "native": "百夜優一郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83015-XmUdY42WSKRG.png"}, {"name": "Shinoa Hiiragi", "native": "柊シノア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83017-XXdnbunnBdTd.png"}, {"name": "Mikaela Hyakuya", "native": "百夜ミカエラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87287-cBUVUJNbvfvT.png"}, {"name": "Shihou Kimizuki", "native": "君月士方", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88912-HVslXuJNgNQc.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoichi Saotome", "native": "早乙女与一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88988-ioriKKJJQNat.png"}, {"name": "Guren Ichinose", "native": "一瀬グレン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88993-YNw36YYleasn.png"}, {"name": "Mitsuba Sanguu", "native": "三宮三葉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135250-fCoUY2wGYLUw.png"}, {"name": "Ashuramaru", "native": "阿朱羅丸", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88888-4JoZHEeFDtOo.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '20993'),
('ANIME', 'Gate', 'GATE: Jieitai Kanochi nite, Kaku Tatakaeri', 'GATE 自衛隊 彼の地にて、斯く戦えり', 'The military fantasy series begins when a gate appears in Tokyo''s Ginza district sometime in the 21st century. From the gate pours out monsters, knights from middle-age Europe, and other fantasy-like beings, and they kill many of the citizens of Tokyo. This event is known as the Ginza Incident.

The government sends a small group of soldiers from the Japanese Self-Defense Forces (a replacement for Japan''s military) to the alternate world beyond the gate. Led by otaku soldier Youji, they find that the villages in the world are being attacked by a dragon. An elf girl who is a survivor from the dragon''s rampage joins the group in their travels across the dangerous new world.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"military","isekai","war","politics","male-protagonist","primarily-adult-cast","reverse-isekai","primarily-female-cast","magic","anachronism","dragons","tanks"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '23', '2015', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 199074, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20994-pSDk4I58jAK5.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20994-9Vy4mDOFYT7O.jpg', '#e4ae50', 20994, '28907', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20994-9Vy4mDOFYT7O.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IulCg2hnu54/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IulCg2hnu54"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rory Mercury", "native": "ロゥリィ・マーキュリー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89029-dkTeY6564JNP.png"}, {"name": "Lelei la Lelena", "native": "レレイ・ラ・レレーナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89030-RxUjgQBDb7uD.png"}, {"name": "Tuka Luna Marceau", "native": "テュカ・ルナ・マルソー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89032-9xHrUaOlIDqA.jpg"}, {"name": "Piña Co Lada", "native": "ピニャ・コ・ラーダ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89039-FAn03wc0QacW.jpg"}, {"name": "Youji Itami", "native": "伊丹耀司", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89065-UZJtKI5pjKdV.jpg"}, {"name": "Shino Kuribayashi", "na