IN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174875-PvSTadcuATtH.png"}, {"name": "Vladilena Milizé", "native": "ヴラディレーナ・ミリーゼ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141061-jqIhB9jmClQ3.png"}, {"name": "Jerome Karlsthal", "native": "ジェローム・カールシュタール", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210920-oFo6r2yemLUb.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '131586'),
('ANIME', 'Kabaneri of the Iron Fortress', 'Koutetsujou no Kabaneri', '甲鉄城のカバネリ', 'As the world is in the middle of an industrial revolution, a monster appears that cannot be defeated unless its heart, which is protected by a layer of iron, is pierced. By infecting humans with its bite, the monster can create aggressive and undead creatures known as Kabane. On the island Hinomoto, located in the far east, people have built stations to shelter themselves from these creatures. People access the station, as well as transport wares between them, with the help of a locomotive running on steam, called Hayajiro. Ikoma, a boy who lives in the Aragane station and helps to build Hayajiro, creates his own weapon called Tsuranukizutsu in order to defeat the creatures. One day, as he waits for an opportunity to use his weapon, he meets a girl named Mumei, who is excused from the mandatory Kabane inspection. During the night, Ikoma meets Mumei again as he sees Hayajiro going out of control. The staff on the locomotive has turned into the creatures. The station, now under attack by Kabane, is the opportunity Ikoma has been looking for.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Supernatural"}', '{"zombie","steampunk","post-apocalyptic","trains","pandemic","travel","guns","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","gore","historical","nudity"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '23', '2016', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 198485, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21196-2PfPfIDrxKki.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21196-0aQqkn5XWmGo.jpg', '#e48650', 21196, '28623', '{"WIT STUDIO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21196-0aQqkn5XWmGo.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NljBw9RtOx4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NljBw9RtOx4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ikoma", "native": "生駒", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89472-Ayu4lT9Crbl5.png"}, {"name": "Mumei", "native": "無名", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89464-3QoSJw8XzDkH.jpg"}, {"name": "Ayame Yomogawa", "native": "四方川菖蒲", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89465-tUQaGxpPCrKz.jpg"}, {"name": "Takumi", "native": "逞生", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89467-AXQ0GCcTiI5z.png"}, {"name": "Yukina", "native": "侑那", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89469-lqZkuy6Gnnwl.jpg"}, {"name": "Kurusu", "native": "来栖", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89466-e3jSPDKHRIoL.png"}, {"name": "Kajika", "native": "鰍", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89468-JUOLxuQZgZ4G.jpg"}, {"name": "Sukari", "native": "巣刈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89470-64nBItEMtj2J.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '21196'),
('ANIME', 'Sword Art Online: Alicization - War of Underworld Part 2', 'Sword Art Online: Alicization - War of Underworld Part 2', 'ソードアート・オンライン アリシゼーション War of Underworld 最終章 (2nd Season)', 'The final load test... The war between the Human Empire and the Dark Territory has engulfed Underworld entirely. The battle has shifted course with the Dark Territory army led by Gabriel, who seeks to capture Alice, the Priestess of Light, against Asuna and the Human Empire forces fighting to save Underworld.

As Kirito''s consciousness remains buried in a deep sleep, Gabriel, standing in as the Dark God Vecta, has recruited thousands of American players to log in to Underworld to annihilate the Human Empire forces. Meanwhile, Asuna, Sinon, and Leafa have joined the battle utilizing three super-accounts of the deities of the Underworld. As the Goddess of Creation Stacia Asuna fights alongside the Human Empire forces to take on the American players in a vicious combat. Sinon, who has gained the super-account for the Sun Goddess Solus, is in pursuit of Gabriel, who has abducted Alice, while Leafa arrives to Underworld with the super-account Earth Goddess Terraria.

But that is not all...

The impassioned speech by Lisbeth has convinced many ALO players to join the fight with the Human Empire despite the risks. With this great war, not only Underworld''s continued existence, but the bottom-up artificial intelligence, the ultimate AI, and even the future of mankind is at stake.

Though he has yet to awaken, only one man holds the fate of this world: the Black Swordsman.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"virtual-world","female-protagonist","heterosexual","war","artificial-intelligence","video-games","swordplay","isekai","primarily-female-cast","primarily-teen-cast","female-harem","male-protagonist"}', '11', NULL, NULL, '24', '2020', 'SUMMER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 198270, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx114308-8UBiS7U9buzu.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114308-VuYDoBJMbU1i.jpg', '#e4c943', 114308, '40540', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114308-VuYDoBJMbU1i.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z7oiq9LDm8k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7oiq9LDm8k"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c289e7781e8676b0b88a417ccfefad141432077321_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - The World of Swords"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/f2620abbec420f275e919e480e82222f1432079867_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - Beater"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/6d82a4a5622a6dc02bc072f47258ed011432076330_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Red Nosed Reindeer"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/8f86346833247a7dd0be7225a8f6c07d1432081748_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - The Black Swordsman"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/828a0d394b174334e79ddcf80e90b5c41432080157_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - A Crime Within the Walls"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/c7654a8111961ceec634b1dd1fa0bd5a1432087378_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Illusionary Avenger"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.