('ANIME', 'The Eminence in Shadow Season 2', 'Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute! 2nd season', '陰の実力者になりたくて！ 2nd season', 'Everything has been going according to plan, but the hour of awakening draws near. Cid Kagenou and Shadow Garden investigate the Lawless City, a cesspool where the red moon hangs low in the sky and three powerful monarchs rule the streets. The true draw for Cid, however, is one who can draw blood–the Blood Queen, a vampire who has slumbered in her coffin for eons. Her awakening approaches, and Cid could finally face a day of reckoning.', '{"Action","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","magic","primarily-female-cast","chuunibyou","cult","satire","parody","male-protagonist","anti-hero","swordplay","assassins","female-harem"}', '12', NULL, NULL, '24', '2023', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 197806, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx161964-JpkEbHI8ivaP.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/161964-a3MIPlFGpwbo.jpg', '#6b1a1a', 161964, '54595', '{"Nexus"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/161964-a3MIPlFGpwbo.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/POEf1iuKR70/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=POEf1iuKR70"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Cid Kagenou", "native": "シド・カゲノー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136837-3WR22FYet8Hv.jpg"}, {"name": "Alpha", "native": "アルファ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162246-IbbxkhNJFDN5.png"}, {"name": "Beta", "native": "ベータ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162247-R6OrAuT1FwL4.png"}, {"name": "Gamma", "native": "ガンマ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162245-x86QMM6nOj75.png"}, {"name": "Delta", "native": "デルタ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image"