('ANIME', 'Black Bullet', 'Black Bullet', 'ブラック・ブレット', 'The Gastrea virus spreads like wildfire, causing each infected host to rapidly mutate, gaining new powers and abilities with every stage of development, even while they continue to attack, kill and infect multiple new hosts. Unable to fight a pandemic enemy that turns defenders into adversaries, the shocked remnants of the human race are forced to retreat into cities surrounded by giant monoliths made of Varanium, one of the few materials that can stop the Gastrea. Now mankind''s last hope lies in the Cursed Children: young girls infected with the virus who have managed to retain a hold on their humanity. Paired with a partner, they alone have the strength to take on a Gastrea in one-on-one combat. But the very thing that gives them power is a ticking time bomb, so even as they protect humanity, they are also feared and shunned. Are they Girls? Monsters? Or Mankind''s Ultimate Salvation?', '{"Action","Drama","Mystery","Sci-Fi"}', '{"male-protagonist","super-power","guns","military","kaiju","pandemic","female-harem","revenge","urban-fantasy","seinen"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2014', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 197261, '67', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20457-ftrNiYhZzgoY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20457.jpg', '#f1a150', 20457, '20787', '{"Kinema Citrus","Orange"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20457.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pqzHE-Y6538/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pqzHE-Y6538"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rentarou Satomi", "native": "里見蓮太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b74619-HHssePHYByLp.png"}, {"name": "Enju Aihara", "native": "藍原延珠", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/74621-Ps47Of4nJKp9.jpg"}, {"name": "Kisara Tendo", "native": "天童木更", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83523-4M96n5mmxRnm.png"}, {"name": "Kagetane Hiruko", "native": "蛭子影胤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83505-HiDVMEa3j161.jpg"}, {"name": "Sumire Muroto", "native": "室戸菫", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83521-rospSdu4TuDd.png"}, {"name": "Tina Sprout", "native": "ティナ・スプラウト", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88336-yxxU5kiQkQuh.png"}, {"name": "Seitenshi", "native": "聖天子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88337-SGoTJp23NUzI.png"}, {"name": "Midori Fuse", "native": "布施 翠", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/88338.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '20457'),
('ANIME', 'Sword Art Online the Movie: Ordinal Scale', 'Sword Art Online: Ordinal Scale', 'ソードアート・オンライン -オーディナル・スケール-', 'In 2022, the world of virtual reality was upended by the arrival of a new invention from a genius programmer, Akihiko Kayaba. Called NerveGear, it was the first full-dive system and with it, came endless possibilities to VRMMORPGs.

In 2026, a new machine called the Augma is developed to compete against the NerveGear and its successor, the Amusphere. A next-gen wearable device, the Augma doesn''t have a full-dive function like its predecessors. Instead, it uses Augmented Reality to get players into the game. It is safe, user-friendly and lets users play while they are conscious, making it an instant hit on the market. The most popular game on the system is “Ordinal Scale” (aka: OS), an ARMMORPG developed exclusively for the Augma.

Asuna and the gang have already been playing OS for a while, by the time Kirito decides to join them. They’re about to find out that Ordinal Scale isn’t all fun and games…', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Romance","Sci-Fi"}', '{"artificial-intelligence","heterosexual","augmented-reality","video-games","swordplay","virtual-world","urban","isekai","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","primarily-female-cast"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '119', '2017', 'WINTER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 196552, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21403-k8DZhZ3x1BCO.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21403-3CvHjmnIays3.jpg', NULL, 21403, '31765', '{"A-1 Pictures"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21403-3CvHjmnIays3.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/32FLqOWjUfI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=32FLqOWjUfI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kazuto Kirigaya", "native": "桐ヶ谷和人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36765-BnLbXg0Tzzh9.png"}, {"name": "Asuna Yuuki", "native": "結城明日奈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36828-j5ib0adAzGMx.png"}, {"name": "Yuuna Shigemura", "native": "重村悠那", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121626-4jbOszZDVu5S.png"}, {"name": "Eiji Nochizawa", "native": "後沢鋭二", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137705-u0xTYm866lOP.png"}, {"name": "Akihiko Kayaba", "native": "茅場晶彦", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36829-X5zITNEQ7xij.png"}, {"name": "Ryoutarou Tsuboi", "native": "壷井遼太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36830-41SWIDvhqOo4.png"}, {"name": "Suguha Kirigaya", "nat