('ANIME', 'Wolf Children', 'Ookami Kodomo no Ame to Yuki', 'おおかみこどもの雨と雪', 'The theme of the film is the love between parents and children. The story covers 13 years and begins with a 19-year-old college student named Hana who encounters and falls in "fairy tale-like" love with a "wolf man." After marrying the wolf man, Hana gives birth and raises two wolf children—an older sister named Yuki who was born on a snowy day, and a younger brother named Ame who was born on a rainy day. The four quietly lived in a corner of a city to conceal the existence of the "wolf children," but when the wolf man suddenly dies, Hana decides to move to a rural town far removed from the city.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"parenthood","family-life","werewolf","coming-of-age","shapeshifting","female-protagonist","rural","environmental","philosophy","kemonomimi","animals","mythology"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '117', '2012', 'SPRING', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 195089, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12355-wNsvhEsXEgrH.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12355.jpg', '#e45d6b', 12355, '12355', '{"MADHOUSE","Studio Chizu"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/12355.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8xLji7WsW0w/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8xLji7WsW0w"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hana", "native": "花", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b60279-1DRIDCpJZ9SD.png"}, {"name": "Yuki", "native": "雪", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b60281-QaCr9FOcsIOQ.png"}, {"name": "Ame", "native": "雨", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b60283-1oOCO9yq7ymy.png"}, {"name": "Ookami", "native": "おおかみ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistc