: "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b329046-9rNZ9uCwJ8yd.png"}, {"name": "Mitsuki Kiryuu", "native": "桐生三輝", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b329047-oaJEv034sHox.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '163270'),
('ANIME', 'A Whisker Away', 'Nakitai Watashi wa Neko wo Kaburu', '泣きたい私は猫をかぶる', 'Miyo Sasaki is an energetic high school girl who comes from a broken family consisting of her unconfident father and an overly invested stepmother, whose attempts at connecting with Miyo come across as bothersome. Seeing Kento Hinode as a refuge from all her personal issues, she can''t help herself from forcing her unorthodox demonstrations of love onto her crush.

While Miyo is unable to get Kento''s attention as herself, she manages to succeed by interacting with him in the form of a white cat, affectionately nicknamed ""Tarou"" by Kento. But Miyo soon realizes that she can''t help Kento with the various problems she overhears in her cat form and is now caught between two tough choices. Will she continue her relationship with him as a cat, or will she reveal her identity and risk what they have, in order to help him as her human self?

[Written by MAL Rewrite]', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"shapeshifting","animals","female-protagonist","henshin","kemonomimi","family-life","urban-fantasy","heterosexual","school","anthropomorphism","youkai"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '104', '2020', 'SPRING', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 192317, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx114963-QWMbi5ttovSK.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114963-UiyoYE6udFpW.jpg', '#bbe45d', 114963, '41168', '{"Studio Colorido"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/114963-UiyoYE6udFpW.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aXc9DVfLTGo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aXc9DVfLTGo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Miyo Sasaki", "native": "笹木美代", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158754-6EOniUeZRQN4.jpg"}, {"name": "Kento Hinode", "native": "日之出賢人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158755-ljXu07KnuLGo.png"}, {"name": "Nekoten Shuyaku", "native": "猫店主役", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162758-zY8OBVfDaZSX.png"}, {"name": "Kusugi", "native": "楠木", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162759-4ePTNSiWKl7d.png"}, {"name": "Masamichi Isami", "native": "伊佐美正道", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165189-GSqpnMsXSYL1.png"}, {"name": "Yoriko Fukase", "native": "深瀬頼子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165190-02hO1GxfNC1x.png"}, {"name": "Tomoya Sakaguchi", "native": "坂口智也", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165191-ifCueP77lbPC.png"}, {"name": "Youji Sasaki", "native": "笹木洋治", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https:/