('ANIME', 'Shangri-La Frontier', 'Shangri-La Frontier', 'シャングリラ・フロンティア', '"When was the last time I played a game that wasn''t crap?" This is a world in the near future where games that use display screens are classified as retro. Anything that can''t keep up with state-of-the-art VR technology is called a "crap game," and you see a large number of crap games coming out. Those who devote their lives to clearing these games are called "crap-game hunters," and Rakuro Hizutome is one of them. The game he''s chosen to tackle next is Shangri-La Frontier, a "god-tier game" that has a total of thirty million players. Online friends... An expansive world... Encounters with rivals... These are changing Rakuro and all the other players'' fates! The best game adventure tale by the strongest "crap game" player begins now!', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"video-games","virtual-world","male-protagonist","anthropomorphism","swordplay","shounen","travel","slapstick"}', '25', NULL, NULL, '26', '2023', 'FALL', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 191602, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx151970-xtIx3VqEk02X.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151970-Tnnfp0f7NOzj.jpg', '#5da1e4', 151970, '52347', '{"C2C"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151970-Tnnfp0f7NOzj.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4HpOvyY4sDw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4HpOvyY4sDw"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/7dfee558a466e76dc6b1599dcd3b505a1743321843_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 50 - The Anonymous (Asinine) A-Team and a Crisis"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/5acc8e981c10e7b7c314a96c3058497e1742717448_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 49 - Great King of the Deep, I Humbly Seek to Crush You"}, {"url": "https://im