('ANIME', 'Classroom of the Elite Season 3', 'Youkoso Jitsuryoku Shijou Shugi no Kyoushitsu e 3rd Season', 'ようこそ実力至上主義の教室へ 3rd Season', 'The third semester kicks off in high gear with a special boot camp deep in the mountains. Forcibly separated into groups along grade and gender lines, the first, second and third years alike must work together to survive the rugged terrain. Even worse? The leader of the group that comes in last will be expelled. Can Class D make it back to campus intact, or is this where they finally say goodbye to one of their own?', '{"Drama","Psychological"}', '{"school","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","ensemble-cast","philosophy","coming-of-age","revenge","survival","bullying","disability","boarding-school","female-harem"}', '13', NULL, NULL, '24', '2024', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 191139, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx146066-zzKl6P6OeEjy.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/146066-gxjPUB1ofAO4.jpg', '#bbd6f1', 146066, '51180', '{"Lerche"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/146066-gxjPUB1ofAO4.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z11Ozjk0ufY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z11Ozjk0ufY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kiyotaka Ayanokouji", "native": "綾小路清隆", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123212-ewZgUQr9vvEM.png"}, {"name": "Arisu Sakayanagi", "native": "坂柳有栖", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124691-S9GyfwMAkkJ9.jpg"}, {"name": "Suzune Horikita", "native": "堀北鈴音", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123213-jUfrGBXfW7BL.png"}, {"name": "Honami Ichinose", "native": "一之瀬帆波", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123216-N9tQZf2XIKu6.png"}, {"name": "Kei