('ANIME', 'Fate/stay night', 'Fate/stay night', 'Fate/stay night', 'Raised by a mysterious sorcerer after the death of his parents in a catastrophic fire, Shirou Emiya has only just begun to learn small tidbits of magic. When he is caught in a battle between two powerful Magi, however, he ends up performing a spell above his expected ability, accidentally summoning a beautiful woman knight to protect him.

Shirou is thus unwillingly thrust into the competition known as the Holy Grail War where Seven Magi called Masters, together with their spirit partners called Servants, fight to acquire a powerful artifact said to grant every wish.', '{"Action","Fantasy","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"magic","battle-royale","death-game","urban-fantasy","mythology","heterosexual","spearplay","samurai","male-protagonist","swordplay","super-power","witch"}', '24', NULL, NULL, '24', '2006', 'WINTER', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 190291, '68', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx356-mTpMvtillumS.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/356-0VzS7BcObayT.jpg', '#ff5d43', 356, '356', '{"Studio DEEN"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/356-0VzS7BcObayT.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aFyxNcwl3U0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aFyxNcwl3U0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shirou Emiya", "native": "衛宮士郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b496-GI0waavDjyk3.png"}, {"name": "Artoria Pendragon", "native": "アルトリア・ペンドラゴン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b497-Yg5pNmC8kxzs.png"}, {"name": "Rin Toosaka", "native": "遠坂凛", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b498-lwawtSpLyATL.png"}, {"name": "Archer", "native": "アーチャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2087-l5WP4W4vmfJJ.png"}, {"name": "Cú  Chulainn", "native": "クー・フーリン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b499-gS5RAdupSKWQ.png"}, {"name": "Sakura Matou", "native": "間桐桜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b500-NQrLbnBr1sDv.png"}, {"name": "Shinji Matou", "native": "間桐慎二", "role": "SUPPORT