('ANIME', 'Kiki''s Delivery Service', 'Majo no Takkyuubin', '魔女の宅急便', 'Kiki is an enterprising young girl who must follow tradition to become a full-fledged witch. Venturing out with only her chatty black cat, Jiji, Kiki flies off for the adventure of a lifetime. Landing in a far-off city, she sets up a high-flying delivery service and begins a wonderful experience of independence and responsibility as she finds her place in the world.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","witch","urban-fantasy","female-protagonist","magic","primarily-female-cast","work","coastal","kids","urban","primarily-adult-cast","aviation"}', '1', NULL, NULL, '105', '1989', 'SUMMER', 'MOVIE', 'FINISHED', 187884, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx512-UwP8X4BR8YoM.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/512-Ssp3EE2NdeoA.jpg', '#50a1c9', 512, '512', '{"Studio Ghibli"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/512-Ssp3EE2NdeoA.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4bG17OYs-GA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4bG17OYs-GA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kiki", "native": "キキ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6866-Fe38ZMNvevnF.png"}, {"name": "Jiji", "native": "ジジ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3133-pt3Y3TOU3EQr.png"}, {"name": "Ursula", "native": "ウルスラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11280-bPN8eheBlGMx.png"}, {"name": "Tombo Kopoli", "native": "コポリトンボ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11282-G2IcFBVu9S4L.png"}, {"name": "Osono", "native": "おソノ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11284-fvQsjvwhhOUC.png"}, {"name": 