('ANIME', 'My Hero Academia Season 7', 'Boku no Hero Academia 7', '僕のヒーローアカデミア 7', 'Following an all-out battle with the Paranormal Liberation Front, it is difficult for the people of Japan to continue placing faith in their heroes. To combat the combined power of Tomura Shigaraki and All For One, All Might calls for his ally from the West—the strongest woman on the planet, Star and Stripe.

However, All For One decides to intercept Star and her fleet to get his hands on her overpowered quirk before she can enter Japanese airspace. Although Endeavor, Hawks, and Best Jeanist are headed to the rendezvous point, Star makes a gamble in the present to save her comrades.', '{"Action","Adventure"}', '{"superhero","super-power","shounen","primarily-teen-cast","terrorism","urban-fantasy","ensemble-cast","war","post-apocalyptic","male-protagonist","gore","yandere"}', '21', NULL, NULL, '24', '2024', 'SPRING', 'TV', 'FINISHED', 187391, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx163139-JchZhUFlNTWU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163139-UWM3qDG5cRa6.jpg', '#2893e4', 163139, '54789', '{"bones"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163139-UWM3qDG5cRa6.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/T5HMoxJRhRY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T5HMoxJRhRY"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/6e3a2f0dc647baf6e2e8c1ef09e0d8e31728710159_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 159 - Battle Without a Quirk"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/994f86bfc94acd6e787095bc2fbe098a1728108402_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 158 - A Girl''s Ego"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/460041070a2508747fa15c0830d8475f1727510005_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 157 - I Am Here"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire3-tmb/d75be54b3feba7246243b202d9989ece1726905127_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 156 - It''s a Small World"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/45a70fd2c3849d4bcaba9b6d425e21691726299457_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 155 - Hopes"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/1a17527b4f245297ebd24745a2831508