ge": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/125956-jzhb8Z4peLb8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '163139'),
('MANGA', 'Chainsaw Man', 'Chainsaw Man', 'チェンソーマン', 'The name says it all! Denji''s life of poverty is changed forever when he merges with his pet chainsaw dog, Pochita! Now he''s living in the big city and an official Devil Hunter. But he''s got a lot to learn about his new job and chainsaw powers!

- Nominated for the 2020 Manga Taisho Award.

- Winner of the 2021 Kono Manga ga Sugoi Award.

- Winner of the 66th Shogakukan Manga Award in the shounen category.

- Winner of the 2021 and 2022 Harvey Award for Best Manga.

- Chapters 1-97 were released in Weekly Shounen Jump from Dec 3, 2018 to Dec 13, 2020. The series resumed from Ch. 98 in Shounen Jump+ on July 12, 2022', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Horror","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","urban-fantasy","coming-of-age","psychosexual","male-protagonist","gore","body-horror","henshin","urban","monster-boy","found-family","survival"}', NULL, '232', '24', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 334055, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx105778-euxXZEIfDY2u.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105778-ppHaMwown6c9.jpg', '#f1c90d', 105778, '116778', '{"Tatsuki Fujimoto","Hanachika Toyama","Jun Nagatsuki"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105778-ppHaMwown6c9.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VPB_J6Egi28/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VPB_J6Egi28"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Denji", "native": "デンジ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130102-FO1VHNnEnLlB.png"}, {"name": "Power", "native": "パワー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137079-6yLEUYR3bmpr.png"}, {"name": "Makima", "native": "マキマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137080-UHcynYNjb5ZU.png"}, {"name": "Aki Hayakawa", "native": "早川アキ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137081-TSrUR3mUJL6r.png"}, {"name": "Asa Mitaka", "native": "三鷹アサ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282389-Mr4vAa8Du2Jx.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoru", "native": "ヨル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282872-taoHfD0JGiZG.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuutarou Kurose", "native": "黒瀬ユウタロウ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144592-pUY67nacCeud.png"}, {"name": "Kishibe", "native": "岸辺", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144593-hdCTT9t54z0s.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '105778'),
('MANGA', 'Jujutsu Kaisen', 'Jujutsu Kaisen', '呪術廻戦', 'Although Yuji Itadori looks like your average teenager, his immense physical strength is something to behold! Every sports club wants him to join, but Itadori would rather hang out with the school outcasts in the Occult Research Club. One day, the club manages to get their hands on a sealed cursed object. Little do they know the terror they’ll unleash when they break the seal…

- Ranked 1st in Japan''s Bookstore Employees Top Manga of 2018.

- Nominated for the 25th Annual Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize in 2021.

- Nominated for the 65th Shogakukan Manga Award in the Shounen Category in 2019.

- Includes one extra chapter.', '{"Action","Drama","Supernatural"}', '{"urban-fantasy","demons","super-power","shounen","curses","monster-boy","male-protagonist","youkai","magic","martial-arts","body-horror","dissociative-identities"}', NULL, '272', '30', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 254366, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx101517-H3TdM3g5ZUe9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101517-FrJtb3Th3HtF.jpg', '#e4a15d', 101517, '113138', '{"Gege Akutami","Mizuki Yoda","Yuufoo Gakuji"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101517-FrJtb3Th3HtF.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/R60IExw7v8A/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R60IExw7v8A"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuuji Itadori", "native": "虎杖悠仁", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127212-FVm2tD0erQ5B.png"}, {"name": "Megumi Fushiguro", "native": "伏黒恵", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126635-L0y3I92JSUkN.png"}, {"name": "Satoru Gojou", "native": "五条悟", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127691-9zqh1xpIubn7.png"}, {"name": "Nobara Kugisaki", "native": "釘崎野薔薇", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133700-f6sOO3TcgLV6.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta Okkotsu", "native": "乙骨憂太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129571-GHJk7gviHOOw.jpg"}, {"name": "Suguru Getou", "native": "夏油傑", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133699-FCnXaISgazAi.png"}, {"name": "Sukuna", "native": "宿儺", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133701-rCQuDpHr3UZL.png"}, {"name": "Mahito", "native": "真人", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133702-Y7JRG5vAvjIL.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '101517'),
('MANGA', 'Berserk', 'Berserk', 'ベルセルク', 'His name is Guts, the Black Swordsman, a feared warrior spoken of only in whispers. Bearer of a gigantic sword, an iron hand, and the scars of countless battles and tortures, his flesh is also indelibly marked with The Brand, an unholy symbol that draws the forces of darkness to him and dooms him as their sacrifice. But Guts won''t take his fate lying down; he''ll cut a crimson swath of carnage through the ranks of the damned—and anyone else foolish enough to oppose him! Accompanied by Puck the Elf, more an annoyance than a companion, Guts relentlessly follows a dark, bloodstained path that leads only to death...or vengeance.

- Volumes 1-5 contain the 16 prequel chapters 0A - 0P.

- Chapter 83 was omitted from Volume 13 due to the author’s request.

- Volume 14 includes “Berserk: The Prototype”.

- Due to the author''s passing, starting from Chapter 365, the manga is illustrated by Studio Gaga (Miura''s assistants) and supervised by Kouji Mori (a close friend of Miura''s).', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Psychological"}', '{"seinen","revenge","male-protagonist","demons","gore","philosophy","found-family","anti-hero","travel","swordplay","survival","war"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1989', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 246537, '92', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30002-Cul4OeN7bYtn.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30002-3TuoSMl20fUX.jpg', '#d6861a', 30002, '2', '{"Kentarou Miura","Studio Gaga","Kouji Mori"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30002-3TuoSMl20fUX.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uam9bo293-w/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uam9bo293-w"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Guts", "native": "ガッツ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b422-XTaiTuvRohsV.png"}, {"name": "Casca", "native": "キャスカ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b423-AmVFCaJJOBsc.png"}, {"name": "Griffith", "native": "グリフィス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b424-Jfrsf8I7zBps.png"}, {"name": "Serpico", "native": "セルピコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5059-wWVkoasyfJNk.png"}, {"name": "Puck", "native": "パック", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5060-PWn2hc2nBy9J.jpg"}, {"name": "Farnese de Vandimion", "native": "ファルネーゼ・ド・ヴァンディミオン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7857-W7WpcGlw2aeH.png"}, {"name": "Isidro", "native": "イシドロ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/charact