('MANGA', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba', 'Kimetsu no Yaiba', '鬼滅の刃', 'The setting is Taisho era Japan. Tanjirou is a kindhearted young boy who lived peacefully with his family as a coal seller. Their normal life changes completely when his family is slaughtered by demons. The only other survivor, Tanjirou''s younger sister Nezuko, has become a ferocious demon. In order to return Nezuko to normal and get revenge on the demon that killed their family, the two of them depart on a journey. From a young talent, an adventure tale of blood and swords begins!

- Includes two extra chapters.
 
- Nominated to the 24th and 25th Annual Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","shounen","swordplay","male-protagonist","revenge","historical"}', NULL, '207', '23', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 211091, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx87216-c9bSNVD10UuD.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87216-TVKEGfSxAqKs.jpg', '#f1d628', 87216, '96792', '{"Koyoharu Gotouge","Mizuki Yoda","Kintetsu Yamada"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87216-TVKEGfSxAqKs.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UP1VEX8K1yA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UP1VEX8K1yA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tanjirou Kamado", "native": "竈門炭治郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126071-BTNEc1nRIv68.png"}, {"name": "Nezuko Kamado", "native": "竈門禰豆子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127518-NRlq1CQ1v1ro.png"}, {"name": "Inosuke Hashibira", "native": "嘴平伊之助", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129130-SJC0Kn1DU39E.jpg"}, {"name": "Zenitsu Agatsuma", "native": "我妻善逸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129131-FZrQ7lSlxmEr.png"}, {"name": "Muzan Kibutsuji", "native": "鬼舞辻無惨", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129132-4nIZakUZ1o8W.jpg"}, {"name": "Kyoujurou Rengoku", "native": "煉獄杏寿郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129133-VlTPowwt68rJ.png"}, {"name": "Giyuu Tomioka", "native": "冨岡義勇", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130050-qsLThJs5VIbz.png"}, {"name": "Muichirou Tokitou", "native": "時透無一郎", "role": "SUPPOR