('MANGA', 'Tokyo Ghoul', 'Tokyo Ghoul', '東京喰種 トーキョーグール', 'Shy Ken Kaneki is thrilled to go on a date with the beautiful Rize. But it turns out that she’s only interested in his body—eating it, that is. When a morally questionable rescue transforms him into the first half-human half-Ghoul hybrid, Ken is drawn into the dark and violent world of Ghouls, which exists alongside our own.', '{"Action","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"cannibalism","urban-fantasy","gore","male-protagonist","survival","seinen","philosophy","dystopian","coming-of-age","shapeshifting","body-horror","police"}', NULL, '144', '14', NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 197759, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx63327-glC9cDxYBja9.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/63327-uaFaG1HAJ0tK.jpg', '#e46b5d', 63327, '33327', '{"Sui Ishida","Edith  Belarra","Joanna Kochanowska"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/63327-uaFaG1HAJ0tK.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/61_N5Wz_oMg/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=61_N5Wz_oMg"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ken Kaneki", "native": "金木研", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87275-mb13EWZBdbh3.png"}, {"name": "Touka Kirishima", "native": "霧嶋董香", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87277-oUaqrI1iBzu6.png"}, {"name": "Koutarou Amon", "native": "亜門鋼太朗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88407-YwE6D75Xskxl.png"}, {"name": "Hinami Fueguchi", "native": "笛口雛実", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88293-4J36uyflNWvb.png"}, {"name": "Yukinori Shinohara", "native": "篠原幸紀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88408