That’s what he wants, but what does he get…?', '{"Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","seinen","philosophy","denpa","psychosexual","urban","male-protagonist","anti-hero","school","surreal-comedy","cult","work"}', NULL, '147', '13', NULL, '2007', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 187188, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx34632-5xMDkx3pXsEh.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/34632-JULTgA6q6jAH.jpg', '#e4c943', 34632, '4632', '{"Inio Asano","Hiro Kashiwaba","JN Productions"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/34632-JULTgA6q6jAH.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Punpun Onodera", "native": "小野寺プンプン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b17706-9OF3wt3wnO6s.png"}, {"name": "Aiko Tanaka", "native": "田中愛子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b22726-S7mGKZn16Djh.png"}, {"name": "Sachi Nanjou", "native": "南条幸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b58443-DNpfQUX72UMs.png"}, {"name": "Kamisama", "native": "神様", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n17703-DPNetEKYSTCu.png"}, {"name": "Yuuichi Onodera", "native": "小野寺雄一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21954-HCjvJJ9m1cq6.jpg"}, {"name": "Kou Shimizu", "native": "清水コー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b22653-jEdvPv0MWKj6.png"}, {"name": "Punyama Punpun Papa", "native": "プン山 プンプン パパ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/22727.jpg"}, {"name": "Punyama Punpun Mama", "native": "プン山 プンプン ママ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/22728.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '34632'),
('MANGA', 'My Hero Academia', 'Boku no Hero Academia', '僕のヒーローアカデミア', 'Middle school student Izuku Midoriya wants to be a hero more than anything, but he hasn’t got an ounce of power in him. With no chance of ever getting into the prestigious U.A. High School for budding heroes, his life is looking more and more like a dead end. Then an encounter with All Might, the greatest hero of them all, gives him a chance to change his destiny…

- Winner of the 1st Next Manga Award in the Print Category in 2015.

- Nominated for the 8th Manga Taisho Award in 2015.
 
- Nominated for the 40th Kodansha Manga Award in the Shounen Category in 2016.
 
- Includes one extra chapter.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"superhero","super-power","urban-fantasy","shounen","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","boarding-school","ensemble-cast","school","criminal-organization","conspiracy","coming-of-age"}', NULL, '432', '42', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 178696, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85486-INqnYx8gL3eX.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85486-4mTRih1qOdgk.jpg', '#f1d650', 85486, '75989', '{"Kouhei Horikoshi","Kei Monri","Keisuke Ikeda"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85486-4mTRih1qOdgk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AwOfsqsI44s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AwOfsqsI44s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Izuku Midoriya", "native": "緑谷出久", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89028-8w1I9o1ISHMg.png"}, {"name": "Katsuki Bakugou", "native": "爆豪勝己", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88892-bdOha3lNcaN6.png"}, {"name": "Shouto Todoroki", "native": "轟焦凍", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89220-KNBwaVFAR8FD.png"}, {"name": "Ochako Uraraka", "native": "麗日お茶子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89221-gSF2a4gPbG4m.png"}, {"name": "Toshinori Yagi", "native": "八木俊典", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89224-K6KEuQAuYKzq.jpg"}, {"name": "Tomura Shigaraki", "native": "死柄木弔", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89226-qGXqFthO4SM3.jpg"}, {"name": "Tenya Iida", "native": "飯田天哉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89222-TL8MQM3wJgEB.png"}, {"name": "Eijirou K