('MANGA', 'Vagabond', 'Vagabond', 'バガボンド', 'At seventeen years of age, Miyamoto Musashi--still known by his childhood name, Shinmen Takezo--was a wild young brute just setting out along the way of the sword.

In the aftermath of the epic Battle of Sekigahara, Takezo finds himself a fugitive survivor on the losing side of the war. Takezo''s vicious nature has made him an outcast even in his own village, and he is hunted down like an animal. At this crucial crossroads in Takezo''s life, an eccentric monk and a childhood friend are the only ones who can help him find his way.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama"}', '{"samurai","swordplay","seinen","historical","philosophy","travel","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","martial-arts","survival","disability","cultivation"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1998', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 163816, '91', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30656-9mW113O7rDnA.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30656-XYzvRlsc3iK4.jpg', NULL, 30656, '656', '{"Takehiko Inoue","Eiji Yoshikawa","Yasuhisa Hara"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30656-XYzvRlsc3iK4.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kZhw6gclUhw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kZhw6gclUhw"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Musashi Miyamoto", "native": "宮本武蔵", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6194-HOyr8E7FCFHJ.png"}, {"name": "Matahachi Honiden", "native": "本位田又八", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8134-CrWGxQ3aeqeD.png"}, {"name": "Kojirou Sasaki", "native": "佐々木小次郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10731-qqAJQX9TeSvJ.png"}, {"name": "Otsu", "native": "おつう", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/9482.jpg"}, {"name": "Baiken Shishido", "native": "宍戸梅軒", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/10836.jpg"}, {"name": "Soho Takuan", "native": "沢庵宗彭", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14182-v8L5jrWWVvXt.png"}, {"name": "Seijuro Yoshioka", "native": "吉岡清十郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14183-OGVvbiakcgsq.png"}, {"name": "Denshichirou Yoshioka", "native": "吉岡伝七郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/14214.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30656'),
('MANGA', 'SPY x FAMILY', 'SPY×FAMILY', 'SPY×FAMILY', 'The master spy codenamed <Twilight> has spent his days on undercover missions, all for the dream of a better world. But one day, he receives a particularly difficult new order from command. For his mission, he must form a temporary family and start a new life?! A Spy/Action/Comedy about a one-of-a-kind family!

- Nominated for the 24th Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize in 2020.

- Nominated for the 13th and 14th Manga Taisho Award in 2020 and 2021.

- Nominated for the 44th Kodansha Manga Award in the Shounen Category in 2020.', '{"Action","Comedy","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"family-life","espionage","found-family","war","assassins","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","surreal-comedy","adoption","work","fake-relationship","school"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 160185, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx108556-NHjkz0BNJhLx.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/108556-iCiPfU0GU4OM.jpg', '#e4505d', 108556, '119161', '{"Tatsuya Endou","Mafuyu Konishi","Itsuchi Yosuga"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/108556-iCiPfU0GU4OM.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BEFHobRfLh0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BEFHobRfLh0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Anya Forger", "native": "アーニャ・フォージャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138100-4Li0tWRCa5bQ.png"}, {"name": "Loid Forger", "native": "ロイド・フォージャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138101-7NCB0Md8zA6G.png"}, {"name": "Yor Forger", "native": "ヨル・フォージャー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138102-ZOAu9jI2d5ke.png"}, {"name": "Bond", "native": "ボンド", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169679-EFPubVtZFYom.jpg"}, {"name": "Becky Blackbell", "native": "ベッキー・ブラックベル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150423-RxXwrHzeLCss.jpg"}, {"name": "Damian Desmond", "native": "ダミアン・デズモンド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150424-4B4psF6I4dgO.png"}, {"name": "Yuuri Briar", "native": "ユーリ・ブライア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150425-mP852peLh9eS.jpg"}, {"name": "Sylvia Sherwood", "native": "シルヴィア・シャーウッド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157887-P66pD0ilpmtZ.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '108556'),
('MANGA', 'Vinland Saga', 'Vinland Saga', 'ヴィンランド・サガ', 'As a child, Thorfinn sat at the feet of the great Leif Ericson and thrilled to wild tales of a land far to the west. But his youthful fantasies were shattered by a mercenary raid. Raised by the Vikings who murdered his father, Thorfinn became a terrifying warrior, forever seeking to kill the band''s leader, Askeladd, and avenge his father. Sustaining Thorfinn through his ordeal are his pride in his family and his dreams of a fertile westward land, a land without war or slavery … the land Leif called Vinland.

- Includes the one-shot "Sayonara ga Chikai no de" (For Our Farewell Is Near)

- Includes the one-shot "Assassin''s Creed: Valhalla x Vinland Saga"

- Includes two extra chapters.

- Won the Grand Prize at the Japan Media Arts Festival in 2009.

- Winner of the 36th Kodansha Manga Award in the General category in 2012.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama"}', '{"historical","coming-of-age","vikings","foreign","philosophy","seinen","male-protagonist","war","revenge","found-family","travel","primarily-adult-cast"}', NULL, '224', '29', NULL, '2005', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 139186, '90', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30642-0mjRDkf4THpo.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30642-MeizzL2WDv6C.jpg', '#f16b43', 30642, '642', '{"Makoto Yukimura","Stephen Paul","Marc Bernabé"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30642-MeizzL2WDv6C.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Thorfinn Karlsefni", "native": "トルフィン・カルルセヴニ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10138-zOPrka0ddZOR.png"}, {"name": "Askeladd", "native": "アシェラッド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13020-ZdiYlNmpRUNS.png"}, {"name": "Thors Snorresson", "native": "トールズ・スノーレソン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13021-XJAVDHwMWek2.png"}, {"name": "Canute Svenson", "native": "クヌート", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b17438-NwyOSMxycmck.png"}, {"name": "Thorkell", "native": "トルケル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b17440-XvYe5JY862ZT.png"}, {"name": "Bjorn", "native": "ビョルン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19485-GqL2A0NKp3Tf.png"}, {"name": "Leif Erikson", "native": "レイフ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19486-XRzBNqoLb5Le.png"}, {"name": "Willibald", "native": "ヴィリバルド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b20704-N5pntGOae3F4.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30642'),
('MANGA', 'The Promised Neverland', 'Yakusoku no Neverland', '約束のネバーランド', 'Emma, Norman and Ray are the brightest kids at the Grace Field House orphanage. And under the care of the woman they refer to as “Mom,” all the kids have enjoyed a comfortable life. Good food, clean clothes and the perfect environment to learn—what more could an orphan ask for? One day, though, Emma and Norman uncover the dark truth of the outside world they are forbidden from seeing.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Thriller"}', '{"primarily-child-cast","body-horror","found-family","coming-of-age","female-protagonist","shounen","travel","ensemble-cast","philosophy","gore"}', NULL, '181', '20', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 134174, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx87423-gPNtu8QbGped.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n87423-n5n0LZu9Gs5H.jpg', '#e4d650', 87423, '100128', '{"Kaiu Shirai","Posuka Demizu","Carlotta Spiga"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n87423-n5n0LZu9Gs5H.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XZTtJaJwkJQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XZTtJaJwkJQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Norman", "native": "ノーマン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121700-CRwKIlcBcjbv.jpg"}, {"name": "Ray", "native": "レイ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121724-SJTdODjeO7e6.jpg"}, {"name": "Emma", "native": "エマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121725-LQciVJOjnMVh.png"}, {"name": "Isabella", "native": "イザベラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121701-hP5hanKRUH9u.png"}, {"name": "Krone", "native": "クローネ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistc