('MANGA', 'Blue Lock', 'Blue Lock', 'ブルーロック', 'After a disastrous defeat at the 2018 World Cup, Japan''s team struggles to regroup. But what''s missing? An absolute Ace Striker, who can guide them to the win. The Japan Football Union is hell-bent on creating a striker who hungers for goals and thirsts for victory, and who can be the decisive instrument in turning around a losing match...and to do so, they''ve gathered 300 of Japan''s best and brightest youth players. Who will emerge to lead the team...and will they be able to out-muscle and out-ego everyone who stands in their way?', '{"Action","Drama","Sports"}', '{"male-protagonist","battle-royale","athletics","primarily-male-cast","primarily-teen-cast","ensemble-cast","shounen","fitness","anti-hero","football"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 125197, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx106130-yPNeuSu75ey1.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106130-4UbnMTU80zur.jpg', '#86d61a', 106130, '114745', '{"Muneyuki Kaneshiro","Yuusuke Nomura","Tatsuya Endou"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106130-4UbnMTU80zur.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tpckSigsErQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tpckSigsErQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yoichi Isagi", "native": "潔世一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140856-wVzKSyvU7R5B.png"}, {"name": "Seishirou Nagi", "native": "凪誠士郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162969-WGnGyVQrFi0X.png"}, {"name": "Rin Itoshi", "native": "糸師凛", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169395-oYTkJnimI3Eu.png"}, {"name": "Jinpachi Ego", "native": "絵心甚八", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140857-DOTyKBCufon9.png"}, {"name": "Hyouma Chigiri", "native": "千切豹馬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167444-JTHkkJAX4E3q.png"}, {"name": "Meguru Bachira", "native": "蜂楽廻", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162213-4czykzdxmWG6.png"}, {"name": "Rensuke Kunigami", "native": "國神錬介", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162214-9x9Q3A9rxpx8.png"}, {"name": "Reo Mikage", "native": "御影玲王", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169394-8KDqHUN1VyGC.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '106130'),
('MANGA', 'Horimiya', 'Horimiya', 'ホリミヤ', 'At school, Kyouko Hori is known for being smart, attractive, and popular. On the other hand, her classmate, the boring, gloomy Izumi Miyamura tends to get painted as a "loser fanboy." But when a liberally pierced and tattooed (not to mention downright gorgeous) Miyamura appears unexpectedly on the doorstep of secretly plain-Jane homebody Hori, these two similarly dissimilar teenagers discover that there are multiple sides to every story...and person!

- Includes 20 extra chapters.

- The 17th volume was released on July 18, 2023, two years after the series'' original ending. This new volume included 10 additional chapters.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"heterosexual","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","school","family-life","coming-of-age","ensemble-cast","slapstick","episodic","shounen"}', NULL, '152', '17', NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 123508, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx72451-vVXtRwyttjGG.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/42451-shG1Ksjxm3pw.jpg', '#e45d93', 72451, '42451', '{"HERO","Daisuke Hagiwara","Maite Madinabeitia"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/42451-shG1Ksjxm3pw.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kyouko Hori", "native": "堀京子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66171-o2vk3689wWFK.png"}, {"name": "Izumi Miyamura", "native": "宮村伊澄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66173-g8eU1LGWPB8O.png"}, {"name": "Tooru Ishikawa", "native": "石川透", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66961-VZV5IwKUwYfp.png"}, {"name": "Yuki Yoshikawa", "native": "吉川由紀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66963-JBKCtpgwdgkG.png"}, {"name": "Remi Ayasaki", "native": "綾崎レミ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66965-Kfqui6IitXaL.png"}, {"name": "Shuu Iura", "native": "井浦秀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66967-driczOA04cxe.png"}, {"name": "Souta Hori", "native": "堀創太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66969-w9HNa7igeTeF.png"}, {"name": "Yuuna Okuyama", "native": "奥山有菜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66971-yfKmxIsWKWyR.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '72451'),
('MANGA', 'Bleach', 'BLEACH', 'BLEACH', 'Ichigo Kurosaki has always been able to see ghosts, but this ability doesn''t change his life nearly as much as his close encounter with Rukia Kuchiki, a Soul Reaper and member of the mysterious Soul Society. While fighting a Hollow, an evil spirit that preys on humans who display psychic energy, Rukia attempts to lend Ichigo some of her powers so that he can save his family; but much to her surprise, Ichigo absorbs every last drop of her energy. Now a full-fledged Soul Reaper himself, Ichigo quickly learns that the world he inhabits is one full of dangerous spirits and, along with Rukia— who is slowly regaining her powers— it''s Ichigo''s job to protect the innocent from Hollows and help the spirits themselves find peace.', '{"Action","Adventure","Supernatural"}', '{"shounen","swordplay","super-power","ghost","male-protagonist","war","ensemble-cast","urban-fantasy","coming-of-age","primarily-teen-cast","exorcism","philosophy"}', NULL, '706', '74', NULL, '2001', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 121972, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30012-1epmVfTSv2rr.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30012-RpbdVc2yNxhw.jpg', '#5da1f1', 30012, '12', '{"Tite Kubo","Shou Aimoto","Kentarou Kurimoto"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30012-RpbdVc2yNxhw.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uXw5cCh1DaQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uXw5cCh1DaQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ichigo Kurosaki", "native": "黒崎一護", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5-a7bkJgjhhigE.png"}, {"name": "Rukia Kuchiki", "native": "朽木ルキア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6-25WoBeWMZXBc.png"}, {"name": "Orihime Inoue", "native": "井上織姫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7-JdR4betokDjR.jpg"}, {"name": "Uryuu Ishida", "native": "石田雨竜", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b564-a6LJitrjSfKC.jpg"}, {"name": "Yasutora Sado", "native": "茶渡泰虎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/575.jpg"}, {"name": "Renji Abarai", "native": "阿散井恋次", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b906-ImRjx5HFM8X6.png"}, {"name": "Kisuke Urahara", "native": "浦原喜助", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210-mw01NrQfRjzT.png"}, {"name": "Toushirou Hitsugaya", "native": "日番谷冬獅郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b245-buy3Cfn6IFSB.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30012'),
('MANGA', 'Kaguya-sama: Love is War', 'Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai: Tensaitachi no Renai Zunousen', 'かぐや様は告らせたい～天才たちの恋愛頭脳戦～', 'As leaders of their prestigious academy’s student council, Kaguya and Miyuki are the elite of the elite! But it’s lonely at the top… Luckily for them, they’ve fallen in love! There’s just one problem—they both have too much pride to admit it. And so begins the daily scheming to get the object of their affection to confess their romantic feelings first… Love is a war you win by losing.

- The first 10 chapters were published in Monthly Miracle Jump. It switched to Weekly Young Jump starting with Ch. 11, with the chapter count being reset. This entry still includes the first 10 chapters from Miracle Jump.

- Winner of the 65th Shogakukan Manga Award for "Best General Manga" category in 2019.', '{"Comedy","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school","heterosexual","tsundere","female-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","school-club","seinen","ojou-sama","ensemble-cast","coming-of-age","slapstick","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '281', '28', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 119917, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86635-EdaLQmsn86Fy.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86635-qjRKbsrM3U9F.jpg', '#d61a35', 86635, '90125', '{"Aka Akasaka","Tomo Kimura","Emi Louie-Nishikawa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86635-qjRKbsrM3U9F.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IRBB7wU0wm0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IRBB7wU0wm0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kaguya Shinomiya", "native": "四宮かぐや", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120649-NPaWaIpWy60E.png"}, {"name": "Miyuki Shirogane", "native": "白銀御行", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121101-Q8HzKP15At2d.png"}, {"name": "Yuu Ishigami", "native": "石上優", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121102-tiQFxnSEIAwm.png"}, {"name": "Chika Fujiwara", "native": "藤原千花", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121103-UGLxT8utLPnq.png"}, {"name": "Miko Iino", "native": "伊井野ミコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125886-TQbmqAaSgBLS.png"}, {"name": "Ai Hayasaka", "native": "早坂愛", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121104-7TYRl3EEsDYU.png"}, {"name": "Kei Shirogane", "native": "白銀圭", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126144-4fc2sYUVFKOJ.png"}, {"name": "Erika Kose", "native": "巨瀬工リカ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126986-Pcspig2orfPq.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86635'),
('MANGA', 'Tokyo Revengers', 'Tokyo卍Revengers', '東京卍リベンジャーズ', 'Hanagaki Takemichi was once a low-life punk, but after biting off more than he could chew with a gang in middle school, he ran away from his old life. Now that he’s an adult, the gang that once terrorized him has grown into the largest gang in Tokyo, and they’ve started killing people–including his old girlfriend! After learning this news, a mysterious force on a train platform shoves Takemichi right in front of an approaching train. As his life flashes before his eyes, he blinks to find himself transported back to middle school, before he fled from the gang! Now he has the chance to right what went wrong all those years ago. Can he save his girlfriend’s life in the future–and what else might he change if he’s rewriting the past?

- Winner of the Shounen Manga category of the 44th annual Kodansha Manga Awards.

- Includes one extra chapter.', '{"Action","Drama","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"delinquents","gangs","male-protagonist","revenge","crime","shounen","age-regression","urban","ensemble-cast","motorcycles","heterosexual"}', NULL, '279', '31', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 118209, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx102988-OoVJxQCH6fbR.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/102988-T9bMDQxSyGpv.jpg', '#e45d50', 102988, '104565', '{"Ken Wakui","Aurélien Estager","Loris Usai"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/102988-T9bMDQxSyGpv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UcIifuECSzM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UcIifuECSzM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Takemichi Hanagaki", "native": "花垣武道", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145342-GSUutL83jGgI.png"}, {"name": "Manjirou Sano", "native": "佐野万次郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145341-CuPldCLZMvvf.png"}, {"name": "Hinata Tachibana", "native": "橘日向", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138453-MFISjDiAEfiM.png"}, {"name": "Keisuke Baji", "native": "場地圭介", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145343-vRrkdWEUXwYM.jpg"}, {"name": "Chifuyu Matsuno", "native": "松野千冬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145344-q4BqRljEBYNc.png"}, {"name": "Ken Ryuuguji", "native": "龍宮寺 堅", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145345-zyirrSsKIDCb.png"}, {"name": "Takashi Mitsuya", "native": "三ツ谷隆", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167841-Pp08TBnzGhK4.jpg"}, {"name": "Hakkai Shiba", "native": "柴八