('MANGA', 'Hunter x Hunter', 'HUNTER×HUNTER', 'HUNTER×HUNTER', 'Gon might be a country boy, but he has high aspirations. Despite his Aunt Mito''s protests, Gon decides to follow in his father''s footsteps and become a legendary Hunter. The Hunter hopefuls begin their journey by storm-tossed ship, where Gon meets Leorio and Kurapika, the only other applicants who aren''t devastated by bouts of seasickness.

Having survived the terrors of the high seas, Gon and his companions now have to prove their worth in a variety of tests in order to find the elusive Exam Hall. And once they get there, will they ever leave alive...?', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"shounen","super-power","cultivation","ensemble-cast","travel","male-protagonist","primarily-male-cast","politics","assassins","urban-fantasy","revenge","philosophy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1998', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 110042, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30026-uCvXMudMzmwI.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30026-JXfraiazLTQe.jpg', '#ffbb43', 30026, '26', '{"Yoshihiro Togashi","Naoko Takeuchi","Katsunori Matsui"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30026-JXfraiazLTQe.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/R5lpKKrm5m8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R5lpKKrm5m8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Killua Zoldyck", "native": "キルア=ゾルディック", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27-Z5O02kQUydpT.jpg"}, {"name": "Kurapika", "native": "クラピカ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b28-ivA7UGnfE40a.png"}, {"name": "Leorio Paradinight", "native": "レオリオ・パラディナイト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b29-RgzoSeKmDYzl.jpg"}, {"name": "Gon Freecss", "native": "ゴン＝フリークス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b30-lyFExKyDhefc.jpg"}, {"name": "Hisoka Morow", "native": "ヒソカ・モロウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b31-FZckOuu7L1un.png"}, {"name": "Ging Freecss", "native": "ジン・フリークス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/26-VpZXIwOdcz8p.jpg"}, {"name": "Illumi Zoldyck", "native": "イルミ＝ゾルディック", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b57-pTFguojSOQZW.png"}, {"name": "Chrollo Lucilfer", "native": "クロロ・ルシルフル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b58-USOmsz3nursi.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30026'),
('MANGA', '20th Century Boys', '20 Seiki Shounen', '20世紀少年', 'Humanity, having faced extinction at the end of the 20th century, would not have entered the new millennium if it weren''t for them. In 1969, during their youth, they created a symbol. In 1997, as the coming disaster slowly starts to unfold, that symbol returns. This is the story of a group of boys who try to save the world.

For Kenji, a simple convenience store manager who once dreamed of becoming a rock ''n'' roll musician, a host of memories from his past come rushing back when one of his childhood friends mysteriously commits suicide. Could this new death be related to the rise of a bizarre new cult that''s been implicated in several other murders and disappearances? Determined to dig deeper, Kenji reunites with some of his old buddies in the hope of learning the truth behind it all.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Thriller"}', '{"ensemble-cast","coming-of-age","seinen","achronological-order","conspiracy","cult","found-family","male-protagonist","detective","philosophy","historical","musical-theater"}', NULL, '249', '22', NULL, '1999', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 108346, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30003-E84fwIh22LAQ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30003-MBm3u1K1uHsi.jpg', '#e4c943', 30003, '3', '{"Naoki Urasawa","Marc Bernabé","Akemi Wegmüller"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30003-MBm3u1K1uHsi.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kenji Endou", "native": "遠藤健児", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3442-QdMHJOKv2Xos.jpg"}, {"name": "Chouji Ochiai", "native": "落合長治", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6004-wCseNjnRhze8.png"}, {"name": "Kanna Endou", "native": "遠藤カンナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b9730-TxluI1UEBU7z.png"}, {"name": "Tomodachi", "native": "ともだち", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/14314.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukiji Setoguchi", "native": "瀬戸口ユキジ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7271-KUHwm99LY43L.png"}, {"name": "Kyuutarou Kaminaga", "native": "神永球太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "im