('MANGA', 'Komi Can''t Communicate', 'Komi-san wa, Komyushou desu.', '古見さんは、コミュ症です。', 'Timid Tadano is a total wallflower, and that’s just the way he likes it. But all that changes when he finds himself alone in a classroom on the first day of high school with the legendary Komi. He quickly realizes she isn’t aloof—she’s just super awkward. Now he’s made it his mission to help her on her quest to make 100 friends!

- Winner of the 67th Shogakukan Manga Award in the Shounen Category in 2021.

- Includes 37 extra chapters.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school","coming-of-age","kuudere","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast","episodic","female-protagonist","disability","slapstick","heterosexual","shounen","meta"}', NULL, '537', '37', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 107329, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx97852-M7vlc2OGR2gp.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/97852-wHsdcKYktdp5.jpg', '#e4aea1', 97852, '99007', '{"Tomohito Oda","Katsumasa Ogura","John Werry"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/97852-wHsdcKYktdp5.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8L7UWVy5geU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8L7UWVy5geU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hitohito Tadano", "native": "只野仁人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b78093-QnJ9wDICvhSR.png"}, {"name": "Shouko Komi", "native": "古見硝子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121956-5FbIbcd6gAZW.png"}, {"name": "Rumiko Manbagi", "native": "万場木留美子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127449-E0m9AYQPclwq.png"}, {"name": "Najimi Osana", "native": "長名なじみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126825-J4GTiz4OHDa5.png"}, {"name": "Omoharu Nakanaka", "native": "中々思春", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128378-M2kHIBoYvazc.png"}, {"name": "Masayoshi Komi", "native": "古見将賀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130865-Ztgp75hdKhQ2.png"}, {"name": "Shuuko Komi", "native": "古見秀子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130867-cdy2mWlQhiX9.png"}, {"name": "Makoto Katai", "native": "片居誠",