('MANGA', 'Fire Punch', 'Fire Punch', 'ファイアパンチ', 'Orphaned siblings Agni and Luna, like the Ice Witch who cursed their world, are two of the “blessed,” humans who hold special abilities. However, not all who are blessed are friendly, and after another of their kind attacks Agni and decimates the orphans'' village, Agni fights to survive, vowing revenge.', '{"Action","Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"post-apocalyptic","dystopian","revenge","suicide","philosophy","anti-hero","super-power","survival","torture","body-horror","male-protagonist","gore"}', NULL, '83', '8', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 105449, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx87170-nyuwcN7rU4pc.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87170-gsBzHdIHoyEk.jpg', '#e4a15d', 87170, '98270', '{"Tatsuki Fujimoto","Tatsuya Endou","Yukinobu Tatsu"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87170-gsBzHdIHoyEk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0B1WciHqLUw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0B1WciHqLUw"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Agni", "native": "アグニ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120594-71dcmLPGpxjU.png"}, {"name": "Judah", "native": "ユダ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b147002-aGp078NejSj1.jpg"}, {"name": "Doma", "native": "ドマ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/120595-rqFddhAMvmha.png"}, {"name": "Togata", "native": "トガタ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126893-K5JlGa9DxPUE.png"}, {"name": "Sun", "native": "サン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b147001-946cU5HOue5D.jpg"}, {"name": "Nenetto", "native": "ネネト", "role": "SUPPO