('MANGA', 'Tokyo Ghoul:re', 'Tokyo Ghoul:re', '東京喰種-トーキョーグール-:re', 'In Tokyo, an unchanging despair is lurking. Mysterious man-eating beings, ghouls, run rampant in Tokyo. Living hidden during everyday life, the existence of ghouls, whose true identities are shrouded in mystery, permanently terrorizes Tokyo''s residents.

At CCG, the sole institution that investigates and resolves cases related to ghouls, Haise Sasaki has been assigned a certain mission. While dealing with the unruly four problem children known as "Quinx", Haise''s days of suffering begin...?!', '{"Action","Drama","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"seinen","philosophy","dystopian","body-horror","shapeshifting","gore","coming-of-age","urban-fantasy","police","primarily-adult-cast","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, '181', '16', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 104830, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85611-Asb0BNP23NsJ.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85611-xK7DMNtc0MNZ.jpg', '#e4431a', 85611, '81117', '{"Sui Ishida","Edith  Belarra","Fernando Mucioli"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85611-xK7DMNtc0MNZ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SeIeqH30sE0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SeIeqH30sE0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ken Kaneki", "native": "金木研", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87275-mb13EWZBdbh3.png"}, {"name": "Touka Kirishima", "native": "霧嶋董香", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b87277-oUaqrI1iBzu6.png"}, {"name": "Saiko Yonebayashi", "native": "米林才子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88872-uhlmoT4vBxE3.png"}, {"name": "Tooru Mutsuki", "native": "六月透", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n88886-bGodL2ANji2m.jpg"}, {"name": "Ginshi Shirazu", "native": "不知吟士", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88887-XjY2i5Jhkwl1.jpg"}, {"name": "Kuki Urie", "native": "瓜江久生", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88935-AtMsL0lEmeK6.png"}, {"name": "Nimura Furuta", "native": "旧多二福", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126031-3tBpl6tvYwaZ.png"}, {"name": "Hinami Fueguchi", "native": "笛口雛実", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88293-4J36uyflNWvb.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85611'),
('MANGA', 'Haikyu!!', 'Haikyuu!!', 'ハイキュー！！', 'Shouyou Hinata is out to prove that in volleyball you don’t need to be tall to fly!

After losing his first and last volleyball match against Tobio Kageyama, “the King of the Court,” Shouyou Hinata swears to become his rival after graduating middle school. But what happens when the guy he wants to defeat ends up being his teammate?!

- Winner of the 61st Shogakukan Manga Award in the Shounen Category in 2017.

- Includes two extra chapters.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Sports"}', '{"volleyball","shounen","male-protagonist","coming-of-age","school-club","primarily-male-cast","ensemble-cast","primarily-teen-cast","philosophy","school"}', NULL, '404', '45', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 102357, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx65243-mR4MnJFmfaOF.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/65243-naohhXW4M4b9.jpg', '#f17843', 65243, '35243', '{"Haruichi Furudate","Kouhei Uchida","Ken Ogino"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/65243-naohhXW4M4b9.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OmRfbjwOtbI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OmRfbjwOtbI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shouyou Hinata", "native": "日向翔陽", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b64769-WoWlCMLLgJ14.png"}, {"name": "Tobio Kageyama", "native": "影山飛雄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b64771-BuCVs7B8bBdh.png"}, {"name": "Makoto Nakashima", "native": "中島真", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/50755.jpg"}, {"name": "Koushi Sugawara", "native": "菅原孝支", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67321-cxP7NdI0JC3H.png"}, {"name": "Daichi Sawamura", "native": "澤村大地", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67323-yFbLDAfJ5ysG.png"}, {"name": "Ryuunosuke Tanaka", "native": "田中龍之介", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67325-yPkbZJkofp5w.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuu Nishinoya", "native": "西谷夕", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67327-zQb1dlC7joPb.jpg"}, {"name": "Kei Tsukishima", "native": "月島蛍", "role": "SUPPOR