('MANGA', 'Naruto', 'NARUTO', 'NARUTO -ナルト-', 'Twelve years ago the Village Hidden in the Leaves was attacked by a fearsome threat. A nine-tailed fox spirit claimed the life of the village leader, the Hokage, and many others. Today, the village is at peace and a troublemaking kid named Naruto is struggling to graduate from Ninja Academy. His goal may be to become the next Hokage, but his true destiny will be much more complicated. The adventure begins now!', '{"Action","Adventure","Supernatural"}', '{"shounen","ninja","coming-of-age","found-family","super-power","male-protagonist","martial-arts","orphan","philosophy","cultivation","magic","henshin"}', NULL, '700', '72', NULL, '1999', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 99833, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx30011-9yUF1dXWgDOx.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30011-pkX1O0EFqvV7.jpg', '#fe7828', 30011, '11', '{"Masashi Kishimoto","Yuuichi Itakura","Ryou Tasaka"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30011-pkX1O0EFqvV7.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fYgdxb9qTew/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fYgdxb9qTew"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Naruto Uzumaki", "native": "うずまきナルト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b17-phjcWCkRuIhu.png"}, {"name": "Sasuke Uchiha", "native": "うちはサスケ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13-SISLEw1oAD7a.png"}, {"name": "Kakashi Hatake", "native": "はたけカカシ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b85-mkVBh2yjxjmx.png"}, {"name": "Sakura Haruno", "native": "春野サクラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145-IorfpI8arxeX.png"}, {"name": "Itachi Uchiha", "native": "うちはイタチ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14-9Kb1E5oel1ke.png"}, {"name": "Rock Lee", "native": "ロック・リー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b306-oUTOO45xInXt.png"}, {"name": "Guy Might", "native": "マイト・ガイ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307-xieUEdhdTVwQ.png"}, {"name": "Zabuza Momochi", "native": "桃地再不斬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b728-zHw77BzLzQKT.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30011'),
('MANGA', 'Hell’s Paradise: Jigokuraku', 'Jigokuraku', '地獄楽', 'Gabimaru the Hollow is one of the most vicious assassins ever to come out of the ninja village of Iwagakure. He’s ruthlessly efficient, but a betrayal results in him being handed a death sentence. He has only one hope—in order to earn his freedom, he must travel to a long-hidden island and recover an elixir that will make the shogun immortal. Failure is not an option. On this island, heaven and hell are just a hair’s breadth away.', '{"Action","Adventure","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"survival","samurai","mythology","anti-hero","philosophy","ninja","ensemble-cast","gore","male-protagonist","historical","gods","primarily-adult-cast"}', NULL, '127', '13', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 98522, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx100994-f6CMjiQQNVeS.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100994-mEIqjSzFKysR.jpg', '#d61a86', 100994, '112318', '{"Yuuji Kaku","Yukinobu Tatsu","Tatsuya Endou"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100994-mEIqjSzFKysR.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C7iGt19x_F4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C7iGt19x_F4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gabimaru", "native": "画眉丸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137260-xmSis8FmwhEE.png"}, {"name": "Sagiri", "native": "佐切", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137263-I2krXFEFOHjL.png"}, {"name": "Touma", "native": "桐馬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137261-lWhxTwLOYLpO.png"}, {"name": "Nurugai", "native": "ヌルガイ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137262-frEjtAk5zYRV.png"}, {"name": "Gantetsusai Tamiya", "native": "民谷巌鉄斎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137264-qmjsYXb6YkX7.png"}, {"name": "Tenza", "native": "典坐", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137265-seGQMLb69BKV.png"}, {"name": "Senta", "native": "仙汰", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137266-5BQ0RQI2SXjs.png"}, {"name": "Shion", "native": "士遠", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137267-D3mKSNS6H4o8.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '100994'),
('MANGA', 'A Silent Voice', 'Koe no Katachi', '聲の形', 'Based on a one-shot that won the 80th Weekly Shounen Magazine Newbie Best Mangaka Award.

Shouya is a bully. When Shouko, a girl who can''t hear, enters his elementary school class, she becomes their favorite target, and Shouya and his friends goad each other into devising new tortures for her. But the children''s cruelty goes too far. Shouko is forced to leave the school, and Shouya ends up shouldering all the blame. Six years later, the two meet again. Can Shouya make up for his past mistakes, or is it too late?', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"rehabilitation","language-barrier","bullying","coming-of-age","disability","school","heterosexual","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","female-protagonist"}', NULL, '64', '7', NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 91103, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85135-11OOnyaqV71k.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85135-BPNyMuWVvZjh.jpg', '#e49343', 85135, '56805', '{"Yoshitoki Ooima","Ben Applegate","Steven LeCroy"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85135-BPNyMuWVvZjh.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mS_om5EK8YI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mS_om5EK8YI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shouko Nishimiya", "native": "西宮硝子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b80243-RzxE51iUU5eq.png"}, {"name": "Shouya Ishida", "native": "石田将也", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b80491-NK6pxb6oH61P.png"}, {"name": "Yuzuru Nishimiya", "native": "西宮結絃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89335-3fy5a7Qa9h9J.jpg"}, {"name": "Naoka Ueno", "native": "植野直花", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124026-KcQmX7heg7im.jpg"}, {"name": "Miyako Ishida", "native": "石田美也子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124030-YoZ0Drg5cHXX.jpg"}, {"name": "Maria Ishida", "native": "石田マリア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124031-ErVGKjxFH56V.jpg"}, {"name": "Miki Kawai", "native": "川井みき", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124033-UThOFdQGZjq7.jpg"}, {"name": "Satoshi Mashiba", "native": "真柴智", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124034-94AX4zhTaQZB.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85135'),
('MANGA', 'Sakamoto Days', 'SAKAMOTO DAYS', 'SAKAMOTO DAYS', 'Taro Sakamoto was the ultimate assassin, feared by villains and admired by hitmen. But one day...he fell in love! Retirement, marriage, fatherhood and then... Sakamoto gained weight! The chubby guy who runs the neighborhood store is actually a former legendary hitman! Can he protect his family from danger? Get ready to experience a new kind of action comedy series!', '{"Action","Comedy"}', '{"assassins","urban-fantasy","family-life","crime","found-family","primarily-adult-cast","primarily-male-cast","konbini","male-protagonist","gangs","guns","shounen"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 89453, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx125828-p78Z8SflkfmO.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/125828-wnmpFCNg0WkK.jpg', '#f1930d', 125828, '131334', '{"Yuuto  Suzuki","Tomohiro Iwakura","Kazuhiko Ookawa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/125828-wnmpFCNg0WkK.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/V32gTIktnds/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V32gTIktnds"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tarou Sakamoto", "native": "坂本太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196522-phOzXgufOs7R.png"}, {"name": "Shin Asakura", "native": "朝倉シン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196521-bedknWj9u7s2.png"}, {"name": "Shaotang Lu", "native": "ルー・シャオタン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207272-qQ7YZOKtbzzZ.png"}, {"name": "Aoi Sakamoto", "native": "坂本葵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212302-OG58WeogzshB.png"}, {"name": "Heisuke Mashimo", "native": "眞霜平助", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b252687-nLmp7FlEkm5d.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoichi Nagumo", "native": "南雲", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264336-W5eQn2SL4P7N.png"}, {"name": "Akira Akao", "native": "赤尾晶", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b287914-e3fju4t1fRcv.png"}, {"name": "Kei Uzuki", "native": "有月憬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272878-A9l4Cu4rI7Y3.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '125828'),
('MANGA', 'Dr. STONE', 'Dr. STONE', 'Dr.STONE', 'One fateful day, all of humanity was petrified by a blinding flash of light. After several millennia, high schooler Taiju awakens and finds himself lost in a world of statues. However, he’s not alone! His science-loving friend Senku’s been up and running for a few months and he''s got a grand plan in mind—to kickstart civilization with the power of science!', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"post-apocalyptic","survival","ensemble-cast","educational","shounen","male-protagonist","lost-civilization","travel","environmental","philosophy","kingdom-management","primarily-male-cast"}', NULL, '236', '27', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 89263, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b98416-L44f4idEGMAX.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98416-1XM7oOALCGjA.jpg', '#e4ae28', 98416, '103897', '{"Riichirou Inagaki","Boichi","Caleb Cook"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98416-1XM7oOALCGjA.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Y2ry4tqDDjY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y2ry4tqDDjY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Senkuu Ishigami", "native": "石神千空", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124142-XUO1g7wRqkaT.png"}, {"name": "Kohaku", "native": "コハク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124143-DABUFs3cPNrP.png"}, {"name": "Tsukasa Shishiou", "native": "獅子王司", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124144-KOjcmhunbvYn.png"}, {"name": "Chrome", "native": "クロム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124145-EEvQmsj8jku4.png"}, {"name": "Taiju Ooki", "native": "大木大樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124146-TeXd4r0upuIX.jpg"}, {"name": "Gen Asagiri", "native": "あさぎりゲン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127445-oUCyS7Tl8l5D.png"}, {"name": "Ryuusui Nanami", "native": "七海龍水", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145097-TYg5SshsyvUU.png"}, {"name": "Yuzuriha Ogawa", "native": "小川杠", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124147-y3uE9rBepdad.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98416'),
('MANGA', 'Dorohedoro', 'Dorohedoro', 'ドロヘドロ', 'In a city so dismal it''s known only as "the Hole," a clan of Sorcerers have been plucking people off the streets to use as guinea pigs for atrocious "experiments" in the black arts. In a dark alley, Nikaido found Caiman, a man with a reptile head and a bad case of amnesia. To undo the spell, they''re hunting and killing the Sorcerers in the Hole, hoping that eventually they''ll kill the right one. But when En, the head Sorcerer, gets word of a lizard-man slaughtering his people, he sends a crew of "cleaners" into the Hole, igniting a war between two worlds.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Horror","Mystery"}', '{"magic","ensemble-cast","anti-hero","amnesia","seinen","dystopian","body-horror","gore","surreal-comedy","primarily-adult-cast","demons","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '191', '23', NULL, '2000', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 88863, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx31133-Jx6map3Oidz1.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31133-82wi2P0RY41H.jpg', '#a15d28', 31133, '1133', '{"Q Hayashida","Sylvain Chollet","Anne Demars"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31133-82wi2P0RY41H.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8yrNYhhZKqQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8yrNYhhZKqQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kaiman", "native": "カイマン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b9192-Jly0Soaxc6DX.png"}, {"name": "Nikaido", "native": "ニカイドウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16057-eFteZol4cg9t.jpg"}, {"name": "Shin", "native": "心", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16058-WGqEK3I9bH7c.jpg"}, {"name": "Noi", "native": "能井", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16059-mUfErMfV09e5.jpg"}, {"name": "En", "native": "煙", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16060-d7kczT3iuuWp.png"}, {"name": "Fujita", "native": "藤田", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/16062.jpg"}, {"name": "Ebisu", "native": "恵比寿", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16063-GIoMZpg8cKd6.jpg"}, {"name": "Risu", "native": "栗鼠", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b31212-Y8ZdrqTQ4Od7.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '31133'),
('MANGA', 'Uzumaki: Spiral into Horror', 'Uzumaki', 'うずまき', 'Kurozu-cho, a small fogbound town on the coast of Japan, is cursed. According to Shuichi Saito, the withdrawn boyfriend of teenager Kirie Goshima, their town is haunted not by a person or being but by a pattern: uzumaki, the spiral, the hypnotic secret shape of the world. It manifests itself in small ways: seashells, ferns, whirlpools in water, whirlwinds in air. And in large ways: the spiral marks on people''s bodies, the insane obsessions of Shuichi''s father, the voice from the cochlea in your inner ear. As the madness spreads, the inhabitants of Kurouzu-cho are pulled ever deeper, as if into a whirlpool from which there is no return...

- Includes the extra chapter "Uzumaki Tokubetsu-hen: Ginga", which was included in editions later released.

- Chosen by the American Library Association (ALA) as one of the Top Ten Great Graphic Novels for Teens 2009. (Vol. 1)', '{"Drama","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"body-horror","cosmic-horror","seinen","survival","female-protagonist","gore","episodic","philosophy","rural","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '20', '3', NULL, '1998', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 87868, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30436-Opk9ZubMPuDU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30436-2ga2SL6B6inQ.jpg', '#ffd6ae', 30436, '436', '{"Junji Itou","Susan Daigle-Leach","Marc Bernabé"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30436-2ga2SL6B6inQ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kirie Goshima", "native": "五島桐絵", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/6540.jpg"}, {"name": "Shuuichi Saitou", "native": "斎藤秀一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8459-y456x3P6mrwY.jpg"}, {"name": "Mitsuru Yamaguchi", "native": "山口満", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13864-REJCORGEmIXo.jpg"}, {"name": "Azami Kurotani", "native": "黒谷あざみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131720-TDRE8X8Mma6O.png"}, {"name": "Toshio Saitou", "native": "斎藤敏夫", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181025-ZBxqzujrTNgu.png"}, {"name": "Yukie Saitou", "native": "斎藤雪枝", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181029-klGxqxSykNch.png"}, {"name": "Yasuo Goshima", "native": "五島康夫", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181026-48BNkIgrn0qK.png"}, {"name": "Chizuko Goshima", "native": "五島ちずこ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/charac