('MANGA', 'Goodbye, Eri', 'Sayonara Eri', 'さよなら絵梨', 'With his mother dying, Yuuta attempts to capture her last days on his phone. After her death, Yuuta heads to the roof of the hospital to commit suicide, but a meeting with a strange girl leads him on the path to making a movie.', '{"Drama","Psychological"}', '{"filmmaking","meta","pov","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","acting","female-protagonist","family-life","primarily-teen-cast","school"}', NULL, '1', '1', NULL, '2022', NULL, 'ONE_SHOT', 'FINISHED', 86143, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx146983-pLf4apCkFwKL.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/146983-YIiw77utmcMH.jpg', '#f1500d', 146983, '145863', '{"Tatsuki Fujimoto","Tooru Kuramori","Atsuka Yamagata"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/146983-YIiw77utmcMH.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3Je62Nqn4j8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Je62Nqn4j8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Eri", "native": "絵梨", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270499-xhcO4k19t3e2.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta Itou", "native": "伊藤優太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270546-qSflx7TAxAqF.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta no Chichi", "native": "優太の父", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b324130-v8Ni7Q8d2wjZ.png"}, {"name": "Tauchi", "native": "田内", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b324131-BTL08kbN9fr8.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta no Haha", "native": "優太の母", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b324132-1zAazwYgWgZ2.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta no Tomodachi", "native": "優太の友達", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b324133-lgLRPvRZAJaO.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '146983'),
('MANGA', 'Frieren: Beyond Journey’s End', 'Sousou no Frieren', '葬送のフリーレン', 'The adventure is over but life goes on for an elf mage just beginning to learn what living is all about.

Elf mage Frieren and her courageous fellow adventurers have defeated the Demon King and brought peace to the land. With the great struggle over, they all go their separate ways to live a quiet life. But as an elf, Frieren, nearly immortal, will long outlive the rest of her former party. How will she come to terms with the mortality of her friends? How can she find fulfillment in her own life, and can she learn to understand what life means to the humans around her? Frieren begins a new journey to find the answer.

- Winner of the Grand Prize at the 14th Manga Taisho Awards.

- Nominated for the 25th Annual Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize.

- Placed 3rd at the 7th Annual Next Manga Award.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","travel","elf","philosophy","female-protagonist","snowscape","demons","iyashikei","medieval","kuudere","heterosexual","episodic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 85943, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx118586-CXKgWikBFQgS.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/118586-R1c7mc72oPvS.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 118586, '126287', '{"Kanehito Yamada","Tsukasa Abe","Katsumasa Ogura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/118586-R1c7mc72oPvS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sIFkD5l8ZCU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sIFkD5l8ZCU"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/c438e1cac4a058fde005adebc2c6b7421768324222_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 1 - Shall We Go, Then?"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/ba4d10f40b83c46f596926eb92ab04151768679793_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 2 - The Hero of the South"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/d41929bbb04e92cec71b040e6d4ddc3f1769622703_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 3 - Somewhere She''d Like"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/88e00367e90702463427a10154bf4f5e1769896944_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Other People''s Homes"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/43e05645aa73250cbe415096126b39311770751846_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Logistics in the Northern Plateau"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/27742e241e4aad4b5271be56089b879b1771996080_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - A Demon-Slaying Request"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Frieren", "native": "フリーレン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "h