('MANGA', 'Three Days of Happiness', 'Jumyou wo Kaitotte Moratta. Ichinen ni Tsuki, Ichimanen de.', '寿命を買い取ってもらった。一年につき、一万円で。', 'Kusunoki used to believe he was destined for great things. But now, approaching the age of twenty, he’s a completely mediocre college student with no motivation, no dreams, and no money. After learning he can sell his remaining years, he chooses to divest himself of all but his last three months. Spending this remaining time with his monitor, Miyagi, has Kusunoki truly destroyed his final chance to find happiness…or has he somehow found it?', '{"Drama","Psychological","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"philosophy","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","kuudere","cohabitation","primarily-adult-cast","urban-fantasy","heterosexual"}', NULL, '18', '3', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 85081, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx97553-vqJj5DFS8v2p.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/97553-efSxd9Q935oS.jpg', '#5dbbe4', 97553, '100448', '{"Sugaru Miaki","Shouichi Taguchi","E9L"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/97553-efSxd9Q935oS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kusunoki", "native": "クスノキ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132152-N6INNYIk0Tb6.jpg"}, {"name": "Miyagi", "native": "ミヤギ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132151-UThU5WPrYstE.jpg"}, {"name": "Himeno", "native": "ヒメノ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145032-JQ0pM62wJ3pK.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '97553'),
('MANGA', 'Land of the Lustrous', 'Houseki no Kuni', '宝石の国', 'In a world inhabited by crystalline lifeforms called The Lustrous, every unique gem must fight for their way of life against the threat of lunarians who would turn them into decorations. Phosphophyllite, the most fragile and brittle of gems, longs to join the battle. When Phos is instead assigned to complete a natural history of their world, it sounds like a dull and pointless task. But this new job brings Phos into contact with Cinnabar, a gem forced to live in isolation. Can Phos’s seemingly mundane assignment lead both Phos and Cinnabar to the fulfillment they desire?

- Includes 12 extra chapters.

- Nominated for the 8th Manga Taisho in 2015.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"philosophy","anthropomorphism","seinen","cosmic-horror","shapeshifting","post-apocalyptic","agender","dissociative-identities","ensemble-cast","asexual","swordplay"}', NULL, '120', '13', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 83933, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx74489-5HtDCFfut8Be.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/74489-iAeCc8td3qWX.jpg', NULL, 74489, '44489', '{"Haruko Ichikawa","Alethea Nibley","Evan Hayden"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/74489-iAeCc8td3qWX.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Phosphophyllite", "native": "フォスフォフィライト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123385-ild8gXk13xcO.png"}, {"name": "Shinsha", "native": "シンシャ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123384-ZA5owNzNH4Y3.jpg"}, {"name": "Kongou", "native": "金剛", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123394-RYb2wD26uHH2.png"}, {"name": "Diamond", "native": "ダイヤモンド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123390-JpK1cECeWCEo.png"}, {"name": "Bort", "native": "ボルツ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123389-fMHLobcWf8lL.png"}, {"name": "Rutile", "native": "ルチル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123399-0qOAnNWCrhCo.jpg"}, {"name": "Alexandrite", "native": "アレキサンドライト", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123386-l078Jx6Ntddg.png"}, {"name": "Yellow Diamond", "native": "イエローダイヤモンド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123400-RDGUEopzSghD.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '74489'),
('MANGA', 'Witch Hat Atelier', 'Tongari Boushi no Atelier', 'とんがり帽子のアトリエ', 'In a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: she wants to be a witch. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and Coco was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream to become a witch … until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious, traveling magician. After secretly seeing Qifrey perform magic in a way she’s never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody “knows” might not be the truth, and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it may seem...

- Nominated for the 11th Manga Taishou Award in 2018.

- Won the Daruma d''Or at Japan Expo in 2019.

- Won Best U.S. Edition of International Material - Asia at the Eisner Awards in 2020.

- Won the Best Manga Award at the Harvey Awards in 2020.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"witch","magic","found-family","female-protagonist","drawing","coming-of-age","teacher","ensemble-cast","medieval","primarily-female-cast","primarily-child-cast","politics"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 83642, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx98263-kIeaTXrAbGkj.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98263-inZk3YmhgbQh.jpg', '#f1c950', 98263, '100035', '{"Kamome Shirahama","Stephen Kohler","Lídia Ivasa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98263-inZk3YmhgbQh.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Coco", "native": "ココ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129840-B2CVE0TIcKpT.png"}, {"name": "Qifrey", "native": "キーフリー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129841-brgGFuOv1h0n.png"}, {"name": "Richeh", "native": "リチェ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129838-DRjxUa0u7Lyg.jpg"}, {"name": "Tetia", "native": "テティア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129839-7KP7lqLC7ZdW.png"}, {"name": "Agott Arkrome", "native": "アガット・アークロム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129842-n9YfEU63mDNm.png"}, {"name": "Olruggio", "native": "オルーギオ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137972-4sSEu1132KZM.png"}, {"name": "Tartah", "native": "タータ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158680-uSo7mCDoFqoA.jpg"}, {"name": "Easthies", "native": "イースヒース", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158683-zwBynDci5MwD.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98263'),
('MANGA', 'Fullmetal Alchemist', 'Hagane no Renkinjutsushi', '鋼の錬金術師', 'Alchemy tore the Elric brothers’ bodies apart. Can their bond make them whole again?

In this world, alchemists are those who study and perform the art of alchemical transmutation—the science of manipulating and transforming matter. They are bounded by the Law of Equivalent Exchange: in order to gain something, one must sacrifice something of equal value.

In an alchemical ritual gone wrong, Edward Elric lost his arm and his leg, and his brother Alphonse became nothing but a soul in a suit of armor. Equipped with mechanical “auto-mail” limbs, Edward becomes a state alchemist, seeking the one thing that can restore his and his brother’s bodies...the legendary Philosopher’s Stone.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"alchemy","politics","philosophy","military","war","shounen","male-protagonist","disability","travel","steampunk","ensemble-cast","super-power"}', NULL, '116', '27', NULL, '2001', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 80667, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30025-mpPVpCKFTowt.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30025-IaxAxX9hIGx0.jpg', '#f1ae5d', 30025, '25', '{"Hiromu Arakawa","Jun Tokou","Kyu Aiya"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30025-IaxAxX9hIGx0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Edward Elric", "native": "エドワード・エルリック", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11-TA5Nuk7EDUZG.jpg"}, {"name": "Alphonse Elric", "native": "アルフォンス・エルリック", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12-tCKu8yK5kFL5.jpg"}, {"name": "Winry Rockbell", "native": "ウィンリィ・ロックベル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/63-xloedtYxiJ2E.jpg"}, {"name": "Pinako Rockbell", "native": "ピナコ・ロックベル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65-Yw7j20Y9uewh.png"}, {"name": "Scar", "native": "スカー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66-bLbGWXrmDqfV.png"}, {"name": "Izumi Curtis", "native": "イズミ・カーティス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67-ggB3aC6DzQqB.png"}, {"name": "Roy Mustang", "native": "ロイ・マスタング", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b68-moBLY2WO2am3.png"}, {"name": "Maes Hughes", "native": "マース･ヒューズ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b69-MRetSG8Qevvu.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30025'),
('MANGA', 'The Fragrant Flower Blooms With Dignity', 'Kaoru Hana wa Rin to Saku', '薫る花は凛と咲く', 'This story takes place in a particular town with two infamous schools in constant dispute: Chidori High, a boys'' school predominantly attended by low-class students with damning grades, and its neighbor Kikyo Girls'' High, with most of its female students coming from wealthy and prestigious families. One day, high school second-year Rintaro Tsumugi, a fierce-looking but gentle-minded student at Chidori, is helping at his family''s patisserie when he encounters a female customer by the name of Kaoruko Waguri. Rintaro enjoys his time with Kaoruko, as she doesn''t judge him for his appearance, but this blissful peace is quickly disturbed when Rintaro makes the discovery that Kaoruko is actually a student at Kikyo. This revelation marks the beginning of the two''s strenuous tale, as they fight against the limitations placed upon them by their schools and surroundings in an attempt to find their own path!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"iyashikei","heterosexual","primarily-teen-cast","school","male-protagonist","coming-of-age","ensemble-cast","female-protagonist","shounen","philosophy","food","urban"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 80430, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx140475-QEGtrmdvbpOv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/140475-FgBKTTJY7Ry6.jpg', NULL, 140475, '144267', '{"Saka Mikami","Manon Debienne","Sayaka Okada"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/140475-FgBKTTJY7Ry6.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rYHdW6aIl7I/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rYHdW6aIl7I"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kaoruko Waguri", "native": "和栗薫子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268676-aQmqvqj0DNoJ.png"}, {"name": "Rintarou Tsumugi", "native": "紬凛太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268677-APMPGH67QqPr.jpg"}, {"name": "Subaru Hoshina", "native": "保科昴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270095-Z5KpvacVXp1S.jpg"}, {"name": "Shohei Usami", "native": "宇佐美翔平", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272240-1okw3miy0dPX.png"}, {"name": "Saku Natsusawa", "native": "夏沢朔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272241-6NHTwQDIUXQk.png"}, {"name": "Ayato Yorita", "native": "依田絢斗", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272243-i9xYmuUQaI3q.png"}, {"name": "Kyouko Tsumugi", "native": "紬杏子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286245-iZhNiS29Mw2B.jpg"}, {"name": "Keichiro Tsumugi", "native": "紬圭一郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b299398-Xs4z2ZR8lywB.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '140475'),
('MANGA', 'Blue Period', 'Blue Period', 'ブルーピリオド', 'The studious Yatora leaves a dry life of study and good manners behind for a new passion: painting. But untethering yourself from all your past expectations is dangerous as well as thrilling…', '{"Drama","Slice of Life"}', '{"drawing","coming-of-age","seinen","male-protagonist","educational","philosophy","primarily-adult-cast","school","school-club"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 77350, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx107237-tyQXghsKmE0t.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107237-mBUo7cMAWktl.jpg', '#5dc9e4', 107237, '107931', '{"Tsubasa Yamaguchi","Ajani Oloye","Jesús Espí"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107237-mBUo7cMAWktl.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yatora Yaguchi", "native": "矢口八虎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144674-Y2Y6BlAPu22v.png"}, {"name": "Ryuuji Ayukawa", "native": "鮎川龍二", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150417-DVMK9sQwBx8a.png"}, {"name": "Maru Mori", "native": "森まる", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157117-pJhhwUaGaMxK.jpg"}, {"name": "Yotasuke Takahashi", "native": "高橋世田介", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b157118-Otu2NmNHzLxX.png"}, {"name": "Maki Kuwana", "native": "桑名マキ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b194201-yxhQI3TDOt46.png"}, {"name": "Masako Saeki", "native": "佐伯昌子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b194202-6HaB3tnpT9OQ.png"}, {"name": "Haruka Hashida", "native": "橋田悠", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b194203-CDlUmFQLqHyi.png"}, {"name": "Shiro