('MANGA', 'Kingdom', 'Kingdom', 'キングダム', 'Xin is a war orphan in a poor village in the kingdom of Qin. He has big dreams of becoming a great general, and when his best friend’s life is cut short by political machinations, Xin sets off to find a deposed ruler and help restore his place on the throne, while working his way up through the ranks of the Qin kingdom’s army to do what no one has ever done before—unify China.', '{"Action","Drama"}', '{"military","historical","war","ancient-china","royal-affairs","politics","male-protagonist","seinen","swordplay","coming-of-age","foreign","gore"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2006', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 76752, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx46765-KPXir4sRqJBW.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/46765-8DqCBEYyt9yP.jpg', '#e46b43', 46765, '16765', '{"Yasuhisa Hara","Sui Ishida","Toshimitsu Matsubara"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/46765-8DqCBEYyt9yP.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZmDorgdAG4g/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZmDorgdAG4g"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/981b5688f5bf78f028b9417b977bd10d1761319931_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 4 - Zhao''s National Gate"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire2-tmb/5658776e2f666e0007f0b5a2078d57741761846063_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 5 - Storming Liewei"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/09525d07bc4d0ee372d46fad2e4211de1762625038_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 6 - Liewei''s Trap"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/4a27b77d66da0e1dffc48606a25a409f1763139158_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode 7 - Weapons of Conquest"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire4-tmb/9b9e0b2e85b0c55887242de67dfee551176