('MANGA', 'Slam Dunk', 'SLAM DUNK', 'SLAM DUNK', 'Hanamichi Sakuragi''s got no game with girls--none at all! It doesn''t help that he''s known for throwing down at a moment''s notice and always coming out on top. A hopeless bruiser, he''s been rejected by 50 girls in a row! All that changes when he meets the girl of his dreams, Haruko, and she''s actually not afraid of him! When she introduces him to the game of basketball, his life is changed forever...', '{"Comedy","Drama","Sports"}', '{"basketball","male-protagonist","primarily-male-cast","ensemble-cast","shounen","school","primarily-teen-cast","delinquents","heterosexual","rehabilitation","school-club"}', NULL, '276', '31', NULL, '1990', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 74671, '90', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30051-5KJyPlO7z5F4.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30051-Cp4mFnqb6zhz.jpg', '#f18650', 30051, '51', '{"Takehiko Inoue","Katsumi Tatsuzawa","Drik Sada"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30051-Cp4mFnqb6zhz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hanamichi Sakuragi", "native": "桜木花道", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b310-3GLKM2I3EiRf.png"}, {"name": "Kaede Rukawa", "native": "流川楓", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311-uxwHnw9lXk4e.png"}, {"name": "Ryouta Miyagi", "native": "宮城リョータ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b312-QZ0Jv451096U.png"}, {"name": "Hisashi Mitsui", "native": "三井寿", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b313-D720Nz8fAUxw.jpg"}, {"name": "Takenori Akagi", "native": "赤木剛憲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b314-MPvsR4ndNZDd.png"}, {"name": "Akira Sendou", "native": "仙道彰", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3403-YkPE1BmqEGGn.png"}, {"name": "Kiyota Nobunaga", "native": "清田信長", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8389-EOuhBm7HrtT8.png"}, {"name": "Toru Hanagata", "native": "花形透", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8450-axm4NDis9L93.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30051'),
('MANGA', 'The Flowers of Evil', 'Aku no Hana', '惡の華', 'The story opens as middle school student Takao Kasuga receives an F on a math test. But he doesn''t even seem to notice because he''s too engrossed in surreptitiously reading Beaudelaire''s The Flowers of Evil. And the day goes downhill from there. In a moment of weakness, he finds and takes home the gym clothes belonging to sweet, pretty Nanako Saeki on whom he has a major crush. Unfortunately for Takao, there''s a witness to the theft: Nakamura, who has a huge chip on her shoulder and a sadistic streak.

As the saga unfolds, we see Takao struggling to decide whether to confess or cover up his misdeeds at the same time that he tries to win over the girl of his dreams, and avoid the blackmail attempts of Nakamura, his new ”BFF.”

Smart, funny, and emotionally engaging, The Flowers of Evil introduces a character who''s not a hero, but just an ordinary teenager in search of true love and real friendship.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Romance"}', '{"coming-of-age","psychosexual","philosophy","denpa","love-triangle","classic-literature","school","male-protagonist","bullying","shounen","rural","writing"}', NULL, '58', '11', NULL, '2009', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 74020, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx54705-78Th5SRaL0Ns.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/54705-c8gXYYrQboNu.jpg', NULL, 54705, '24705', '{"Shuuzou Oshimi","Thibaud Desbief","Marc Bernabé"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/54705-c8gXYYrQboNu.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Sawa Nakamura", "native": "仲村佐和", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b62793-7YclMbAYh0q1.png"}, {"name": "Takao Kasuga", "native": "春日高男", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b62795-Dz6v679QTqe3.png"}, {"name": "Nanako Saeki", "native": "佐伯奈々子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b62797-WVfc0yGcF3WD.jpg"}, {"name": "Aya Tokiwa", "native": "常磐文", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b78361-ZxPOANU4YTC2.png"}, {"name": "Kouji Fujiwara", "native": "藤原晃司", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/78405.jpg"}, {"name": "Koizumi", "native": "小泉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/78961.jpg"}, {"name": "Ken Kojima", "native": "小島 建", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/80191.jpg"}, {"name": "Ai Kinoshita", "native": "木下 亜衣", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/80193.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '54705'),
('MANGA', 'The Climber', 'Kokou no Hito', '孤高の人', 'Transfer student Buntaro Mori starts his first day at his new school already on the administration’s radar. He’s withdrawn and sullen, and the teachers are just waiting for him to explode. When his annoying classmate Miyamoto promises to leave him alone forever if he climbs to the top of the school, Mori eagerly takes up the challenge and shocks everyone when he makes it all the way to the roof. Flushed with the victory of his first successful climb, Mori can’t resist the lure of the local peak, despite warnings from more experienced climbers about the risks of climbing alone. But Mori doesn’t care. A little danger is nothing in the face of his new obsession.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Psychological","Sports"}', '{"mountaineering","philosophy","coming-of-age","seinen","outdoor-activities","travel","male-protagonist","wilderness","primarily-male-cast","primarily-adult-cast","survival","hikikomori"}', NULL, '170', '17', NULL, '2007', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 73171, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx37375-wkgev4kXhamw.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/37375-CWUiMtQsmdJI.jpg', '#5daee4', 37375, '7375', '{"Shinichi Sakamoto","Jirou Nitta","Shinya Komi"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/37375-CWUiMtQsmdJI.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gu97AQtbZk0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gu97AQtbZk0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Buntarou Mori", "native": "森文太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b35510-qMAnMK0udakL.jpg"}, {"name": "Yumi Shirai", "native": "白井夕実", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36838-lQQ4H44eVGnz.png"}, {"name": "Masao Oonishi", "native": "大西政雄", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36840-Vq3OxOWQVggI.png"}, {"name": "Hajime Miyamoto", "native": "宮本一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b36841-Lah6GMoXagNM.png"}, {"name": "Ayumu Takemura", "native": "竹村歩", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67535-WpEhgYqNjSJP.png"}, {"name": "Isao Adachi", "native": "足立勲", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67537-NNrG1LRZiiov.png"}, {"name": "Hana Katou", "native": "加藤花", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67539-HD3euz81nOu4.png"}, {"name": "Tatsuji Komatsu", "native": "小松辰治", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/67541.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '37375'),
('MANGA', 'Homunculus', 'Homunculus', 'ホムンクルス', 'Nakoshi Susumu, age 34, is living out of his car. Between spending his days with the homeless and his nights in his vehicle, he has little to his name–but not so little that he’ll agree to be the subject of a scientific experiment. An unnerving medical student is stalking him and offering to pay Nakoshi a significant sum to test trepanation: the ability to draw out a sixth sense by drilling into the skull. Nakoshi refuses. When Nakoshi’s beloved car is towed, though, he finally agrees to cash and the operating table. At first, the experiment seems to bear no fruit, and Nakoshi’s life is unchanged. That is, until Nakoshi realizes his vision has warped in his left eye…showing him the twisted homunculus inside every human.', '{"Drama","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"philosophy","seinen","psychosexual","male-protagonist","primarily-adult-cast","denpa","anti-hero","body-horror","homeless","gore","class-struggle"}', NULL, '166', '15', NULL, '2003', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 73105, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30936-P55KMUW1sgLN.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30936-2JwXy6PK3gT0.jpg', NULL, 30936, '936', '{"Hideo Yamamoto","Cerridwyn Graffham","Rina Mapa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30936-2JwXy6PK3gT0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Susumu Nakoshi", "native": "名越進", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8278-Fakx1GON3oGD.png"}, {"name": "Ito Manabu", "native": "伊藤学", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8279-4L42iG3wdsgq.png"}, {"name": "Nanako Nanase", "native": "七瀬ななこ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/80971.jpg"}, {"name": "Ken", "native": "ケンさん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/81037.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukari", "native": "ユカリ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/81429.jpg"}, {"name": "Ita", "native": "イタさん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/81475.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30936'),
('MANGA', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Part 6: Stone Ocean', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Stone Ocean', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 ストーンオーシャン', 'Jolyne Cujoh—daughter of Jotaro Kujo—is sentenced to 15 years in prison for a murder she didn’t commit! In a bizarre turn of events, the prison is filled with Stand users. Some become her allies, but many are sent to kill Jolyne and her friends in a scheme to resurrect the scourge of the Joestar family—DIO! It’s a battle for survival in a prison where death lurks around every corner while Jolyne fights to save her father’s life.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Supernatural"}', '{"female-protagonist","super-power","prison","urban-fantasy","memory-manipulation","foreign","crime","gore","primarily-female-cast","shounen","ensemble-cast","philosophy"}', NULL, '158', '17', NULL, '1999', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 73076, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx33009-jF9dqLJcZC4n.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33009-K2pElLx3k64t.jpg', '#ff861a', 33009, '3009', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Kazuya Fujisawa","Tsuyoshi Nakamura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33009-K2pElLx3k64t.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u0VBX2zp_DI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u0VBX2zp_DI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Joutarou Kuujou", "native": "空条承太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4003-gWDSEGbeOAll.png"}, {"name": "Jolyne Kuujou", "native": "空条徐倫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11222-Se9QoJHDSeYY.png"}, {"name": "Hermes Costello", "native": "エルメェス・コステロ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13369-7lNj3c1ohOVz.png"}, {"name": "Weather Report", "native": "ウェザー・リポート", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/c