('MANGA', 'Jujutsu Kaisen 0', 'Jujutsu Kaisen 0: Tokyo Toritsu Jujutsu Koutou Senmon Gakkou', '呪術廻戦 0 東京都立呪術高等専門学校', 'Yuta Okkotsu is a nervous high school student who is suffering from a serious problem—his childhood friend Rika has turned into a curse and won''t leave him alone. Since Rika is no ordinary curse, his plight is noticed by Satoru Gojo, a teacher at Jujutsu High, a school where fledgling exorcists learn how to combat curses. Gojo convinces Yuta to enroll, but can he learn enough in time to confront the curse that haunts him?', '{"Action","Supernatural"}', '{"shounen","demons","male-protagonist","school","urban-fantasy","magic","super-power"}', NULL, '4', '1', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 72260, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx105469-IvLF5yIf6LBC.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105469-bFlz61UBbNvb.jpg', '#bba128', 105469, '115710', '{"Gege Akutami","Fédoua Lamodière","Jeong-Un Lee"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105469-bFlz61UBbNvb.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://img1.ak.crunchyroll.com/i/spire1-tmb/a7a9b61cd6817661dfca73404ce05a3d1762890678_full.jpg", "kind": "episode", "caption": "Episode  - Jujutsu Kaisen: Execution - Trailer"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Satoru Gojou", "native": "五条悟", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127691-9zqh1xpIubn7.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta Okkotsu", "native": "乙骨憂太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129571-GHJk7gviHOOw.jpg"}, {"name": "Suguru Getou", "native": "夏油傑", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133699-FCnXaISgazAi.png"}, {"name": "Kento Nanami", "native": "七海建人", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133704-8wLTGjc234q2.png"}, {"name": "Maki Zenin", "native": "禪院真希", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134167-5TCytk45YByD.png"}, {"name": "Mai Zenin", "native": "禪院真依", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134168-FdWz5w2LqpeF.jpg"}, {"name": "Panda", "native": "パンダ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137974-9qnK3DPrvLKh.jpg"}, {"name": "Aoi Toudou", "native": "東堂葵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137975-6TH7PiLWJaqy.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '105469'),
('MANGA', 'Toilet-Bound Hanako-kun', 'Jibaku Shounen Hanako-kun', '地縛少年 花子くん', '"Hanako-san, Hanako-san... are you there?"

At Kamome Academy, rumors abound about the school''s Seven Mysteries, one of which is Hanako-san. Said to occupy the third stall of the third floor girls'' bathroom in the old school building, Hanako-san grants any wish when summoned. Nene Yashiro, an occult-loving high school girl who dreams of romance, ventures into this haunted bathroom... but the Hanako-san she meets there is nothing like she imagined! Kamome Academy''s Hanako-san... is a boy!', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Mystery","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"youkai","mythology","ghost","school","urban-fantasy","female-protagonist","heterosexual","shounen","male-protagonist","exorcism"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 72219, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx98842-Ji0v423UZ4er.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98842-p4I8mwxxMrFa.jpg', '#e4355d', 98842, '105084', '{"AidaIro","Alethea Nibley","Tania Biswas"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98842-p4I8mwxxMrFa.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3wrEE13ZmyE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3wrEE13ZmyE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hanako", "native": "花子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128651-GaZImkP2Of1R.png"}, {"name": "Nene Yashiro", "native": "八尋寧々", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128652-2LLhX7bBtwyC.png"}, {"name": "Kou Minamoto", "native": "源光", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137222-ojZAO84oI2Hp.png"}, {"name": "Tsukasa Yugi ", "native": "柚木つかさ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137221-zZaoaXVcr8nj.png"}, {"name": "Sakura Nanamine ", "native": "七峰桜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137223-W1NKXmHbS4fU.png"}, {"name": "Teru Minamoto", "native": "源輝", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137224-c0Ce7xTJWyl0.jpg"}, {"name": "Sousuke Mitsuba", "native": "三葉惣助", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141671-ukMBUI4c2p53.png"}, {"name": "Akane Aoi", "native": "蒼井茜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150855-Fv4qOy84I0ZE.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98842'),
('MANGA', 'Kagurabachi', 'Kagurabachi', 'カグラバチ', 'Young Chihiro spends his days training under his famous swordsmith father. One day he hopes to become a great sword-maker himself. The goofy father and the serious son--they thought these days would last forever. But suddenly, tragedy strikes. A dark day soaked in blood. Chihiro and his blade now live only for revenge.

- Winner of the Tsugimanga 2024 Award in the Print Manga Category. 

- Winner of the 4th Magademy Commitment Award. 

- Nominee of the 70th Shogakukan Award.', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"swordplay","urban-fantasy","shounen","revenge","male-protagonist","criminal-organization","magic","politics","yakuza","gore","mafia","gangs"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 71052, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx169355-5pqzh1Wb4NOQ.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/169355-MzURKZ3veXa7.jpg', '#d6351a', 169355, '162479', '{"Takeru Hokazono","Aya Nakamura","Kagetora Toono"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/169355-MzURKZ3veXa7.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cySfucCEhRA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cySfucCEhRA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chihiro Rokuhira", "native": "六平千鉱", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b314801-MvuHiyPe5Dxu.png"}, {"name": "Hakuri Sazanami", "native": "漣伯理", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326181-WSlgO36TiAjA.jpg"}, {"name": "Togo Shiba", "native": "柴登吾", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b314802-MSshYoi5yuJB.jpg"}, {"name": "Kunishige Rokuhira", "native": "六平国重", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b314803-rHxwPh9ehNl9.png"}, {"name": "Hinao", "native": "ヒナオ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315655-rw7lrHHsN6oq.png"}, {"name": "Char Kyounagi", "native": "鏡凪シャル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b316062-rWB4eSCJIgrE.png"}, {"name": "Genichi Soujou", "native": "宗城厳一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b317244-f0XOgt4liSF7.png"}, {"name": "Soushirou Azami", "native": "薊奏士郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b318348-Lq61zKW8P0zw.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '169355'),
('MANGA', 'The Quintessential Quintuplets', 'Go-toubun no Hanayome', '五等分の花嫁', 'One day, a poor high school second-year named Futaro Uesugi comes across a private tutoring gig with good pay. But his pupils are his classmates!! And they’re quintuplets!! A-and they’re all gorgeous girls, but they’re also troublemakers who hate to study and are on the verge of flunking out! And his first task is simply gaining the sisters’ trust?! Every day is a party! The curtain is rising on the Nakano quintuplets’ quirky romantic comedy with five times the cute!!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"twins","female-harem","primarily-female-cast","love-triangle","heterosexual","male-protagonist","marriage","school","tsundere","shounen","family-life","cute-girls-doing-cute-things"}', NULL, '122', '14', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 70282, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx100230-TA0RQ9d7RVas.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100230-aiEuOcHPAC9l.jpg', '#f16b43', 100230, '103851', '{"Negi Haruba","Marcey Naitou","Antonio Valdez"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100230-aiEuOcHPAC9l.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/im3k9VYR8AQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=im3k9VYR8AQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Fuutarou Uesugi", "native": "上杉風太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128063-0h9piZcxa2zt.png"}, {"name": "Ichika Nakano", "native": "中野一花", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126371-0KQpl80s8kXQ.png"}, {"name": "Nino Nakano", "native": "中野二乃", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126372-DtorHRgQaYUJ.png"}, {"name": "Miku Nakano", "native": "中野三玖", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126373-CW