('MANGA', 'Soul Eater', 'Soul Eater', 'ソウルイーター', 'Maka is a scythe meister, working to perfect one particular scythe until it is good enough to become Death''s Weapon -- the weapon used by Shinigami-sama, the spirit of Death himself. As if that wasn''t unusual enough, her scythe is a demon scythe called Soul Eater, which can change form from a scythe to a human-looking boy. In order to make Soul Eater powerful enough to be Death''s Weapon, he must eat the souls of 99 humans and 1 witch. Along the way, the two of them face many different challenges, including a cat witch named Blair (who happens to have a thing for Soul) and a teacher who''s been turned into a zombie (and wants him to join her!). Her fellow students, like the shadow ninja weapon meister named Black Star who always needs to be the center of attention, aren''t much help, either. It''ll be a miracle if Maka even survives, let alone manages to make Soul Eater into the Death Scythe.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"ensemble-cast","magic","shounen","henshin","super-power","female-protagonist","gods","guns","witch","shapeshifting","school","swordplay"}', NULL, '117', '25', NULL, '2003', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 69470, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30908-nk6Ct4euJelZ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30908-FRfozuUeiH1D.jpg', '#f1ae50', 30908, '908', '{"Atsushi Ookubo","Yoshiki Tonogai","Takuji Katou"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30908-FRfozuUeiH1D.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Maka Albarn", "native": "マカ・アルバーン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8439-5TIyWlfClnMs.png"}, {"name": "Death the Kid", "native": "デス・ザ・キッド", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8455-0Ztel4ew5bNd.png"}, {"name": "Soul Eater Evans", "native": "ソウル・イーター・エヴァンス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8456-GtNbISpXhkvd.png"}, {"name": "Black☆Star", "native": "ブラック☆スター", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8464-oKu98OyJ3eZt.png"}, {"name": "Tsubaki Nakatsukasa", "native": "中務椿", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8443-WtvTWl6zufoc.png"}, {"name": "Patricia Thompson", "native": "パトリシア・トンプソン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8444-AbC3BxZA7gUY.png"}, {"name": "Elizabeth Thompson", "native": "エリザベス・トンプソン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8445-7BIqYhg3OKMn.png"}, {"name": "Franken Stein", "native": "フランケン・シュタイン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8446-uTTlVv5DRQnr.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30908'),
('MANGA', 'Grand Blue Dreaming', 'Grand Blue', 'ぐらんぶる', 'After moving out on his own to a seaside town, Iori Kitahara makes a college debut he never anticipated. A new chapter of his life unfolds, full of diving with beautiful girls and shenanigans with a gaggle of lovable bastards! Idiot-expert Kenji Inoue and au naturel authority Kimitake Yoshioka bring you a glorious college tale filled with booze-fueled antics!', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life","Sports"}', '{"slapstick","surreal-comedy","male-protagonist","seinen","college","primarily-adult-cast","nudity","coastal","bar","scuba-diving","heterosexual","otaku-culture"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 68724, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx87395-axsA49kSZp72.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87395-oSAhMYznMKAE.jpg', '#e4a15d', 87395, '70345', '{"Kenji Inoue","Kimitake Yoshioka","Jan Ivan Concepcion"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87395-oSAhMYznMKAE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kOcjINpcY5s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kOcjINpcY5s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Iori Kitahara", "native": "北原伊織", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123182-tuQ2yf5IEx02.jpg"}, {"name": "Chisa Kotegawa", "native": "古手川千紗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123181-t0pV6LtaDUf6.png"}, {"name": "Kouhei Imamura", "native": "今村耕平", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125917-FBK4DlUGycsr.jpg"}, {"name": "Aina Yoshiwara", "native": "吉原愛菜", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127420-ssYIvTQrmliT.jpg"}, {"name": "Sakurako Busujima", "native": "毒島桜子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/