('MANGA', 'The Way of the Househusband', 'Gokushufudou', '極主夫道', 'He was the fiercest member of the yakuza, a man who left countless underworld legends in his wake. They called him “the Immortal Dragon.” But one day he walked away from it all to travel another path—the path of the househusband! The curtain rises on this cozy yakuza comedy!', '{"Comedy","Slice of Life"}', '{"parody","episodic","yakuza","male-protagonist","slapstick","gangs","family-life","primarily-adult-cast","seinen","heterosexual","food","urban"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 68340, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx101233-ipG2rYitNxyd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101233-4Q41vXLKrjhe.jpg', '#f1bb5d', 101233, '112922', '{"Kousuke Oono","Sheldon Drzka","Amanda Haley"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101233-4Q41vXLKrjhe.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MT9oP2ienqo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MT9oP2ienqo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tatsu", "native": "龍", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b131519-KgmdjieEssj7.png"}, {"name": "Masa", "native": "雅", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b131520-qtGDNO05CsVX.png"}, {"name": "Miku", "native": "美久", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b131521-6DGz4B3dTF84.jpg"}, {"name": "Torajirou", "native": "虎二郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b151205-vDvCsLpjHkcz.jpg"}, {"name": "Hibari Torii", "native": "酉井ひばり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180245-TocGYGkH719B.jpg"}, {"name": "Bob", "native": "ボブ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilis