('MANGA', 'Gachiakuta', 'Gachiakuta', 'ガチアクタ', 'A boy lives in a floating town, where the poor scrape by and the rich live a sumptuous life, simply casting their garbage off the side, into the abyss. When he’s falsely accused of murder, though, his wrongful conviction leads to an unimaginable punishment—exile off the edge, with the rest of the trash. Down on the surface, the cast-off waste of humanity has bred vicious monsters, and to travel the path to vengeance against those who cast him into Hell, a boy will have to become a warrior…', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"ensemble-cast","shounen","male-protagonist","dystopian","revenge","post-apocalyptic","super-power","survival","urban-fantasy","urban","assassins"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 67380, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx144946-cscic3n2SwdY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/144946-85c80rNqlAPp.jpg', NULL, 144946, '144180', '{"Kei Urana","Hachibee","Kazuki Ishihara"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/144946-85c80rNqlAPp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S7GW3Z5bvqM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7GW3Z5bvqM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rudo", "native": "ルド", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266433-8JWks5k2OPJn.png"}, {"name": "Enjin", "native": "エンジン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266438-3Veykti1lXgg.png"}, {"name": "Zanka Nijiku", "native": "ザンカ・ニジク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268742-PSWLnWDJH7HJ.png"}, {"name": "Riyou Reaper", "native": "リヨウ・リーパー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b275749-fglzDjaLZh1H.png"}, {"name": "Chiwa", "native": "チワ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266434-Wkjo1jlTgDCm.jpg"}, {"name": "Regto", "native": "レグト", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266437-sUIpywq7P310.jpg"}, {"name": "Tamsy Caines", "native": "タムジー・ケインズ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291689-qUluOFlz7ZiD.png"}, {"name": "Amo Empool", "native": "アモ・エンプール", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298929-FPGX8O3DHcoL.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '144946'),
('MANGA', 'Claymore', 'CLAYMORE', 'CLAYMORE', 'In a world where monsters called Yoma prey on humans and live among them in disguise, humanity’s only hope is a new breed of warrior known as Claymores. Half-human, half-monster, these silver-eyed slayers possess supernatural strength but are condemned to fight their savage impulses—or lose their humanity completely.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Horror"}', '{"demons","primarily-female-cast","super-power","female-protagonist","monster-girl","swordplay","gore","youkai","body-horror","ensemble-cast","orphan","adoption"}', NULL, '159', '27', NULL, '2001', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 66653, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30583-Ysqwu8uryIUX.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30583-nVYlrUhqOPGC.jpg', '#e4935d', 30583, '583', '{"Norihiro Yagi","Sabrina Heep","Jonathan Tarbox"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30583-nVYlrUhqOPGC.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Clare", "native": "クレア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2188-yjGSCtaC06Yh.png"}, {"name": "Raki", "native": "ラキ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/2208.jpg"}, {"name": "Miria", "native": "ミリア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2702-VPTwNJWL3ZXF.png"}, {"name": "Deneve", "native": "デネヴ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2731-WrDFQ5ptu62q.png"}, {"name": "Helen", "native": "ヘレン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2732-5VWqCclHaR11.png"}, {"name": "Rubel", "native": "ルヴル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2209-hRHRyBb8VcLG.png"}, {"name": "Teresa", "native": "テレサ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2398-6SjGbti0dhaE.jpg"}, {"name": "Riful", "native": "リフル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/2622.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30583'),
('MANGA', 'Bloom Into You', 'Yagate Kimi ni Naru', 'やがて君になる', 'Yuu has always loved shoujo manga and awaits the day she gets a love confession that sends her heart aflutter with bubbles and hearts, and yet when a junior high classmate confesses his feelings to her…she feels nothing. Disappointed and confused, Yuu enters high school still unsure how to respond. That’s when Yuu sees the beautiful student council president Nanami turn down a suitor with such maturity that she’s inspired to ask her for help. But when the next person to confess to Yuu is Nanami herself, has her shoujo romance finally begun?', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"yuri","female-protagonist","coming-of-age","lgbtq-themes","school","primarily-teen-cast","primarily-female-cast","school-club","acting","aromantic","philosophy"}', NULL, '53', '8', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 66504, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86218-sIl9tnqHZQyh.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86218-haluRJRutcif.jpg', '#f1d6c9', 86218, '88660', '{"Nio Nakatani","Jenny McKeon","Aline Kukor"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86218-haluRJRutcif.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lfdnNJk0hHo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lfdnNJk0hHo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuu Koito", "native": "小糸侑", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123528-q3SR8wyDPTCe.png"}, {"name": "Touko Nanami", "native": "七海燈子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123529-XSxpzTGWAq2a.png"}, {"name": "Sayaka Saeki", "native": "佐伯沙弥香", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123530-i2u0KClGP7IM.png"}, {"name": "Koyomi Kanou", "native": "叶こよみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127273-Z8nDMPDBAA89.png"}, {"name": "Seiji Maki", "native": "槙聖司", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128067-8Etz536mz22x.jpg"}, {"name": "Akari Hyuuga", "native": "日向朱里", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128103-QcKJvyKPKMFS.jpg"}, {"name": "Miyako Kodama", "native": "児玉都", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128561-TWh3PyMtgBYu.jpg"}, {"name": "Riko Hakozaki", "native": "箱崎理子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128562-s9PzHbFkkSEt.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86218'),
('MANGA', 'Fire Force', 'Enen no Shouboutai', '炎炎ノ消防隊', 'Terror has paralyzed the clockwork metropolis of Tokyo! Possessed by demons, people have begun to burst into flame, leading to the establishment of a special firefighting team: the Fire Force, ready to roll on a moment''s notice to fight spontaneous combustion anywhere it might break out. The team is about to get a very unique addition: Shinra, a boy who possesses the unique power to run at the speed of a rocket, leaving behind the famous "devil''s footprints" (and destroying his shoes in the process). Can the Fire Force discover the source of this strange phenomenon and put a stop to it? Or will the city burn to ashes first?', '{"Action","Drama","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","religion","shounen","firefighters","conspiracy","meta","male-protagonist","demons","urban-fantasy","military","primarily-adult-cast","primarily-male-cast"}', NULL, '305', '34', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 66362, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx86310-OraykJ8bRNTr.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86310-VbFYmmEc2tve.jpg', '#e49328', 86310, '91037', '{"Atsushi Ookubo","Kei Urana","Shusaku Namikawa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86310-VbFYmmEc2tve.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VlKMTCJRKZ0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VlKMTCJRKZ0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shinra Kusakabe", "native": "日下部森羅", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n120462-oSWdz2MhkbDE.png"}, {"name": "Akitaru Oubi", "native": "秋樽桜備", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130712-N38fiCh2y0CX.png"}, {"name": "Maki Oze", "native": "尾瀬茉希", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130713-TgLx8rgtGpXV.png"}, {"name": "Takehisa Hinawa", "native": "武久火縄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n130714-pLzE3rXtP1C4.png"}, {"name": "Arthur Boyle", "native": "アーサー・ボイル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n130715-IYNBAHBQa14y.png"}, {"name": "Iris", "native": "アイリス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n130716-5564jUgQxK9a.png"}, {"name": "Tamaki Kotatsu", "native": "環古達", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130751-J8rhd4d3TxF4.png"}, {"name": "Princess Hibana", "native": "プリンセス火華", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130783-10kVdsVrwpuO.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86310'),
('MANGA', 'Blood on the Tracks', 'Chi no Wadachi', '血の轍', 'Ordinary middle school student Seiichi Osabe receives love and care from his mother Seiko. Until one summer an incident changes the family dynamic forever. This is a story of a mother’s love that has gone too far….', '{"Drama","Horror","Psychological"}', '{"seinen","family-life","denpa","coming-of-age","psychosexual","male-protagonist","heterosexual","bullying","philosophy"}', NULL, '153', '17', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 66239, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx98397-5b3kSYyw7ykd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98397-7LpOrR1siadf.jpg', '#e45d50', 98397, '104271', '{"Shuuzou Oshimi","Daniel Komen","Verónica Calafell"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98397-7LpOrR1siadf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0_dSXFL7sDk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_dSXFL7sDk"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Seiichi Osabe", "native": "長部静一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135220-EcBIh1DXFxSs.png"}, {"name": "Seiko Osabe", "native": "長部静子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135222-5F2iZFBoWmHo.png"}, {"name": "Yuko Fukiishi", "native": "吹石由衣子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135221-zqIyE04E8kDM.jpg"}, {"name": "Shigeru no Haha", "native": "シゲルの母", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199806-c5vibOOUnI9U.png"}, {"name": "Ichiro Osabe", "native": "長部 一郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199807-IVm3MaoTWqn8.png"}, {"name": "Shigeru", "native": "シゲル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199808-SZA8fPbFCSmN.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98397'),
('MANGA', 'Call of the Night', 'Yofukashi no Uta', 'よふかしのうた', 'One sleepless night, Ko slips out to walk the streets. Life after dark is a revelation! When flirtatious Nazuna invites Ko to spend the night at her place in an abandoned building, he’s stoked! But then he awakens to kisses on his neck with a little too much bite to them... Is it just the delicious taste of his blood that makes her meet him night after night for late-night adventures, conversation and...naps? Or something else? Then, when a cute girl from Ko’s past shows up and competes for his attention, his budding relationship with the undead is put to the test!

- Seventh place of Tsugimanga 2020 Award in the Manga Category and first place of Daruma 2023 Award (France) in the new manga category (released in 2022 in France).

- Includes three extra chapters.', '{"Comedy","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","urban-fantasy","monster-girl","male-protagonist","shounen","coming-of-age","interspecies","female-protagonist","surreal-comedy","primarily-teen-cast","heterosexual","hikikomori"}', NULL, '203', '20', NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 66168, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx111233-bQQV6KWMBXz4.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/111233-U7rco1cixgQB.jpg', '#5dd6d6', 111233, '121480', '{"Kotoyama","Xavière Daumarie","Annaliese Christman"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/111233-U7rco1cixgQB.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eYCes9pACaY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eYCes9pACaY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nazuna Nanakusa", "native": "七草ナズナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168774-zoB9InjmXYq2.png"}, {"name": "Kou Yamori", "native": "夜守コウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168866-zf5bb7rmZpxX.png"}, {"name": "Akira Asai", "native": "朝井アキラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175663-JGx6M5mT9OiT.png"}, {"name": "Kiyosumi Shirakawa", "native": "白河清澄", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175656-R8RvecOSWBXE.png"}, {"name": "Niko Hirata", "native": "平田ニコ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175657-ZtPcifxlep0G.png"}, {"name": "Seri Kikyou", "native": "桔梗セリ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175658-orkKzYl8kMtW.png"}, {"name": "Anko Uguisu", "native": "鶯餡子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175659-1W8HJJzAZ1dI.png"}, {"name": "Akihito Akiyama", "native": "秋山昭人", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175660-JnKkxnC7o9fq.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '111233'),
('MANGA', 'BLAME!', 'BLAME!', 'BLAME!', 'In a future version of Earth, there is a city grown so chaotically massive that its inhabitants no longer recall what “land” is. Within this megastructure the silent, stoic Killy is on a mission to find the Net Terminal Gene—a genetic mutation that once allowed humans to access the cybernetic NetSphere. Armed with a powerful Graviton Beam Emitter, Killy fends off waves of attacks from fellow humans, cyborgs and silicon-based lifeforms. Along the way, he encounters a highly-skilled scientist whose body has deteriorated from a lengthy imprisonment who promises to help Killy find the Net Terminal Gene, once she settles a score for herself…', '{"Action","Drama","Horror","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"seinen","cyborg","post-apocalyptic","cyberpunk","robots","survival","travel","dystopian","body-horror","guns","cosmic-horror","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '66', '10', NULL, '1997', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 66080, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30149-YetcNrfacNVj.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30149-QnYfKC0ZWXmN.jpg', '#d6a178', 30149, '149', '{"Tsutomu Nihei","Marc Bernabé","Paweł Dybała"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30149-QnYfKC0ZWXmN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Killy", "native": "キリー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3762-hh1LPjA5Tswg.png"}, {"name": "Cibo", "native": "シボ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3763-HGLzLifxgoRH.png"}, {"name": "Sanakan", "native": "サナカン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n10882-Qw3Gt9UEf6Sk.png"}, {"name": "Dhomochevsky", "native": "ドモチェフスキー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b15438-gj4zgalY0tz7.png"}, {"name": "Pcell", "native": "プセル", "role": "S