('MANGA', 'Wotakoi: Love is Hard for Otaku', 'Wotaku ni Koi wa Muzukashii', 'ヲタクに恋は難しい', 'Narumi Momose has had it rough: every boyfriend she’s had dumped her once they found out she was an otaku, so she’s gone to great lengths to hide it. When a chance meeting at her new job with childhood friend, fellow otaku, and now coworker Hirotaka Nifuji almost gets her secret outed at work, she comes up with a plan to make sure he never speaks up. But he comes up with a counter-proposal: why doesn’t she just date him instead? In love, there are no save points.

- Includes 29 extra chapters.

- The English edition combines 2 Japanese volumes into one each (so e.g. the first two Japanese volumes are combined into 1 English volume).', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"otaku-culture","primarily-adult-cast","office-lady","video-games","work","episodic","heterosexual","josei","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","office","iyashikei"}', NULL, '115', '11', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 65178, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86717-S7z7uizfTfEu.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86717-96ElWeIFwPPj.jpg', '#f1935d', 86717, '89087', '{"Fujita","Aline Kukor","Joachim Roussel"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86717-96ElWeIFwPPj.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YzWVJB4ybrA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YzWVJB4ybrA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hirotaka Nifuji", "native": "二藤宏高", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122189-ai5CYyRv1CAH.png"}, {"name": "Narumi Momose", "native": "桃瀬成海", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122190-3VC3pxCguyu7.png"}, {"name": "Hanako Koyanagi", "native": "小柳花子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122191-sigwgpeam2U1.png"}, {"name": "Tarou Kabakura", "native": "樺倉太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122192-qnLmMg3YaGNd.png"}, {"name": "Naoya Nifuji", "native": "二藤尚哉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/122193-fRNWPtZ1iLdG.jpg"}, {"name": "Kou Sakuragi", "native": "桜城光", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124023-5EE8eXTKDGyg.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoshiki Ichijou", "native": "一条良樹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179958-WigSemwnUGdS.png"}, {"name": "Doumoto", "native": "堂元", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179959-Z0rIyNJyGzVl.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86717'),
('MANGA', 'Look Back', 'Look Back', 'ルックバック', 'Fujino is a fourth grader who draws a manga strip for the school newspaper. Her art makes her the star of the class, but one day she''s told that Kyomoto, a student who refuses to come to school, would also like to submit a manga for the paper...', '{"Drama","Slice of Life"}', '{"drawing","female-protagonist","primarily-female-cast","hikikomori","coming-of-age","shounen","work","meta","school","philosophy"}', NULL, '1', '1', NULL, '2021', NULL, 'ONE_SHOT', 'FINISHED', 64869, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx136807-KNfQQTRD4HUK.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/136807-5i0zxn7OvOim.jpg', '#f1f1c9', 136807, '138673', '{"Tatsuki Fujimoto","Hanachika Toyama","Reizou Aisu "}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/136807-5i0zxn7OvOim.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Rs9s2bxJXF8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rs9s2bxJXF8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ayumu Fujino", "native": "藤野歩", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286677-AXLCzHTcBGYr.jpg"}, {"name": "Kyomoto", "native": "京本", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286932-6Syfi8YMh3KE.jpg"}, {"name": "Otoko", "native": "男", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b349101-ufhPykHrRkH9.png"}, {"name": "Tannin", "native": "担任", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b349099-Zw5DFLKTK5di.png"}, {"name": "Tomodachi no Haha", "native": "友達の母", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b349127-o2dDIvc19tuZ.png"}, {"name": "Obaa-chan", "native": "おばあちゃん", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b349129-JnqHprLV7uKu.png"}, {"name": "4-Koma no Dansei", "native": "4コマの男性", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b349132-LRCDri91MyR9.png"}, {"name": "4-Koma no Josei", "native": "4コマの女性", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b349133-D5xjCBTAu9VB.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '136807'),
('MANGA', 'Yotsuba&!', 'Yotsuba to!', 'よつばと！', 'Hello! This is Koiwai Yotsuba, Yotsuba Koiwai...um, YOTSUBA! Yotsuba moved with Daddy to a new house from our old house waaaaaaay over there! And moving''s fun ''cos people wave! (Ohhhh!!) And Yotsuba met these nice people next door and made friends to play with (one of ''em acted like one of those bad strangers Daddy told Yotsuba not to go with, but it was okay in the end). I hope we get to play a lot. And eat ice cream! And-and-and...oh yeah! You should come play with Yotsuba too!

- Includes an interlude.

- Won the Excellence Award for Manga at the Japan Media Arts Festival in 2006 and the Grand Prize of the 20th Osamu Tezuka Cultural Prize in 2016.

- Was nominated for the Manga Taishō award in 2008 and for the 12th and 20th Osamu Tezuka Cultural Prize in 2008 and 2016.

- Was nominated for the Eisner Award in the "Best Publication for Kids" category.', '{"Comedy","Slice of Life"}', '{"family-life","iyashikei","episodic","parenthood","female-protagonist","cute-girls-doing-cute-things","slapstick","shounen","outdoor-activities","rural","adoption"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2003', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 64190, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30104-sUVzNlTWZ5cu.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30104-CDra9ye7UPGI.jpg', '#e4a135', 30104, '104', '{"Kiyohiko Azuma","Stephen Paul","Amy Forsyth"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30104-CDra9ye7UPGI.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yotsuba Koiwai", "native": "小岩井四葉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3568-5mfNplO06SPY.png"}, {"name": "Yousuke Koiwai", "native": "小岩井葉介", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3577-gvuDyWJRv5mS.png"}, {"name": "Takashi Takeda", "native": "竹田隆", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n3578-y4R4s1t21D7G.png"}, {"name": "Fuuka Ayase", "native": "綾瀬風香", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n7742-qA8eLhbKWjRt.png"}, {"name": "Ena Ayase", "native": "綾瀬恵那", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7757-51LGUgtARUrN.png"}, {"name": "Asagi Ayase", "native": "綾瀬あさぎ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n9164-13YvBT8Y5DLM.png"}, {"name": "Yasuda", "native": "安田", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/3609.jpg"}, {"name": "Danbo", "native": "ダンボー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/13407.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30104'),
('MANGA', 'Ajin: Demi-Human', 'Ajin', '亜人', 'High school student Kei Nagai is struck dead in a grisly traffic accident, but immediately revives to learn that he may not be like every other human. Instead, he may be a mysterious almost immortal being granted not only the powers of rejuvination but the abilities to see super-natural beings. Scared, he runs away, and is aided in his escape from society by his friend. Unfortunately for Kei, the manhunt is on and he will soon be caught within a conflict between mankind and others like him as they prepare to fight a new war based on terror.

- Includes 13 extra chapters.

- Nominated for the 7th annual Manga Taishou Award.

- Nominated for the Readers Award in the 18th Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize.

- Nominated for the 38th Annual Kodansha Manga Awards in the Seinen category.

- Nominated for the 40th Kodansha Manga Awards in 2016 in the General category.', '{"Action","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"fugitive","urban-fantasy","seinen","super-power","suicide","terrorism","crime","gore","male-protagonist","conspiracy","anti-hero","guns"}', NULL, '99', '17', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 63874, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b79865-rwKmISrhJJyP.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/79865-000LDA9RyB1n.jpg', '#1a5d6b', 79865, '49865', '{"Gamon Sakurai","Tsuina Miura","Ko Ransom"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/79865-000LDA9RyB1n.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Satou", "native": "佐藤", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89797-7FYeQEmgLdcj.png"}, {"name": "Izumi Shimomura", "native": "下村泉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120725-6C5KiCrK01eZ.png"}, {"name": "Kei Nagai", "native": "永井圭", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120726-lQIFUPMKBLb7.png"}, {"name": "Kou Nakano", "native": "中野攻", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120728-h7hsmYWBdnV4.png"}, {"name": "Yuu Tosaki", "native": "戸崎優", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122294-m0z7G4egVPaa.png"}, {"name": "Kouji Tanaka", "native": "田中功次", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122331-WOuECv4H1jb8.png"}, {"name": "Ritsu Nagai", "native": "永井 律", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/120650-42oCo4dO55Bg.jpg"}, {"name": "Hirasawa", "native": "平沢", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/120651-RNG9x5XvbO0H.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '79865'),
('MANGA', 'Noragami: Stray God', 'Noragami', 'ノラガミ', 'Yato is a homeless god. He doesn’t even have a shrine, not to mention worshippers! So to achieve his ambitious goals, he’s set up a service to help those in need (for a small fee), hoping he’ll eventually raise enough money to build himself the lavish temple of his dreams. Of course, he can’t afford to be picky, so Yato accepts all kinds of jobs, from finding lost kittens to helping a student overcome bullies at school.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"gods","male-protagonist","youkai","mythology","exorcism","female-protagonist","urban-fantasy","shounen","ghost","swordplay","heterosexual","religion"}', NULL, '109', '27', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 62818, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx54692-3vWUzvrCyArN.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/54692-uPhOYKvQK6yp.jpg', '#f1d6ae', 54692, '24692', '{"Adachitoka","Alethea Nibley","Athena Nibley"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/54692-uPhOYKvQK6yp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yato", "native": "夜ト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84677-PFmohzIXD1ud.png"}, {"name": "Hiyori Iki", "native": "壱岐ひより", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84679-GdMxvYy36M9H.png"}, {"name": "Yukine", "native": "雪音", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84681-vFMPNxeDkoqt.png"}, {"name": "Toto-sama", "native": "父様", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b261716-ToRWFlmAlmuJ.png"}, {"name": "Bishamon", "native": "毘沙門", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88239-aiUFUPNjmAh7.jpg"}, {"name": "Kazuma", "native": "兆麻", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88240-Q1aOkqfeFQpV.png"}, {"name": "Kofuku Ebisu", "native": "エビス 小福", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88241-3NQSKNgaQRNC.png"}, {"name": "Tenjin", "native": "天神", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88689-9OTDNG9R1zjC.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '54692'),
('MANGA', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: JoJolion', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: JoJolion', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 ジョジョリオン', 'This part will take place in Morioh-Cho (the same town in Part 4: Diamond is Unbreakable), but in the alternative universe in which Steel Ball Run takes place.

Following the Great East Japan earthquake, Morioh has been stricken by vast earthen protrusions known by the locals as Wall Eyes. Despite investigation, professional estimations are left empty. Meanwhile, the young girl Yasuho Hirose discovers a man buried within the ground, he possesses a distinctive star-shaped birthmark together with deeply penetrating bite marks. The man, who has contracted a staple case of amnesia is taken in by a local family and given the name Jousuke Higashikata, however mysterious events cannot stop from piling one upon the other and soon that enigma known as stands emerges to complement the great cloud of confusion.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"coming-of-age","super-power","seinen","amnesia","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy","family-life","agriculture","body-horror","cultivation"}', NULL, '110', '27', NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 62635, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx55515-HhCsfAsd7VK1.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/55515-J5JG2JLZqHU1.jpg', '#e4c943', 55515, '25515', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Satoshi Yamauchi"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/55515-J5JG2JLZqHU1.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hkW8l5A3nh4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hkW8l5A3nh4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jousuke Higashikata", "native": "東方定助", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43778-A9Ixc5ZeCsD6.png"}, {"name": "Joubin Higashikata", "native": "東方常敏", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b62653-DDwsPpfxTU2c.png"}, {"name": "Yasuho Hirose", "native": "廣瀬康穂", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b42779-0B8YRF1UTvZd.png"}, {"name": "Tsurugi Higashikata", "native": "東方つるぎ", "role": 