('MANGA', 'Made in Abyss', 'Made in Abyss', 'メイドインアビス', 'In an age when the corners of the world have been scoured for their secrets, only one place remains unexplored–a massive cave system known as the Abyss. Those who traverse its endless pits and labyrinth-like tunnels are known as Cave Raiders. A young orphan named Riko dreams of following in her mother’s footsteps as a Cave Raider, and when she meets a strange robot when exploring the Abyss, she’s one step closer to achieving her goal!

- Includes the 5-chapter "How Are You? Somewhere" side story.

- Nominated for the 11th Manga Taishou Awards (2018).', '{"Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Sci-Fi"}', '{"survival","primarily-child-cast","travel","lost-civilization","female-protagonist","body-horror","chibi","wilderness","amnesia","gore","seinen","male-protagonist"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 58158, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86551-0EzmsMZiPSu9.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86551-oHju7E1ze0Ob.jpg', '#e4a15d', 86551, '91941', '{"Akihito Tsukushi","Beni Axia Conrad","James Gaubatz"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86551-oHju7E1ze0Ob.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Riko", "native": "リコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122443-Md7TtolADEJh.png"}, {"name": "Reg", "native": "レグ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122444-9rGUpcjwygHD.png"}, {"name": "Nanachi", "native": "ナナチ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122445-5uDu8wMy8Jxi.png"}, {"name": "Prushka", "native": "プルシュカ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122466-RnolgKgexYDl.png"}, {"name": "Faputa", "native": "ファプタ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b160733-86kSKUGyAczO.jpg"}, {"name": "Bondrewd", "native": "ボンドルド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122463-p4o7qOTJ2Lba.jpg"}, {"name": "Ouzen", "native": "オーゼン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122464-xnYajKbuEa29.jpg"}, {"name": "Lyza", "native": "ライザ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122465-YHQVVPnVZZX1.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86551'),
('MANGA', 'Pandora Hearts', 'Pandora Hearts', 'パンドラハーツ', 'The air of celebration surrounding fifteen-year-old Oz Vessalius’s coming-of-age ceremony quickly turns to horror when he is condemned for a sin about which he knows nothing. He is thrown into an eternal, inescapable prison known as the Abyss from which there is no escape. There, he meets a young girl named Alice, who is not what she seems. Now that the relentless cogs of fate have begun to turn, do they lead only to crushing despair for Oz, or is there some shred of hope for him to grasp on to?', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"}', '{"philosophy","amnesia","ensemble-cast","found-family","fairy-tale","male-protagonist","butler","denpa","magic"}', NULL, '107', '24', NULL, '2006', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 57694, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx33031-LzNWgqS69qAj.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/3031-pruYv7prmiCP.png', NULL, 33031, '3031', '{"Jun Mochizuki","Midori Endou","Tomo Kimura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/3031-pruYv7prmiCP.png", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Oz Vessalius", "native": "オズ・ベザリウス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13835-1H8HQb47woJH.png"}, {"name": "Alice", "native": "アリス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13836-a7CzqtzhMLSS.jpg"}, {"name": "Xerxes Break", "native": "ザークシーズ・ブレイク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14020-r0qXmjKEWv7L.png"}, {"name": "Sharon Rainsworth", "native": "シャロン・レインズワース", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n14021-JVeMfEbulePe.jpg"}, {"name": "Gilbert Nightray", "native": "ギルバート・ナイトレイ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n16211-6c8Kyg9QWfGb.jpg"}, {"name": "Vincent Nightray", "native": "ヴィンセント・ナイトレイ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b17888-QdKtNNZ1B5HU.png"}, {"name": "Charlotte Baskerville", "native": "シャルロット・バスカヴィル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19110-JIHxjRVijV1S.png"}, {"name": "Jack Vessalius", "native": "ジャック・ベザリウス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19370-hn6m8CnxPhnA.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '33031'),
('MANGA', 'Nisekoi: False Love', 'Nisekoi', 'ニセコイ', 'As a child, Raku Ichijou made a secret promise with his childhood sweetheart, keeping a pendant as a memento while his love took the key. He dreams of one day meeting his past love, but years later, reality smashes his hopes when Chitoge Kirisaki accidentally knees him in the face...

Though Raku’s a normal high schooler, his family heads the notorious yakuza gang the Shuei-Gumi faction! And he’s dragged into family affairs when he’s forced into a relationship with Chitoge, the daughter of a rival gang’s boss!

Despite their constant spats, the two somehow fool everyone with their false relationship. Raku then discovers that Chitoge has a mysterious key from her past, which she can’t remember... Plus, two other girls appear with keys as well—Kosaki Onodera and Marika Tachibana!

Caught in the midst of this love maelstrom, even more complications arise for Raku when his class decides on Romeo and Juliet as the class’s play for the school festival. Can the two false lovebirds pull off the impossible and make the play a success?', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"love-triangle","female-harem","primarily-female-cast","heterosexual","fake-relationship","male-protagonist","shounen","slapstick","primarily-teen-cast","tsundere","school","coming-of-age"}', NULL, '240', '25', NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 56847, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx61499-aXInaLRa6xv5.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31499-B5vpoR3et5Rw.jpg', '#e49350', 61499, '31499', '{"Naoshi Komi","Tomohiro Hasegawa","Ippei Gotou"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31499-B5vpoR3et5Rw.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YYuHz6_PRK8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYuHz6_PRK8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chitoge Kirisaki", "native": "桐崎千棘", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b48391-SuJot8cVKjHj.png"}, {"name": "Raku Ichijou", "native": "一条楽", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b48393-XwciXYkyzTMY.png"}, {"name": "Kosaki Onodera", "native": "小野寺小咲 ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b52723-YbLFn4JmoAVQ.png"}, {"name": "Marika Tachibana", "native": "橘万里花", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66597-uvxnKDUNlSJZ.png"}, {"name": "Ruri Miyamoto", "native": "宮本るり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b58281-8xcROGltvLfg.png"}, {"name": "Seishirou Tsugumi", "native": "鶫 誠士郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b58885-w07G5SNbFBBW.png"}, {"name": "Shuu Maiko", "native": "舞子集", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b63489-sWngkrUrniHK.png"}, {"name": "Claude Ringheart", "native": "クロード", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b82933-lWeGWoKCqRjT.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '61499'),
('MANGA', 'Delicious in Dungeon', 'Dungeon Meshi', 'ダンジョン飯', 'When young adventurer Laios and his company are attacked and soundly thrashed by a dragon deep in a dungeon, the party loses all its money and provisions...and a member! They''re eager to go back and save her, but there is just one problem: If they set out with no food or coin to speak of, they''re sure to starve on the way! But Laios comes up with a brilliant idea: "Let''s eat the monsters!" Slimes, basilisks, and even dragons...none are safe from the appetites of these dungeon-crawling gourmands!

- Nominated in the 9th, 10th, 11th, and 12th Manga Taishou Award in 2016-2019.

- Ranked first in the 2016 Kono Manga ga Sugoi! (Male Readers Division).

- Includes 14 extra chapters.', '{"Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"food","dungeon","environmental","magic","ensemble-cast","medieval","primarily-adult-cast","seinen","philosophy","elf","male-protagonist","dragons"}', NULL, '111', '14', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 56171, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86082-MXizJxzbijdd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86082-L0gxhGsRsDDE.jpg', '#f1c993', 86082, '85781', '{"Ryouko Kui","Marc Bernabé","Taylor Engel"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86082-L0gxhGsRsDDE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mLfJ7B20A2Q/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mLfJ7B20A2Q"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Laios Thorden", "native": "ライオス・トーデン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126818-vWeIwxSERSHd.png"}, {"name": "Marcille Donato", "native": "マルシル・ドナトー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127292-MAWgxbS0Cbrs.png"}, {"name": "Senshi", "native": "センシ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127689-SC65fBVrUx8v.png"}, {"name": "Izutsumi", "native": "イヅツミ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130507-iB88aMlQPuMz.png"}, {"name": "Chilchuck Tims", "native": "チルチャック・ティムズ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130509-NFZ7xFt1kLqd.png"}, {"name": "Toshirou Nakamoto", "native": "半本俊朗", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130506-S5gp6sZyi8q9.png"}, {"name": "Falin Thorden", "native": "ファリン・トーデン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130508-ZaP30snJccry.png"}, {"name": "Kabru", "native": "カブルー", "role": "SUPPORT