('MANGA', 'Blue Box', 'Ao no Hako', 'アオのハコ', 'Taiki Inomata is on the boys'' badminton team at sports powerhouse Eimei Junior and Senior High. He''s in love with basketball player Chinatsu Kano, the older girl he trains alongside every morning in the gym. One Spring day, their relationship takes a sharp turn ... And thus begins this brand-new series of love, sports and youth!', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life","Sports"}', '{"school-club","school","athletics","primarily-teen-cast","heterosexual","male-protagonist","coming-of-age","badminton","shounen","female-protagonist","basketball","cohabitation"}', NULL, '250', '28', NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 55804, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx132182-maXh2QzYPrqR.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/132182-1jdVSMx8ShXd.jpg', '#e47843', 132182, '135545', '{"Kouji Miura","Aki Hinohara","Yui Okino"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/132182-1jdVSMx8ShXd.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yVitogAVgb0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yVitogAVgb0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chinatsu Kano", "native": "鹿野千夏", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b191241-FaDEXRL1CgJr.png"}, {"name": "Taiki Inomata", "native": "猪股大喜", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b191242-uQJUPMyknaTb.png"}, {"name": "Hina Chouno", "native": "蝶野雛", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b218648-kXxXy8lPkeGV.png"}, {"name": "Kyou Kasahara", "native": "笠原匡", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b218647-A2ngPlh7Yucn.png"}, {"name": "Ayame Moriya", "native": "守屋菖蒲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b288215-fk7KsmgcGG53.png"}, {"name": "Kengo Haryuu", "native": "針生健吾", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b225314-LD3QqS6uAd1o.png"}, {"name": "Karen Moriya", "native": "守屋花恋", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b288217-mQ8wZIn5B3Dj.png"}, {"name": "Shuuji Yusa", "native": "遊佐柊仁", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b288213-0wcgDwOry4F8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '132182'),
('MANGA', 'ReLIFE', 'ReLife', 'リライフ', 'When the responsibilities of being an adult and the ugly side of corporate bullying betrays one''s childhood dreams, many would wish to return to their innocent childhood to relive their life and make the right decisions. Dumbfounded by the offer presented to him, 27-year-old Arata Kaizaki hopes to turn his life around through a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

Returning home from his part-time job, Arata is persuaded by Ryou Yoake, an employee of ReLife Research Institute, into participating in an experiment which will help him overcome his difficulties and re-enter corporate life. As part of the ReLife experiment, Arata''s physique is reverted to that of a 17-year-old, and all he must do is relive his high school life for one year. Waiting for him at the end of the experiment is a job offer that he has been struggling to get ever since he left his first company.

With few other options, he decides to go along with this plan. However, with adult-like tendencies and many years since his last formal education, Arata steps into an unexpectedly challenging territory—a normal day of high school.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"age-regression","school","full-color","rehabilitation","ensemble-cast","coming-of-age","kuudere","male-protagonist","seinen","work","heterosexual"}', NULL, '238', '15', NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 55439, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx85849-TYAa7nhwSvbx.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85849-nMDvs94oNC3X.jpg', '#1aaed6', 85849, '78523', '{"Sou Yayoi","Sakura Ilgert"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85849-nMDvs94oNC3X.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3eFySl9W3ec/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eFySl9W3ec"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Arata Kaizaki", "native": "海崎新太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89425-vLPRybM1gNa7.png"}, {"name": "Chizuru Hishiro", "native": "日代千鶴", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89426-9VS3dWDKDs4v.jpg"}, {"name": "Ryou Yoake", "native": "夜明了", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89427-1maEZa0szSC9.jpg"}, {"name": "An Onoya", "native": "小野屋杏", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89428-8UUfkFTy5jGR.png"}, {"name": "Rena Kariu", "native": "狩生玲奈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89632-vwI8zFb4zB9m.jpg"}, {"name": "Kazuomi Ooga", "native": "大神和臣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89633-3HzqMb9xJe8V.jpg"}, {"name": "Honoka Tamarai", "native": "玉来ほのか", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89838-gjgmpDHILDLx.png"}, {"name": "Akira Inukai", "native": "犬飼暁", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89839-v50d35XrK5LF.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85849'),
('MANGA', 'The Seven Deadly Sins', 'Nanatsu no Taizai', '七つの大罪', 'When they were accused of trying to overthrow the monarchy, the feared warriors the Seven Deadly Sins were sent into exile. Princess Elizabeth discovers the truth the Sins were framed by the king''s guard, the Holy Knights too late to prevent them from assassinating her father and seizing the throne! Now the princess is on the run, seeking the Sins to help her reclaim the kingdom. But the first Sin she meets, Meliodas, is a little innkeeper with a talking pig. He doesn''t even have a real sword! Have the legends of the Sins'' strength been exaggerated...?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"shounen","ensemble-cast","demons","super-power","magic","gods","fairy","spearplay","medieval","fairy-tale","war","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '367', '41', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 55300, '69', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx74485-mFbj0sQEcBur.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/74485-AIeNftbhWu1H.jpg', '#f16b43', 74485, '44485', '{"Nakaba Suzuki","Christine Dashiell","Edward Kondo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/74485-AIeNftbhWu1H.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iQyn_60YYI0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iQyn_60YYI0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Meliodas", "native": "メリオダス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b72921-XDHNd1wflN6P.png"}, {"name": "Elizabeth Liones", "native": "エリザベス・リオネス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b72923-Hidpb955mwMW.png"}, {"name": "Diane", "native": "ディアンヌ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b74653-XpMcsLVZBnkZ.jpg"}, {"name": "Ban", "native": "バン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b77605-NrjhQwZwgJ3l.png"}, {"name": "King", "native": "キング", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83801-52RnDXQDZ1I7.png"}, {"name": "Hawk", "native": "ホーク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n86683-ZXPoLZnKqNtx.png"}, {"name": "Gowther", "native": "ゴウセル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88823-Oppzl2h6OhO8.png"}, {"name": "Merlin", "native": "マーリン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89180-rN6OVPki8h3V.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '74485'),
('MANGA', 'Assassination Classroom', 'Ansatsu Kyoushitsu', '暗殺教室', 'Meet the would-be assassins of class 3-E: Sugino, who let his grades slip and got kicked off the baseball team. Karma, who’s doing well in his classes but keeps getting suspended for fighting. And Okuda, who lacks both academic and social skills, yet excels at one subject: chemistry. Who has the best chance of winning that reward? Will the deed be accomplished through pity, brute force or poison...? And what chance does their teacher have of repairing his students’ tattered self-esteem?', '{"Action","Comedy","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"teacher","assassins","school","primarily-child-cast","shounen","ensemble-cast","satire","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '188', '21', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 54915, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx69883-zDt4DUXkQS5N.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/69883-BikwnPOqa0uL.jpg', '#f1ae43', 69883, '39883', '{"Yuusei Matsui","Marc Bernabé","Eric Montesinos"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/69883-BikwnPOqa0uL.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tfT6JIroFL4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tfT6JIroFL4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Koro-sensei", "native": "殺せんせー ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65643-jimrOw0RGtoB.png"}, {"name": "Nagisa Shiota", "native": "潮田渚", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65645-nWH4mBMW5lYw.png"}, {"name": "Karma Akabane", "native": "赤羽業", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b71933-HQ1TSjlrJ8Hv.jpg"}, {"name": "Tadaomi Karasuma", "native": "烏間惟臣", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/73881-Ukr6cBzK8dsi.png"}, {"name": "Irina Jelavic", "native": "イリーナ・イェラビッチ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b73883-ajlj28kkjxlb.jpg"}, {"name": "Ritsu", "native": "律", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/74832-88SvstxVuDGn.png"}, {"name": "Kaede Kayano", "native": "茅野カエデ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/85291-io7X60xBW1LK.jpg"}, {"name": "Itona Horibe", "native": "堀部イトナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b85293-VJJa4wciJTcl.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '69883'),
('MANGA', 'Solanin', 'Solanin', 'ソラニン', 'College graduates struggle to cope with the real world. Music offers refuge in this modern manga with an American attitude.
Meiko Inoue is a recent college grad working as an office lady in a job she hates. Her boyfriend Naruo is permanently crashing at her apartment because his job as a freelance illustrator doesn''t pay enough for rent. And her parents in the country keep sending her boxes of veggies that just rot in her fridge. Straddling the line between her years as a student and the rest of her life, Meiko struggles with the feeling that she''s just not cut out to be a part of the real world.

- Nominated for the Eisner Award for Best U.S. Edition of International Material - Japan and the Harvey Award for Best American Edition of Foreign Material.

- Includes one extra chapter and one-shot "Haru yo Koi (Awaiting Spring)" first included in the October 2017 new Japanese edition.', '{"Drama","Music","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","band","seinen","primarily-adult-cast","heterosexual","found-family","female-protagonist","family-life","urban","rock-music","college"}', NULL, '30', '2', NULL, '2005', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 54724, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx33731-AnTmPqTS2W8C.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33731-sSFulGxVNQeP.jpg', '#e4d635', 33731, '3731', '{"Inio Asano","Thibaud Desbief","Minori Imai"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33731-sSFulGxVNQeP.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Meiko Inoue", "native": "井上芽衣子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18350-sPkUTf5b4wER.jpg"}, {"name": "Naruo Taneda", "native": "種田成男", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18351-LxBiKvBLs8qa.jpg"}, {"name": "Ai Kotani", "native": "小谷 アイ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/18352.jpg"}, {"name": "Katou Kenichi", "native": "加藤 賢一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/18353.jpg"}, {"name": "Jirou Yamada", "native": "山田 二郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18354-LKpvzC5YILQu.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '33731'),
('MANGA', 'Yona of the Dawn', 'Akatsuki no Yona', '暁のヨナ', 'A red-haired princess loses her family and her kingdom—now she must rise and fight for her throne!

Princess Yona lives an ideal life as the only princess of her kingdom. Doted on by her father, the king, and protected by her faithful guard Hak, she cherishes the time spent with the man she loves, Su-won. But everything changes on her 16th birthday when tragedy strikes her family!

Yona reels from the shock of witnessing a loved one''s murder and having to fight for her life. With Hak''s help, she flees the palace and struggles to survive while evading her enemy''s forces. But where will this displaced princess go when all the paths before her are uncertain?', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","found-family","travel","shoujo","historical","kingdom-management","politics","fugitive","mythology","royal-affairs","war","heterosexual"}', NULL, '295', '48', NULL, '2009', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 54511, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx51525-wZ1AjkbXrKns.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/51525-WMZWU0tOPxKR.jpg', '#f18643', 51525, '21525', '{"Mizuho Kusanagi","Lys Blakeslee","JN Productions"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/51525-WMZWU0tOPxKR.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_qaJpECrEYI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_qaJpECrEYI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yona", "native": "ヨナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43814-M0nlr2AP7vY0.png"}, {"name": "Hak Son", "native": "ハク", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43815-WRbln8jA1mPk.jpg"}, {"name": "Yun", "native": "ユン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67745-0oHMcSVNp7U5.jpg"}, {"name": "Ki-Ja", "native": "キジャ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67747-Epj21EmBa34y.jpg"}, {"name": "Shin-Ah", "native": "シンア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67749-56bkWIb9ZpWy.jpg"}, {"name": "Jae-Ha", "native": "ジェハ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67751-wfoNe4W9UHTc.png"}, {"name": "Zeno", "native": "ゼノ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67753-QzWNHsalPyWu.jpg"}, {"name": "Soo-Won", "native": "スウォン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88670-XZCwY41qf0P1.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '51525'),
('MANGA', 'Dragon Ball', 'Dragon Ball', 'ドラゴンボール', 'Dragon Ball follows the adventures of Son Goku from his childhood through adulthood as he trains in martial arts and explores the world in search of the seven mystical orbs known as the Dragon Balls, which can summon a wish-granting dragon when gathered. Along his journey, Goku makes several friends and battles a wide variety of villains, many of whom also seek the Dragon Balls for their own desires. Along the way becoming the strongest warrior in the universe.

Part II of Dragon Ball is also known as "Dragon Ball Z" in North America.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"martial-arts","travel","shounen","super-power","male-protagonist","cultivation","aliens","coming-of-age","anachronism"}', NULL, '520', '42', NULL, '1984', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 54373, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30042-4SetGiEbGc9x.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30042-4aSSSOxCNWgE.jpg', '#fee40d', 30042, '42', '{"Akira Toriyama","Takashi Matsuyama","Fuyuto Takeda"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30042-4aSSSOxCNWgE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gokuu Son", "native": "孫悟空", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/246-wsRRr6z1kii8.png"}, {"name": "Bulma", "native": "ブルマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b678-2YCe13F0tFos.jpg"}, {"name": "Vegeta", "native": "ベジータ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b913-NIFkKazWM8VO.png"}, {"name": "Piccolo", "native": "ピッコロ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b914-KuS8AWjqBrqa.jpg"}, {"name": "Gohan Son", "native": "孫悟飯", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2093-kdFZhqcNSsqW.png"}, {"name": "Kuririn", "native": "クリリン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2159-qtEuMYyOUkwY.jpg"}, {"name": "Pu''ar", "native": "プーアル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b677-PTNZaPeuV1Dx.jpg"}, {"name": "Majin Boo", "native": "魔人ブウ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/1012.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30042'),
('MANGA', 'Pluto', 'PLUTO', 'PLUTO', 'In an ideal world where man and robots coexist, someone or something has destroyed the powerful Swiss robot Mont Blanc. Elsewhere a key figure in a robot rights group is murdered. The two incidents appear to be unrelated...except for one very conspicuous clue - the bodies of both victims have been fashioned into some sort of bizarre collage complete with makeshift horns placed by the victims'' heads. Interpol assigns robot detective Gesicht to this most strange and complex case - and he eventually discovers that he too, as one of the seven great robots of the world, is one of the targets.', '{"Drama","Mecha","Mystery","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"seinen","robots","artificial-intelligence","detective","police","politics","philosophy","foreign","real-robot","ensemble-cast","war","noir"}', NULL, '65', '8', NULL, '2003', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 53652, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30745-kueBpwriQkvZ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30745-vC3JZQjHPwhn.jpg', '#d6ae78', 30745, '745', '{"Naoki Urasawa","Takashi Nagasaki","Makoto Tezuka"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30745-vC3JZQjHPwhn.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gesicht", "native": "ゲジヒト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b9791-XcumTmi2IfRe.jpg"}, {"name": "Atom", "native": "アトム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18913-0CmKJTMJeNZ3.jpg"}, {"name": "Epsilon", "native": "エプシロン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14343-OPQO2909RH9a.jpg"}, {"name": "Uran", "native": "ウラン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16536-DnLVxozCWmkU.png"}, {"name": "Brau-1589", "native": "ブラウ1589", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b22226-QHgeQdIxEyLW.png"}, {"name": "Umatarou Tenma", "native": "天馬午太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b22925-4O1KJzegVTKU.png"}, {"name": "Dr. Roosevelt", "native": "Dr. ルーズベルト", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b23362-5EWPXeqKMDEM.png"}, {"name": "Ochanomizu Hakase", "native": "お茶の水博士", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b24144-cTQPHq64vzGC.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30745'),
('MANGA', 'The Guy She Was Interested In Wasn''t a Guy at All', 'Ki ni Natteru Hito ga Otoko ja Nakatta', '気になってる人が男じゃなかった', 'Fashionable and upbeat high schooler Aya falls head over heels for an employee at a local CD shop. He''s got an air of mystery about him, great style, and an impeccable music taste. Little does she know—this supposedly male employee is actually her female classmate Mitsuki! Mitsuki generally keeps to herself, but since her seat is right next to Aya''s, she can''t help but be extremely aware of the other''s crush. Revealing the truth is out of the question for Mitsuki—but perhaps getting closer to Aya wouldn''t be so bad...', '{"Music","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","yuri","lgbtq-themes","rock-music","tomboy","primarily-teen-cast","short-form-chapter","gyaru","primarily-female-cast","work","school","josei"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 52674, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx149544-466pXfETA8oP.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/149544-LYz4luvHDWxg.jpg', '#aee428', 149544, '155861', '{"Sumiko Arai","Ajani Oloye","Yuanyou Ye"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/149544-LYz4luvHDWxg.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Aya Oosawa", "native": "大沢綾", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282093-KSj41LnAwawO.jpg"}, {"name": "Mitsuki Koga", "native": "古賀美月", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282094-vAr5cHPwyCIY.jpg"}, {"name": "Megumu Narita", "native": "成田恵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b290483-EVqyEXBljmyi.jpg"}, {"name": "Joe", "native": "ジョー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305502-a81MGAca1Fm7.jpg"}, {"name": "Kanna", "native": "カンナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s