('MANGA', 'Real', 'Real', 'リアル', 'A motorcycle accident, bone cancer, a speeding truck crashing into a boy on a stolen bicycle--tragic life-changing events turn the worlds of three young men upside down. These three very different personalities have only one thing in common--their passion for basketball.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Sports"}', '{"coming-of-age","ensemble-cast","disability","male-protagonist","seinen","rehabilitation","basketball","primarily-male-cast","delinquents","athletics","fitness","philosophy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1999', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 50634, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30657-AzyyUOWMJ6fd.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30657-jK5aBm6e15lB.jpg', '#f16b28', 30657, '657', '{"Takehiko Inoue","Yuuichi Itakura","Yasuhisa Hara"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30657-jK5aBm6e15lB.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_D_iow5i2bk/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_D_iow5i2bk"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tomomi Nomiya", "native": "野宮朋美", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8732-W6z3WCk52BZv.png"}, {"name": "Kiyoharu Togawa", "native": "戸川清春", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12236-B3o8Lhd3sZMl.png"}, {"name": "Hisanobu Takahashi", "native": "高橋久信", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/17211.jpg"}, {"name": "Kumi Azumi", "native": "安積久美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/33473.jpg"}, {"name": "Katsuta Tora", "native": "勝田虎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/33506.jpg"}, {"name": "Yamauchi Hitoshi", "native": "山内仁史", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b33507-uGluUuNgx0qj.jpg"}, {"name": "Mitsuru Nagano", "native": "長野満", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/42180.jpg"}, {"name": "Natsumi Yamashita", "native": "山下夏美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b77091-9jZexcwz0Phk.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30657'),
('MANGA', 'Magi: The Labyrinth of Magic', 'Magi', 'マギ', 'Deep within the deserts lie the mysterious Dungeons, vast stores of riches there for the taking by anyone lucky enough to find them and brave enough to venture into the depths from where few have ever returned. Plucky young adventurer Aladdin means to find the Dungeons and their riches, but Aladdin may be just as mysterious as the treasures he seeks. Together with the djinn Ugo and his friend Alibaba, Aladdin sets out to find his fortune in the depths of the endless dunes…', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","foreign","conspiracy","war","politics","royal-affairs","class-struggle","male-protagonist","shounen","dungeon","slavery","economics"}', NULL, '369', '37', NULL, '2009', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 50353, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx44790-4Rzup5aNVcVC.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/44790-jtsLHoIHZaUY.jpg', '#5da1e4', 44790, '14790', '{"Shinobu Ootaka","Yoshifumi Ootera","Akira Sugito"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/44790-jtsLHoIHZaUY.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q8sGWJiWj4s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q8sGWJiWj4s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Aladdin", "native": "アラジン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b41949-LaoaHJ2tJxBw.png"}, {"name": "Alibaba Saluja", "native": "アリババ・サルージャ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b42501-BKURFIipvE1C.png"}, {"name": "Morgiana", "native": "モルジアナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b43121-o2KuUeEfh6AS.png"}, {"name": "Judar", "native": "ジュダル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b42502-suDfjEugIuVT.jpg"}, {"name": "Sinbad", "native": "シンドバッド",