('MANGA', 'Choujin X', 'Choujin X', '超人X', 'Best friends Tokio and Azuma do everything together, even if most of the time it feels like Tokio is just stumbling along in Azuma’s cooler, more talented footsteps. But when they’re attacked one night by a superhuman mutant called a choujin, Tokio finally has a chance to shine—by turning into a choujin himself!

Being a superpowered creature isn’t all it’s cracked up to be, though. Tokio has to hide his transformation from his family and dodge a truancy charge at school, all while dealing with the increasingly odd incidents happening around town!', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological"}', '{"urban-fantasy","henshin","super-power","body-horror","seinen","superhero","male-protagonist","gore","surreal-comedy","coming-of-age","female-protagonist","religion"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 50275, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx126693-hEqUWtBfUHyc.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/126693-MuGVrfQfbEx8.jpg', NULL, 126693, '131403', '{"Sui Ishida","Jan Cash","Edward Kondo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/126693-MuGVrfQfbEx8.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GOhJiQmRSlw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GOhJiQmRSlw"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tokio Kurohara", "native": "黒原トキオ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b224464-jgvtS1lbHEsB.jpg"}, {"name": "Azuma Higashi", "native": "東アズマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b224490-Qb9Obn3E8FMx.jpg"}, {"name": "Ely Otta", "native": "乙田エリイ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b242366-v7XiXk32BR2c.jpg"}, {"name": "Maiko Momoma", "native": "百萬マイコ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284978-sXv2Y58Njedv.png"}, {"name": "Simon Kagomura", "native": "鍵村シモン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b263736-VXW3XKFveyaB.png"}, {"name": "Johnny Takeyama", "native": "竹山ジョニーキヨシ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b224523-