('MANGA', 'BEASTARS', 'BEASTARS', 'BEASTARS', 'One night at Cherryton Academy, an herbivore student is brutally murdered. Among the members of the Drama Club, the herbivores’ suspicions naturally turn to their carnivore classmates… The prime suspect? Gray wolf Legoshi. But he wouldn’t hurt a fly. Or would he? Will dwarf rabbit Haru bring out the beast in him? Or are his feelings for her…something else?', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"anthropomorphism","animals","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","school","cannibalism","ensemble-cast","philosophy","urban","crime","psychosexual","politics"}', NULL, '196', '22', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 49099, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx98587-useiMvZ0nfya.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98587-4CInt0kI3hcN.jpg', '#e45d6b', 98587, '103701', '{"Paru Itagaki","Hikari Sumi","Tomo Kimura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98587-4CInt0kI3hcN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jJcRYJwRGd8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jJcRYJwRGd8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Legoshi", "native": "レゴシ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125168-cOydxRHEbAYb.png"}, {"name": "Haru", "native": "ハル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125169-zxyLpg1BOnU5.jpg"}, {"name": "Louis", "native": "ルイ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125170-TIHSOgfQbkbU.png"}, {"name": "Bill", "native": "ビル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n132945-G5NJQ9JMtF0X.jpg"}, {"name": "Juno", "native": "ジュノ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132946-H4bYx7gFT0Ki.png"}, {"name": "Pina", "native": "ピナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132947-RYIRivJeF6vR.png"}, {"name": "Gouhin", "native": "ゴウヒン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132948-HzBozI7pzdte.png"}, {"name": "Gosha", "native": "ゴーシャ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132981-RUz1yUyhNcI1.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98587'),
('MANGA', 'Akame ga KILL!', 'Akame ga Kill!', 'アカメが斬る！', 'Teenage country bumpkin Tatsumi dreams of earning enough money for his impoverished village by working in the Capital--but his short-lived plans go awry when he''s robbed by a buxom beauty upon arrival! Penniless, Tatsumi is taken in by the lovely Miss Aria, but just when his Capital dreams seem in reach yet again, Miss Aria''s mansion is besieged by Night Raid--a team of ruthless assassins who targets high-ranking members of the upper class! As Tatsumi is quick to learn, appearances can be deceiving in the Capital, and this team of assassins just might be...the good guys?!', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Horror"}', '{"assassins","shounen","war","swordplay","gore","anti-hero","male-protagonist","super-power","heterosexual","ensemble-cast","female-protagonist","kuudere"}', NULL, '80', '15', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 48459, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx55132-bhKk5JoXcvdA.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/55132-XY7cA2XRsJXk.jpg', NULL, 55132, '25132', '{"Takahiro","Tetsuya Tashiro","Edith  Belarra"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/55132-XY7cA2XRsJXk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Akame", "native": "アカメ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b63351-0WmsDENpiscp.png"}, {"name": "Tatsumi", "native": "タツミ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/64749-a2ZdRWW1D5TR.jpg"}, {"name": "Leone", "native": "レオーネ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65227-PWmfiEVJbCwQ.png"}, {"name": "Mine", "native": "マイン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b65229-hYOZtUlIpd5G.png"}, {"name": "Lubbock", "native": "ラバック", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/ani