('MANGA', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Part 1: Phantom Blood', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Phantom Blood', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 ファントムブラッド', 'Young Jonathan Joestar’s life is forever changed when he meets his new adopted brother, Dio. For some reason, Dio has a smoldering grudge against him and derives pleasure from seeing him suffer. But every man has his limits, as Dio finds out. This is the beginning of a long and hateful relationship!', '{"Action","Adventure","Supernatural"}', '{"shounen","primarily-male-cast","cultivation","super-power","historical","gore","male-protagonist","foreign"}', NULL, '44', '5', NULL, '1986', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 48296, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx31517-Y3pL6OTH74Iq.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31517-pZMJjv8mUgi7.jpg', '#50a1f1', 31517, '1517', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Ryosuke Kabashima","Evan Galloway"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31517-pZMJjv8mUgi7.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/avCD2oCxA2I/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avCD2oCxA2I"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Dio Brando", "native": "ディオ・ブランドー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4004-w0OtWuvjhftG.png"}, {"name": "Jonathan Joestar", "native": "ジョナサン・ジョースター", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8087-GTrObHQvujB5.png"}, {"name": "Will A. Zeppeli", "native": "ウィル・A・ツェペリ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/18062-FjIMwcBJra9L.jpg"}, {"name": "Robert E. O. Speedwagon", "native": "ロバート・E・O・スピードワゴン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n21938-7iTMOJ4i6ET8.png"}, {"name": "Erina Pendleton", "native": "エリナ・ペンドルトン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21937-mwAbJAgxE8yP.jpg"}, {"name": "George Joestar I", "native": "ジョージ・ジョースターI世", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n21956-Mv5FsZ4EnKzs.png"}, {"name": "Straits", "native": "ストレイツォ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21961-9JPMSyptHeWe.png"}, {"name": "Dire", "native": "ダイアー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n74057-7SVzc5bAOSdm.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '31517'),
('MANGA', 'The Eminence in Shadow', 'Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!', '陰の実力者になりたくて！', 'One big fat lie and a few twisted truths.

Even in his past life, Cid''s dream wasn''t to become a protagonist or a final boss. He''d rather lie low as a minor character until it''s prime time to reveal he''s a mastermind...or at least, do the next best thing-pretend to be one! And now that he''s been reborn into another world, he''s ready to set the perfect conditions to live out his dreams to the fullest. Armed with his overactive imagination, Cid jokingly recruits members to his organization and makes up a whole backstory about an evil cult that they need to take down. Well, as luck would have it, these imaginary adversaries turn out to be the real deal-and everyone knows the truth but him!', '{"Action","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"chuunibyou","male-protagonist","magic","cult","isekai","parody","anti-hero","shounen","female-harem","swordplay","elf"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 47819, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx106758-jtXpQYQqyNJv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106758-IWiib0G2AJdg.jpg', '#e45d35', 106758, '119022', '{"Anri Sakano","Daisuke Aizawa","Touzai"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106758-IWiib0G2AJdg.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QlgwORls2jQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QlgwORls2jQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Cid Kagenou", "native": "シド・カゲノー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136837-3WR22FYet8Hv.jpg"}, {"name": "Alpha", "native": "アルファ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162246-IbbxkhNJFDN5.png"}, {"name": "Beta", "native": "ベータ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162247-R6OrAuT1FwL4.png"}, {"name": "Gamma", "native": "ガンマ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162245-x86QMM6nOj75.png"}, {"name": "Delta", "native": "デルタ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162248-57Xgk6EmwKRQ.png"}, {"name": "Epsilon", "native": "イプシロン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162249-eJRpBIC5lAZX.png"}, {"name": "Claire Kagenou", "native": "クレア・カゲノー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168798-IrHBKh5xbRsr.png"}, {"name": "Alexia Midgar", "native": "アレクシア・ミドガル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168799-uAsWFrrfqxTN.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '106758'),
('MANGA', 'Akira', 'AKIRA', 'AKIRA', 'Welcome to Neo-Tokyo, built on the ashes of a Tokyo annihilated by a blast of unknown origin that triggered World War III. The lives of two streetwise teenage friends, Tetsuo and Kaneda, change forever when paranormal abilities begin to waken in Tetsuo, making him a target for a shadowy agency that will stop at nothing to prevent another catastrophe like the one that leveled Tokyo. At the core of the agency''s motivation is a raw, all-consuming fear of an unthinkable, monstrous power known only as Akira.', '{"Action","Horror","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"dystopian","cyberpunk","military","post-apocalyptic","seinen","super-power","male-protagonist","gore","delinquents","philosophy","drugs","war"}', NULL, '120', '6', NULL, '1982', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 47497, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30664-JJq9tosQvlpW.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30664-B3RVMh7TnXEB.jpg', '#e45043', 30664, '664', '{"Katsuhiro Ootomo","Satoshi Takabatake","Satoshi Kon"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30664-B3RVMh7TnXEB.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shoutarou Kaneda", "native": "金田正太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2588-OfACKXYm2lkV.png"}, {"name": "Tetsuo Shima", "native": "島鉄雄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2589-HR4oPhkLGq6q.png"}, {"name": "Kei", "native": "ケイ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b9875-8eHWcOTvtTQB.png"}, {"name": "Akira", "native": "アキラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b24735-OvEvnQqenWxa.png"}, {"name": "Shikishima Taisa", "native": "敷島大佐", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16288-fCbFrPrvtlvC.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaori", "native": "カオリ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16289-1PsWTr11jxQg.png"}, {"name": "Resistance Member", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18439-qsVwHTTHbq3k.png"}, {"name": "Yamagata", "native": "山形", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b20463-wa6RVPshbPZC.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30664'),
('MANGA', 'The Apothecary Diaries', 'Kusuriya no Hitorigoto', '薬屋のひとりごと', 'Maomao, a young woman trained in the art of herbal medicine, is forced to work as a lowly servant in the inner palace. Though she yearns for life outside its perfumed halls, she isn’t long for a life of drudgery! Using her wits to break a “curse” afflicting the imperial heirs, Maomao attracts the attentions of the handsome eunuch Jinshi and is promoted to attendant food taster. But Jinshi has other plans for the erstwhile apothecary, and soon Maomao is back to brewing potions and…solving mysteries?!', '{"Drama","Mystery"}', '{"female-protagonist","medicine","detective","royal-affairs","foreign","primarily-female-cast","seinen","drugs","politics","work","maids","crime"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 47236, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx99022-Hh2WdyNgR8HM.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/99022-J1LhaA8HbVzV.jpg', NULL, 99022, '107562', '{"Erika Ikeda","Natsu Hyuuga","Touko Shino"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/99022-J1LhaA8HbVzV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kdjQ_dkXr4s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdjQ_dkXr4s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Maomao", "native": "猫猫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126824-MqsCncTO1qpv.png"}, {"name": "Jinshi", "native": "壬氏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127278-0qCQciTkPOMS.jpg"}, {"name": "Koutei", "native": "皇帝", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b144110-bAnH9gjergcc.jpg"}, {"name": "Riishu", "native": "里樹妃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b156764-aEbQtGaJ9PzZ.jpg"}, {"name": "Aaduo", "native": "阿多", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b156765-HPRJaEN81jSa.jpg"}, {"name": "Rifa", "native": "梨花妃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b156766-3DxfskkEqNvc.jpg"}, {"name": "Gyokuyou", "native": "玉葉妃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b156767-6ncEJKdsEQ3O.jpg"}, {"name": "Gaoshun", "native": "高順", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b244317-zm6LeJmLN9kZ.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '99022'),
('MANGA', 'All You Need Is Kill', 'All You Need Is Kill', 'All You Need Is Kill', 'When the alien Mimics invade, Keiji Kiriya is just one of many recruits shoved into a suit of battle armor called a Jacket and sent out to kill. Keiji dies on the battlefield, only to be reborn each morning to fight and die again and again. On his 158th iteration, he gets a message from a mysterious ally--the female soldier known as the Full Metal Bitch. Is she the key to Keiji''s escape or his final death?', '{"Action","Drama","Mecha","Psychological","Romance","Sci-Fi"}', '{"military","seinen","aliens","survival","war","primarily-adult-cast","male-protagonist","time-loop","guns","heterosexual","gore"}', NULL, '17', '2', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 46813, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85215-Uo4ZWJS1s8BH.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85215-w2JFbzOMqSXp.jpg', '#0d3578', 85215, '62887', '{"Takeshi Obata","Hiroshi Sakurazaka","Thibaud Desbief"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85215-w2JFbzOMqSXp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2Qo6ucIV1gc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Qo6ucIV1gc"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Keiji Kiriya", "native": "キリヤ・ケイジ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84785-eUo4BueeuaCY.png"}, {"name": "Rita Vrataski", "native": "リタ・ヴラタスキ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b84787-J4fuPAlxZO3O.jpg"}, {"name": "Shasta Raylle", "native": "シャスタ・レイル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/84789.jpg"}, {"name": "Jin Yonabaru", "native": "ジン・ヨナバル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/84791.jpg"}, {"name": "Bartolome Ferrell", "native": "バルトロメ・フェレウ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/84793.jpg"}, {"name": "Rachel Kisaragi", "native": "レイチェル・キサラギ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b317455-q8uKyCJKq6sW.png"}, {"name": "Arthur Hendricks", "native": "アーサー・ヘンドリックス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b317456-Ybygl6JV5LwA.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85215'),
('MANGA', 'Bungo Stray Dogs', 'Bungou Stray Dogs', '文豪ストレイドッグス', 'Having been kicked out of the orphanage, a despairing young man by the name of Atsushi Nakajima rescues a strange man from a suicide attempt--Osamu Dazai. Turns out that Dazai is part of an armed-detective agency staffed by individuals whose supernatural powers take on a literary bent!', '{"Action","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"urban-fantasy","detective","super-power","mafia","crime","male-protagonist","classic-literature","primarily-male-cast","cute-boys-doing-cute-things","seinen","work","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 46717, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85307-23PaGq5FakEV.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85307-HPlNkWrkD0nk.jpg', NULL, 85307, '56529', '{"Kafka Asagiri","Harukawa35","Carlos Mingo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85307-HPlNkWrkD0nk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FV7M5aC7wfM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FV7M5aC7wfM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Atsushi Nakajima", "native": "中島敦", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89197-vB5kP72ruckV.png"}, {"name": "Osamu Dazai", "native": "太宰治", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89198-qKmRTw4Y3PRC.png"}, {"name": "Doppo Kunikida", "native": "国木田独歩", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89200-mZJo7iEwJGzg.png"}, {"name": "Ranpo Edogawa", "native": "江戸川乱歩", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89201-K0X5HNq88Oub.png"}, {"name": "Junichirou Tanizaki", "native": "谷崎潤一郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89205-69AfPXd4QmX3.png"}, {"name": "Kenji Miyazawa", "native": "宮沢賢治", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89207-i7pw9zNQqXpZ.png"}, {"name": "Akiko Yosano", "native": "与謝野晶子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89208-Zjsz22lCmrIE.png"}, {"name": "Kyouka Izumi", "native": "泉鏡花", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89856-GB3SOKXTBnrX.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85307'),
('MANGA', 'The Girl From the Other Side: Siúil, a Rún', 'Totsukuni no Shoujo', 'とつくにの少女', 'In a world split between the Inside and the Outside, those living in both realms are told never to cross over to the other side, lest they be cursed. A young girl named Shiva lives on the other side, in a vacant village with a demonic guardian known only as “Teacher.” Although the two are forbidden to touch, they seem to share a bond that transcends their disparate appearances. But when Shiva leaves Teacher’s care to seek out her grandmother, the secret behind her mysterious living arrangement comes to light.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"}', '{"fairy-tale","rural","anthropomorphism","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","demons","family-life","philosophy","adoption","found-family","curses","teacher"}', NULL, '53', '11', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 46685, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86770-vjBM79Z1GVbs.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86770-7rHc5L7dR6O1.jpg', NULL, 86770, '93972', '{"Nagabe","Kyouhei Shinpuku","Adrienne Beck"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86770-7rHc5L7dR6O1.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Sensei", "native": "先生", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123987-a6OmZkVSWfs2.jpg"}, {"name": "Shiva", "native": "シーヴァ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b123988-OftE5hJJHfyL.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86770'),
('MANGA', 'Tomo-chan is a Girl!', 'Tomo-chan wa Onnanoko!', 'トモちゃんは女の子!', 'Boyish high school girl Aizawa Tomo finally manages to tell her childhood friend Jun that she’s got a crush on him. Unfortunately, her confession goes right over his head—he didn’t even realize she was a girl until junior high, and even now, Jun still thinks of her as a bro! How can Tomo-chan possibly convince him otherwise and win Jun’s heart?

- Originally published daily on Twi4. The volume release compiled the series into 51 chapters.

- Includes 8 sets of bonus pages, where each set is considered a chapter; each volume contains a set.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"tomboy","4-koma","female-protagonist","heterosexual","school","slapstick","short-form-chapter","primarily-teen-cast","tsundere","episodic","athletics","shounen"}', NULL, '961', '8', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 46563, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx86300-VQWRaxoTXciF.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86300-sL2KyEMqCE7d.jpg', NULL, 86300, '92149', '{"Fumita Yanagida","Jennifer O''Donnell","Wesley O''Donnell"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86300-sL2KyEMqCE7d.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tomo Aizawa", "native": "相沢智", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89181-eo1e0troTZz2.jpg"}, {"name": "Junichirou Kubota", "native": "久保田淳一郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89182-BHYMfg00RGvr.png"}, {"name": "Misuzu Gundou", "native": "群堂みすず", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89183-7rdNPxR2afjA.png"}, {"name": "Carol Olston", "native": "キャロル・オールストン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n89512-Uxe3M5okQXG7.png"}, {"name": "Akemi Aizawa", "native": "相沢あけみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89509-ibzmCdGKxCaB.jpg"}, {"name": "Gorou Aizawa", "native": "相沢五郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89510-HzDOoBYVXUlc.jpg"}, {"name": "Kousuke Misaki", "native": "御崎光助", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89511-mlonsiDWDEoM.jpg"}, {"name": "Misaki Gundou", "native": "群堂みさき", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/