('MANGA', 'Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You', 'Super no Ura de Yani Suu Futari', 'スーパーの裏でヤニ吸うふたり', 'At age forty-five, office worker Sasaki has had enough of the corporate grind. His only solace is smoking-and the friendly smile of supermarket cashier Yamada. When Sasaki can''t find Yamada after a particularly trying day, a striking woman invites him to smoke with her. The despondent man thinks he''s made a new smoking buddy in the cool, teasing Tayama, but Sasaki doesn''t realize he already knows her!

Winner of the Next Manga Award 2022 in the Web Manga Category.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"heterosexual","konbini","seinen","primarily-adult-cast","work","urban","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","iyashikei","office","kuudere"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 44437, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx147149-9DQ4upJAV2kQ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/147149-QhktEdABIQK7.jpg', '#f16b50', 147149, '148467', '{"Asaka Takishima","Bana Yoshida","Amanda Haley"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/147149-QhktEdABIQK7.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IoZGW7AjVs4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IoZGW7AjVs4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Sasaki", "native": "佐々木", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b281763-4LXduEGESuso.png"}, {"name": "Yamada", "native": "山田", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b281764-GzjgHWq4gW9n.png"}, {"name": "Gotou", "native": "後藤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307811-dwvCqZUh9k8w.jpg"}, {"name": "Obata", "native": "小畑", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315451-PezrNVg8AmFJ.jpg"}, {"name": "Oono", "native": "大野", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315452-dha4CAvf3MkA.jpg"}, {"name": "Maezawa", "native": "前澤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315453-UKnbiI2h8SKF.jpg"}, {"name": "Suzuki", "native": "鈴木", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b319609-FhL6FAGs4uTm.jpg"}, {"name": "Kawakami", "native": "川上", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b325245-2If61hcSjSDf.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '147149'),
('MANGA', 'Happiness', 'Happiness', 'ハピネス', 'Nothing interesting is happening in Makoto Ozaki’s first year of high school. His life is a series of quiet humiliations: low-grade bullies, unreliable friends, and the constant frustration of his adolescent lust. But one night, a pale, thin girl knocks him to the ground in an alley and offers him a choice. Now everything is different. Daylight is searingly bright. Food tastes awful. And worse than anything is the terrible, consuming thirst. The tiny shames of his old life have been replaced by two towering horrors: the truth of what will slake his awful craving and high school itself.', '{"Drama","Horror","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","primarily-teen-cast","gore","heterosexual","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '50', '10', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 42974, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86136-CJRGk54qB6Ev.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86136-FWKXOeoS2Mu1.jpg', '#fe5078', 86136, '85173', '{"Shuuzou Oshimi","Thibaud Desbief","Kevin Gifford"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86136-FWKXOeoS2Mu1.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Makoto Okazaki", "native": "岡崎真氏", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n130197-gzUv8EwZ0PFQ.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukiko Gosho", "native": "五所雪子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143737-5jWqpiCtgN4G.png"}, {"name": "Nora", "native": "ノラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130196-DWvcqan6rbGr.png"}, {"name": "Yuki Ono", "native": "大野勇樹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b205115-rNvwFCaEJrQX.jpg"}, {"name": "Nao Shiraishi", "native": "白石菜緒", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b220773-Aoz0aznnWgOw.png"}, {"name": "Masami Sakurane", "native": "桜根正美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b220774-F0cEKPLjv05Y.jpg"}, {"name": "Saku", "native": "サク", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b220775-f8qg31KUlBFA.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86136'),
('MANGA', 'Blue Exorcist', 'Ao no Exorcist', '青の祓魔師', 'Raised by Father Fujimoto, a famous exorcist, Rin Okumura never knew his real father. One day a fateful argument with Father Fujimoto forces Rin to face a terrible truth—the blood of the demon lord Satan runs in Rin''s veins! Rin swears to defeat Satan, but doing that means entering the mysterious True Cross Academy and becoming an exorcist himself. Can Rin fight demons and keep his infernal bloodline a secret? It won''t be easy, especially when drawing his father''s sword releases the demonic power within him!', '{"Action","Supernatural"}', '{"demons","male-protagonist","shounen","conspiracy","urban-fantasy","twins","swordplay","primarily-teen-cast","primarily-male-cast","exorcism","school","religion"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2009', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 42954, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx43492-2mvXJnP6Feqq.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/43492-WF5WHHGkLwxg.jpg', '#f18650', 43492, '13492', '{"Kazue Katou","Tatsuya Endou","Yuusaku Shibata"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/43492-WF5WHHGkLwxg.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rin Okumura", "native": "奥村燐", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b24482-E6087V4uAVqL.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukio Okumura", "native": "奥村雪男", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b24734-GgVZoNAPnxoc.png"}, {"name": "Ryuuji Suguro", "native": "勝呂竜士", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b30429-NmVCBSzm3GNY.png"}, {"name": "Shiemi Moriyama", "native": "杜山しえみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b30430-LwO3yM6dg0HF.png"}, {"name": "Shirou Fujimoto", "native": "藤本獅郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b30431-l