('MANGA', 'D.Gray-man', 'D.Gray-man', 'ディー・グレイマン', 'A born exorcist, Walker''s primary anti-akuma weapon is the cross that''s embossed on his red, disfigured left hand, which contains Innocence. But not only does Walker destroy akuma, he sees the akuma hiding inside a person''s soul! Together with his fellow exorcists fighting under the command of the Black Order, Walker leads the battle against the Millennium Earl, the evil being out to destroy mankind.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"demons","super-power","foreign","found-family","male-protagonist","religion","cult","exorcism","shounen","adoption","circus","primarily-male-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2004', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 42807, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30024-UUUz8xxkt8pc.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30024-Ml6IkHhDalAz.jpg', '#e4935d', 30024, '24', '{"Katsura Hoshino","Akira Akatsuki","Tsuyoshi Watanabe"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30024-Ml6IkHhDalAz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Allen Walker", "native": "アレン・ウォーカー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139-QnuZQbLodMF3.png"}, {"name": "Yuu Kanda", "native": "神田ユウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140-vbv18x2l0tDw.png"}, {"name": "Lenalee Lee", "native": "リナリー・リー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141-XOVoHUg6M2kN.png"}, {"name": "Lavi", "native": "ラビ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b779-kSxmhfuEP2UR.png"}, {"name": "Komui Lee", "native": "コムイ・リー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b142-S49HHpPBlxky.png"}, {"name": "Tyki Mikk", "native": "ティキ・ミック", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b778-6iR5U4r75jHc.jpg"}, {"name": "Road Kamelot", "native": "ロード・キャメロット", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b780-QGegNJEufooQ.jpg"}, {"name": "Miranda Lotto", "native": "ミランダ・ロットー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b857-EVk4GH6Xbe6R.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30024'),
('MANGA', 'I Am a Hero', 'I Am a Hero', 'アイアムアヒーロー', 'A mentally unhinged manga artist witnesses the beginning of a zombie outbreak in Tokyo, and he’s certain of only two things: he’s destined to be the city’s hero, and he possesses something quite rare in Japan—an actual firearm! 

Nominated for the 3rd and 4th Manga Taisho Award (2010).

Includes a new epilogue chapter that was released 4 years after the official end of the manga.', '{"Action","Horror","Psychological"}', '{"seinen","survival","post-apocalyptic","male-protagonist","gore","guns","body-horror","urban","love-triangle","pov","disability","hikikomori"}', NULL, '265', '22', NULL, '2009', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 42665, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx44440-oLFibAj4TvM7.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/44440-EsVCieTs3ojl.jpg', NULL, 44440, '14440', '{"Kengo Hanazawa","Marc Bernabé","Lídia Ivasa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/44440-EsVCieTs3ojl.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MX_YZXx6lWI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MX_YZXx6lWI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hideo Suzuki", "native": "鈴木英雄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/37610.jpg"}, {"name": "Hiromi Hayakari", "native": "はやかり ひろみ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/78073.jpg"}, {"name": "Tsugumi Oda", "native": "小田つぐみ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/78075.jpg"}, {"name": "Kurusu", "native": "来栖", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/78077.jpg"}, {"name": "Obaa-san", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282319-4UVAJpmu9glR.jpg"}, {"name": "Tetsuko Kurokawa", "native": "黒川徹子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344137-gCuXzN9p3F88.jpg"}, {"name": "Sango", "native": "サンゴ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344138-ILZDFETZpXCK.jpg"}, {"name": "Mitani", "native": "三谷", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344139-IIjU7sgdmS1n.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '44440'),
('MANGA', 'Kubo Won''t Let Me Be Invisible', 'Kubo-san wa Mob wo Yurusanai', '久保さんは僕を許さない', 'First year high schooler Junta Shiraishi is a mob character who goes unnoticed even when he''s standing right next to you. But his classmate, "heroine-level beauty" Kubo, always notices him and is there to tease him. Anyone can become special to someone, but it might be a little too early to call these feelings "love." Perhaps this story is still two-steps from being a romantic comedy--let''s call it a sweet comedy where a background character becomes visible!

- Includes 13 extra chapters and the pilot one-shot.

- Won 19th place (2020) and 7th place (2021) in the Tsugi ni Kuru Manga Awards in the physical release category.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"iyashikei","heterosexual","school","primarily-teen-cast","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","chibi","cute-girls-doing-cute-things","seinen","coming-of-age"}', NULL, '158', '12', NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 42663, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx112981-lI95vW7wk8Nv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/112981-XwfEzj8CJSzH.jpg', '#e44393', 112981, '122448', '{"Nene Yukimori","Amanda Haley","Snir Aharon"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/112981-XwfEzj8CJSzH.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GZeYJYC3X9s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GZeYJYC3X9s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nagisa Kubo", "native": "久保渚咲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b164986-FewavqJshmYl.png"}, {"name": "Junta  Shiraishi", "native": "白石純太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b173331-DJo02GVou1Cj.png"}, {"name": "Seita Shiraishi", "native": "白石誠太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196720-2NsuK4n9lOou.jpg"}, {"name": "Akina Kubo", "native": "久保明菜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196721-WHYMwRM1SieA.png"}, {"name": "Saki Kubo", "native": "久保沙貴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196722-7G1UQw1rKSgP.png"}, {"name": "Tamao Taira", "native": "平玉緒", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196723-f3fyCGNkUqv3.png"}, {"name": "Hazuki Kudou", "native": "工藤葉月", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196724-J2unHcStELB1.png"}, {"name": "Yuuma Sudou", "native": "須藤勇真", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213143-eaiEZiiIhTEs.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '112981'),
('MANGA', 'Tomodachi Game', 'Tomodachi Game', 'トモダチゲーム', 'Play a game that costs a lot of money with your best friends! The key to clearing the game is "don''t doubt your friends." However, one betrayal raises suspicion, and the game becomes a psychological warfare! Money or friends?

The ultimate intellectual game manga that shakes people''s hearts has been born!', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological"}', '{"anti-hero","male-protagonist","survival","revenge","shounen","ships"}', NULL, '130', '26', NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 42622, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85911-Z6xE67IxevPA.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85911-ebU5GnEdGgQE.jpg', '#e45086', 85911, '62795', '{"Mikoto Yamaguchi","Yuuki Satou","Maite Madinabeitia"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85911-ebU5GnEdGgQE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuuichi Katagiri", "native": "片切友一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122064-p5x9pgsdjj4W.jpg"}, {"name": "Yutori Kokorogi", "native": "心木ゆとり", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127637-duK9JtmuGImW.png"}, {"name": "Shiho Sawaragi", "native": "沢良宜志法", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127638-7c6AnJdppdK0.png"}, {"name": "Tenji Mikasa", "native": "美笠天智", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127639-xhIRxtOdTnim.jpg"}, {"name": "Makoto Shibe", "native": "四部誠", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127641-q5cUAXkQpyAG.png"}, {"name": "Kei Shinomiya", "native": "紫宮京", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127625-UETEYuvm9cz5.png"}, {"name": "Juuzou Kadokura", "native": "門倉十蔵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127626-RIaEACseVnnI.jpg"}, {"name": "Tsukino", "native": "月野", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127627-XSG0KkguyTaw.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85911'),
('MANGA', 'The Summer Hikaru Died', 'Hikaru ga Shinda Natsu', '光が死んだ夏', 'Two boys lived in a village: Yoshiki and Hikaru. The two did everything together...until the day Hikaru was encompassed by a mysterious light. That was when everything changed—Hikaru most of all. Yoshiki still wishes from the bottom of his heart to always stay by his side...but is there even a Hikaru left to be with?', '{"Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"male-protagonist","cosmic-horror","rural","primarily-teen-cast","lgbtq-themes","boys-love","unrequited-love","curses","urban-fantasy","seinen","school"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 42448, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx138603-j0gcshf7PVkN.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/138603-daMO0so1tqNv.jpg', '#e46b0d', 138603, '141833', '{"Mokmok Len","Ajani Oloye","Abigail Blackman"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/138603-daMO0so1tqNv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vrMuk5D5twY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vrMuk5D5twY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yoshiki Tsujinaka", "native": "辻中佳紀", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b281109-SRUQVkT7DYyg.jpg"}, {"name": "Hikaru Indou", "native": "忌堂光", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b281110-WxqeTYKB8XdD.jpg"}, {"name": "Asako Yamagishi", "native": "山岸朝子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b359202-syrbw7pLHUB7.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuki Tadokoro", "native": "田所結希", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b365939-wOB6wBXVMdpW.jpg"}, {"name": "Rie Kurebayashi", "native": "暮林理恵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b359203-bFCeQtL3g8Fe.png"}, {"name": "Tanaka", "native": "田中", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b359204-jlRpm1vV5Hjk.png"}, {"name": "Yuuta Maki", "native": "巻ゆうた", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b365938-DtezhkTZoVCW.png"}, {"name": "Kaoru Tsujinaka", "native": "辻中薫", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b368792-pAozgFjAf6HH.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '138603'),
('MANGA', 'Tomie', 'Tomie', '富江', 'Tomie Kawakami is a femme fatale with long black hair and a beauty mark just under her left eye. She can seduce nearly any man, and drive them to murder as well, even though the victim is often Tomie herself. While one lover seeks to keep her for himself, another grows terrified of the immortal succubus. But soon they realize that no matter how many times they kill her, the world will never be free of Tomie.

- While a collection of mainly independent short stories, Tomie was originally published as Volumes 1 and 2 of the  Ito Junji Kyofu Manga Collection. This entry is for the standalone release of Tomie first published in February 2000 with previously unreleased chapter "小指/Little Finger".

- Later collections such as the ''Complete Deluxe edition'' by VIZ combines this and the sequel entry Tomie: Again for a total of 20 chapters.

- The short story “Painter” has been adapted in the first part of episode 9 of Ito Junji: Collection.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"body-horror","monster-girl","gore","female-protagonist","episodic","shoujo","male-harem","yandere","urban-fantasy","demons"}', NULL, '13', '1', NULL, '1987', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 42386, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30912-LzqytEFBrqUM.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30912-mLAmmYZiiH51.jpg', '#d6281a', 30912, '912', '{"Junji Itou","Anaïs Koechlin","Naomi Kokubo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30912-mLAmmYZiiH51.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tomie", "native": "富江", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19174-GmwTy7yYcWe0.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30912'),
('MANGA', 'Fly Me to the Moon', 'Tonikaku Kawaii', 'トニカクカワイイ', 'First comes marriage, then comes an earthbound love that is out of this world! From the day his parents named him, Nasa Yuzaki has been destined for outer space…or so he believes. But while trying to join the space program, he is thrown for a loop when an accident introduces him to Tsukasa, a mysterious girl with strange powers. Is she an alien, a moon goddess or something else? Since she insists on marrying him, Nasa has plenty of chances to find out!', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"marriage","iyashikei","heterosexual","family-life","coming-of-age","shounen","primarily-adult-cast","meta","parody"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 41749, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx101177-FjjD5UWB3C3t.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101177-ncrsf5znPykf.jpg', '#c9f1f1', 101177, '112589', '{"Kenjirou Hata","John Werry","Evan Waldinger"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101177-ncrsf5znPykf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K5DTuaGoICU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K5DTuaGoICU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nasa Yuzaki", "native": "由​​​​​​​​​​​​​​崎​​​​​​​星​​​​​​​​​​​​空", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130944-Bi9EfjnNO3LT.png"}, {"name": "Tsukasa Yuzaki", "native": "由崎司", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b131106-ZJOpYOpurcYS.png"}, {"name": "Kaname Arisugawa", "native": "有栖川要", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137513-h2d62OMGdOVO.png"}, {"name": "Aya Arisugawa", "native": "有栖川綾", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137514-8CLYxq6Vrsll.png"}, {"name": "Chitose Kaginoji", "native": "鍵ノ寺千歳", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137515-SwOZGCSqhpmO.png"}, {"name": "Aurora", "native": "アウロラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137516-Ea2oRhAwnVv9.png"}, {"name": "Charlotte", "native": "シャーロット", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137517-g9L9c1mlYaOm.png"}, {"name": "Naoko Yanagi", "native": "柳直子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175114-OgCJf9Zlf1QB.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '101177'),
('MANGA', 'Alice in Borderland', 'Imawa no Kuni no Alice', '今際の国のアリス', 'Eighteen-year-old Ryohei Arisu is sick of his life. School sucks, his love life is a joke, and his future feels like impending doom. As he struggles to exist in a world that can’t be bothered with him, Ryohei feels like everything would be better if he were anywhere else. When a strange fireworks show transports him and his friends to a parallel world, Ryohei thinks all his wishes have come true. But this new world isn’t an empty paradise, it’s a vicious game. And the only way to survive is to play.', '{"Action","Drama","Horror","Psychological","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"death-game","survival","philosophy","urban","male-protagonist","gore","gambling","shounen","isekai","dystopian","primarily-adult-cast","revenge"}', NULL, '87', '18', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 41682, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx63031-lE9pKD3cpmVK.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/63031-daZs7fa5k2qm.jpg', '#e46b43', 63031, '33031', '{"Haro Aso","Torarika","Lasse Christiansen"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/63031-daZs7fa5k2qm.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ryouhei Arisu", "native": "有栖良平", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129005-fqVI6zVObo8z.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuzuha Usagi", "native": "宇佐木柚葉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129006-zmxkRv8m3MzC.png"}, {"name": "Morizono Aguni", "native": "粟国杜園", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129007-pwTyx56oE1Mw.png"}, {"name": "Saori Shibuki", "native": "紫吹小織", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b198680-lQpLoedwNjjS.jpg"}, {"name": "Chouta Segawa", "native": "勢川張太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anili