('MANGA', 'Dead Dead Demon''s Dededede Destruction', 'Dead Dead Demon''s Dededededestruction', 'デッドデッドデーモンズデデデデデストラクション', 'The Japan Self-Defense Forces are still looking for a way to combat the alien threat, but so far conventional weapons have had no effect. Maybe it’s time to try something unconventional.

Meanwhile, Kadode Koyama and her best friend avidly track the aliens’ movements on social media and less enthusiastically study for college entrance exams. When the end of the world looms overhead, you learn to take things one step at a time.

- Winner of the 66th Shogakukan Manga Award in the general category.

- Includes one extra chapter.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Sci-Fi","Slice of Life"}', '{"seinen","aliens","female-protagonist","politics","primarily-female-cast","military","coming-of-age","dystopian","denpa","philosophy","language-barrier","school"}', NULL, '101', '12', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 41485, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85316-EGrSrwSMeOxd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85316-G3L0XaNpPhUg.jpg', '#50bbe4', 85316, '70801', '{"Inio Asano","Thibaud Desbief","Marc Bernabé"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85316-G3L0XaNpPhUg.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_7OiPyGMVH4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7OiPyGMVH4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ouran Nakagawa", "native": "中川凰蘭", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88565-8RC8tFVxVzz0.png"}, {"name": "Kadode Koyama", "native": "小山門出", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88566-XI3I0tYcK8XN.png"}, {"name": "Keita Ooba", "native": "大葉圭太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140043-0kMrP1oA5qn0.png"}, {"name": "Hiroshi Nakagawa", "native": "中川ひろし", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89578-YHaDxdOKgQKB.png"}, {"name": "Futaba Takemoto", "native": "竹本ふたば", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89579-T1iS9rxsTT8G.png"}, {"name": "Makoto Tainuma", "native": "田井沼マコト", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89580-FDtX7TICLBUX.png"}, {"name": "Naoki Watarase", "native": "渡良瀬直樹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89581-v5HjpBoI7GHq.jpg"}, {"name": "Rin Hirama", "native": 