('MANGA', 'Shikimori''s Not Just a Cutie', 'Kawaii dake ja Nai Shikimori-san', '可愛いだけじゃない式守さん', 'Shikimori seems like the perfect girlfriend: cute, fun to be around, sweet when she wants to be… but she has a cool dark side that comes out under the right circumstances. And her boyfriend Izumi loves to be around when that happens!

- Originally self-published on Twitter, was then licensed by Kodansha for serialization.

- Won 5th place in Tsugimanga 2020 Award in the Web Manga Category.

- Includes 25 extra chapters.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"heterosexual","school","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","episodic","coming-of-age","cute-girls-doing-cute-things","cute-boys-doing-cute-things","shounen"}', NULL, '203', '20', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 41175, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx107282-ZzzqzHRZShT6.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107282-EAo2QJlW91lV.jpg', NULL, 107282, '118196', '{"Keigo Maki","Stephen Paul","Yeong-Myeong Do"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107282-EAo2QJlW91lV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nTZKLuZo0AE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nTZKLuZo0AE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuuki Izumi", "native": "和泉幽希", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155701-fBaTQgKGLe4O.jpg"}, {"name": "Miyako Shikimori", "native": "式守都", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155702-S8irhsg4QTPf.png"}, {"name": "Kyou Nekozaki", "native": "猫崎享", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184812-pvc1B1yI6IqK.png"}, {"name": "Yui Hachimitsu", "native": "八満結", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184813-xtRpLYZCSlL8.jpg"}, {"name": "Shuu Inuzuka", "native": "犬束秀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184814-Jo9pWb4KKsNS.png"}, {"name": "Ai Kamiya", "native": "狼谷藍", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b185661-hU8QpclbKiwI.jpg"}, {"name": "Rika Isana", "native": "鯨里歌", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b251811-HkT7dH40QV17.jpg"}, {"name": "Saruogi", "native": "猿荻", "role": "SUPP