('MANGA', 'Blue Flag', 'Ao no Flag', '青のフラッグ', 'High school senior year, spring—one of life''s important forks in the road. Taichi Ichinose finds himself in the same class as Futaba Kuze, who he feels strangely averse to, and his popular childhood friend, Touma Mita. One day, Futaba confides in him her love for Touma, and asks him for help. How will Taichi respond? This new “pure” love story begins as the three are colored in the emotions of youth.', '{"Drama","Romance"}', '{"coming-of-age","male-protagonist","shounen","primarily-teen-cast","chibi","school","philosophy","baseball","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, '54', '8', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 40922, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx98334-jyJD2etxVK1T.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98334-Bmw0dgYs7yL6.jpg', '#0da1e4', 98334, '103942', '{"KAITO","Nakamaru Nakagawa","Kazu Kakazu"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/98334-Bmw0dgYs7yL6.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Futaba Kuze", "native": "空勢二葉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126846-3DSpV3nyQFBo.png"}, {"name": "Masumi Itachi", "native": "伊達真澄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126876-oC7QqNd43OAA.png"}, {"name": "Touma Mita", "native": "三田桃真", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126878-yEsoPEtUV8Xg.png"}, {"name": "Taichi Ichinose", "native": "一ノ瀬太一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126879-7cQeDSkJCtzx.png"}, {"name": "Mami Yagihara", "native": "八木原舞美 ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126874-q0OuP4PIYhVj.png"}, {"name": "Seiya Mita", "native": "三田誠也", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b209882-fFwQ1z4yb40H.png"}, {"name": "Akiko Mita", "native": "三田亜樹子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210340-bHbPYRWYA8DL.png"}, {"name": "Shingo Niimura", "native": "新村慎吾", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b319870-NoCykzL2mdKV.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '98334'),
('MANGA', 'Billy Bat', 'Billy Bat', 'ビリーバット', 'It’s 1949 Los Angeles, and Kevin Yamagata, a Japanese American comic book author, is drawing his bestselling character, Billy Bat: a quick-witted detective who is, unsurprisingly, a cartoon bat. Everything is going well for Kevin until he discovers an unfortunate truth: He may have unintentionally plagiarized his beloved character from a drawing he once saw in Japan. Devastated by the news, Kevin returns to war-torn Japan to find the drawing’s original artist . . . but the character’s origins turn out to be far older and more perplexing than he had ever imagined.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"drawing","historical","seinen","conspiracy","philosophy","politics","ensemble-cast","urban-fantasy","travel","foreign","primarily-adult-cast","police"}', NULL, '165', '20', NULL, '2008', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 40064, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx41054-zXqZzpwjJCCR.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/41054-AHdvdNdyRe3M.jpg', '#d6281a', 41054, '11054', '{"Naoki Urasawa","Takashi Nagasaki","Kristi Fernandez"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/41054-AHdvdNdyRe3M.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kevin Yamagata", "native": "ケヴィン・ヤマガタ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b23635-b814kwdWX5j8.png"}, {"name": "Billy Bat", "native": null, "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b23636-6oVXdYeT1aiD.png"}, {"name": "Jackie Momochi", "native": "ジャッキー・モモチ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b73625-JwK2Ykt0R6AB.png"}, {"name": "Kevin Goodman", "native": "ケヴィン・グッドマン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b81661-YKtFwnBB3zRc.jpg"}, {"name": "Lee Oswald", "native": "リー・ハーヴェイ・オズワルド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image