('MANGA', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Part 5: Golden Wind', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Ougon no Kaze', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 黄金の風', 'Golden Wind is here! The highly-acclaimed fifth arc of Hirohiko Araki’s JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure shifts the action from Japan to Italy, as Koichi Hirose heads to Europe to find an aspiring gangster named Giorno Giovanna, the secret son of Dio Brando, scourge of the Joestar family. Organized crime meets family drama and unbelievable enemy Stands in JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure: Part 5—Golden Wind!', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"mafia","super-power","foreign","shounen","travel","ensemble-cast","guns","primarily-male-cast","gore","lgbtq-themes","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '155', '17', NULL, '1995', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 39794, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx33008-HBnMTIGwREaV.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33008-tW6AZVebMFCJ.jpg', '#f19328', 33008, '3008', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Kei Sanbe","Wataru Watanabe"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33008-tW6AZVebMFCJ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Giorno Giovanna", "native": "ジョルノ・ジョバァーナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10529-AloL8jjZwjsg.png"}, {"name": "Narancia Ghirga", "native": "ナランチャ・ギルガ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11895-qLSpMN3gVLHP.png"}, {"name": "Bruno Bucciarati", "native": "ブローノ・ブチャラティ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13045-TIpIF82cMkG9.png"}, {"name": "Pannacotta Fugo", "native": "パンナコッタ・フーゴ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13083-vEmGajGdXqCu.jpg"}, {"name": "Guido Mista", "native": "グイード・ミスタ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13084-DMCv7SP1uRBq.png"}, {"name": "Leone Abbacchio", "native": "レオーネ・アバッキオ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b17525-mlrTtUKPeEOb.png"}, {"name": "Trish Una", "native": "トリッシュ・ウナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27153-D3ru0eppKXRu.png"}, {"name": "Diavolo", "native": "ディアボロ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27155-ZqYlVLxAZjzV.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '33008'),
('MANGA', 'orange', 'orange', 'orange [オレンジ]', 'Everyone has regrets in life. So who wouldn’t take the chance to change the past if given the opportunity? When sixteen-year-old Takamiya Naho receives a mysterious letter, claiming to be from her twenty-seven-year-old self, her life is suddenly thrown into flux. The letter tells her that a new transfer student by the name of Naruse Kakeru will be joining her class, and to keep her eye on him. But why? Naho must decide what to make of the letter and its cryptic warning, and what it means not only for her future, but for Kakeru’s as well.

Included series/one-shot:

Volumes 1-5: Haru-iro Astronaut (春色アストロノート , Spring-Colored Astronaut); #1: Bessatsu Margaret 2011-06, #2: Betsuma sister 2012-01, #3~5: kakioroshi

Mami and Tomoki have always shared everything in life, they are identical twins, yet so different in character and personality: Mami tender and helpless, courted by boys to whom she doesn''t never "no" for excessive kindness, Tomoki with a strong sense of duty and a great spirit of sacrifice, would do anything to see his sister happy. But there comes a time, however, when one realizes there are things that cannot be shared, especially when it is something extremely rare and unique... just like an alien?!
 
Volume 6: Mirai (未来)
 
Volume 7: Suwa Hiroto (須和弘人) 

A side story focusing on Naho and Suwa''s lives in the world where Kakeru passed away at age 17.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Romance","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"love-triangle","shoujo","school","heterosexual","female-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, '39', '7', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 39352, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx65573-PwRU3hisff0g.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/65573-BdCXR8yzTQ5G.jpg', '#e4d65d', 65573, '35573', '{"Ichigo Takano","Amber Tamosaitis","Lys Blakeslee"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/65573-BdCXR8yzTQ5G.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UQCDrUhPgoU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UQCDrUhPgoU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Naho Takamiya", "native": "高宮菜穂", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66591-948k4lMRa4gm.jpg"}, {"name": "Kakeru Naruse", "native": "成瀬翔", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66593-712ERVocDhCB.jpg"}, {"name": "Hiroto Suwa", "native": "須和弘人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b66595-Gs6XD2PAuPM0.jpg"}, {"name": "Takako Chino", "native": "茅野貴子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b76828-rXQge6GI8kZ5.png"}, {"name": "Azusa Murasaka", "native": "村坂あずさ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b76830-UJgX9ntiwJUt.jpg"}, {"name": "Saku Hagita", "native": "萩田朔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b76832-R7vKq486BUiq.jpg"}, {"name": "Rio Ueda", "native": "上田莉緒", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196990-ADm8wb8VSnbA.jpg"}, {"name": "Kakeru no 