('MANGA', 'My Love Story with Yamada-kun at Lv999', 'Yamada-kun to Lv999 no Koi wo Suru', '山田くんとLv999の恋をする', 'Recently dumped, Akane is just about to quit the game she used to play with her boyfriend, when she meets Yamada in the same RPG. Yamada in real life turns out to be somewhat of a legend. The only problem is - he is ONLY interested in the game. As Akane''s feelings grow, will Yamada''s focus stay on the game?', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"video-games","heterosexual","female-protagonist","otaku-culture","shoujo"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 38913, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx109501-eT3s7wv5gkrB.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/109501-y84LgnESYhKS.jpg', '#f1506b', 109501, '125052', '{"Mashiro","Nuria Cimas Pita"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/109501-y84LgnESYhKS.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UULiMw27I9s/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UULiMw27I9s"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Akane Kinoshita", "native": "木之下茜", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b197172-MfY8D8sSMjHy.png"}, {"name": "Akito Yamada", "native": "山田秋斗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b197173-t2KNplNgpQV6.png"}, {"name": "Runa Sasaki", "native": "佐々木瑠奈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199120-cC3hg83DYcto.png"}, {"name": "Eita Sasaki", "native": "佐々木瑛太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199121-8PgP309K6DkU.png"}, {"name": "Momoko Maeda", "native": "前田桃子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b300521-6fSVkgiIwyNX.png"}, {"name": "Takezou Kamota", "native": "鴨田たけぞう", "role": "SUPPORTING", "i