('MANGA', '21st Century Boys', '21 Seiki Shounen', '21世紀少年', 'War is over. The Friend is dead. Mankind no longer faces the threat of extinction. Peace has finally come to Tokyo... Or has it? The mystery still remains. Nobody knows who the Friend was and where he came from. The only clue is hidden deep within the memories—the memories of the hero Kenji. It is time to open Pandora’s Box to discover what is left at the bottom.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"conspiracy","seinen","cult","ghost","military","virtual-world","augmented-reality","robots","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '16', '2', NULL, '2006', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 37852, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx30743-eln5xX7mt8ps.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30743-rhUiXElXjlKe.png', '#e4c95d', 30743, '743', '{"Naoki Urasawa","Marc Bernabé","Akemi Wegmüller"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30743-rhUiXElXjlKe.png", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kenji Endou", "native": "遠藤健児", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b3442-QdMHJOKv2Xos.jpg"}, {"name": "Chouji Ochiai", "native": "落合長治", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6004-wCseNjnRhze8.png"}, {"name": "Kanna Endou", "native": "遠藤カンナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b9730-TxluI1UEBU7z.png"}, {"name": "Tomodachi", "native": "ともだち", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/14314.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukiji Setoguchi", "native": "瀬戸口ユキジ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7271-KUHwm99LY43L.png"}, {"name": "Kyuutarou Kaminaga", "native": "神永球太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8116-O9ZZj9EYrEFq.png"}, {"name": "Yoshitsune Minamoto", "native": "皆本ヨシツネ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b20072-XbBJ07We3l6t.png"}, {"name": "Hattori", "native": "服部", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21461-g4aMXr9l12QD.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30743'),
('MANGA', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Part 2: Battle Tendency', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Sentou Chouryuu', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 戦闘潮流', 'The beginning of the Battle Tendency Arc! The Joestar family is called upon to do battle against evil again! This time, it’s Joseph Joestar, the grandson of Jonathan Joestar! And his enemies are more powerful and diabolical than ever! Behold! The terror of the Pillar Men!', '{"Action","Adventure","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","shounen","male-protagonist","foreign","cultivation","vampire","travel","gore","urban-fantasy","historical","surreal-comedy"}', NULL, '69', '7', NULL, '1987', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 37750, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx31630-Fg8JERVKuWB5.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31630-90PUgztrRfCv.jpg', '#e4c90d', 31630, '1630', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Hirohisa Onikubo","Reiki Taki"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31630-90PUgztrRfCv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Joseph Joestar", "native": "ジョセフ・ジョースター", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6356-RImEfUfHpC58.png"}, {"name": "Rudol von Stroheim", "native": "ルドル・フォン・シュトロハイム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n21958-RvVcFEHfOrKV.png"}, {"name": "Caesar Zeppeli", "native": "シーザー・アントニオ・ツェペリ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21959-Cm9Rlh0EFAQw.png"}, {"name": "Lisa Lisa", "native": "リサリサ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21960-3stfLc0uwgoT.png"}, {"name": "Wamuu", "native": "ワムウ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21965-waQaIDkSC77a.png"}, {"name": "Kars", "native": "カーズ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n21966-ZvYmd1Dwp613.png"}, {"name": "Erina Pendleton", "native": "エリナ・ペンドルトン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21937-mwAbJAgxE8yP.jpg"}, {"name": "Robert E. O. Speedwagon", "native": "ロバート・E・O・スピードワゴン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n21938-7iTMOJ4i6ET8.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '31630'),
('MANGA', 'Our Dreams at Dusk: Shimanami Tasogare', 'Shimanami Tasogare', 'しまなみ誰そ彼', 'Not only is high schooler Tasuku Kaname the new kid in town, he’s also terrified that he’s been outed as gay. Just as he’s contemplating doing the unthinkable, Tasuku meets a mysterious woman who leads him to a group of people dealing with problems not so different from his own. In this realistic, heartfelt depiction of LGBT+ characters from different backgrounds finding their place in the world, a search for inner peace proves to be the most universal experience of all.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life"}', '{"lgbtq-themes","coming-of-age","found-family","seinen","male-protagonist","bullying","ensemble-cast","transgender","agender","boys-love","asexual"}', NULL, '23', '4', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 37590, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx87208-Ur9f4VA4M5JB.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87208-eZ7Lhi7LV36q.jpg', '#5dc9f1', 87208, '97244', '{"Yuuki Kamatani","Jocelyne Allen","Kaitlyn Wiley"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87208-eZ7Lhi7LV36q.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l4lZz8TQaBM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lZz8TQaBM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tasuku  Kaname", "native": "要介", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n133055-3I9p6OTOzfj0.png"}, {"name": "Touma Tsubaki", "native": "椿冬馬", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n133056-ghmOH0HCEk8T.jpg"}, {"name": "Haruko Daichi", "native": "大地春子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135188-CmnzH4bGzWIH.jpg"}, {"name": "Natsuyoshi Utsumi", "native": "内海", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135189-eiMvVlQsJx89.png"}, {"name": "Chaiko", "native": "チャイコ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135190-VcccIMJxkrIq.jpg"}, {"name": "Anonymous", "native": "誰か", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135191-Cqy57M8FGQGD.jpg"}, {"name": "Shuuji Misora", "native": "美空秋治", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b163317-f2Pz9CItWUoj.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '87208'),
('MANGA', 'Maid-sama!', 'Kaichou wa Maid-sama!', '会長はメイド様！', 'As if being student council president of a predominantly male high school isn’t hard enough, Misaki Ayuzawa has a major secret—she works at a maid café after school! How is she supposed to keep her image of being ultrasmart, strong and overachieving intact once school heartthrob Takumi Usui discovers her double life?!

Included one-shots:

Volume 1: Toumei na Sekai (A Transparent World)

Volume 4: Tsuide ni 3 Baka mo Maid-sama! (And While We''re at It, the Idiot Trio as Maids!)

Volume 4: Soshite Momotaro mo Maid-sama (Peach Boy Is a Maid Too!)

Volume 6: Aoi Haru (Blue Spring)

Volume 6: Fukukaichou wa Ouji-sama!? (The Vice-President Is a Prince?!)

Volume 7: Aoi to to Yukai na Nakama-tachi (Aoi with Fun Friends)

Volume 8: Baka to Furyou to Hero to (An Idiot, a Delinquent and a Hero)

Volume 8: Toaru Asa no Seitokaishitsu (A Particular Morning in the Student Council Office)

Volume 11: Kaichou wa Shisuji-sama! (The President Is a Butler!)

Volume 11: Konnichiwa Imouto desu (Hello, I''m the Little Sister)

Volume 12: Sentimental Ikkun (Sentimental Ikkun)

Volume 13: Maid Latte Hikaeshitsu (Maid Latte Back Room)

Volume 15: Baka to Furyou to Madonna to (An Idiot, a Delinquent and a Madonna)

Volume 17: Comics Kakioroshi Short Story (Exclusive Short Comic)', '{"Comedy","Romance"}', '{"shoujo","female-protagonist","heterosexual","tsundere","school","primarily-teen-cast","tomboy","maids","work","male-harem","restaurant"}', NULL, '99', '18', NULL, '2005', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 37157, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx32921-joMcvusRyZV6.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/32921-rRQa31mhzYPy.jpg', '#feae28', 32921, '2921', '{"Hiro Fujiwara","Alethea Nibley","Paweł Dybała"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/32921-rRQa31mhzYPy.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LduTFwa5Cks/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LduTFwa5Cks"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Takumi Usui", "native": "碓氷拓海", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14523-yFjXVeK6c6IE.png"}, {"name": "Misaki Ayuzawa", "native": "鮎沢美咲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14941-qh15JS5cEQDL.jpg"}, {"name": "Aoi Hyoudou", "native": "兵藤葵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16614-kYZByrhYdCJe.jpg"}, {"name": "Shouichirou Yukimura", "native": "幸村祥一郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/19286.jpg"}, {"name": "Hinata Shintani", "native": "深谷陽向", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19985-sHzQhMUrLHvJ.jpg"}, {"name": "Soutarou Kanou", "native": "叶爽太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27667-mHj9LXkj4jyu.png"}, {"name": "Tora Igarashi", "native": "五十嵐虎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27717-SUpDLRWbi5Hm.jpg"}, {"name": "Kanade Maki", "native": "真木奏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b27718-txH0amJZuXw1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '32921'),
('MANGA', 'Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou', 'Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou', 'ヨコハマ買い出し紀行', 'Set hundreds of years in the future after an environmental catastrophe, Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou (also known as Yokohama Shopping Log) centers on the simple life of Alpha, an android who runs a small coffee shop in coastal Japan. Alpha stands witness to chronicle the end of humanity’s days with coffee, a slice of watermelon, and the sound of her moon guitar backed by distant seagulls. Quiet and bittersweet, this tale is about the melancholy beauty that can be found even as the end approaches.', '{"Sci-Fi","Slice of Life"}', '{"iyashikei","female-protagonist","post-apocalyptic","coastal","philosophy","rural","coming-of-age","robots","seinen","lost-civilization","artificial-intelligence","episodic"}', NULL, '144', '14', NULL, '1994', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 37047, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b30004-k0YUnO94IB4x.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30004-xHbpHwm7lcGp.jpg', '#f1d61a', 30004, '4', '{"Hitoshi Ashinano","Daniel Komen","Ludwig Sacramento"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30004-xHbpHwm7lcGp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Alpha Hatsuseno", "native": "初瀬野アルファ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2765-x0TlD7Lb5HLq.png"}, {"name": "Kokone Takatsu", "native": "鷹津ココネ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2978-lVHCMf4nkYkb.png"}, {"name": "Alpha Koumi''ishi", "native": "子海石アルファ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4684-FHLAwIVfdgHU.png"}, {"name": "Koumi''ishi", "native": "子海石せんせい", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6188-pcOzZFaZRnpy.png"}, {"name": "Oji-san", "native": "おじさん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6902-yTV5t1J5lW01.png"}, {"name": "Takahiro", "native": "タカヒロ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6903-czfmYDCMqCKC.png"}, {"name": "Matsuki", "native": "真月", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6904-MKUH8bgoZ97q.png"}, {"name": "Misago", "native": "ミサゴ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/6905.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30004'),
('MANGA', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Part 4: Diamond is Unbreakable', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Diamond wa Kudakenai', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 ダイヤモンドは砕けない', 'In April 1999, Jotaro Kujo travels to a town in Japan called Morioh to find a young man named Josuke Higashikata, the secret love child of his grandfather, Joseph Joestar. Upon finding him, Jotaro is surprised to learn that Josuke also possesses a Stand. After their strange meeting, the pair team up to investigate the town’s proliferation of unusual Stands!', '{"Action","Adventure","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","urban-fantasy","shounen","ensemble-cast","primarily-male-cast","male-protagonist","delinquents"}', NULL, '174', '18', NULL, '1992', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 36656, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx33006-uFu4BInfxXNx.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33006-cSteTCN5clLl.jpg', '#e4f15d', 33006, '3006', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Kei Sanbe","Masato Naka"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/33006-cSteTCN5clLl.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jousuke Higashikata", "native": "東方仗助", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13085-CkmgXL7SSLxL.jpg"}, {"name": "Yoshikage Kira", "native": "吉良吉影", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12055-eCEkIVV4qoCu.png"}, {"name": "Joutarou Kuujou", "native": "空条承太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4003-gWDSEGbeOAll.png"}, {"name": "Rohan Kishibe", "native": "岸辺露伴", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12659-hgT3g7q7oHnU.png"}, {"name": "Kouichi Hirose", "native": "広瀬康一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b24496-h2oMSeBxyYUc.jpg"}, {"name": "Okuyasu Nijimura", "native": "虹村億泰", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n28991-IYMZXahuCel5.png"}, {"name": "Joseph Joestar", "native": "ジョセフ・ジョースター", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6356-RImEfUfHpC58.png"}, {"name": "Mikitaka Hasekura", "native": "支倉 未起隆", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n24819-8CoXToPvxsQ2.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '33006'),
('MANGA', 'A Sign of Affection', 'Yubisaki to Renren', 'ゆびさきと恋々', 'Yuki is a typical college student, whose world revolves around her friends, social media, and the latest sales. But when a chance encounter on a train leads to her meeting friend-of-a-friend and fellow student Itsuomi-san, her world starts to widen. But even though Itsuomi-kun can speak three languages, sign language isn’t one of them. Can the two learn to communicate the budding feelings between them?

- Ranked 17th place for the Tsugimanga Award in the Print Manga Category in 2020.

- Nominated for the 45th and 46th Kodansha Manga Award in the Shoujo Category in 2021 and 2022.

- Nominated for the 68th Shogakukan Manga Award in the Shoujo Category', '{"Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"shoujo","language-barrier","female-protagonist","disability","primarily-adult-cast","heterosexual","college"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 36559, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx111189-tvPJRVj5nGic.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/111189-SvB7s0IMtfmj.jpg', '#f1a143', 111189, '121504', '{"Suu Morishita","Christine Dashiell","Lys Blakeslee"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/111189-SvB7s0IMtfmj.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuki Itose", "native": "糸瀬雪", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179809-pxG89n30MGwl.jpg"}, {"name": "Itsuomi Nagi", "native": "波岐逸臣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b179810-E34imq24Z2Gw.jpg"}, {"name": "Oushi Ashioki", "native": "芦沖桜志", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b206489-6Ewj3mocooVc.png"}, {"name": "Rin Fujishiro", "native": "藤白りん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b206490-zXi4Z96IDuW3.png"}, {"name": "Kyouya Nagi", "native": "波岐京弥", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b206491-VP37C9wssba3.png"}, {"name": "Shin Iryuu", "native": "伊柳心", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b246023-JY3YgmQALjHM.png"}, {"name": "Emma Nakasono", "native": "中園エマ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282662-eMBZCTHgAIto.png"}, {"name": "Yasuhiro Sandanbata", "native": "三反畑康広", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b323162-Zwm0KrxsELwt.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '111189'),
('MANGA', 'The Dangers in My Heart', 'Boku no Kokoro no Yabai Yatsu', '僕の心のヤバイやつ', 'Ichikawa Kyoutarou, a boy barely clinging to the bottom rung of his school’s social ladder, secretly believes he’s the tortured lead in some psychological thriller. He spends his days dreaming up ways to disrupt his classmates’ peaceful lives and pining after Anna Yamada, the class idol. But Kyotaro’s not nearly the troubled teen he pretends to be…and it turns out Anna’s a bit odd herself!

- Winner of the Tsugi ni Kuru Web Manga 2020 Award.

- Nominee for the 2020 Manga Taisho Award.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"heterosexual","school","male-protagonist","coming-of-age","female-protagonist","shounen"}', NULL, '199', '14', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 36339, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx101557-bEJu54cmVYxx.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101557-VR51QZfL5YcW.jpg', '#f1e400', 101557, '112807', '{"Norio Sakurai","Yuuko Fukuda","Keita Takahashi"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101557-VR51QZfL5YcW.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fxxnFPhxM3o/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fxxnFPhxM3o"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Anna Yamada", "native": "山田杏奈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174190-Yl9xcIc5VTtI.jpg"}, {"name": "Kyoutarou Ichikawa", "native": "市川京太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174191-ZxpNhPXKgxhX.jpg"}, {"name": "Kana Ichikawa", "native": "市川香菜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193218-3mexVYcc0PoC.jpg"}, {"name": "Chihiro Kobayashi", "native": "小林ちひろ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b202927-bQP0mtgDeNt1.jpg"}, {"name": "Moeko Sekine", "native": "関根萌子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207168-5yke9SeJWTCw.jpg"}, {"name": "Serina Yoshida", "native": "吉田芹那", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b244631-brX66jFaOcex.jpg"}, {"name": "Shou Adachi", "native": "足立翔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297344-O1WzfeRh5o8O.png"}, {"name": "Kenta Kanzaki", "native": "神崎健太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297345-jqx12kbZeAnc.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '101557'),
('MANGA', 'The Case Study of Vanitas', 'Vanitas no Carte', 'ヴァニタスの手記', 'Rumors revolving around The Book of Vanitas, a clockwork grimoire of dubious reputation, draw Noé, a young vampire in search of a friend''s salvation, to Paris. What awaits him in the City of Flowers, however, is not long hours treading the pavement or rifling through dusty bookshops in search of the tome. Instead, his quarry comes to him...in the arms of a man claiming to be a vampire doctor! Thrust into a conflict that threatens the peace between humans and vampires, will Noé cast in his lot with the curious and slightly unbalanced Vanitas and his quest to save vampirekind?', '{"Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","historical","steampunk","primarily-adult-cast","anti-hero","class-struggle","medicine","shounen","revenge","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy","philosophy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 36109, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86568-IibEQI2zjYFl.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86568-JrSxk3Xju6xx.jpg', '#e4c91a', 86568, '93753', '{"Jun Mochizuki","Taylor Engel","Fédoua Lamodière"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86568-JrSxk3Xju6xx.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8csCE-3aAS8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8csCE-3aAS8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Vanitas", "native": "ヴァ二タス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89590-K3RdKR4VnYM4.png"}, {"name": "Noé Archiviste", "native": "ノエ・アルシヴィスト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89835-xnAJMex6Uq0U.png"}, {"name": "Jeanne", "native": "ジャンヌ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89836-xLr4mkxojjc3.png"}, {"name": "Dominique de Sade", "native": "ドミニク・ド・サド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139553-Ni2xZ2U8aPii.jpg"}, {"name": "Roland Fortis", "native": "ローラン・フォルティス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139554-kD2aBERnYQPA.png"}, {"name": "Astolfo Granatum", "native": "アストルフォ・グラナトゥム", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b145998-2aV7SZGyWXBc.png"}, {"name": "Chloé d''Apchier", "native": "クロエ・ダプシェ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b146014-lhZxoInTtvNc.jpg"}, {"name": "Murr", "native": "ムル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b146015-TTM14WCYx74X.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86568'),
('MANGA', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure Part 3: Stardust Crusaders', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Stardust Crusaders', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険スターダストクルセイダース', 'In a Japanese jail sits 17-year-old Jotaro Kujo: punk, fighter, delinquent...and possessed by a force beyond his control! Around the world, evil spirits are awakening: "Stands," monstrous invisible creatures which give their bearers incredible powers. To save his mother''s life, Jotaro must tame his dark forces and travel around the world to Cairo, Egypt, where a hundred-year-old vampire thirsts for the blood of his family. But the road is long, and an army of evil Stand Users waits to kill JoJo and his friends...', '{"Action","Adventure","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","shounen","male-protagonist","foreign","primarily-male-cast","travel","urban-fantasy","vampire","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, '152', '16', NULL, '1989', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 35919, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx30872-BZM8n264VdlV.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30872-DDSDMo6UHhvz.jpg', '#e4ae35', 30872, '872', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Kei Sanbe","Hirohisa Onikubo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30872-DDSDMo6UHhvz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Joutarou Kuujou", "native": "空条承太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4003-gWDSEGbeOAll.png"}, {"name": "Dio Brando", "native": "ディオ・ブランドー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4004-w0OtWuvjhftG.png"}, {"name": "Jean-Pierre Polnareff", "native": "ジャン＝ピエール・ポルナレフ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4368-1KToX8uSi1U1.png"}, {"name": "Joseph Joestar", "native": "ジョセフ・ジョースター", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6356-RImEfUfHpC58.png"}, {"name": "Noriaki Kakyouin", "native": "花京院典明", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/8945-gyPfrVpCb5CF.jpg"}, {"name": "Mohammed Avdol", "native": "モハメド・アヴドゥル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b8946-BumWgNGkPP9W.jpg"}, {"name": "Iggy", "native": "イギー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21089.jpg"}, {"name": "Hol Horse", "native": "ホル・ホｰス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16557-Kw9mRwSaq6ut.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30872'),
('MANGA', 'Hajime no Ippo: Fighting Spirit!', 'Hajime no Ippo', 'はじめの一歩', 'Makunouchi Ippo has been bullied his entire life. Constantly running errands and being beaten up by his classmates, Ippo has always dreamed of changing himself, but never has the passion to act upon it. One day, in the midst of yet another bullying, Ippo is saved by Takamura Mamoru, who happens to be a boxer. Ippo faints from his injuries and is brought to Takamura boxing gym to recover. As he regains consciousness, he is awed and amazed at his new surroundings in the gym, though lacks confidence to attempt anything. Takamura places a photo of Ippo’s classmate on a punching bag and forces him to punch it. It is only then that Ippo feels something stir inside him and eventually asks Takamura to train him in boxing. Thinking that Ippo does not have what it takes, Takamura gives him a task deemed impossible and gives him a one week time limit. With a sudden desire to get stronger, for himself and his hard working mother, Ippo trains relentlessly to accomplish the task within the time limit. Thus Ippo’s journey to the top of the boxing world begins.', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Sports"}', '{"boxing","shounen","male-protagonist","primarily-adult-cast","primarily-male-cast","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1989', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 35828, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx30007-jVUNk721L0Uz.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30007-lPJnvyj6zJvD.jpg', '#e49350', 30007, '7', '{"George Morikawa","Kentarou Miura","Yuuji Ninomiya"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30007-lPJnvyj6zJvD.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ippo Makunouchi", "native": "幕之内一歩", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b15-AAj73hDX9bor.jpg"}, {"name": "Mamoru Takamura", "native": "鷹村守", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b845-yzHSqt8WpnO5.png"}, {"name": "Masaru Aoki", "native": "青木勝", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b846-x62keRQk14p9.jpg"}, {"name": "Tatsuya Kimura", "native": "木村達也", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b847-Rp9l5vkXT79E.jpg"}, {"name": "Manabu Itagaki", "native": "板垣学", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5184-ZllG2KJqeuc2.jpg"}, {"name": "Genji Kamogawa", "native": "鴨川源二", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b10156-um8cGNzGHxW5.png"}, {"name": "Ryou Mashiba", "native": "間柴了", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1817-zHq0XMkq9ETg.jpg"}, {"name": "Kumi Mashiba", "native": "間柴久美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1818-9NwFptwpyihp.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30007'),
('MANGA', 'The Rising of the Shield Hero', 'Tate no Yuusha no Nariagari', '盾の勇者の成り上がり', 'Naofumi Iwatani, an uncharismatic Otaku who spends his days on games and manga, suddenly finds himself summoned to a parallel universe! He discovers he is one of four heroes equipped with legendary weapons and tasked with saving the world from its prophesied destruction. As the Shield Hero, the weakest of the heroes, all is not as it seems. Naofumi is soon alone, penniless, and betrayed. With no one to turn to, and nowhere to run, he is left with only his shield. Now, Naofumi must rise to become the legendary Shield Hero and save the world!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","bullying","anti-hero","kemonomimi","demons","male-protagonist","fugitive"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 35716, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85442-pIcvm2OjfTjR.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85442-PAkKJCoKcJSu.jpg', '#e4ae43', 85442, '67615', '{"Kyu Aiya","Aneko Yusagi","Seira Minami"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85442-PAkKJCoKcJSu.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YMNetzRhgjc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YMNetzRhgjc"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Naofumi Iwatani", "native": "岩谷尚文", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88817-Aku5CuN6wO2z.png"}, {"name": "Raphtalia", "native": "ラフタリア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88889-CWYytVbCOPsV.png"}, {"name": "Filo", "native": "フィーロ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126828-nZDnMK4Bw7f9.png"}, {"name": "Malty Melromarc", "native": "マルティ・メルロマルク", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129808-T5fd863K9TOI.png"}, {