('MANGA', 'Innocent', 'Innocent', 'イノサン', 'In the 18th century, seeking "freedom and equality," the event that gave birth to modern French society, the French Revolution, began. There was one protagonist that lived within the darkness, Charles-Henri Sanson. He was the fourth-generation head of the Sanson family, and the executioner of Paris. This is the story of a man nobly facing his harsh fate...

- Nominated for the 18th Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize "Reader Award" in 2014

- Nominated for the 8th Manga Taishou Award in 2015.', '{"Drama","Psychological"}', '{"historical","seinen","coming-of-age","foreign","gore","politics","torture","male-protagonist","philosophy","work","bisexual","female-protagonist"}', NULL, '99', '9', NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 35638, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85165-owwLAkh5RdBr.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n85165-1ra5zlLMTYeX.jpg', NULL, 85165, '58563', '{"Shinichi Sakamoto","Kaworu Ooshima","Marc Bernabé"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n85165-1ra5zlLMTYeX.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Charles-Henri Sanson", "native": "シャルル＝アンリ・サンソン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89944-byIcUL2uzDGc.png"}, {"name": "Marie-Joseph Sanson", "native": "マリー＝ジョセフ・サンソン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89943-0dglHr2tRd4z.png"}, {"name": "Subyss", "native": "スービィス ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131343-zs1dcRJkD8oK.png"}, {"name": "Jean de Chartois", "native": "ジャン・ド・シャルトワ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131344-GxQB97qwA6TO.png"}, {"name": "Nicholas-Charles Gabriel Sanson", "native": "ニコラ＝シャルル・ガブリエル・サンソン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131345-Gm7RgNnSCfqx.png"}, {"name": "Robert-Francois Damiens ", "native": "ロベール＝フランソワ・ダミアン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131346-ydiOsy9RSK9M.png"}, {"name": "Anne-Marthe-Dubut Sanson", "native": "アンヌ＝マルト・デュビュ・サンソン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n131347-SBj5EBiRs6Iu.png"}, {"name": "Earl de Chartois", "native": "シャルトワ伯爵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "ht