('MANGA', 'Usogui', 'Usogui', '嘘喰い', 'Driven by his desire for quick money, young Kaji gets involved with a loan shark and soon finds himself hounded by debt collectors. One day, a mysterious man named Baku Madarame appears before him. Calling himself a gambler, Baku boldly declares that he’ll help Kaji repay his debt—and descends into the world of underground casinos…', '{"Action","Psychological","Thriller"}', '{"gambling","death-game","primarily-adult-cast","male-protagonist","seinen","crime","philosophy","martial-arts","poker","mafia","primarily-male-cast","anti-hero"}', NULL, '539', '49', NULL, '2006', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 33661, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx39982-68LS2Z9075Kw.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/39982-NvKY73cU2h51.jpg', '#e40d28', 39982, '9982', '{"Toshio Sako"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/39982-NvKY73cU2h51.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Baku Madarame", "native": "斑目貘", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b68809-LZYV3JSwA64w.png"}, {"name": "Marco", "native": "マルコ/ロデム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b75228-2hqrQHbzL83p.png"}, {"name": "Kaji Takaomi", "native": "隆臣梶", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134946-YaQG6cpYgE3A.png"}, {"name": "Hikoichi Yakou", "native": "夜行妃古壱", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168688-NhQaRSQnFOeY.png"}, {"name": "Kyara", "native": "伽羅", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168689-w5gFu0LWJLPD.jpg"}, {"name": "Souichi Kiruma", "native": "切間創一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168690-Hr6Mw7OfjRrr.png"}, {"name": "Vincent Lalo", "native": "ビンセント・ラロ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https: