('MANGA', 'BECK', 'BECK', 'BECK', 'For the first 14 years of his life, Yukio Tanaka has been one heck of a boring guy. He has no hobbies, a weak taste in music, and only a small vestige of a personality. He yearns for an exciting life, but his shy, and somewhat neurotic personality make him his own worst enemy. Little does he know that his life will be forever changed when he meets Ryusuke Minami, a wild and unpredictable 16 year-old fresh from America, who happens to be in a rock-and-roll band named after his Frankenstein-like patched dog—Beck.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Music","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"band","coming-of-age","rock-music","male-protagonist","primarily-male-cast","shounen","foreign","heterosexual","work"}', NULL, '103', '34', NULL, '2000', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 33483, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30145-ipNuwNgD5AJS.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30145-vg1Djx1OdaLx.jpg', '#e46b5d', 30145, '145', '{"Harold Sakuishi","John K. Pe-Ta","Chikara Sakuma"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30145-vg1Djx1OdaLx.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yoshiyuki Taira", "native": "平義行", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308-4a9DDGoSiqOK.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukio Tanaka", "native": "田中幸雄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b676-fH6R0OOn5lQb.jpg"}, {"name": "Maho Minami", "native": "南真帆", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2755-HaqHwcOp17uG.jpg"}, {"name": "Ryuusuke Minami", "native": "南竜介", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4170-YlIlab0JBWv6.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuuji Sakurai", "native": "桜井裕志", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/4613.jpg"}, {"name": "Tsunemi Chiba", "native": "千葉恒美", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4946-WbPIMY0odWkT.jpg"}, {"name": "Kenichi Saitou", "native": "斉藤研一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/7395.jpg"}, {"name": "Izumi Ishiguro", "native": "石黒泉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/7396.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30145'),
('MANGA', 'Skip and Loafer', 'Skip to Loafer', 'スキップとローファー', 'Excellent student Iwakura Mitsumi has always dreamt about leaving her small town, going to a prestigious university, and making positive change in the world. But she’s so focused on reaching her goals that she’s not prepared for the very different (and overwhelming) city life that awaits her in a Tokyo high school. Luckily, she makes fast friends with Shima Sousuke, a handsome classmate who’s as laid-back as she is over-prepared. Can this naive country girl make it big in Tokyo with Sousuke by her side? 

- Nominated for the 2020 Manga Taisho Award.

- Winner of the Best General Manga category at the 47th Kodansha Manga Award in 2023.', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","female-protagonist","school","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","iyashikei","seinen","rural","urban"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 33400, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx109285-HmBZpzsO2zxd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/109285-ZJPAgX6vCwen.jpg', NULL, 109285, '118289', '{"Misaki Takamatsu","Nicole Frasik","Vanessa Satone"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/109285-ZJPAgX6vCwen.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Tzs6zBB4E-Q/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tzs6zBB4E-Q"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mitsumi Iwakura", "native": "岩倉美津未", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138851-KqCx4CjktnPl.png"}, {"name": "Sousuke Shima", "native": "志摩聡介", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138850-eqwZ11Q6sLrl.png"}, {"name": "Mika Egashira", "native": "江頭ミカ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234803-TG9zDpvgGsdC.png"}, {"name": "Yuzuki Murashige", "native": "村重結月", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138849-NAyVfRTuUi1B.png"}, {"name": "Makoto Kurume", "native": "久留米誠", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234806-IFZjaw0mSNJJ.png"}, {"name": "Fumino Toyama", "native": "遠山文乃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234805-L7wiQWESaCyy.jpg"}, {"name": "Nao", "native": "ナオ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234811-a4qkRQwypnnY.png"}, {"name": "Narumi Kanechika", "native": "兼近鳴海", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234807-KieTaKGrQ4Mg.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '109285'),
('MANGA', 'Masamune-kun’s Revenge', 'Masamune-kun no Revenge', '政宗くんのリベンジ', 'As an overweight child, Makabe Masamune was mercilessly teased and bullied by one particular girl, Adagaki Aki. Determined to one day exact his revenge upon her, Makabe begins a rigorous regimen of self-improvement and personal transformation.

Years later, Masamune reemerges as a new man. Handsome, popular, with perfect grades and good at sports, Masamune-kun transfers to Aki’s school, and is unrecognizable to her. Now, Masamune-kun is ready to confront the girl who bullied him so many years ago and humiliate her at last. But will revenge be as sweet as he thought?

Included Side Chapters:

Chapter 9.5: Investigative Report into Aki Adagaki

Chapter 12.5: A Fine Tradition of Stewardship

Chapter 14.5: Tsunade Island Incident Part 2

Chapter 20.5: Kojuurou Wants To Become A Dandy

Chapter 35.2: Piggy''s Memorial Part 2', '{"Comedy","Romance"}', '{"school","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","revenge","heterosexual","female-harem","shounen","ojou-sama","tsundere"}', NULL, '54', '10', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 33341, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx76716-wuf4DCyBf9aT.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/76716-cotonDscRojI.jpg', '#e4d635', 76716, '46716', '{"Hazuki Takeoka","Tiv","Andrew Cunningham"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/76716-cotonDscRojI.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Aki Adagaki", "native": "安達垣愛姫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b76364-ATlG8j4fx3vg.png"}, {"name": "Masamune Makabe", "native": "真壁政宗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b81967-vfprXRXeNdgq.png"}, {"name": "Chinatsu Hayase", "native": "早瀬千夏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121006-xVhr9m7OtkJV.png"}, {"name": "Tae Futaba", "native": "双葉妙", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121007-QOnQXBsJAtVe.png"}, {"name": "Yoshino Koiwai", "native": "小岩井吉乃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121008-fCtwkTJ2v2bj.png"}, {"name": "Kikune Kiba", "native": "木場菊音", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121009-NhSdNOCuJ0El.jpg"}, {"name": "Sonoka Kaneko", "native": "金子 園香", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121010-tbOk03LzlQli.png"}, {"name": "Kojuurou Shuri", "native": "朱里小十郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121011-LZJEUoqVCCxR.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '76716'),
('MANGA', 'My Broken Mariko', 'My Broken Mariko', 'マイ・ブロークン・マリコ', 'Tomoyo Shiino has stood by her friend Mariko through years of abuse, abandonment, and depression. However horrific her circumstances, their friendship has been the one reassuring constant in Mariko''s life-and Tomoyo''s too. That is, until Tomoyo is utterly blindsided by news of Mariko''s death. In life, Tomoyo felt powerless to help her best friend out of the darkness that ultimately drove her over the edge. Now, Tomoyo is determined to liberate Mariko''s ashes for one final journey together... to set free her dear, broken Mariko.

- Includes the one-shot "YISKA". 

- includes the extra "Home Sweet Home!".', '{"Drama","Psychological"}', '{"female-protagonist","suicide","coastal","primarily-adult-cast","josei","coming-of-age","primarily-female-cast","rehabilitation","philosophy","tomboy"}', NULL, '6', '1', NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 33295, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx112579-STxOi2dwQmTZ.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/112579-kU8eOqO9AI8k.jpg', '#f1e450', 112579, '123812', '{"Waka Hirako","Marc Bernabé","Amanda Haley"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/112579-kU8eOqO9AI8k.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/t2Mw8uR75CA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t2Mw8uR75CA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tomoyo Shiino", "native": "シイノトモヨ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b192314-EXcLV6NjTF9D.png"}, {"name": "Mariko Ikagawa", "native": "イカガワマリコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208319-waQoc4xLxXDl.png"}, {"name": "Makio", "native": "マキオ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b292195-0v3K7guOfZyw.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '112579'),
('MANGA', 'Parasyte', 'Kiseijuu', '寄生獣', 'They arrive in silence and darkness. They descend from the skies. They have a hunger for human flesh. They are everywhere. They are parasites, alien creatures who must invade–and take control of–a human host to survive. And once they have infected their victims, they can assume any deadly form they choose: monsters with giant teeth, winged demons, creatures with blades for hands. But most have chosen to conceal their lethal purpose behind ordinary human faces. So no one knows their secret–except an ordinary high school student. Shin is battling for control of his own body against an alien parasite, but can he find a way to warn humanity of the horrors to come?', '{"Action","Drama","Horror","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"male-protagonist","seinen","body-horror","aliens","shapeshifting","super-power","environmental","gore","philosophy"}', NULL, '64', '10', NULL, '1989', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 33082, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30401-siY6wmwnHFi6.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30401-QDlISnJA72Jz.jpg', '#f1a128', 30401, '401', '{"Hitoshi Iwaaki","Marc Bernabé","Andrew Cunningham"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30401-QDlISnJA72Jz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shinichi Izumi", "native": "泉新一", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12323-NAoqDYOn2RSo.png"}, {"name": "Migi", "native": "ミギー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13773-Kuak0WTeTU9z.png"}, {"name": "Ryouko Tamiya", "native": "田宮良子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16586-5BBzHsx1GLGC.jpg"}, {"name": "Kana Kimishima", "native": "君嶋加奈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19215-oei5N1hu9w9w.png"}, {"name": "Satomi Murano", "native": "村野里美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19436-d9ImDTVNQPKt.jpg"}, {"name": "A", "native": "A", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/22141-dAU9uVjF2nae.jpg"}, {"name": "Kazuyuki Izumi", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/22142-vlmihBFr4G0g.jpg"}, {"name": "Nobuko Izumi", "native": "泉信子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/22143-MTuyh4Ab0ruH.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30401'),
('MANGA', 'Citrus', 'citrus', 'citrus', 'Yuzuko Aihara, a high school girl whose main interests are fashion, friends and having fun, is about to get a reality check. Due to her mom’s remarriage, Yuzu has transferred to a new, all-girls school that is extremely strict. Her real education is about to begin.

From Day One, happy-go-lucky Yuzu makes enemies, namely the beautiful yet stern Student Council President Mei. So what happens when a dejected Yuzu returns home and discovers the shock of her life: that Mei is actually her new step-sister who has come to live with her? Even more surprising, when Mei catches Yuzu off-guard and kisses her out of the blue, what does it all mean?', '{"Drama","Romance"}', '{"yuri","female-protagonist","inseki","primarily-female-cast","cohabitation","school","gyaru","lgbtq-themes","family-life"}', NULL, '50', '10', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 32722, '70', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx80145-PeU7lVLC4d4Z.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n80145-HpdWU7sYpq8K.jpg', '#e4bba1', 80145, '50145', '{"Saburouta","Amber Tamosaitis","Roland Amago"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n80145-HpdWU7sYpq8K.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vHbgHyYiivc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vHbgHyYiivc"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mei Aihara", "native": "藍原芽衣", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83209-gv2ABy7LBr5x.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuzu Aihara", "native": "藍原柚子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83367-qOJp0tfOZf7r.jpg"}, {"name": "Harumi Taniguchi", "native": "谷口はるみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b83387-UImdNRsseICO.jpg"}, {"name": "Matsuri Mizusawa", "native": "水沢まつり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88667-1uLbk7yHhnz6.jpg"}, {"name": "Himeko Momokino", "native": "桃木野 姫子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88668-Hbg8rf8f6Iwv.png"}, {"name": "Shiraho Suzuran", "native": "鈴蘭白帆", "role": "SUP