('MANGA', 'Insomniacs After School', 'Kimi wa Houkago Insomnia', '君は放課後インソムニア', 'Unable to sleep at night, Ganta Nakami is cranky in class and unpopular with his classmates. He discovers that the school observatory, once used by the now-defunct astronomy club, may be the perfect place for a nap—but he’s not alone. Fellow insomniac Isaki Magari is willing to share the observatory with Nakami, and a friendship between the two begins as they bond over the most unlikely of things.', '{"Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","astronomy","iyashikei","heterosexual","school","school-club","photography","seinen","disability","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","outdoor-activities"}', NULL, '125', '14', NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 32378, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx110473-igM02JDDzQXM.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/110473-Fr0nJcGMmsrR.jpg', '#e45d50', 110473, '121213', '{"Makoto Ojiro","Óscar Tejero","Studio Charon"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/110473-Fr0nJcGMmsrR.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/R_wY8rFouBI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R_wY8rFouBI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ganta Nakami", "native": "中見丸太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161229-pdxEqMtNRlPI.png"}, {"name": "Isaki Magari", "native": "曲伊咲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161230-KUMSejEwkCoD.png"}, {"name": "Two-chan", "native": "ツーちゃん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b304942-5QpZDKKL2VvC.png"}, {"name": "Usako Kurashiki", "native": "倉敷兎子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161231-kYhTo8I2XysD.png"}, {"name": "Yui Shiromaru", "native": "白丸結", "role": "SUP