('MANGA', 'My Dearest Self With Malice Aforethought', 'Shinai naru Boku e Satsui wo Komete', '親愛なる僕へ殺意をこめて', 'Eiji the college-age virgin dreams of someday having a girlfriend...until he wakes up one day with his "girlfriend" in his bed with him! Not only that, his buddy tells him he got in a fight...and that three days have passed that Eiji doesn''t remember? What dark secrets are being hidden...by Eiji himself?', '{"Drama","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Slice of Life","Thriller"}', '{"crime","seinen","amnesia","denpa","detective","male-protagonist","gore","gangs","nudity","college","orphan"}', NULL, '98', '11', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 32115, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx106867-exeApKyXHJNH.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106867-G2GPTdHU8bLm.jpg', '#f1c9ae', 106867, '115746', '{"Hajime Inoryu","Shouta Itou","Jacqueline Fung"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106867-G2GPTdHU8bLm.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Eiji Urashima", "native": "浦島英二", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259880-wCBWmZZTptkI.jpg"}, {"name": "Kyouka Yukimura", "native": "雪村京歌", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259882-jKzFBXVcCnD9.jpg"}, {"name": "Kiichi Urashima", "native": "浦島喜一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259883-X4cXgqvZjAYV.png"}, {"name": "Rei Shinmyouji", "native": "真明寺麗", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259884-qGxPOC5uGj90.png"}, {"name": "Momoi", "native": "桃井", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259885-wDMnLBBbUFzX.png"}, {"name": "Yashiro Sai", "native": "佐井社", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259887-WaZGuG