('MANGA', 'Gin Tama', 'Gintama', '銀魂', 'The samurai didn''t stand a chance. First, the aliens invaded Japan. Next, they took all the jobs. And then they confiscated everyone''s swords. So what does a hotheaded former samurai like Sakata "Gin" Gintoki do to make ends meet? Take any odd job that comes his way, even if it means losing his dignity.

Included Bonus Chapters:

Volume 1: Dandelion (One-shot).

Volume 2: Shirokuro (One-shot).

Volume 24: 13 (One-shot).

Volume 38: Bankara-san Ga Tooru (One-shot).

Volume 41: Special Lesson.', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Sci-Fi"}', '{"found-family","parody","samurai","meta","swordplay","male-protagonist","aliens","philosophy","episodic","shounen","space","historical"}', NULL, '709', '77', NULL, '2003', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 31937, '86', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30044-vPmoz3vTPvZs.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30044-3Q6rPDp3ZBIZ.jpg', '#e4435d', 30044, '44', '{"Hideaki Sorachi","Kenta Shinohara","Youichi Amano"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30044-3Q6rPDp3ZBIZ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z7bw5wBafu8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7bw5wBafu8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gintoki Sakata", "native": "坂田銀時", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b672-cP5VPriN67xJ.png"}, {"name": "Shinpachi Shimura", "native": "志村新八", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b673-nScArSMt85kd.jpg"}, {"name": "Kagura", "native": "神楽", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b674-w8wCh0A5Qa8R.png"}, {"name": "Kotarou Katsura", "native": "桂小太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1533-tSqUrj2DOK5p.png"}, {"name": "Ayame Sarutobi", "native": "猿飛あやめ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n1759-hbviRHbxGNmx.jpg"}, {"name": "Sougo Okita", "native": "沖田総悟", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2282-X0uYqwmwxiPo.png"}, {"name": "Toushirou Hijikata", "native": "土方十四郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2650-zgkj5l8mIOnn.png"}, {"name": "Sadaharu", "native": "定春", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.an