('MANGA', 'Takopi''s Original Sin', 'Takopii no Genzai', 'タコピーの原罪', 'Takopi travels from his home of Happy Planet to spread happiness across Earth, but meets the unsmiling Shizuka upon landing. Her friends at school and home life seem to be the source of her somber expression—and the pure-hearted Takopi is determined to change things for the better! But what truths await him when the curtains rise in this shocking drama?!', '{"Drama","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"bullying","aliens","denpa","primarily-child-cast","female-protagonist","shounen"}', NULL, '16', '2', NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 31795, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx142568-xPC5wQPxTV1s.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/142568-dHr6C2u01Pp0.jpg', '#e4355d', 142568, '142600', '{"Taizan 5","Gandalf Bartholomäus","Manon Debienne"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/142568-dHr6C2u01Pp0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vsPbfdv41-w/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vsPbfdv41-w"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shizuka Kuze", "native": "久世しずか", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266369-vhLyGsVBIlAT.jpg"}, {"name": "Takopi", "native": "タコピー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266372-zUgh0xxukbW8.png"}, {"name": "Marina Kirarazaka", "native": "雲母坂まりな", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266370-OClTuCBxS13v.jpg"}, {"name": "Naoki Azuma", "native": "東直樹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266371-8ytjDeW2vHba.jpg"}, {"name": "Chappy", "native": "チャッピー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b269156-P38kNe4mVCne.png"}, {"name": "Junya Azuma", "native": "東潤也", 