('MANGA', 'Goblin Slayer', 'Goblin Slayer', 'ゴブリンスレイヤー', 'A young priestess joins her first adventuring party but almost immediately encounters the most unspeakable horrors. Rescued by an enigmatic warrior called Goblin Slayer, she partners with her savior on his mission to exterminate all goblins-by any means necessary. When rumors of Goblin Slayer''s feats begin circulating, there''s no telling who might come calling next...', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"seinen","revenge","goblin","gore","male-protagonist","anti-hero","swordplay"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 31401, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx87321-ijdB0SNr1JSs.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87321-lV4TLFKrDTGv.jpg', '#e49343', 87321, '98720', '{"Kumo Kagyuu","Kousuke Kurose","Noboru Kannatsuki"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/87321-lV4TLFKrDTGv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lEW9v1H2HlQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lEW9v1H2HlQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Goblin Slayer", "native": "ゴブリンスレイヤー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126458-wCulCEFEPZSK.png"}, {"name": "Onna Shinkan", "native": "女神官", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126483-NQuBqaXHUJO2.jpg"}, {"name": "Yousei Yunde", "native": "妖精弓手", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126457-leHoOLIOZy2a.png"}, {"name": "Ushikai Musume", "native": "牛飼娘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/126484-izE4ON548jnn.jpg"}, {"name": "Uketsuke-jou", "native": "受付嬢", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/126485-2zo57ux4EMeC.jpg"}, {"name": "Majo", "native": "魔