('MANGA', 'Battle Angel Alita', 'GUNNM', '銃夢', 'In a dump in the lawless settlement of Scrapyard, far beneath the mysterious space city of Zalem, disgraced cyber-doctor Daisuke Ido makes a strange find: the detached head of a cyborg woman who has lost all her memories. He names her Gally and equips her with a powerful new body, the Berserker. While Gally remembers no details of her former life, a moment of desperation reawakens in her nerves the legendary school of martial arts known as Panzer Kunst. In a place where there is no justice but what people make for themselves, Gally decides to become a hunter-killer, tracking down and taking out those who prey on the weak. But can she hold onto her humanity as she begins to revel in her own bloodlust?', '{"Action","Sci-Fi"}', '{"cyberpunk","female-protagonist","amnesia","seinen","dystopian","robots","desert","post-apocalyptic","gore","cyborg","martial-arts","nudity"}', NULL, '54', '9', NULL, '1990', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 31319, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30768-CQ5ITQ2YAX7R.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30768-UlYUVEc0Gsrb.jpg', '#e45d35', 30768, '768', '{"Yukito Kishiro","Marc Bernabé","Stephen Paul"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30768-UlYUVEc0Gsrb.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gally", "native": "ガリィ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2308-WaUcHYfleGsb.png"}, {"name": "Sechs", "native": "ゼクス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5773-54g7Qq0B2rgz.png"}, {"name": "Desty Nova", "native": "ディスティ・ノヴァ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6544-fveQ86tAJUO0.png"}, {"name": "Ido Daisuke", "native": "イド・ダイスケ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6545-DJcvZ5Y6tLOq.png"}, {"name": "Figure Four", "native": "フォギア・フォア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6547-81PAC0EfL6oh.png"}, {"name": "Den", "native": "電", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/6548.jpg"}, {"name": "Koyomi K", "native": "コヨミ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b6550-XwkXS5WeoDDd.jpg"}, {"name": "Shumira", "native": "シュミラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/6552.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30768'),
('MANGA', 'The Fable', 'The Fable', 'ザ・ファブル', 'When you''re the infamous prodigy hitman known only as “Fable,” many things come easy. Being a normal person, however, isn''t one of them. In fact, being told that he can''t kill anyone for a while may just be the hardest job Fable’s ever taken...', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"yakuza","seinen","urban","assassins","crime","guns","primarily-adult-cast","surreal-comedy","found-family","nudity","survival","disability"}', NULL, '240', '22', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 31194, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx94490-rdtpGHQHOHHC.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/94490-O4saIjLvj85W.jpg', '#d6a16b', 94490, '87844', '{"Katsuhisa Minami","Adam Hirsch","Arbash Mughal"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/94490-O4saIjLvj85W.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Fable", "native": "ファブル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b173771-wgOorCDjqQhR.png"}, {"name": "Youko Satou", "native": "佐藤洋子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188618-TQU2Ks0LeEby.png"}, {"name": "Yuukari", "native": "ユーカリ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b285640-fZUOil07ja8Y.png"}, {"name": "Hiroshi Hamada", "native": "浜田広志", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b290486-2zTROFDQhLER.png"}, {"name": "Satoshi Ebihara", "native": "海老原剛士", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b290548-P3DNSwNML0Qc.png"}, {"name": "Misaki Shimizu", "native": "清水岬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b290549-HpZmurU0M81K.png"}, {"name": "Boss", "native": "ボス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b292104-jbmhvwmUqUpK.png"}, {"name": "Yamaoka", "native": "山岡", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b292105-clJCpmVkqG8i.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '94490'),
('MANGA', 'Watashitachi no Shiawase na Jikan', 'Watashitachi no Shiawase na Jikan', '私たちの幸せな時間', '"I have something I don''t want to lose"

"So much so that these terrible feelings have grown."

A pianist who attempted suicide 3 times, Juri, is taken to help her aunt at a prison where murderers who killed indiscriminately are sentenced to death. There, she meets a man named Yuu who took the lives of 3 people. A mother''s antagonism--a brother''s death... Together they embrace the violent rebellion in their hearts caused by the large, deep scars they carry. However, before long, they both embrace an earnest hope in their hearts. "I want to live"...

An adaptation of novel by South Korea''s most popular female novelist, Gong Ji-Young.', '{"Drama","Music","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"female-protagonist","seinen","rehabilitation","philosophy","primarily-adult-cast","heterosexual","prison","suicide"}', NULL, '8', '1', NULL, '2008', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 31110, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/11734.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/41734-yHdPG2TjEOQ3.jpg', '#febb50', 41734, '11734', '{"Sumomo Yumeka","Ji-Young Gong"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/41734-yHdPG2TjEOQ3.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuu", "native": "優", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/28263.jpg"}, {"name": "Juri Mutou", "native": "武藤樹里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/28264.jpg"}, {"name": "Monica", "native": "モニカ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/31162.jpg"}, {"name": "Jirou Inoue", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/35096.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '41734'),
('MANGA', 'Teasing Master Takagi-san', 'Karakai Jouzu no Takagi-san', 'からかい上手の高木さん', 'Middle schooler Nishikata has had it with his classmate Takagi--the chronic teaser who sits nearby. Day in and day out, she comes after him with every sort of trick or prank. Even when he tries to get her back, she''s always one step ahead. But rest assured, it''s only the beginning. He''s not about to give up that easily in this battle of cunning and youth!', '{"Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"school","slapstick","primarily-child-cast","heterosexual","shounen","episodic"}', NULL, '190', '20', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 31009, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85533-lrXvNT9iH9sY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85533-XGpHOVawHcU0.jpg', '#c9d6f1', 85533, '78537', '{"Souichirou Yamamoto","Thibaud Desbief","Taylor Engel"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85533-XGpHOVawHcU0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nishikata", "native": "西片", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/120799-175LQCsgpSJk.jpg"}, {"name": "Takagi", "native": "高木", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/120800-fZe52KrIKqv6.jpg"}, {"name": "Mano", "native": "真野", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128606-mXAI7pwWuCE7.png"}, {"name": "Nakai", "native": "中井", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128607-Yp2bNIh9Wfl4.jpg"}, {"name": "Mina Hibino", "native": "日比野ミナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128608-j1uRTq46p5XJ.jpg"}, {"name": "Tanabe-sensei", "native": "田辺先生", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128609-YITeO7eJEarZ.jpg"}, {"name": "Kimura", "native": "木村", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128610-guKKI3hp3vB3.jpg"}, {"name": "Sanae Tsukimoto", "native": "月本サナエ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128611-lehh3l21kXm1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85533'),
('MANGA', 'A Bride''s Story', 'Otoyomegatari', '乙嫁語り', 'A Bride’s Story tells the tale of a beautiful young bride in nineteenth-century Asia. At the age of twenty, Amir is sent to a neighboring town to be wed. But her surprise at learning her new husband, Karluk, is eight years younger than her is quickly replaced by a deep affection for the boy and his family. Though she hails from just beyond the mountains, Amir’s clan had very different customs, foods, and clothes from what Karluk is used to. As the two of them learn more about each other through their day-to-day lives, the bond of respect and love grows stronger.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"ensemble-cast","historical","marriage","female-protagonist","heterosexual","travel","seinen","foreign","indigenous-cultures","arranged-marriage","iyashikei","desert"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2008', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 30697, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx41514-IHeXFwqmWivk.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n41514-U16n5eHLy1of.jpg', '#e4d6ae', 41514, '11514', '{"Kaoru Mori","William Flanagan","Yohan Leclerc"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n41514-U16n5eHLy1of.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-yO7Ybp91WA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yO7Ybp91WA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Amir Halgal", "native": "アミル・ハルガル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b26120-QSklJtiQj84L.png"}, {"name": "Karluk Eihon", "native": "カルルク・エイホン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b26121-abjcDaa42aPg.png"}, {"name": "Pariya Togonosh", "native": "パリヤ・トゴノシュ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b46767-JPkUqxplStak.png"}, {"name": "Henry Smith", "native": "ヘンリー・スミス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b59461-U5JXk2eGLPyk.jpg"}, {"name": "Rostem", "native": "ロステム", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/79563-T9jVV4KyUvch.png"}, {"name": "Azel Halgal", "native": "アゼル・ハルガル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b85349-BYDZ9N4n2fba.png"}, {"name": "Yusuf", "native": "ユスフ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121120-13lhFv5ZdaQ0.jpg"}, {"name": "Seleke", "native": "セイレケ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '41514'),
('MANGA', 'Banana Fish', 'BANANA FISH', 'BANANA FISH', 'Nature made Ash Lynx beautiful; nurture made him a cold ruthless killer. A runaway brought up as the adopted heir and sex toy of "Papa" Dino Golzine, Ash, now at the rebellious age of seventeen, forsakes the kingdom held out by the devil who raised him. But the hideous secret that drove Ash''s older brother mad in Vietnam has suddenly fallen into Papa''s insatiably ambitious hands--and it''s exactly the wrong time for Eiji Okamura, a pure-hearted young photographer from Japan, to make Ash Lynx''s acquaintance...', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Psychological","Thriller"}', '{"mafia","gangs","crime","drugs","noir","primarily-male-cast","shoujo","revenge","criminal-organization","ensemble-cast","anti-hero","fugitive"}', NULL, '110', '19', NULL, '1985', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 30656, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30756-rlxjQWBAizHX.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30756-raw9tFTKi9cQ.jpg', '#ffbb35', 30756, '756', '{"Akimi Yoshida","Marc Bernabé","Rachel Thorn"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30756-raw9tFTKi9cQ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Rm54hW42O10/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rm54hW42O10"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ash Lynx", "native": "アッシュ・リンクス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13580-1J7PwIB8kTpu.png"}, {"name": "Eiji Okumura", "native": "奥村英二", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21928-4zjiuRL3omAo.jpg"}, {"name": "Sing Soo-Ling", "native": "シン・スウ・リン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b29567-GC7gU6v0tPK5.jpg"}, {"name": "Max Lobo", "native": "マックス・ロボ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/lar