('MANGA', 'Zom 100: Bucket List of the Dead', 'Zom 100: Zombie ni Naru Made ni Shitai 100 no Koto', 'ゾン100 ～ゾンビになるまでにしたい100のこと～', 'Surviving a zombie apocalypse beats being a wage slave any day! After spending years slaving away for a soul-crushing company, Akira''s life has lost its luster. He lives in a trash-filled apartment, his pay is abysmal, and he can''t even muster up the nerve to confess his love to his beautiful co-worker. But when a zombie apocalypse ravages his town, it gives him the push he needs to live for himself. Now Akira''s on a mission to complete all 100 items on his bucket list before he...well, kicks the bucket.', '{"Action","Comedy","Horror"}', '{"zombie","primarily-adult-cast","post-apocalyptic","pandemic","male-protagonist","surreal-comedy","slapstick","seinen","survival","work","heterosexual","gore"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 30604, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx104660-NZZdpLJlgHle.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/104660-dBf2eJ0bjZQ9.jpg', '#fe2886', 104660, '122392', '{"Haro Aso","Koutarou Takata","Nova Skipper"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/104660-dBf2eJ0bjZQ9.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SmE6xUZDD_o/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SmE6xUZDD_o"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Akira Tendou", "native": "天道輝", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214584-4zsaqbOP55bf.png"}, {"name": "Kenichirou Ryuuzaki", "native": "竜崎憲一郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214583-akJm3W589tEd.png"}, {"name": "Shizuka Mikazuki", "native": "三日月閑", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214582-k5Bcd0DB59ik.jpg"}, {"name": "Beatrix Amerhauser", "native": "ベアトリクス・アメルハウザー", "r