('MANGA', 'So I''m a Spider, So What?', 'Kumo desu ga, Nani ka?', '蜘蛛ですが、なにか？', 'I''m gonna survive, just watch me! I was your average, everyday high-school girl, but now I''ve been reborn in a magical world...as a spider?! Wait--this isn''t how these stories are supposed to go! Can I get a do-over? ...No? But how am I supposed to survive in this big, scary dungeon as one of the weakest monsters? It''s ''every spider for herself'' in here! I gotta figure out the rules to this QUICK, or I''ll have to kiss my short second life goodbye...', '{"Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","monster-girl","seinen","female-protagonist","anti-hero","demons","elf","ensemble-cast","medieval","travel","anthropomorphism","magic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 30241, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86952-ah2w3DFY2Uek.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86952-Yn4MlS3MqXMz.jpg', NULL, 86952, '95353', '{"Okina Baba","Asahiro Kakashi","Tsukasa Kiryuu"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86952-Yn4MlS3MqXMz.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uWKJr7OnOYQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uWKJr7OnOYQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kumoko", "native": "蜘蛛子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122124-6ymNNXYfvyXO.png"}, {"name": "Ariel", "native": "アリエル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130477-Szp3TMGbCCab.png"}, {"name": "Wrath", "native": "ラース", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130478-AwSSj9UXo7ht.png"}, {"name": "Sophia Keren", "native": "ソフィア・ケレン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b130482-ot2Zp8BKIUOy.png"}, {"name": "Potimas Harrifenas", "native": "ポティマス・ハァイフェナス", 