('MANGA', 'Ichi the Witch', 'Madan no Ichi', '魔男のイチ', 'Magic is alive and well in the world, inside beings known as Majiks. By completing a Majik’s trial, a Witch can gain its power. However, only women can become Witches or use magical items. All that changes one day when a young man named Ichi turns the world on its head by defeating an infamous Majik and gaining its magical powers!

- Winner of the 2025 Next Manga Award in the Print Manga Category.

- Ranked 11th in Da Vinci''s 2025 Book of the Year ranking.

- Ranked 4th in the Men''s Division of Takarajimasha''s Kono Manga ga Sugoi! 2026 guidebook.

- Ranked 10th in the 19th Manga Taisho in 2026.

- Nominated for the 50th Kodansha Manga Award in the Shounen Category in 2026.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","witch","male-protagonist","found-family","demons","shounen","anachronism","matriarchy","primarily-female-cast","anthropomorphism"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 29849, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx180752-13CVO310XiEs.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/180752-Mt5DCo1mryj8.jpg', '#e48643', 180752, '173944', '{"Osamu Nishi","Shiro Usazaki","Yuuki Akou"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/180752-Mt5DCo1mryj8.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TheTgr6zTdI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TheTgr6zTdI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ichi", "native": "イチ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344548-sEYgqUM1ebqP.png"}, {"name": "Desscaras", "native": "デスカラス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344549-4NDWaiicmiSx.jpg"}, {"name": "Kumugi Harvest", "native": "クムギ・ハーヴェスト", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b347919-LTbnxxa9Ozmq.png"}, {"name": "Gokuraku Kagami", "native": "ゴクラク・カガミ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b357302-4LmJR9shkUA4.png"}, {"name": "Uroro", "native": "ウロロ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344557-YTJeKNYdiLjm.png"}, {"name": "Monegold", "native": "マネーゴールド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344558-V6n2Tam3EUwc.png"}, {"name": "Circos", "native": "キルコス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b350578-Ks56OktRjySL.png"}, {"name": "Shirabedonna", "native": "シラベドンナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b347920-A30HdZBEAiq8.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '180752'),
('MANGA', 'Erased', 'Boku dake ga Inai Machi', '僕だけがいない街', 'Twenty-nine-year-old Satoru Fujinuma is floundering through life. Amid his daily drudgery, he finds himself in the grip of an incredible, inexplicable, and uncontrollable phenomenon that rewinds time, a condition that seems to only make his drab life worse. But then, one day, everything changes. A terrible incident forever changes Satoru''s life as he knows it...and with it, comes a "Revival" that sends Satoru eighteen years into the past!

In the body of his boyhood self, Satoru encounters sights he never imagined he would see again--the smile of his mother, alive and well, his old friends, and Kayo Hinazuki, the girl who was kidnapped and murdered when he was a boy the first time around. To return to the present and prevent the tragedy that brought him back to his childhood in the first place, Satoru begins plotting a way to change Hinazuki''s fate...But up against the clock and a faceless evil, does eleven-year-old Satoru even stand a chance?

 - Was nominated for the 18th Tezuka Osamu Cultural Prize Reader Award in 2014 and for the 7th, 8th and 9th Manga Taisho Award between 2014 and 2016. Also nominated for the 40th Kodansha Manga Awards in 2016.

- Volume 9 contains the 5-chapter “Boku Dake ga Inai Machi:Re” side story.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"crime","primarily-child-cast","age-regression","male-protagonist","school","seinen","detective","revenge","bullying","writing","snowscape"}', NULL, '49', '9', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 29640, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx69325-17ud19Cg0xIO.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/69325-TfZeFpcMbstp.jpg', '#e45043', 69325, '39325', '{"Kei Sanbe","Sheldon Drzka","Denis Kimura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/69325-TfZeFpcMbstp.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Satoru Fujinuma", "native": "藤沼悟", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89275-xCGzh6jAGe2v.png"}, {"name": "Kayo Hinazuki", "native": "雛月加代", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89276-LjlYvXfOnjHB.jpg"}, {"name": "Sachiko Fujinuma", "native": "藤沼佐知子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89326-zNVEqTuDt7kL.jpg"}, {"name": "Airi Katagiri", "native": "片桐愛梨", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89355-w1xEKGHisGWE.jpg"}, {"name": "Kazu", "native": "カズ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89356-O2NYct6HMlYj.png"}, {"name": "Kenya Kobayashi", "native": "小林賢也", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89357-E9erSMef5EJC.png"}, {"name": "Osamu", "native": "修", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89358-FA7IQL7z0MvL.jpg"}, {"name": "Jun Shiratori", "native": "白鳥潤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89359-xsqTQviyS5Ii.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', 