('MANGA', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: The JOJOLands', 'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: The JOJOLands', 'ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 The JOJOLands', 'The stage is set on a volcanic island in the Pacific Ocean, Hawaii. Jodio Joestar, a young boy living on Oahu Island, harbors the ambition to become a great millionaire. The clue to his goal lies in reaching the pinnacle of the mechanisms of this world. What means will he choose to achieve his objective?', '{"Action","Adventure","Supernatural"}', '{"crime","super-power","seinen","foreign","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast","espionage","anti-hero","urban-fantasy","coastal","body-horror","crossdressing"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 29636, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx138072-G9PrTnqb8CRI.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/138072-pEOL4iKZfIdO.jpg', '#f1d628', 138072, '139629', '{"Hirohiko Araki","Masato Shindou"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/138072-pEOL4iKZfIdO.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mBfyiYuxbM4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mBfyiYuxbM4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jodio Joestar", "native": "ジョディオ・ジョースタ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298895-spg2mlUaQiGv.png"}, {"name": "Dragona Joestar", "native": "ドラゴナ・ジョースター", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298896-0m6KVKgh5Ri1.png"}, {"name": "Paco Laburantes", "native": "パコ・ラブランテス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298904-8ciZpIrAEv1c.png"}, {"name": "Usagi Alohaoe", "native": "ウサギ・アロハオエ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b306164-IKp6R2BZELGY.png"}, {"name": "Charming Man", "native": "チャーミング・マン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anili