('MANGA', 'Whisper Me a Love Song', 'Sasayaku You ni Koi wo Utau', 'ささやくように恋を唄う', 'Bubbly, energetic first-year high school student Himari falls head over heels for her senpai Yori after hearing her band perform on the first day of school. Himari tells Yori she just loves her, and to Himari''s surprise, Yori says she loves Himari back! But when Himari realizes that she and her senpai are feeling two different kinds of love, she begins to ask herself what "love" really means...

- Eighteenth place of Tsugimanga 2020 Award in the Manga Category

- First place in Yuri Navi’s best Yuri Manga of 2020', '{"Drama","Music","Romance"}', '{"yuri","primarily-female-cast","female-protagonist","band","lgbtq-themes","school-club","school","primarily-teen-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 29625, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx107987-p5l7uOOecd3I.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107987-aFoxujs14S6n.jpg', '#f15dae', 107987, '118625', '{"Eku Takeshima","Kevin Steinbach","Xiao Tian Ye"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107987-aFoxujs14S6n.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9jXCgJ-nIDA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9jXCgJ-nIDA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Himari Kino", "native": "木野ひまり", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167670-0eRqT1USWPXm.png"}, {"name": "Yori Asanagi", "native": "朝凪依", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167671-iAX3XLqTQnbu.png"}, {"name": "Miki Mizuguchi", "native": "水口未希", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215498-EH9bqbwGwof0.jpg"}, {"name": "Shiho Izumi", "native": "泉志帆", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215602-3At6W8NEQlO0.png"}, {"name": "Momoka Satomiya", "native": "里宮百々花", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215603-0SgtzCg6a7ky.png"}, {"name": "Mari Tsutsui", "native": "筒井真理", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215604-A4MwAk4jXPLK.png"}, {"name": "Kaori Tachibana", "native": "橘香織", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215605-XyKpDi5yYAED.png"}, {"name": "Aki Mizuguchi", "native": "水口亜季", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215606-W0wleEA2NRd8.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '107987'),
('MANGA', 'Undead Unluck', 'Undead Unluck', 'アンデッドアンラック', 'What happens when an unlucky girl meets an undead guy? Pure chaos!

All Fuuko wants is a passionate romance like the one in her favorite shojo manga. Unfortunately, her Unluck ability makes that impossible. But just as Fuuko hits rock bottom, Andy sweeps her off her feet—literally! Now she’s become Andy’s unwilling test subject as he works to find a way to trigger a stroke of Unluck big enough to kill him for good. However, when the pair discovers a secret organization is hunting them, it puts Andy’s burial plans on hold.

- Winner of the 6th Next Manga Award in the Print Manga Category in 2020.

- Includes five extra chapters.', '{"Action","Comedy","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","shounen","female-protagonist","primarily-adult-cast","urban-fantasy","kaiju","heterosexual","male-protagonist","gore","martial-arts","ensemble-cast"}', NULL, '244', '27', NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 29571, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx114791-Rj07uWUnsgLY.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/114791-NPjwp1AgS0d3.jpg', '#f15da1', 114791, '123956', '{"Yoshifumi Tozuka","Takuma Tateishi","Takuya Tsuzuki"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/114791-NPjwp1AgS0d3.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D5FcrPWefAU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D5FcrPWefAU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Andy", "native": "アンディ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158749-W1XmNGmRJphS.png"}, {"name": "Fuuko Izumo", "native": "出雲風子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158750-VTbFjpOOnmu5.png"}, {"name": "Shen Xiang", "native": "シェン・シアン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b160089-NDVQurh5CEDL.png"}, {"name": "Gina  Chamber", "native": "ジーナ・チェンバー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161088-9XwIEeIIyO55.png"}, {"name": "Tatiana", "native": "タチアナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167313-xxvUs7qjCrXH.png"}, {"name": "Isshin", "native": "一心", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167314-8KcXuI46rsRP.png"}, {"name": "Nico Vorgeil", "native": "ニコ・フォーゲイル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167315-1lURktYbez7i.png"}, {"name": "Billy Alfred", "native": "ビリー＝アルフレッド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167316-a0Ro68jFh0Ga.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '114791'),
('MANGA', 'Mushishi', 'Mushishi', '蟲師', 'Some live in the deep darkness behind your eyelids. Some eat silence. Some thoughtlessly kill. Some simply drive men mad. They are known as mushi—creatures that came into being shortly after life emerged from the primordial ooze. They still exist parallel to our own lives and can only be seen by a select few. As a mushishi, Ginko is one of the few who are aware of their existence, and this young man with a sardonic smile roams from place to place with the knowledge and skill to aid those unwittingly affected by mushi.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"travel","episodic","environmental","youkai","rural","seinen","mythology","eco-horror","iyashikei","philosophy","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '50', '10', NULL, '1999', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 29569, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30418-8unnG2Y01lXX.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30418-VPxoz8CyditN.jpg', '#f1e486', 30418, '418', '{"Yuki Urushibara","William Flanagan","Olinda Cordukes"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30418-VPxoz8CyditN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ginko", "native": "ギンコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b425-khK03T5n9Umq.png"}, {"name": "Adashino", "native": "化野", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4071-RXY16EmCYjVr.png"}, {"name": "Nui", "native": "ぬい", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b5167-DreoKnv7XdOS.jpg"}, {"name": "Tanyuu Karibusa", "native": "狩房淡幽", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b13714-WP9UOIjZrD8j.png"}, {"name": "Amane", "native": "周", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19464-52vCvJeOXqIk.png"}, {"name": "Kourou", "native": "虹郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b19708-Yb2SG4UiR1Bb.png"}, {"name": "Biki", "native": "ビキ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/20108.jpg"}, {"name": "Shinra Ioroi", "native": "五百蔵しんら", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b23764-ZSj7YZM871u8.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30418'),
('MANGA', 'Ashita no Joe: Fighting for Tomorrow', 'Ashita no Joe', 'あしたのジョー', 'A young drifter named Joe Yabuki wanders through the slums of Tokyo, but when the local ruffians try to give him a hard time he teaches them a rough lesson with his fists. The spectacle sparks a gleam in the eye of an old drunk who happens to be watching—Danpei Tange, a failed boxer and former coach who sees something special in the boy. He pleads with Joe to train with him off, but the cocky young fighter brushes him. Later, though, when Joe is arrested and put in a juvenile detention facility, he realizes that he’s going to need to hone his raw fighting skills if he wants to survive. Thus is born a partnership that might just take Joe all the way to the top…', '{"Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"}', '{"boxing","coming-of-age","male-protagonist","urban","orphan","class-struggle","anti-hero","athletics","shounen","rehabilitation","primarily-male-cast","delinquents"}', NULL, '171', '20', NULL, '1968', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 29273, '89', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx31303-l21HJn9AXl7w.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/1303-0YcHdL7MyKFB.jpg', '#d61a50', 31303, '1303', '{"Ikki Kajiwara","Tetsuya Chiba","Sanbanchi Kawa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/1303-0YcHdL7MyKFB.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BIXHPgNtAZg/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BIXHPgNtAZg"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Joe Yabuki", "native": "矢吹丈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11804-iGb4oJ99VCcz.jpg"}, {"name": "Tooru Rikiishi", "native": "力石徹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b20185-A2ItKKrpgfcB.png"}, {"name": "Danpei Tange", "native": "丹下段平", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/charact