('MANGA', 'The Ancient Magus'' Bride', 'Mahoutsukai no Yome', '魔法使いの嫁', 'Hatori Chise has lived most of her short 15-year life full of neglect and abuse, and devoid of love. With no familial warmth, she''s had more than her share of troubles and pitfalls. Just when it seems like life can''t get any worse, she''s now being sold at a slave auction! When a cloaked man, with the head of a beast'' skull and wielding strange powers, purchases her, Chise’s life will never be the same again.

The man is a a sorcerer of great power, a kindly magus who frees Chise and then makes a bold statement: 
Chise will become his apprentice–and his bride!', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"magic","female-protagonist","foreign","mythology","rural","monster-boy","shounen","heterosexual"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 29080, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx85435-GEy771ZSyuO0.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85435-wbuz26htrb2M.jpg', '#e43528', 85435, '61189', '{"Kore Yamazaki","Kyouhei Shinpuku","Adrienne Beck"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85435-wbuz26htrb2M.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chise Hatori", "native": "羽鳥智世", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88344-zn7wbe8rKgqT.png"}, {"name": "Elias Ainsworth", "native": "エリアス・エインズワーズ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121430-n1k9M5RdkXyI.png"}, {"name": "Titania", "native": "ティターニア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124153-40mppXmtFzLz.jpg"}, {"name": "Oberon", "native": "オベロン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/124155-iDJCsdqXTR4P.jpg"}, {"name": "Silky", "native": "シルキー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125915-cDwNFGfAGy4s.png"}, {"name": "Ruth", "native": "ルツ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/125916-FmtQGDFTX0Rr.jpg"}, {"name": "Simon Callum", "native": "サイモン・カラム", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/126974-Yg3ed9YyB5X9.jpg"}, {"name": "Lindel", "native": "リンデル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129384-zSLY3QNgirXd.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85435'),
('MANGA', 'One Room of Happiness', 'Sachi-iro no One Room', '幸色のワンルーム', 'That day, she was abducted. But to her, that abduction was a ray of hope -- the beginning of a new life. The girl promises to marry her abductor, and the abductor offers plenty of "happiness." This is the story of an abductor and his victim... How could it be so warm?', '{"Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life"}', '{"rehabilitation","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","crime","philosophy","found-family"}', NULL, '69', '11', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 28832, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx100557-55nghYjyfP4i.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n100557-vdNLOj6DiyFV.jpg', NULL, 100557, '104829', '{"Hakuri","Carlo Vanstiphout","Olinda Cordukes"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n100557-vdNLOj6DiyFV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IxRDtatnT4o/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IxRDtatnT4o"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Onii-san", "native": "お兄さん", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132916-Xzls2D5wem1j.png"}, {"name": "Sachi", "native": "幸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b132917-Cew6eyGH8ylK.png"}, {"name": "Hijiri Matsubase", "native": "松葉瀬聖", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167944-jvHbvG68CJEg.png"}, {"name": "Miho Satou", "native": "佐藤美穂", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175959-0ilfacdpeKFB.png"}, {"name": "Ryotarou Yashiro", "native": "八代涼太郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175960-LNfnuXYGqkHz.png"}, {"name": "Shin Katagiri", "native": "片桐真", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175961-jqWwLy0m3y7e.png"}, {"name": "Sachi''s Mother", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175962-kP4RTsB9pncM.png"}, {"name": "Tsugumi Hitotsugi", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b191137-Kcc352LSGdDg.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '100557'),
('MANGA', 'Reborn!', 'Katekyo Hitman REBORN!', '家庭教師ヒットマンREBORN!', 'Here Comes Reborn!

When Reborn, a fedora-wearing, gun-toting toddler, arrives and says he''s come to groom Tsuna for his future as boss of an Italian organized crime family, Tsuna is more than a little skeptical. But Reborn may have the "magic bullet" necessary to turn Tsuna''s life around!.', '{"Action","Comedy"}', '{"mafia","shounen","super-power","male-protagonist","slapstick","school","primarily-male-cast","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '411', '42', NULL, '2004', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 28005, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30047-Gr8KL98hzzYT.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30047-GliECv0W8PPE.jpg', '#e4a143', 30047, '47', '{"Akira Amano","Kenji Sakaki","KAITO"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30047-GliECv0W8PPE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/exaG4m0Au3Q/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=exaG4m0Au3Q"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tsunayoshi Sawada", "native": "沢田綱吉", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b670-ZK5VTiy59C1M.png"}, {"name": "Reborn", "native": "リボーン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b671-G7Z01vwnpbxS.png"}, {"name": "Hayato Gokudera", "native": "獄寺隼人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1535-C3xPsU0krlGb.jpg"}, {"name": "Takeshi Yamamoto", "native": "山本武", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1556-4N3lWv9VUJj4.png"}, {"name": "Mukuro Rokudo", "native": "六道骸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1853-kEdoYjW3BmNc.jpg"}, {"name": "Kyouya Hibari", "native": "雲雀恭弥", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1858-eqEEzEUEzAkH.jpg"}, {"name": "Lambo", "native": "ランボ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1859-FMaxQi2KIvKH.png"}, {"name": "Ryouhei Sasagawa", "native": "笹川了平", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1861-mjcnbnpixWjR.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30047'),
('MANGA', 'HELLSING', 'HELLSING', 'HELLSING', 'Hellsing, a secret organization of the British government, have long been battling supernatural threats to keep the people safe from creatures of the night. The current leader, Integra Wingates Hellsing controls her own personal army to eliminate the undead beings, but even her highly trained soldiers pale in comparison to her most trusted vampire exterminator, a man by the name of Alucard, who is actually a powerful vampire himself. Along with Integra''s mysterious butler and Alucard''s new vampire minion, Seras Victoria, The Hellsing Organization must face not only regular ghouls and vampires, but a rivaling secret organization from the Vatican, and Millennium, an enigmatic group of madmen spawned by a certain war over 50 years ago...

A bloody battle between monsters is about to begin, The dead are dancing, and all hell is singing...', '{"Action","Horror","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","seinen","gore","guns","anti-hero","religion","foreign","primarily-adult-cast","police","terrorism","male-protagonist","female-protagonist"}', NULL, '92', '10', NULL, '1997', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27697, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30267-w3NHbBONJ4bN.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30267-J7aGwHsDnkD5.jpg', '#f1281a', 30267, '267', '{"Kouta Hirano","Duane Johnson","Rafał Rzepka"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30267-J7aGwHsDnkD5.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Alucard", "native": "アーカード", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n601-CVySkaFQgsPW.jpg"}, {"name": "Integra Fairbrook Wingates Hellsing", "native": "インテグラル・ファルブルケ・ウィンゲーツ・ヘルシング", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n603-APJJRPduEnJV.jpg"}, {"name": "Alexander Anderson", "native": "アレクサンド・アンデルセン神父", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b606-uox8devG45Zp.png"}, {"name": "Seras Victoria", "native": "セラス・ヴィクトリア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b624-qdFGCDB5Zhco.png"}, {"name": "Walter C. Dornez", "native": "ウォルター・C（クム）・ドルネーズ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b609-VoV9ogwkKMB5.png"}, {"name": "Enrico Maxwell", "native": "エンリコ・マクスウェル", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/610.jpg"}, {"name": "Pip Bernadotte", "native": "ピップ・ベルナドット", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b612-KxUaUzMpl5KM.png"}, {"name": "The Major", "native": "少佐", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b613-13Oi69jlA9Bw.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30267'),
('MANGA', 'ACT-AGE', 'act-age', 'アクタージュ act-age', 'Lights! Camera! ACTION! Kei Yonagi wants to be an actress! But an already-difficult dream to achieve has become much harder since her father left and her mother died. She''s now taking care of her two little siblings on her own.

Without much money left, will she have to give up her dream?!', '{"Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life"}', '{"acting","work","female-protagonist","coming-of-age","filmmaking","philosophy","shounen"}', NULL, '123', '12', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'CANCELLED', 27575, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx100991-E044nvi94bWW.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100991-76Y5JkdeiR95.jpg', '#e45043', 100991, '112115', '{"Tatsuya Matsuki","Shiro Usazaki","Kouji Miura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100991-76Y5JkdeiR95.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fe9YtHG4TIY/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fe9YtHG4TIY"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kei Yonagi", "native": "夜凪景", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126858-LgxX8EGGuBVC.png"}, {"name": "Chiyoko Momoshiro", "native": "百城千世子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b131360-Dthz1mmiA8c8.png"}, {"name": "Akira Hoshi", "native": "星アキラ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139941-KIiBYw99kZGz.png"}, {"name": "Sumiji Kuroyama", "native": "黒山墨字", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139943-YPDbNbr7dhLe.jpg"}, {"name": "Araya Myoujin", "native": "明神阿良也", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139944-WCg7EozMAIKk.png"}, {"name": "Arisa Hoshi", "native": "星アリサ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139942-kGulagTA2hvX.png"}, {"name": "Yuki Hiiragi", "native": "柊雪", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139945-frOkHOWWSYVg.png"}, {"name": "Yukiji Tezuka", "native": "手塚由紀治", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b139946-EjaZzsmDbxyq.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '100991'),
('MANGA', 'Yu Yu Hakusho', 'Yuu☆Yuu☆Hakusho', '幽☆遊☆白書', 'Yusuke Urameshi was a tough teen delinquent until one selfless act changed his life...by ending it. When he died saving a little kid from a speeding car, the afterlife didn''t know what to do with him, so it gave him a second chance at life. Now, Yusuke is a ghost with a mission, performing good deeds at the behest of Botan, the ferrywoman of the River Styx, and Koenma, the pacifier-sucking judge of the dead.', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"shounen","super-power","demons","primarily-male-cast","cultivation","male-protagonist","martial-arts","coming-of-age","delinquents","urban-fantasy","philosophy","youkai"}', NULL, '176', '19', NULL, '1990', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27516, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30053-wCR6xyGzeUYo.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30053-SB0avWUS5wWY.jpg', '#e4ae28', 30053, '53', '{"Yoshihiro Togashi","Kunio Ajino","Hideaki Togashi"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30053-SB0avWUS5wWY.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yuusuke Urameshi", "native": "浦飯幽助", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b729-V6GlADOEZv3x.png"}, {"name": "Kazuma Kuwabara", "native": "桑原和真", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n730-H6SRWfoiFjBR.jpg"}, {"name": "Kurama", "native": "蔵馬", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b731-cv0jfjVrD09V.jpg"}, {"name": "Hiei", "native": "飛影", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b732-rg4H7yyv3LRo.png"}, {"name": "Keiko Yukimura", "native": "雪村螢子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/733.jpg"}, {"name": "Botan", "native": "ぼたん", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b734-Coza0NrWAC7W.png"}, {"name": "Genkai", "native": "幻海", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b735-C85KgkJl660I.jpg"}, {"name": "Yukina", "native": "雪菜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b736-ccd82PSlyxX3.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30053'),
('MANGA', 'Kengan Ashura', 'Kengan Ashura', 'ケンガンアシュラ', 'Since the Edo periods of Japan, gladiator arenas exist in certain areas. In these arenas, wealthy business owners and merchants hire gladiators to fight in unarmed combat where winner takes all. Tokita Ohma, nicknamed "Ashura", joins these arenas and devastates his opponents. His spectacular ability to crush his enemies catches the attention of the big business owners, including the Nogi Group chairman, Nogi Hideki.', '{"Action","Sports"}', '{"martial-arts","ensemble-cast","wrestling","male-protagonist","primarily-adult-cast","primarily-male-cast","boxing","athletics","shounen","revenge"}', NULL, '260', '27', NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27509, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86265-TyETC1VA9qWd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86265-E2XYMJkzZCwv.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 86265, '72025', '{"Yabako Sandrovich","Daromeon","Hajime Musashino"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86265-E2XYMJkzZCwv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ouma Tokita", "native": "十鬼蛇王馬", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137446-umIgsem3URij.png"}, {"name": "Kazuo Yamashita", "native": "山下一夫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143838-1bMajQ35FKh9.png"}, {"name": "Cosmo Imai", "native": "今井コスモ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137447-wKRjmEss598q.png"}, {"name": "Kaede Akiyama", "native": "秋山楓", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143837-uJqHToQgsMqi.png"}, {"name": "Jun Sekibayashi", "native": "関林ジュン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143839-N1COkV1uWdxA.jpg"}, {"name": "Setsuna Kiryu", "native": "桐生刹那", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143840-EkPIPAEeTv8b.jpg"}, {"name": "Ryou Inaba", "native": "因幡良", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143841-dT0DVvrdo05S.png"}, {"name": "Keizaburou Sawada", "native": "沢田慶三郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143842-dWa9LDcc1d7E.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86265'),
('MANGA', 'Dai Dark', 'Dai Dark', '大ダーク', 'Zaha Sanko’s body has great and terrible powers–they say that possessing his bones will grant you any wish, even the desire to become ruler of the universe. But Sanko is still a teenage dude with his own life, and he isn’t about to let every monstrous lowlife in the galaxy rip him limb from limb. He and his skeletal buddy Avakian will use their dark powers to fend off any murder attempts while they search space for whomever put this curse on Sanko’s bones…because killing them might end the madness.', '{"Action","Comedy","Horror","Sci-Fi"}', '{"space","gore","surreal-comedy","aliens","body-horror","dystopian","anti-hero","shounen","skeleton","henshin","demons"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 27507, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx105263-r8PwuxORXWFP.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105263-YI9gC2cGaYvd.jpg', '#e45d50', 105263, '118858', '{"Q Hayashida","Daniel Komen","Phil Christie"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105263-YI9gC2cGaYvd.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6VXdt5PJjl4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6VXdt5PJjl4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Zaha Sanko", "native": "ザハ＝サンコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143044-NvZ1KFjwzs30.png"}, {"name": "Avakian", "native": "アバキアン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143574-wzk3lmqztEjZ.png"}, {"name": "Shimada Death", "native": "死ま田＝デス", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158224-aJlQXfFzHlKB.png"}, {"name": "Hajime Damemaru", "native": "一＝ダメ丸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b158225-ZxLXOzfqcs1m.png"}, {"name": "Chidaruma", "native": "チダルマ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b79443-lJrwt4yXwOFx.png"}, {"name": "Misetani Box", "native": "店谷=ボックス", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b224446-mDAzVdqd0yXt.png"}, {"name": "Mouja", "native": "モージャ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b292021-wFaOylLnGYnv.png"}, {"name": "Hikari no Omo", "native": "光の主", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b325379-xTC9LhHZ1E9E.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '105263'),
('MANGA', 'Boarding School Juliet', 'Kishuku Gakkou no Juliet', '寄宿学校のジュリエット', 'At Dahlia Academy, a prestigious boarding school attended by students of two feuding countries—the eastern Nation of Touwa, and the Principality of West—Romio Inuzuka, leader of the dorms’ Touwa first-years, wishes for a romance that can never be. For his ladylove is none other than his arch-enemy, Juliet Persia, leader of the dorms’ West first-years! Is Inuzuka ready to risk it all to confess his feelings? And even if Persia somehow agrees to go out with them, how long can they keep a forbidden relationship under wraps?!', '{"Action","Comedy","Romance"}', '{"school","heterosexual","gangs","boarding-school","ensemble-cast","shounen","foreign","female-protagonist","slapstick","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '121', '16', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27155, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx86279-UF065BhrwVHW.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86279-hGX7R26ZCUw3.jpg', '#e45d78', 86279, '91514', '{"Yousuke Kaneda","Amanda Haley","James Dashiell"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86279-hGX7R26ZCUw3.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B2F3nvXUJgs/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B2F3nvXUJgs"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Juliet Persia", "native": "ジュリエット・ペルシア", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126989-CQg9qI0FNwOm.png"}, {"name": "Romio Inuzuka", "native": "犬塚露壬雄", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128066-mky3G1KpLMqN.png"}, {"name": "Scott Fold", "native": "スコット・フォールド", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n128468-JOTknQ9BNdKw.png"}, {"name": "Chartreux Westia", "native": "シャルトリュー・ウェスティア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128469-MKtpVYyFx199.png"}, {"name": "Hasuki Komai", "native": "狛井蓮季", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n128470-hYxri4gGDGM2.jpg"}, {"name": "Aby Ssinia", "native": "アビ・シニア", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n128471-zt1fRpGKYmAG.png"}, {"name": "Cait Sith", "native": "ケット・シィ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n128472-UqqjnOblQkcJ.png"}, {"name": "Kochou Wang", "native": "王胡蝶", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n128473-ItqVLqGpBfB3.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86279'),
('MANGA', 'Heavenly Delusion', 'Tengoku Daimakyou', '天国大魔境', 'Within the safety of the walls, youths are raised in a nursery-style setting by robots. While life there may appear stale on the surface, the children are full of potential and curiosity. In many ways it is like a slice of heaven. The outside world is a hell-scape. It is almost entirely void of anything mechanical and is now inhabited by bizarre, yet powerful super-natural beings.

Maru, with the aid of Kiruko, is out there crisscrossing what was once Tokyo for heaven. But after searching for so long, maybe heaven is more of an untenable dream than a potential reality.', '{"Adventure","Drama","Mystery"}', '{"post-apocalyptic","seinen","male-protagonist","dystopian","survival","travel","female-protagonist","super-power","heterosexual","transgender"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 27069, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx101942-yjslDpT6XcpK.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101942-ngU0GtuDDzPU.jpg', '#1a93d6', 101942, '111745', '{"Masakazu Ishiguro","Yohan Leclerc","Ko Ransom"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/101942-ngU0GtuDDzPU.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OrcJ36MrH-4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OrcJ36MrH-4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Maru", "native": "マル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289824-7LdKeeZkpEjF.png"}, {"name": "Kiruko", "native": "キルコ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289828-021nDZVsvAP5.png"}, {"name": "Tokio", "native": "トキオ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289825-HuPBhMJyVI7Q.png"}, {"name": "Mimihime", "native": "ミミヒメ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289826-RVPbwpkNF38n.png"}, {"name": "Kuku", "native": "クク", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289827-QU0JNSpZ4nEt.png"}, {"name": "Robin Inazaki", "native": "稲崎露敏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289846-KNW2XLMmfpn0.jpg"}, {"name": "Kona", "native": "コナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289848-ljZ1VbWDSAJU.png"}, {"name": "Yuuko Aoshima", "native": "青島優子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289849-aCqJMQXUqcBA.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '101942'),
('MANGA', 'Giji Harem', 'Giji Harem', '疑似ハーレム', 'A first year high school girl likes a second year boy in her drama club. She acts out various character archetypes that you would find in a typical manga harem as their friendship deepens.

- Originally a Twitter manga, it was picked up for serialization by Gekkan Sunday on January 12, 2019.

