('MANGA', 'The Girl I Like Forgot Her Glasses', 'Suki na Ko ga Megane wo Wasureta', '好きな子がめがねを忘れた', 'Serialisation of the original Twitter comic!

Kaede Komura has a huge crush on his seat partner, Mie-san. She, however, has terrible eyesight, and tends to either forget or break her glasses! Komura-kun offers her a helping hand, and as they grow closer, their feelings for each other grow too.', '{"Comedy","Romance"}', '{"heterosexual","iyashikei","school","disability","shounen","male-protagonist","kuudere"}', NULL, '120', '12', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 26210, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx105641-17QzwtypyRxU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105641-wtrHJNNG7v8u.jpg', '#f1a15d', 105641, '117332', '{"Koume Fujichika"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105641-wtrHJNNG7v8u.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8RsVgiiG3MM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8RsVgiiG3MM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kaede Komura", "native": "小村楓", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129903-HuR5Fc4gnY96.png"}, {"name": "Ai Mie", "native": "三重あい", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n129904-TThqlHWM3gM7.png"}, {"name": "Asuka Kawato", "native": "川戸あすか", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b309615-4ljgPxBfOSCQ.png"}, {"name": "Maho Toyama", "native": "遠山まほ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b309616-Y57SZutwR3ql.png"}, {"name": "Ren Azuma", "native": "東蓮", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b309622-BV6IIH9NbgfZ.png"}, {"name": "Tomo Yasaka", "native": "八坂智", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b309623-FuXGjXgv29Aj.png"}, {"name": "Narumi Someya", "native": "染谷成海", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilis