('MANGA', 'Monthly Girls'' Nozaki-kun', 'Gekkan Shoujo Nozaki-kun', '月刊少女野崎くん', 'The boy of her dreams...is a girl''s manga artist?! To the eyes of high school student Chiyo Sakura, classmate Umetarou Nozaki--brawny of build and brusque of tongue--is a dreamboat! When Chiyo finally works up the courage to tell Nozaki how she feels about him, she knows rejection is on the table...but getting recruited as a manga-ka''s assistant?! Never in a million years! But for someone who makes a living drawing sweet girly romances, Nozaki-kun is a little slow on the uptake when it comes to matters of the heart in reality. And so Chiyo''s daily life of manga making and heartache begins!', '{"Comedy","Romance"}', '{"drawing","parody","4-koma","ensemble-cast","work","school","heterosexual","otaku-culture","unrequited-love","female-protagonist","tomboy","tsundere"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 26196, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx59211-ltc4FW9inrms.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/59211-qSzLKVzlnhGR.jpg', '#86ff35', 59211, '29211', '{"Izumi Tsubaki","Leighann Harvey","Lys Blakeslee"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/59211-qSzLKVzlnhGR.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Umetarou Nozaki ", "native": "野崎梅太郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/87269.jpg"}, {"name": "Chiyo Sakura ", "native": "佐倉千代", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n87271-IccVl2JDURIl.jpg"}, {"name": "Mikoto Mikoshiba ", "native": "御子柴実琴", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/87267.jpg"}, {"name": "Masayuki Hori", "native": "堀政行", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88116-SX9DTqHASisV.png"}, {"name": "Yuu Kashima", "native": "鹿島遊", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.