('MANGA', 'Rurouni Kenshin', 'Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan', 'るろうに剣心 -明治剣客浪漫譚-', 'One hundred and forty years ago in Kyoto, with the coming of the American "Black Ships," there arose a warrior who, felling men with his bloodstained blade, gained the name Hitokiri, manslayer! His killer blade helped close the turbulent Bakumatsu era and slashed open the progressive age known as Meiji. Then he vanished, and with the flow of years, became legend.

Included one-shots:

Volume 1: Rurōni -Meiji Kenkaku Romantan- (second one-shot for the series, which Watsuki calls a "side-story")

Volume 3: Rurōni -Meiji Kenkaku Romantan- (first one-shot for the series, which Watsuki calls the "pilot")

Volume 6: Sengoku no Mikazuki (Nobuhiro Watsuki''s debut one-shot)

Volume 28: Meteor Strike', '{"Action","Adventure","Romance"}', '{"swordplay","historical","samurai","shounen","heterosexual","male-protagonist","martial-arts","ninja","assassins"}', NULL, '259', '28', NULL, '1994', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 26169, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30022-jxTlViun1o10.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30022-iDwZIi8WFDeo.jpg', '#e4865d', 30022, '22', '{"Nobuhiro Watsuki","Hiroyuki Takei","Eiichirou Oda"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30022-iDwZIi8WFDeo.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Y_Ld48VSU0k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y_Ld48VSU0k"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kenshin Himura", "native": "緋村剣心", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b147-miunGYp6fkzb.png"}, {"name": "Kaoru Kamiya", "native": "神谷薫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b148-4FiP3CHKw8IM.png"}, {"name": "Sanosuke Sagara", "native": "相楽佐之助", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b149-YxCJj4qtMUzB.jpg"}, {"name": "Yahiko Myojin", "native": "明神弥彦", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b150-TdeyGWxyLx2l.png"}, {"name": "Megumi Takani", "native": "高荷恵", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b151-NQX07l1lFlYY.png"}, {"name": "Aoshi Shinomori", "native": "四乃森蒼紫", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1238-E5QVXIonLmR8.png"}, {"name": "Hajime Saitou", "native": "斎藤一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b1409-V7taAezM5IUI.png"}, {"name": "Misao Makimachi", "native": "巻町操", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2262-jQuiPmHqEN0X.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30022'),
('MANGA', 'Planetes', 'Planetes', 'プラネテス', 'Haunted by a space flight accident that claimed the life of his beloved wife, Yuri finds himself six years later as part of a team of debris cleaners on a vessel called the Toy Box charged with clearing space junk from space flight paths. The team consists of Hachimaki, a hot shot debris-man with a sailor''s affinity for the orbital ocean; Fee, a chain-smoking tomboy beauty with an abrasive edge; and Pops, a veteran orbital mechanic whose avuncular presence soothes the stress of the job.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Slice of Life"}', '{"work","space","philosophy","environmental","seinen","politics","family-life","educational","heterosexual","iyashikei","primarily-adult-cast","male-protagonist"}', NULL, '28', '4', NULL, '1999', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 26150, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30481-kHrCeVC8e0wR.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30481-oO5yJWz3J54N.jpg', '#5daee4', 30481, '481', '{"Makoto Yukimura","Marc Bernabé","Verónica Calafell"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30481-oO5yJWz3J54N.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hachirota Hoshino", "native": "星野八郎太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n5105-OOUsvCxhK8un.png"}, {"name": "Ai Tanabe", "native": "田名部愛", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n5263-TBftxnLhMiuz.png"}, {"name": "Fee Carmichael", "native": "フィー·カーマイケル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7573-SM03FPlDjLuM.png"}, {"name": "Yuri Mihalkov", "native": "ユーリ・ミハイロコフ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7572-e4ALrBizAWR6.png"}, {"name": "Goro Hoshino", "native": "星野五郎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7597-lNVg8RfNLHT