('MANGA', 'Devilman', 'Devilman', 'デビルマン', 'Hordes of demons, once thought entombed forever in the underworld, have now returned to Earth. Evil and corruption begin to seep into our world, as demons seize human hosts. Mankind’s only hope for salvation is to use the demons’ power against them–and only a pure-hearted man like Fudo Akira can do so without losing his humanity. Once little more than a crybaby, Akira now wields the terrible power of a devil, yet holds the innocent soul of a man–Devilman!', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Horror"}', '{"demons","gore","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy","body-horror","philosophy","henshin","nudity","shounen","heterosexual","lgbtq-themes"}', NULL, '53', '5', NULL, '1972', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 26131, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx31474-R4x7qkjUfBw6.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31474-eSVkINsgBG53.jpg', '#fe7828', 31474, '1474', '{"Gou Nagai","Marco Franca","Adrienne Beck"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/31474-eSVkINsgBG53.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Akira Fudou", "native": "不動明", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b2456-rTjIXMLPHTu2.jpg"}, {"name": "Ryo Asuka", "native": "飛鳥了", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b4092-63yxC7cCrWke.png"}, {"name": "Miki Makimura", "native": "牧村美樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7968-te8U6niaAoKk.png"}, {"name": "Psycho Jenny", "native": "サイコジェニー", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7966-nh5ZbkAioYaz.jpg"}, {"name": "Miki Kuroda", "native": "黒田ミキ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7971-mjwR42qPcQ5N.jpg"}, {"name": "Devilman", "native": "デビルマン", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https:/