('MANGA', 'Kami nomi zo Shiru Sekai', 'Kami nomi zo Shiru Sekai', '神のみぞ知るセカイ', 'Katsuragi Keima is known on the net as the god of getting the girls while in real life he’s known as otamegane and he hates all real girls. However he is approached by Elsie, a devil from hell, to help her in catching runaway spirits that hide in people. Apparently the spirits only hide in the hearts of girls and the only way to get the souls out is by making the girl fall in love so the spirit gets forced out. And he’s not allowed to fail or he will lose his head.', '{"Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"primarily-female-cast","female-harem","male-protagonist","school","video-games","otaku-culture","demons","heterosexual","urban-fantasy","slapstick","gods","denpa"}', NULL, '271', '26', NULL, '2008', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25717, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx37519-2A9eU21x8uVG.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/37519-qhj9rYSF1xgr.jpg', '#e4865d', 37519, '7519', '{"Tamiki Wakaki","Yu Men Huan Liu","Qianwei Yang"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/37519-qhj9rYSF1xgr.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Keima Katsuragi", "native": "桂木桂馬", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/13468-follPFjSTdME.png"}, {"name": "Elucia de Lute Ima", "native": "エリュシア・デ・ルート・イーマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b14015-7M804nDcgMd6.png"}, {"name": "Haqua du Lot Herminium", "native": "ハクア・ド・ロット・ヘルミニウム", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18866-E4yDtcaGrvF8.png"}, {"name": "Shiori Shiomiya", "native": "汐宮栞", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b15449-50wNrBRPqVSM.png"}, {"name": "Ayumi Takahara", "native": "高原歩美", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/charact