('MANGA', 'Aoashi', 'Aoashi', 'アオアシ', 'Ashito Aoi, a third year middle school student from Ehime, meets Fukuda Tatsuya, a J Youth League coach. Even though he''s still rough around the edges, Ashito has such amazing potential that he gets invited by coach Fukuda to participate in his team''s try-outs in Tokyo. The story of a boy who will revolutionize Japanese football begins to unfold.

- Nominated for the 2017 Manga Taishou Award.

- Winner of the 65th Shogakukan Manga Award for "Best General Manga" category in 2019.', '{"Sports"}', '{"football","male-protagonist","school-club","primarily-male-cast","coming-of-age","ensemble-cast","primarily-teen-cast","seinen"}', NULL, '410', '40', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25618, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx107279-R2vxyPQRqV0X.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107279-D36RyE2DG7S9.jpg', '#f1c943', 107279, '102256', '{"Yuugo Kobayashi","Naohiko Ueno","Akino Kubonaka"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107279-D36RyE2DG7S9.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Y1oSlcXzy20/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y1oSlcXzy20"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ashito  Aoi", "native": "青井葦人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133818-esSz80xzp25D.png"}, {"name": "Tatsuya Fukuda", "native": "福田達也", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133817-DWltAyBhJzxf.png"}, {"name": "Haruhisa Kuribayashi", "native": "栗林晴久", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162034-1F9zCXt8kljy.jpg"}, {"name": "Hana Ichijou", "native": "一条花", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162035-goi3gRhYZErH.jpg"}, {"name": "Nagisa Akutsu", "native": "阿久津渚", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162036-SMQMGEbStZ6H.png"}, {"name": "Yuuma Motoki", "native": "本木遊馬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235170-BPDyEqbr0jcv.png"}, {"name": "Eisaku Otomo", "native": "大友栄作", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235171-Xg0XKQOVFvKe.png"}, {"name": "Shun Aoi", "