('MANGA', 'The Summer You Were There', 'Kimi to Tsuzuru Utakata', '君と綴るうたかた', 'Shizuku is a shy girl who hardly talks to other people. Instead, she loses herself in creative writing, crafting a novel that she never plans to show anyone. But when Kaori–Shizuku’s cute, popular classmate–gets her hands on Shizuku’s manuscript, everything changes. Kaori is a huge fan, and suggests that Shizuku can get inspiration for her writing if the two of them start dating! Can these very different young ladies create their own love story together?', '{"Drama","Psychological","Romance"}', '{"yuri","female-protagonist","writing","rehabilitation","primarily-female-cast","coming-of-age","lgbtq-themes","fake-relationship","primarily-teen-cast"}', NULL, '32', '6', NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25525, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx117620-cyvy8nO9GLm8.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/117620-hUfbQd7m83WC.jpg', NULL, 117620, '128365', '{"Yuama","Margaret Ngo","Elena Pizarro Lanzas"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/117620-hUfbQd7m83WC.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RXzwDXCr9LE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RXzwDXCr9LE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shizuku Hoshikawa", "native": "星川雫", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b204141-4bWLJhrjvHxn.png"}, {"name": "Kaori Asaka", "native": "朝香夏織", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b204142-l8Od0EbclRo3.png"}, {"name": "Shizuka Hoshikawa", "native": "星川静", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308864-1Q9e8eaZK521.png"}, {"name": "Shiori Asaka", "native": "朝香栞", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308865-0m0nb09F1KS9.png"}, {"name": "Seri Ichihara", "native": "市原芹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308866-uN1uegtdyuO2.png"}, {"name": "Ruri Ichinose", "native": "一ノ瀬るり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308867-QuV4skFWK5MV.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '117620'),
('MANGA', 'Akane-banashi', 'Akane-banashi', 'あかね噺', 'Rakugo--the ultimate form of storytelling, where everything in a story is expressed with just your body and words. Shinta and his daughter Akane have been seduced by this wonderful form of classical entertainment. Having observed her father strive to pass the shin''uchi rakugo test, Akane will take her own steps into this unique world!

- Ranked 3rd in the 8th Next Manga Awards print manga category in 2022.

- Ranked 4th in the Kono Manga ga Sugoi! 2023 guidebook for male readers.

- Ranked 3rd in the Nationwide Bookstore Employees'' Recommended Comics of 2023.

- Ranked 2nd in the 16th Manga Taisho in 2023.

- Nominated for the 47th Kodansha Manga Award in the shounen category in 2023.

- Included in the New York Public Library''s 2023 Best Books for Teens.

- Included in YALSA''s 2024 Great Graphic Novels for Teens.', '{"Drama"}', '{"rakugo","female-protagonist","coming-of-age","primarily-adult-cast","acting","work","philosophy","shounen","found-family"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 25460, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx144866-ummLIg6x419I.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/144866-BltObhJaBtT6.jpg', '#fec928', 144866, '144034', '{"Yuuki Suenaga","Takamasa Moue","Kikuhiko Hayashiya"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/144866-BltObhJaBtT6.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B8AE5A41CA0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8AE5A41CA0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Akane Ousaki", "native": "桜咲朱音", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264023-HcYGatU4xIQ4.png"}, {"name": "Masaki Ousaki", "native": "桜咲真幸", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264105-kOAzy2xgTfXe.png"}, {"name": "Shinta Arakawa", "native": "阿良川志ん太", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264106-eFFLml1BmzIe.png"}, {"name": "Shiguma Arakawa", "native": "阿良川志ぐま", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264107-pLXSsuysXFh4.png"}, {"name": "Isshou Arakawa", "native": "阿良川一生", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b278459-7lw2zlgNX2zY.png"}, {"name": "Guriko Arakawa", "native": "阿良川ぐりこ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b279367-2U8T30I3FXGn.png"}, {"name": "Kyoji Arakawa", "native": "阿良川享二", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b280941-RTfnwnfTq65O.png"}, {"name": "Maikeru Arakawa", "native": "阿良川ま