('MANGA', 'the gods lie.', 'Kamisama ga Uso wo Tsuku.', '神様がうそをつく。', 'Natsuru Nanao, a 6th grader who lives alone with his mother, strikes up an unlikely friendship with the reserved and driven Rio Suzumura. Natsuru plays hookey from soccer camp that summer, and instead of telling the truth to his mother, he spends all his time with Rio and her kid brother at their rickety house, where a dark secret threatens to upend their fragile happiness.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"primarily-child-cast","heterosexual","coming-of-age","family-life","seinen","male-protagonist","philosophy","football"}', NULL, '5', '1', NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25307, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx80217-QGyYpWc3qcpI.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/80217-xJqqgWfb1NTc.jpg', '#5da1e4', 80217, '50217', '{"Kaori Ozaki","Marc Bernabé","Claudia Peter"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/80217-xJqqgWfb1NTc.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Natsuru Nanao", "native": "七尾 ナツル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/82207.jpg"}, {"name": "Rio Suzumura", "native": "鈴村理生", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/82209.jpg"}, {"name": "Ritsuko Nanao", "native": "七尾律子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b263879-f8OkiruDzleF.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuuta Suzumura", "native": "鈴村言うた", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b265003-Wayg23BgM2j0.jpg"}, {"name": "Suzumura", "native": "鈴村", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b265032-u6B020rGt1DE.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '80217'),
('MANGA', 'Platinum End', 'Platinum End', 'プラチナエンド', 'As his classmates celebrate their middle school graduation, troubled Mirai is mired in darkness. But his battle is just beginning when he receives some salvation from above in the form of an angel. Now Mirai is pitted against 12 other chosen humans in a battle in which the winner becomes the next god of the world. Mirai has an angel in his corner, but he may need to become a devil to survive.', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"gods","angels","shounen","urban","survival","male-protagonist","superhero","suicide","philosophy","crime","politics","religion"}', NULL, '58', '14', NULL, '2015', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25211, '61', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86526-KEzZ1WkscsCy.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86526-JNIKYHF4ltJN.jpg', '#e46b43', 86526, '93180', '{"Tsugumi Ooba","Takeshi Obata","Thibaud Desbief"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86526-JNIKYHF4ltJN.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mirai Kakehashi", "native": "架橋明日", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89231-ohzYpY5dOXZw.jpg"}, {"name": "Nasse", "native": "ナッセ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89232-PvyFC7R21rZo.jpg"}, {"name": "Revel", "native": "ルベル", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89973-0osNLAv99nk3.jpg"}, {"name": "Saki Hanakago", "native": "花籠咲", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89974-8jid4hCdl92v.jpg"}, {"name": "Kanade Uryuu", "native": "生流奏", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122073-ux6dtoTDK2n3.jpg"}, {"name": "Nanato Mukaido", "native": "六階堂七斗", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169579-L2GUkb1selio.jpg"}, {"name": "Hajime Sokotani", "native": "底谷 一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169620-aXdIgqld1XYh.jpg"}, {"name": "Susumu Yuito", "native": "結糸向", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169621-5cOoYwET0ldi.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86526'),
('MANGA', 'Last Game', 'Last Game', 'ラストゲーム', 'In elementary school, the rich and spoiled Yanagi Naoto was known for excelling in both studies and sports. But then he suffered the first setback of his life when Kujou Mikoto, a girl from a poor family, transferred to his school and performed better than Naoto at every turn. Reeling from this unforgivable blow to his pride, Naoto decided that he had to make Mikoto lose at something…by making her lose her heart to him, which he could then break! Now that they’re both in college, will Naoto finally be able to win Mikoto’s affections–or will he lose this final game with her?', '{"Comedy","Romance"}', '{"shoujo","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","tsundere","kuudere","college","heterosexual","primarily-adult-cast","love-triangle","coming-of-age","school-club"}', NULL, '66', '11', NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25144, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx60315-eE0nNEZpmi2e.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/60315-YqIWMzh936Cv.jpg', '#d65d1a', 60315, '30315', '{"Shinobu Amano","M. Jean","Morgan Watchorn"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/60315-YqIWMzh936Cv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mikoto Kujou", "native": "九条実琴", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/51033.jpg"}, {"name": "Naoto Yanagi", "native": "柳尚人", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/54195.jpg"}, {"name": "Kei Souma", "native": "相馬蛍", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/74307.jpg"}, {"name": "Shiori Fujimoto", "native": "藤本しおり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b277439-z5sYmlQNC59y.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '60315'),
('MANGA', 'House of the Sun', 'Taiyou no Ie', 'たいようのいえ', 'As a child, Mao spent all her time at Hiro’s house across the street. Going to his house always made her feel cheerful. A few years later, Mao’s father gets remarried and Mao finds herself with nowhere to call home. Hiro ends up letting her stay with him in the house he’s been occupying alone since the death of his parents. A love story unfolds, between two childhood friends of different ages.', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"female-protagonist","family-life","coming-of-age","shoujo","tsundere","heterosexual","iyashikei"}', NULL, '70', '13', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25064, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx56736-qYpc12PAQMxi.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/56736-zIM7ZPlQI7cE.jpg', '#febb28', 56736, '26736', '{"Taamo","Tania Horowitz","Abby Lehrke"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/56736-zIM7ZPlQI7cE.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mao Motomiya", "native": "本宮真魚", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b59053-w2AEOAuW1ue9.png"}, {"name": "Hiro Nakamura", "native": "中村広", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b67527-UoTzZPrKjbgd.jpg"}, {"name": "Daiki Nakamura", "native": "中村大樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/81071.jpg"}, {"name": "Chihiro", "native": "千尋", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/127206-6Vvj6WMZlLoM.jpg"}, {"name": "Oda", "native": "織田", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/127207-NbVdKjiesdot.jpg"}, {"name": "Rui Kondou", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b195434-8LPiegR121GO.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaitou Motomiya", "native": null, "role": 