('MANGA', 'Kakegurui - Compulsive Gambler -', 'Kakegurui', '賭ケグルイ', 'Hyakkaou Private Academy. An institution for the privileged with a very peculiar curriculum. You see, when you''re the sons and daughters of the wealthiest of the wealthy, it''s not athletic prowess or book smarts that keep you ahead. It''s reading your opponent-the art of the deal. What better way to hone those skills than with a rigorous curriculum of gambling?

At Hyakkaou Private Academy, the winners live like kings, and the losers are put through the wringer. But when Yumeko Jabami enrolls, she''s gonna teach these kids what a high roller really looks like!', '{"Drama","Mystery","Psychological"}', '{"gambling","card-battle","female-protagonist","school","anti-hero","primarily-female-cast","poker","villainess","primarily-teen-cast","school-club","ojou-sama","slavery"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 25039, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85793-PvROauRZl0VB.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85793-1CYPMzkrwaXd.jpg', '#e4281a', 85793, '73603', '{"Homura Kawamoto","Tooru Naomura","Kevin Gifford"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85793-1CYPMzkrwaXd.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8YyqGrbwPjU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8YyqGrbwPjU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yumeko Jabami", "native": "蛇喰夢子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121889-ABsurpy5SjOW.png"}, {"name": "Mary Saotome", "native": "早乙女芽亜里", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122687-jl1wk9rjO57e.png"}, {"name": "Ryouta Suzui", "native": "鈴井涼太", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122688-DdMMQtWRdchY.png"}, {"name": "Sayaka Igarashi", "native": "五十嵐清華", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122690-BgoAty3EQ2GW.png"}, {"name": "Midari Ikishima", "native": "生志摩妄", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122691-ze4qKEiCv2Lz.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaede Manyuda", "native": "豆生田楓", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122692-R27bMvrrWUAW.jpg"}, {"name": "Kirari Momobami", "native": "桃喰綺羅莉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b122693-qg2NIaq5h1VD.png"}, {"name": "Yuriko Nishinotouin", "native": "西洞院百合子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/122694-3jxZQhslUVLK.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85793'),
('MANGA', 'Kono Oto Tomare!', 'Kono Oto Tomare!', 'この音とまれ！', 'Since the graduation of the senior members of the club, Takezou ends up being the sole member of the "Koto" (traditional Japanese string instrument) club. Now that the new school year has begun, Takezou will have to seek out new members into the club, or the club will become terminated. Out of nowhere, a new member barges into the near-abandoned club room, demanding to join the club. How will Takezou be able to keep his club alive and deal with this rascal of a new member?', '{"Drama","Music","Romance"}', '{"school-club","school","band","coming-of-age","ensemble-cast","male-protagonist","bullying","delinquents","estranged-family","found-family","primarily-teen-cast","primarily-male-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2012', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 24839, '88', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx75143-qPFON51fyZpt.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/75143-1sdQNTbJxYXs.jpg', '#e48643', 75143, '45143', '{"Amyuu Sakura","Aline Kukor","Tom Bertrand"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/75143-1sdQNTbJxYXs.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/13w5m6wTJ-g/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=13w5m6wTJ-g"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Chika Kudou", "native": "久遠愛", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126137-RREqkVfgDvzQ.jpg"}, {"name": "Satowa Houzuki", "native": "鳳月さとわ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127430-ks7iXQbVEeWf.jpg"}, {"name": "Hiro Kurusu", "native": "来栖妃呂", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134560-7hzSBnaq2YCt.png"}, {"name": "Takezou Kurata", "native": "倉田武蔵", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134561-xeSNQb0y3IUN.png"}, {"na