('MANGA', 'Higehiro: After Being Rejected, I Shaved and Took In a High School Runaway', 'Hige wo Soru. Soshite Joshikousei wo Hirou.', 'ひげを剃る。そして女子高生を拾う。', 'Yoshida is just your average salaryman, drowning his tears in booze. On his way home one night, he finds a runaway high school girl sitting on the street. She offers to sleep with him in exchange for a place to stay―and Yoshida lets her off the hook and offers her work instead. A rom-com between the most unbalanced couple you''ll ever find!', '{"Drama","Romance"}', '{"male-protagonist","love-triangle","work","urban","office-lady","coming-of-age","heterosexual","female-harem"}', NULL, '67', '13', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24749, '69', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx105791-HamYdne051zk.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105791-bNr4iAtD02tT.jpg', '#e4d650', 105791, '116766', '{"Imaru Adachi","Shimesaba","booota"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105791-bNr4iAtD02tT.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2Y06obeNtHM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Y06obeNtHM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yoshida", "native": "吉田", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127924-UcmUep3PZq6G.jpg"}, {"name": "Sayu Ogiwara", "native": "荻原沙優", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127925-i0JAx5K81uDQ.png"}, {"name": "Airi Gotou", "native": "後藤愛依梨", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127927-t90fVl4yUM1k.png"}, {"name": "Yuzuha Mishima", "native": "三鳥柚葉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127928-LkYiVsW1I9zF.jpg"}, {"name": "Asami Yuuki", "native": "結城あさみ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/lar