('MANGA', 'Veil', 'Veil', 'Veil', 'A chance encounter. A handsome soldier. A beautiful woman. A tentative love affair smolders on the snowy cobblestone streets, out of sight of those that might keep them apart.

Veil is a beautifully illustrated full-color romance manga, told in stylish short vignettes, beautiful illustrations, and secret moments.', '{"Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"foreign","heterosexual","primarily-adult-cast","josei","disability","episodic","female-protagonist","male-protagonist","full-color","fashion","police"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 24418, '87', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx116170-Q9f5Wk6cod5E.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/116170-0aywoLTUPAns.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 116170, '132678', '{"Ikumi Fukuda","Jocelyne Allen","Miyuki Tsuji"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/116170-0aywoLTUPAns.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Emma", "native": "エマ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b200756-CLJXxNtWom6t.png"}, {"name": "Aleksander", "native": "アレクサンダー", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b259597-fQl24UGb7mOl.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '116170'),
('MANGA', 'Beelzebub', 'Beelzebub', 'べるぜバブ', 'The story follows the "strongest juvenile delinquent", Oga Tatsumi, a first year in "Ishiyama High" the school for delinquents. One day while sleeping next to a river he sees a man floating down it, he pulls him to shore and the man splits in half revealing a baby boy. This boy is the son of the demon king and he has been chosen as the one to raise it with the baby''s demon maid Hilda. The story follows his life with the child and at the delinquent school.', '{"Action","Comedy","Supernatural"}', '{"delinquents","shounen","demons","primarily-male-cast","adoption","school","primarily-teen-cast","male-protagonist","parenthood","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '252', '28', NULL, '2009', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24248, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx40010-Szo3Nu7Y0wKj.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/40010-kBZfQ0un0isa.jpg', '#bbe443', 40010, '10010', '{"Ryuuhei Tamura","Yuuki Tabata","Hirofumi Neda"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/40010-kBZfQ0un0isa.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tatsumi Oga", "native": "男鹿辰巳", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b20766-cNWY0sMyC7fI.png"}, {"name": "Takayuki Furuichi", "native": "古市貴之", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b20769-F1BzwqnB8RYo.png"}, {"name": "Hildegard", "native": "ヒルデガルダ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21153-3WD7pJ03JtcW.png"}, {"name": "Kaiser de Emperana Beelzebub IV", "native": "カイゼル・デ・エンペラーナ・ベルゼバブ4世", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21154-N5G2NWK5oIg1.png"}, {"name": "Alaindelon Bathin de Emuna", "native": "バティム・ド・エムナ・アランドロン", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21155-xNGV1COr7lrY.png"}, {"name": "Aoi Kunieda", "native": "邦枝葵", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b22222-nnVrPKNN9PRG.jpg"}, {"name": "Hidetora Toujou", "native": "東条英虎", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b23247-UWNLHIzRnhIU.png"}, {"name": "Hajime Kanzaki", "native": "神崎一", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b23248-bqJUCVs8Qhcc.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '40010'),
('MANGA', 'xxxHOLiC', 'xxxHolic', '×××ホリック', 'Kimihiro Watanuki is haunted by visions of ghosts and spirits. He seeks help from a mysterious woman named Yuko, who claims she can help. However, Watanuki must work for Yuko in order to pay for her aid. Soon Watanuki finds himself employed in Yuko’s shop where he sees things and meets customers that are stranger than anything he could have ever imagined.

- The series was re-named to xxxHolic•Rou on chapter title pages of chapter 186 and on, but not on their volume''s front covers, spines and indicia.

- The chapter count contains a one-shot published in May 2010 to commemorate the switch, which was later collected into Volume 18.

- The chapter count also reflects the magazine releases; the chapters plus the one-shot were re-arranged into 109 chapters across 19 volumes.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural"}', '{"magic","youkai","mythology","ghost","seinen","crossover","male-protagonist","curses","witch","philosophy","denpa","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '214', '19', NULL, '2003', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24240, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30010-NEPm8nwp7e0M.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30010-1XNsru8DS02E.jpg', '#e47835', 30010, '10', '{"CLAMP","William Flanagan","Fédoua Lamodière"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30010-1XNsru8DS02E.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kimihiro Watanuki", "native": "四月一日君尋", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235-TUmZb6fdlJmL.png"}, {"name": "Yuuko Ichihara", "native": "壱原侑子", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b236-xWbhQJYxYn2P.png"}, {"name": "Shizuka Doumeki", "native": "百目鬼静", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b567-9LpNHHz8K9SW.jpg"}, {"name": "Himawari Kunogi", "native": "九軒ひまわり", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/568.jpg"}, {"name": "Syaoran", "native": "小狼", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126-CG9rp6dE0DKo.png"}, {"name": "Sakura", "native": "サクラ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127-tRCK37wzJyGh.png"}, {"name": "Kurogane", "native": "黒鋼", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/129.jpg"}, {"name": "Zashiki-warashi", "native": "座敷童子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b569-gj1Z6S4HiKNc.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30010'),
('MANGA', 'Kamisama Kiss', 'Kamisama Hajimemashita', '神様はじめました', 'Nanami Momozono is alone and homeless after her dad skips town to evade his gambling debts and the debt collectors kick her out of her apartment.  So when a man she''s just saved from a dog offers her his home, she jumps at the opportunity. But it turns out that his place is a shrine, and Nanami has unwittingly taken over his job as a local deity!

Nanami has all kinda of new responsibilities she doesn''t understand, dangers she''s unaware of, and a cranky ex-familiar who''s...actually pretty hot. What''s a new-fledged godling to do?', '{"Comedy","Fantasy","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"shoujo","female-protagonist","kemonomimi","youkai","demons","coming-of-age","gods","urban-fantasy","monster-boy"}', NULL, '154', '25', NULL, '2008', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24222, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx38157-CCtYXzoNb2bc.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/38157-p7ORWL79Vxrt.jpg', '#fea128', 38157, '8157', '{"Julietta Suzuki","Tomo Kimura","Ryouko Sekiguchi"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/38157-p7ORWL79Vxrt.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nanami Momozono", "native": "桃園奈々生", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18343-YU7AhH28tElo.jpg"}, {"name": "Tomoe", "native": "巴衛", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18344-2d8Ao1wHDZ7U.png"}, {"name": "Shinjirou Kurama", "native": "鞍馬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b24252-ZSowWBQK0cxJ.png"}, {"name": "Mikage", "native": "ミカゲ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b37871-e9fzoh9wAIu8.jpg"}, {"name": "Mizuki", "native": "瑞希", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b37872-y9ECZBxdEZwS.jpg"}, {"name": "Onikiri", "native": "鬼切", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/37873.jpg"}, {"name": "Kotetsu", "native": "虎徹", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/37874.jpg"}, {"name": "Isobe", "native": "磯辺", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/37875.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '38157'),
('MANGA', 'Twin Star Exorcists', 'Sousei no Onmyouji', '双星の陰陽師', 'Rokuro dreams of becoming anything but an exorcist! Then mysterious Benio turns up. The pair are dubbed the "Twin Star Exorcists" and learn they are fated to marry... Can Rokuro escape both fates? When Rokuro''s best friend Ryogo goes missing, Rokuro is forced to ask Benio for help to enter Magano, the realm of the evil Kegare, to rescue him! 

- Includes eight extra chapters.

- Chapters 51 - 54 were originally a spin-off series, later merged into the main series.

- Chapter 13 was split into 2 chapters in the volume release; chapter count reflects the magazine releases.', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"exorcism","shounen","heterosexual","demons","male-protagonist","war","female-protagonist","nudity","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '142', '35', NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24126, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85247-ViNailSUKZVn.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85247-9sPQiRLdcuEA.jpg', '#c95028', 85247, '60511', '{"Yoshiaki Sukeno","Erubo Hijihara","Kousuke Oono"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85247-9sPQiRLdcuEA.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nOkBWXZwL9Y/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nOkBWXZwL9Y"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rokuro Enmadou", "native": "焔魔堂ろくろ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89537-ruoRVI6090vx.png"}, {"name": "Benio Adashino", "native": "化野紅緒", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89538-rRC6ibZA2eCk.png"}, {"name": "Yuuto Ijika", "native": "石鏡悠斗", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89697-isW48juyFuzJ.png"}, {"name": "Mayura Otomi", "native": "音海繭良", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89698-AlaCd2EZzBoT.png"}, {"name": "Seigen Amawaka", "native": "天若清弦", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89699-rYu3cCEw3AQ2.png"}, {"name": "Kinako", "native": "きなこ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89700-yH3R0zvVTpAN.png"}, {"name": "Ryougo Nagitsuji", "native": "椥辻亮悟", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89701-tKPg0tdYCKsC.png"}, {"name": "Arima Tsuchimikado", "native": "土御門有馬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/89702-2KyNFuduvksI.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85247'),
('MANGA', 'Eden: It''s an Endless World!', 'EDEN: It''s an Endless World!', 'EDEN 〜It''s an Endless World!〜', 'In the near future, a large portion of humanity is wiped out by a brutal, new virus that hardens the skin while dissolving internal organs. Those who aren''t immune are either severely crippled or allowed to live with cybernetically enhanced bodies. Taking advantage of a world in chaos, a paramilitary force known as the Propater topples the United Nations and seeks world domination. Elijah, a young survivor searching for his mother, travels towards the Andes Mountains with an artificially intelligent combat robot. When he encounters a group of anti-Propater freedom fighters, a maelstrom of unique characters unfolds. Graphic, cyberpunk, and philosophical, Eden is a place where endearing heroes face a constant struggle for survival and violent surprises wait around every corner!', '{"Action","Drama","Psychological","Sci-Fi"}', '{"foreign","gangs","war","seinen","anti-hero","drugs","post-apocalyptic","politics","primarily-adult-cast","ensemble-cast","philosophy","cyberpunk"}', NULL, '131', '18', NULL, '1997', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24104, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30731-I2lMIZYDECe2.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n30731-E2khN7BzlKut.jpg', '#f16b35', 30731, '731', '{"Hiroki Endo","Kumar Sivasubramanian","Denis Kimura"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n30731-E2khN7BzlKut.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Elijah Ballard", "native": "エリヤ・バラード", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7360-SqI2xJHM6I8I.jpg"}, {"name": "Kenji Asai", "native": "ケンジ・アサイ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b7361-z0O9DvM0yU7i.png"}, {"name": "Cherubim", "native": "ケルビム", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/12811.jpg"}, {"name": "Miriam Arona", "native": "ミリアム・アローナ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12812-5vHvowAMkFi8.png"}, {"name": "Chris Ballard", "native": "クリス・バラード", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/12813.jpg"}, {"name": "Enoa Ballard", "native": "エンノイア・バラード", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/12814.jpg"}, {"name": "Gina Ballard", "native": "ジナ・バラード", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/12815.jpg"}, {"name": "Hana Mayer", "native": "ハナ・メイオール", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b12816-UPK6y4H1TT7J.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '30731'),
('MANGA', 'Summertime Rendering', 'Summer Time Render', 'サマータイムレンダ', 'Hearing the news of the passing of his childhood friend Ushio, Shinpei returns to his hometown in the remote island of Hitogashima to attend her funeral. Little does he know that it is the beginning of a summer full of mystery and horror! No one is prepared for the time twisting adventures ahead that defy life and death!', '{"Action","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"rural","shounen","male-protagonist","ensemble-cast","urban-fantasy","aliens","gore","tanned-skin","crime","denpa","religion","swimming"}', NULL, '139', '13', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24103, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx102989-m8Dy8aSLcHLS.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/102989-C7RkX2Kt79KI.jpg', '#35a1e4', 102989, '110031', '{"Yasuki Tanaka","Tatsuhiko Katayama","Jocelyne Allen"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/102989-C7RkX2Kt79KI.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shinpei Ajiro", "native": "網代慎平", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155703-1CNh5yTk8xWO.jpg"}, {"name": "Mio Kofune", "native": "小舟澪", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155706-guouOSwrSqso.jpg"}, {"name": "Hizuru Minakata", "native": "南方ひづる", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155711-VwaqEhjhI0FL.png"}, {"name": "Ushio Kofune", "native": "小舟潮", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155712-zMvjVpfc4WQN.png"}, {"name": "Haine", "native": "ハイネ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155704-2cdpcDFmNmXw.jpg"}, {"name": "Tokiko Hishigata", "native": "菱形朱鷺子", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155705-odov1kqX0KEr.jpg"}, {"name": "Shiori Kobayakawa", "native": "小早川しおり", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155707-fmMAbx73fWXz.png"}, {"name": "Sou Hishigata", "native": "菱形窓", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b155708-mOQnFZUSbcH3.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '102989'),
('MANGA', 'Hinamatsuri', 'Hinamatsuri', 'ヒナまつり', 'Nitta is an ambitious, young member of the Ashikawa-gumi yakuza syndicate. One day, a mysterious, oval-shaped object falls out of thin air into his apartment, and suddenly changes everything! Inside of the object is an expressionless young girl named Hina. The girl has formidable telekinetic powers that she uses to threaten Nitta, forcing him to allow her to live in his apartment. Dangers abound as the yakuza member and young psychic begin their life together as roommates!', '{"Comedy","Sci-Fi","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"adoption","surreal-comedy","found-family","slapstick","family-life","super-power","yakuza","female-protagonist","urban-fantasy","parenthood","coming-of-age","work"}', NULL, '132', '19', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24083, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx66413-MHIcMzhhOCjd.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n66413-mM3CAMAwfR3J.jpg', NULL, 66413, '36413', '{"Masao Ootake","Stephen Kohler","Nathan Takase"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n66413-mM3CAMAwfR3J.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hina", "native": "ヒナ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89228-X5A2mEkCnJyx.png"}, {"name": "Yoshifumi Nitta", "native": "新田義史", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89229-jYBTw06z7oHy.png"}, {"name": "Hitomi Mishima", "native": "三嶋瞳", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89230-Ji8OpT5cf9dK.png"}, {"name": "Anzu", "native": "アンズ", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125362-AG9aLXKlKsH7.png"}, {"name": "Kiyoshi Baba", "native": "馬場清", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/125363-0vhwDr6n1A8K.jpg"}, {"name": "Mao", "nativ