('MANGA', 'Alya Sometimes Hides Her Feelings in Russian', 'Tokidoki Bosotto Rossiya-go de Dereru Tonari no Alya-san', '時々ボソッとロシア語でデレる隣のアーリャさん', 'Masachika Kuse sits next to Alya, a girl of Russian and Japanese descent. She''s beautiful, haughty, and an exceptional student, while Masachika is nerdy and known for being a slacker. He''s an easy target for her comments in Russian, which she''s all too happy to translate—except he can understand what she''s really saying!', '{"Comedy","Romance"}', '{"heterosexual","school","language-barrier","tsundere","kuudere","foreign","primarily-teen-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 23028, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b152404-PeFLFZXXuVr2.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/152404-MlAq7ISNxBfP.jpg', '#e45da1', 152404, '149334', '{"Sunsunsun","Saho Tenamachi","Momoco"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/152404-MlAq7ISNxBfP.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fubbQeV0QNA/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fubbQeV0QNA"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Alisa Kujou", "native": "アリサ・ミハイロヴナ・九条", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b217334-buImnwO26SgS.jpg"}, {"name": "Masachika Kuze", "native": "久世政近", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b217335-PXJgLsemVaQZ.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuki Suou", "native": "周防有希", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b243404-X1fmwpqHPdyb.jpg"}, {"name": "Mariya Kujou", "native": "マリヤ・ミハイロヴナ・九条", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291294-dlnliQB6b8YS.jpg"}, {"name": "Ayano Kimishima", "native": "君嶋綾乃", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297094-n4