('MANGA', 'Shangri-La Frontier', 'Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kami ge ni Idoman to su', 'シャングリラ・フロンティア〜クソゲーハンター, 神ゲーに挑まんとす〜', 'Second year high school student Rakuro Hizutome is interested in one thing only: finding "shitty games" and beating the crap out of them. His gaming skills are second to none, and no game is too bad for him to enjoy. So when he''s introduced to the new VR game Shangri-La Frontier, he does what he does best—min-maxes and skips the prologue to jump straight into the action. But can even an expert gamer like Rakuro discover all the secrets that Shangri-La Frontier hides...?', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"video-games","virtual-world","anthropomorphism","shounen","kemonomimi","curses","travel","male-protagonist","artificial-intelligence","magic","swordplay"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 23021, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx122063-j2wIvwb6yzPM.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/122063-KzmzOXPHNewn.jpg', '#50bbf1', 122063, '130331', '{"Ryousuke Fuji","Katarina","Kevin Gifford"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/122063-KzmzOXPHNewn.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-7FnBi0a8i4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-7FnBi0a8i4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rakurou Hizutome", "native": "陽務楽郎", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b271367-RM6DwXf1D0gu.png"}, {"name": "Rei Saiga", "native": "斎賀玲", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b281519-reQ83dGVLifA.png"}, {"name": "Towa Amane", "native": "天音永遠", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b281520-2l1wxzAuz9zM.png"}, {"name": "Kei Uomi", "native": "魚臣慧", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://