('MANGA', 'I Want to Eat Your Pancreas', 'Kimi no Suizou wo Tabetai', '君の膵臓をたべたい', 'One day, I – a high schooler – found a paperback in the hospital. The “Disease Coexistence Journal” was its title. It was a diary that my classmate, Sakura Yamauchi, had written in secret. Inside, it was written that due to her pancreatic disease, her days were numbered. And thus, I coincidentally went from Just-a-Classmate to a Secret-Knowing-Classmate. It was as if I were being drawn to her, who was my polar opposite. However, the world presented the girl that was already suffering from an illness with an equally cruel reality…', '{"Drama","Romance","Slice of Life"}', '{"coming-of-age","male-protagonist","female-protagonist","heterosexual","school","seinen"}', NULL, '10', '2', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22949, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx99609-hfnudDtTT1n5.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/99609-Hr0BJtXtw9NK.jpg', NULL, 99609, '104538', '{"Yoru Sumino","Izumi Kirihara","Beni Axia Conrad"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/99609-Hr0BJtXtw9NK.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Haruki Shiga", "native": "志賀春樹", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127116-u2fIKMSYDdVj.png"}, {"name": "Sakura Yamauchi", "native": "山内桜良", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127118-XEvgt4yHSkQv.jpg"}, {"name": "Issei Miyata", "native": "宮田一晴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133276-4KX7vtZ6oQfN.png"}, {"name": "Takahiro", "native": "隆弘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133277-yBGHCfo77UUv.png"}, {"name": "Haruki no Haha", "native": "春樹の母", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b134460-PVwi6xwYXqTS.png"}, {"n