('MANHWA', 'Bastard', 'Hurejasik', '후레자식', 'High school life is hard enough, but it’s even harder for Seon Jin. A sickly disabled boy, Jin might as well be invisible. No one ever pays attention to him, except for the bullies who prey on him for being weak. Jin, however, keeps a very dark secret—there’s a serial killer in his house…and it’s his father!', '{"Drama","Horror","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"}', '{"crime","male-protagonist","gore","bullying","anti-hero","full-color","coming-of-age","disability","noir","heterosexual","delinquents","philosophy"}', NULL, '94', '5', NULL, '2014', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 77365, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b86964-vTdn1Esqw3va.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86964-pdcp6HlZ66lq.jpg', NULL, 86964, '111213', '{"Carnby Kim","Yeong-Chan Hwang","Pil Hong"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86964-pdcp6HlZ66lq.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mt50y78VoqM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mt50y78VoqM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jin Seon", "native": "선우진", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b126821-WcuV5GMptoO4.jpg"}, {"name": "Dong-Soo Seon", "native": "선우 동수", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127412-oxkS5FPg5Nrf.jpg"}, {"name": "Kyun Yoon", "native": "윤견", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127413-IRhIduOC7Bbr.png"}, {"name": "Jae-Hyeok Kim", "native": "김재혁", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127414-042G86A8bkl2.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86964'),
('MANHWA', 'The Greatest Estate Developer', 'Yeokdaegeum Yeongji Seolgyesa', '역대급 영지 설계사', 'When civil engineering student Su-Ho Kim falls asleep reading a fantasy novel, he wakes up as a character in the book! Su-Ho is now in the body of Lloyd Frontera, a lazy noble who loves to drink, and whose family is in a mountain of debt. Using his engineering knowledge, Su-Ho designs inventions to avert the terrible future that lies in wait for him. With the help of a giant hamster, a knight, and the world’s magic, can Su-Ho dig his new family out of debt and build a better future?', '{"Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"surreal-comedy","anachronism","male-protagonist","economics","kingdom-management","isekai","long-strip","anti-hero","slapstick","royal-affairs","full-color","parody"}', NULL, '222', NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 69767, '90', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx140407-fJQr0fmqq1IO.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/140407-WMGs02Q3fFUb.jpg', '#ffc943', 140407, '147272', '{"Hyeon-Min Lee","Hyeon-Su Kim","Baek-Gyeong Mun"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/140407-WMGs02Q3fFUb.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ODhmGJ42c_w/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ODhmGJ42c_w"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Lloyd Frontera", "native": "로이드 프론테라", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b269308-XTwR7eKuYRl2.png"}, {"name": "Javier Asrahan", "native": "하비엘 아스라한", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b269320-1xcSV3Ozya6l.png"}, {"name": "Alicia Magentano", "native": "알리시아 테르미나 마젠타노", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b269322-6OqlC7IaVfWN.png"}, {"name": "Arcos Frontera", "native": "아르코스 프론테라", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.