('MANHWA', 'SSS-Class Revival Hunter', 'SSS-geup Jugeoya Saneun Hunter', 'SSS급 죽어야 사는 헌터', 'In the mysterious, RPG dungeon-like Tower, Confucius Kim lives a mundane existence, envying all the star hunters. One day, his wish for more is granted with a legendary skill to copy others’ abilities… at the cost of his life. Before he can make sense of it, he’s killed by the #1 hunter, the Flame Emperor! But this activates his skill and now he’s copied a new one, the ability to travel back in time upon death. How will Confucius use these skills to outplay the competition and rise to the top?', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"male-protagonist","full-color","suicide","dungeon","urban-fantasy","ghost","primarily-adult-cast","cultivation","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 68694, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx128067-wnLBg6Cy1ncs.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/128067-F2qRPwWiCG7b.jpg', '#f16b5d', 128067, '146909', '{"Neida","Bill K","No-A Sin"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/128067-F2qRPwWiCG7b.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Sz51IU05F88/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sz51IU05F88"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gong-Ja Kim", "native": "김공자", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b203172-oVJDo9hlWshz.png"}, {"name": "Geom-Je", "native": "검제", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211827-jOlKLA5D7TWk.png"}, {"name": "Raviel Ivansia", "native": "라비엘 이반시아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307960-AJZpFVvSpOfK.jpg"}, {"name": "Anastasia Zelenska", "native": "아나스타샤 젤렌스카", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b21