('MANHWA', 'The Horizon', 'Supyeongseon', '수평선', 'A world where everything has been lost. A boy and a girl alone together. A spark of hope kindled between them. All they can do is move forward. But against broken adults and devastating despair, how long will they be able to keep going...?', '{"Adventure","Drama","Psychological"}', '{"survival","post-apocalyptic","philosophy","religion","coming-of-age","primarily-child-cast","crime","travel","male-protagonist","orphan","guns","gore"}', NULL, '21', '3', NULL, '2016', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 64982, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx100568-4BC0PsdwU4bL.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100568-BuzmQ7WSwG5H.jpg', NULL, 100568, '125036', '{"Ji-Hun Jeong","Abigail Blackman"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/100568-BuzmQ7WSwG5H.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Geu Sonyeon", "native": "그 소년", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184330-Iz1UIX3ytdZL.jpg"}, {"name": "Geu Sonyeo", "native": "그 소녀", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b197692-b5zbkzc4Hkt3.jpg"}, {"name": "Unjeonsa", "native": "운전사", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b312080-lrixDaAaojZr.png"}, {"name": "Isanghan Namja", "native": "이상한 남자", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b312087-7h5zI8VFE05u.png"}, {"name": "Supsogui Sonyeo", "native": "숲속의 소녀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b312088-C628gNPXxqhW.png"}, {"name": "Jeongjangeul Ibeun Namja", "native": "정장을 입은 남자", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b312089-hKpqUEFSSWEN.png"}, {"name": "Supsogui Sonyeon", "native": "숲속의 소년", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/f