('MANHWA', 'I’m the Max-Level Newbie', 'Na Honja Mallep Newbie', '나 혼자 만렙 뉴비', 'Kang Jin-Hyeok, a gaming streamer, and content creator is the only person who has cleared the game, [Tower of Trials]. However, as the game’s popularity declines, it becomes increasingly difficult for him to continue making a living as a content creator. Jinhyeok prepares to end his 11-year-long relationship with the game and say goodbye to his humble group of subscribers. But on that very day, the Tower of Trials appears in reality with a message saying that humanity will perish unless all players clear each floor within 90 days. Jin-Hyeok, who knows the game better than anyone, decides to use his knowledge to his advantage and dominate the tower. It’s time to show everyone what a hardcore gamer can do!', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","male-protagonist","dungeon","magic","urban-fantasy","anti-hero","demons","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 51161, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx137280-juUL79K7f9s7.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/137280-I46ILENRzGYY.jpg', '#c9e4f1', 137280, '147392', '{"WAN.Z","Swing Bat","Maslow"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/137280-I46ILENRzGYY.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-i9I3r6ZisU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-i9I3r6ZisU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jin-Hyeok Kang", "native": "강진혁", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b279938-Gh0ln66EwKfC.jpg"}, {"name": "Alice Von Ataraxia", "native": "엘리스 폰 아타락시아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282566-k1qoh9xKrSr9.png"}, {"name": "Teresa Du Laurentia", "native": "테레사 드 로렌시아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character