('MANHWA', 'A Returner''s Magic Should Be Special', 'Gwihwanjaui Mabeobeun Teukbyeolhaeya Hamnida', '귀환자의 마법은 특별해야 합니다', 'The worst calamity humankind has ever faced...

Shadow Realms have ravaged the earth and decimated almost everyone in their way. The survival of humanity hinges upon the success of just six mages, including analytic fighter Desir Herrman. The remaining heroes make one final stand to end the bloodshed...but to no avail. Desir closes his eyes on what should be the end of his life—only to open them and see the beginning of his school days?! Desir has returned thirteen years back to the past, where he’s been given another chance. A chance to see the loved ones he lost, a chance to meet his fellow warriors again, and a chance to save the world…!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","magic","lost-civilization","full-color","age-regression","school","war","swordplay","demons","historical","dungeon"}', NULL, '268', NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 50417, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx105393-oiHumQoBGKG5.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105393-ERoRkr9cT9B6.jpg', '#e4bb5d', 105393, '132247', '{"Wookjakga","Usonan","Micah Kim"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/105393-ERoRkr9cT9B6.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7m-7hsTzQb8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7m-7hsTzQb8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Desir Herrman", "native": "데지르 아르망", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141151-flvE2X91gtFN.png"}, {"name": "Romantica Eru", "native": "로맨티카 에루", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141152-49gUbSBkFK4H.png"}, {"name": "Pram Schneider", "native": "프람 슈나이저", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141153-guaQhmP2ovAS.png"}, {"name": "Azest Kingscrown", "native": "아제스 트킹스크라운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141154-EZh6Auf1rv50.png"}, {"name": "Zod Exarion", "native": "조드 엑사리온", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b172080-4bj2zD1C8JLl.png"}, {"name": "Swan Katarina", "native": "스완 카타리나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b324868-zkvLI0rkFSVv.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '105393'),
('MANHWA', 'Nano Machine', 'Nano Machine', '나노마신', 'Nanotechnology meets martial arts at the Mashin Academy. Yeo-Un’s mother may not be one of the High Priest’s six official wives, but his father’s blood still qualifies him for a chance at the position of Minor Priest. Will a mysterious nanomachine injection from a future descendent help Yeo-un in this fierce competition against his powerful half-siblings?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"martial-arts","cult","anti-hero","swordplay","full-color","politics","gore","revenge","cultivation","artificial-intelligence","male-protagonist","wuxia"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 48586, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx120980-RZ9WLd0o9hyo.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/120980-7ak3NnHP5f2X.jpg', '#e4506b', 120980, '147863', '{"Geobalhan","Geumgangbulgoe","Hanjung Worya"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/120980-7ak3NnHP5f2X.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_t397hfZC3w/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_t397hfZC3w"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yeo-Un Cheon", "native": "천여운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b267544-Rij5JmLpbnQa.png"}, {"name": "Mun-Gyu", "native": "문규", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283636-Z1R6el5KD4id.png"}, {"name": "Heo-Bong", "native": "허봉", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b361210-28BY8nt1WOpy.png"}, {"name": "Hobeopga", "native": "호법가", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b361212-fZuqD3uTSXkH.jpg"}, {"name": "Baek-Gi", "native": "백기", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b319324-8ZLpwvLlmPmv.jpg"