('MANHWA', 'The Legend of the Northern Blade', 'Bukgeom Jeongi', '북검전기', 'For decades, the brave warriors of the Northern Heavenly Sect fought to keep the world safe from the evil Silent Night. But when the fourth generation leader is accused of colluding with the enemy, he is forced to disband the sect and commit suicide to protect his son, Moo-Won. With no family and allies left, Moo-Won leads a dreary life under close surveillance... until a surprise attack from the Silent Night gives him a chance to escape to the mountains. There, the young warrior trains to master the fighting techniques of his predecessors, before the mysterious disappearance of a loved one brings him back to the mainland. Follow Moo-Won as he embarks on a journey to avenge his father’s death and take down the villains who threaten to plunge the world into darkness!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"martial-arts","revenge","male-protagonist","swordplay","full-color","gore","wuxia","politics","war","found-family"}', NULL, '202', NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 47066, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx119521-qYqxFvn0NnXo.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/119521-CPhjvDuMReVg.jpg', NULL, 119521, '134744', '{"Hae-Min","U-Gak","Son"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/119521-CPhjvDuMReVg.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A1DyXT9AZt8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A1DyXT9AZt8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Mu-Won Jin", "native": "진무원", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188800-Ak9ufC5L3rU0.png"}, {"name": "Ha-Seol Eun", "native": "은하설", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255611-LQ4xajt018qz.png"}, {"name": "Soo-Cheon Dam", "native": "담수천", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "http