('MANHWA', 'Eleceed', 'Eleceed', '일렉시드', 'Ji-U is a kind-hearted young man who harnesses the lightning quick reflexes of a cat to secretly make the world a better place – one saved little child or foster pet at a time. Kayden is a secret agent on the run, who finds himself stuck in the body of a…um…decidedly fat old fluffy cat. Together, armed with Ji-U’s super powers and Kayden’s uber-smarts, they’re out to fight those forces who would let evil rule this world. That is, if they can stand each other long enough to get the job done.', '{"Action","Comedy","Supernatural"}', '{"urban-fantasy","super-power","full-color","cultivation","found-family","animals","primarily-male-cast","male-protagonist","primarily-teen-cast","slapstick","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 46879, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx106929-flAUvHZDUz5v.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106929-jYmT1n3Z0m46.jpg', '#35c9e4', 106929, '147171', '{"Jae-Ho Son","Hye-Jin Kim"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/106929-jYmT1n3Z0m46.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ji-U Seo", "native": "서지우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b192792-O8m2jxFRt3pC.png"}, {"name": "Kayden Break", "native": "카이든 브레이크", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193144-2Pl6tSHDcsYT.png"}, {"name": "Kartein", "native": "카르테인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b229107-646DDB9F3sR1.png"}, {"name": "Ji-Seok Yu", "native": "유지석", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b203358-TxnltPuA08Vc.png"}, {"name": "Ji-Yeong Yu", "native": "유지영", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b203359-vnehUltk1dbX.png"}, {"name": "U-In", "native": 