('MANHWA', 'Lout of Count’s Family', 'Baekjakgaui Mangnaniga Doeeotda', '백작가의 망나니가 되었다', 'Kim Rok-Su has one life motto: “Let’s not get beat up.” But after dozing off somewhere midway through the novel “Birth of a Hero,” he wakes up as Cale Henituse - one of the minor villains in the novel who gets the beating of a lifetime from soon-to-be hero Choi Han. Only time will tell how much longer he has before that dreadful encounter. Can Kim Rok-Su change the course of this story so he can enjoy a long and lavish life free of the soon-to-be hero?', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","war","found-family","male-protagonist","politics","magic","super-power","full-color","anti-hero","royal-affairs","dragons","animals"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 45617, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx123573-LKoCKwRouEMW.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/123573-mUJqgpAkIWrX.jpg', '#e45d50', 123573, '147317', '{"Byeollarae","PAN4","Ryeo-Han Yu"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/123573-mUJqgpAkIWrX.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sh35YE4VgXE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sh35YE4VgXE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Cale  Henituse", "native": "케일 헤니투스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187471-3jj8DcFWYjYu.png"}, {"name": "Choi  Han", "native": "최한", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187470-8ivUDT6lLsie.jpg"}, {"name": "Raon Mir", "native": "라온 미르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196525-idyQgXIWT3qL.jpg"}, {"name": "Ohn", "native": "온", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b196524-n3Flfsauia9i.png"}, {"name": "Hong", "native": "홍", "role": 