('MANHWA', 'Pick Me Up', 'Pick Me Up!', '픽 미 업!', '1-Star heroes are just fodder for learning a boss'' attack patterns. That was Seojin Han''s philosophy when playing the notoriously difficult game Pick Me Up. But after being transported into the game as one of those 1-star heroes, he''s got no choice but to rise in rank and defeat the player controlling him and his party. Can a gacha game character hope to defeat a player akin to being his god?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"survival","video-games","isekai","death-game","full-color","male-protagonist","kingdom-management","long-strip","magic","gore","swordplay","anti-hero"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 45444, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx159441-9W8201jAT9Yv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/159441-ozFKHuPOjxhB.jpg', '#5dc9f1', 159441, '154587', '{"U-Ne Cho","Wasakbasak","Hermod"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/159441-ozFKHuPOjxhB.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u_bajZJ1l-o/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u_bajZJ1l-o"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yslat Han", "native": "한 이스라트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298546-D3iI1dihDjs3.jpg"}, {"name": "Jenna Shirai", "native": "제나 시라이", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305577-oM9yXJ6ITxBO.jpg"}, {"name": "Yvolka Strashur", "native": "이올카 리벨 스트라슈르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305579-xxoOOpjZcYtI.jpg"}, {"name": "Edith Callen", "native": "에디스 칼렌", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295375-Cun7mXPRjdK0.jpg"}, {"name": "Isel", "native": "이셀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/