('MANHWA', 'Second Life Ranker', 'Dubeon Saneun Ranker', '두번사는랭커', 'Yeonwoo’s brother disappeared years ago, and he’s devastated to learn of his death. As he copes with his loss, he’s given a pocket watch and learns there’s more to his brother’s death: he was betrayed while competing in the Tower of the Sun God. Now it’s Yeonwoo’s turn to use the knowledge his brother left behind. Can Yeonwoo (call sign: Cain) navigate that world and gain enough power and experience to reach the top of the tower, defeating his brother’s enemies and all those who stand in his way?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"revenge","full-color","male-protagonist","twins","gods","dungeon","survival","mythology","anti-hero","dragons"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 45129, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx109957-EgJWdR7l9TBG.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/109957-E6Q4YJTCjVTA.jpg', '#356be4', 109957, '147324', '{"Nong Nong","Do-Yeon Sa"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/109957-E6Q4YJTCjVTA.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yeon-U Cha", "native": "차연우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140547-8Oey7AgpfM8P.jpg"}, {"name": "Jeong-U Cha", "native": "차정우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165469-RDIsp8lL0zuf.jpg"}, {"name": "Edora", "native": "에도라", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165471-rvODUwTDgcfI.png"}, {"name": "Phante ", "native": "판트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b192568-LVy6doGgn7VM.png"}, {"name": "Nayu", "native": "나유", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b192564-0SvqPdaMocgI.png"}, {"name": "Sesha", "native": "세사", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b301459-mc0EIpUtsVIY.png"}, {"name": "Yvlke", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165468-7nUxRitLbYfF.png"}, {"name": "Yul", "native": "율", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b192606-yhsKIkigiOnK.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '109957'),
('MANHWA', 'The World After the Fall', 'Myeolmang Ihuui Segye', '멸망 이후의 세계', 'Faced with imminent defeat and certain death, would you choose to run – or continue to fight for a doomed world? When mysterious towers appear across the world, summoning monsters that prey on mankind, this is the choice presented to the Tower Walkers – adventurers with special powers to fight the monsters. On the brink of death, they can choose to use a “regression stone” to return to the past for a second chance, though this decision places them in a separate timeline forever. Stubborn Tower Walker Jae-Hwan rejects this choice, choosing to fight for the original timeline, and learning shocking secrets about the Tower along the way.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","male-protagonist","dungeon","primarily-male-cast","primarily-adult-cast","magic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 44973, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx144957-h0qIwRwxOEdg.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/144957-nHOZxp7Kgxmk.jpg', '#f1ae5d', 144957, '147217', '{"S-Cynan","Eondedeu Gamja","Singsyong"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/144957-nHOZxp7Kgxmk.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Mcqb7g3nRQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6Mcqb7g3nRQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jae-Hwan", "native": "재환", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270390-mE0rETRNBede.png"}, {"name": "Mi-No Han", "native": "한미노", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270391-wnT7janj2fyR.png"}, {"name": "Cheong Heo", "native": "청허", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b335543-eMafnTB8NzFh.jpg"}, {"name": "Sirwen Armelt", "native": "시르엔 아르멜트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b335544-rtUzFEqJeuN8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '144957'),
('MANHWA', 'The Boxer', 'The Boxer', '더 복서', 'You’ve got the raw talent. Or you’re the underdog. But do you have the heart? Do you have what it takes? Let’s see what you’re made of. The real fight starts now!', '{"Action","Drama","Sports"}', '{"boxing","martial-arts","athletics","male-protagonist","full-color","primarily-male-cast"}', NULL, '133', '13', NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 44684, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b119174-nFMZSHbrDDbt.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/119174-DoE2aiSp9DOn.jpg', '#f15d6b', 119174, '141120', '{"Ji-Hun Jeong"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/119174-DoE2aiSp9DOn.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6rAQCLUmwuI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6rAQCLUmwuI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yu", "native": "유", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174319-YCsHl8DS97Vt.jpg"}, {"name": "K", "native": "K", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208937-9C9FSDMVXiga.jpg"}, {"name": "J", "native": "J", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b278944-7sGg2scu5N5h.png"}, {"name": "Jay", "native": "인재", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174317-JBxQK6xceRk2.png"}, {"name": "Baeksan Ryu ", "native": "류백산", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174318-nouM12QpelcH.png"}, {"name": "Misaki", "native": "미사키", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208933-PKBykABskMpg.png"}, {"name": "John Taker", "native": "존 테이커", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208934-uS45ggBzqRIK.png"}, {"name": "Jean-Pierre Manuel", "native": "쟝 삐에르 마뉘엘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208935-qNT5TKiqDaF6.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '119174'),
('MANHWA', 'The Swordmaster''s Son', 'Geomsulmyeongga Mangnaeadeul', '검술명가 막내아들', 'Jin Runcandel was destined to become the head of his swordmaster clan. But despite his best efforts, he''s banished for his shoddy swordsmanship. Though Jin eventually makes a contract with the god Solderet and is freed from the curse that hindered his abilities, he meets a rather unfortunate end. In the next moment, however, he awakens as a baby, long before his tragedy began. Armed with a second chance and some new powers, Jin swears to fulfill his destiny and become the ultimate swordmaster.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","age-regression","swordplay","full-color","magic","anti-hero","dragons"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 44414, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx149332-adkSyOFY3c5U.jpg', NULL, NULL, 149332, '146949', '{"COBY","AZI","Je-Won Lee"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UspJjUOFrFQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UspJjUOFrFQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jin Runcandel", "native": "진 룬칸델", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283698-9deKCyrCnSsy.jpg"}, {"name": "Murakan", "native": "무라칸", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b300074-7BlAQUdttfag.jpg"}, {"name": "Gilly McLauran", "native": "길리 맥로란", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b386408-H414hJTIv7Js.jpg"}, {"name": "Ceres Endorma", "native": "시리스 엔도르마", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b386511-ZZ6JxZ0Tm8Ry.jpg"}, {"name": "Quicantel", "native": "퀴칸텔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b383131-3PdoAchdbMhy.jpg"}, {"name": "Valeria Heaster", "native": "발레리아 히스터", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b382913-c37hi0KwzHH8.jpg"}, {"name": "Chiron Runcandel", "native": "시론 룬칸델", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b300024-UHUBLjwT6Z2l.jpg"}, {"name": "Luna Runcandel", "native": "루나 룬칸델", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b300073-JzJzit3dNetj.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '149332'),
('MANHWA', 'Villains Are Destined to Die', 'Agyeogui Ending Jugeumppun', '악역의 엔딩은 죽음뿐', 'This game’s got me obsessed! It’s like it’s taken over my life... wait—HARD MODE ACTIVATED. No-no-no-no-no! It has literally taken me and thrown me into the part of Penelope Eckhart. Love is easy as the heroine, but as the hated villainess, I’m trying very hard not to die… at the hands of my brothers… the prince… a fork… every possible ending is death! This world is stacked against me, but can my wits and insider game knowledge score the affection of these male characters? Or the reset button???', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","villainess","full-color","isekai","estranged-family","adoption","video-games","ojou-sama","royal-affairs","long-strip","primarily-adult-cast","male-harem"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 43396, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx118408-zZuOINqjBZYn.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/118408-FT9bkwTdii7D.jpg', '#e45d93', 118408, '133641', '{"Suwol","Gyeo-Eul Kwon","Chiho Christie"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/118408-FT9bkwTdii7D.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sqKEkfMva_c/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sqKEkfMva_c"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Penelope Eckhart", "native": "페넬로페 에카르트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169632-YCq6ateRLXbM.png"}, {"name": "Derrick Eckhart", "native": "데릭 에카르트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169633-IJHSVt0x5Lmg.png"}, {"name": "Winter Berdandi", "native": "뷘터 베르단디", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169634-dfbhwApFGfYm.png"}, {"name": "Reynold Eckhart", "native": "레널드 에카르트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169635-58ouOLhO5dS4.png"}, {"name": "Callisto Regulus", "native": "칼리스토 레굴루스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169636-SpY8Kw9K5sjx.png"}, {"name": "Eckles", "native": "이클리스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b177033-RDugl70Qv7ez.png"}, {"name": "Emily", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b209742-SfwRlrv4Vl8X.png"}, {"name": "Duke Eckhart", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283425-FVeBUnohGku4.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '118408'),
('MANHWA', 'Wind Breaker', 'Wind Breaker', '윈드브레이커', 'Jay''s the perfect student. He''s got straight As and he''s the student body president. But after being coerced into joining the school''s biking team, the Hummingbird Crew, he discovers a whole new world outside of studying. What new adventures will he face outside the comfort of his textbooks?

- Includes two extra chapters.

- The work was cancelled after it was discovered that the artist had been tracing other people''s art.', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Romance","Sports"}', '{"cycling","coming-of-age","school","full-color","kuudere","heterosexual","delinquents","male-protagonist","fitness","slapstick","mafia"}', NULL, '554', NULL, NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'CANCELLED', 42554, '84', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx86099-lgjjEP3wqzB8.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86099-9ot1t7lYwtBh.jpg', NULL, 86099, '103237', '{"Yong-Seok Jo"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/86099-9ot1t7lYwtBh.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ja-Hyeon Jo", "native": "조자현", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137282-xHqKiX6ihlWA.png"}, {"name": "Min-U Yun", "native": "윤민우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140298-aQQM6BtyYwEx.png"}, {"name": "Yu-Bin Hong", "native": "홍유빈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b137281-IMQXieFJ5KBr.png"}, {"name": "Shelly", "native": "셸리", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140299-ttuDsrg2LofB.png"}, {"name": "Han-Nam Kang", "native": "강한남", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140300-OsTZ4hRHhVNF.png"}, {"name": "Mi-Yeong Kim", "native": "김미영", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b204905-PBm5GG1d8d2k.png"}, {"name": "Owen Knight", "native": "오웬 나이트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207618-LKQZ1EvWY6uO.png"}, {"name": "Monster13", "native": "몬스터13", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b233788-WPKkTOlnlubF.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '86099'),
('MANHWA', 'The Infinite Mage', 'Muhanui Mabeopsa', '무한의 마법사', 'After Sirone was abandoned in a stable, he was found by a family of hunters and raised in a loving home. Despite the hardships of the peasant life, he learned how to read from a young age and became obsessed with books, especially ones on the history of magic. One day, he has an unlikely encounter with a mage and learns how to enter the "spirit zone," the first step to learning how to use magic. Although they say only nobles can be mages, will Sirone be able to prove his infinite potential?', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","school","male-protagonist","full-color"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 41363, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx159930-qK1P4BNQL0zG.jpg', NULL, '#1a78f1', 159930, '154692', '{"kiraz","Themis","Chi-U Kim"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u1eGunCnKcs/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u1eGunCnKcs"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shirone Arian", "native": "아리안 시로네", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b304076-s5hlaPMbwJKO.jpg"}, {"name": "Rian Ogent", "native": "오젠트 리안", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b304074-pNWDhUdU8gkU.jpg"}, {"name": "Amy Karmis", "native": "카르미스 에이미", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b304075-USXMZVmRSley.jpg"}, {"name": "Reina Ogent", "native": "오젠트 레이나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b304077-eUDIsjg10Caw.jpg"}, {"name": "Olina Arian", "native": "아리안 올리나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b320466-TnfhRCB37PzN.png"}, {"name": "Vincent Arian", "native": "아리안 빈센트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b320467-Drgt2vG9GobQ.png"}, {"name": "Jake Ardius", "native": "아르디우스 제이크", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b320468-G3BHjiSiaxuJ.png"}, {"name": "Kite", "native": "카이트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b320469-SCDXQ4ARcfwJ.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '159930'),
('MANHWA', 'Doom Breaker', 'Tusinjeonsaenggi', '투신전생기', 'Zephyr is the last human fighting evil in a world abandoned by the gods. When he is killed in battle by Tartarus, the god of destruction, all hope for humanity seems lost. But Zephyr’s fate is not sealed — the gods who find his battles entertaining have gifted him a second chance at life, as he is sent ten years into the past, back to when he was a slave instead of the most powerful human alive. Can Zephyr get his revenge against Tartarus and save the woman he loves, or is he doomed to repeat the past?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","full-color","dungeon","gods","revenge","dragons","magic","age-regression","conspiracy","swordplay"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 41046, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx136220-u9sewv3u02mN.jpg', NULL, '#43c9e4', 136220, '147172', '{"Cheong-Dam"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BOqe_XcNCBo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BOqe_XcNCBo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Zephyr", "native": "제피르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235008-MAzFI9rLVYE5.png"}, {"name": "Altair Cayenne", "native": "알테어 유스티나 카이엔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b285595-qB0sGUPMnzsz.png"}, {"name": "Ned Stryer", "native": "네드 스트라이어", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b250573-Dq9gmC561ygR.png"}, {"name": "Mercedes", "native": "메르세데스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235009-LSyzyPN4IqJN.png"}, {"name": "Anna Primrose", "native": "안나 프림로즈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b250574-PZTNmiRLJXMR.png"}, {"name": "Polaris Cayenne", "native": "폴라리스 알베르 카이엔", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b285596-B0uFK7CV9si2.png"}, {"name": "Silvestia", "native": "실베스티아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305417-gMAm9J5NbqXH.png"}, {"name": "Eurydice", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b318892-L8Cpm8hoWx4j.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '136220'),
('MANHWA', 'Who Made Me a Princess', 'Eoneu Nal Gongjuga Doeeobeoryeotda', '어느 날 공주가 되어버렸다', 'The story of Athanasia, forsaken princess of the Obelian Empire, ends with her execution at the hands of her own father—or does it? Her tragic tale is the plot of the novel The Lovely Princess. But now, a modern woman who read the book has just woken up as baby Athanasia herself, filled with her own memories and knowledge of the story she’s stuck in! Determined to survive her doomed fate, infant Athanasia embarks on this new life with a plan: avoid attention and hoard valuables to fund her escape. When her plan goes awry, she suddenly needs to charm her way into the good graces of her father, the beautiful tyrant emperor, so he doesn’t kill her again!', '{"Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","isekai","magic","family-life","full-color","tsundere","parenthood","kingdom-management","coming-of-age","revenge","age-regression","royal-affairs"}', NULL, '135', '9', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 40451, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx107521-M4x3AUb7UGIM.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107521-mIv5O0dYsbFf.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 107521, '121269', '{"Plutus","Spoon","Lauren Na"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107521-mIv5O0dYsbFf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MgrEZTLdQzs/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MgrEZTLdQzs"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Athanasia de Alger Obelia", "native": "아타나시아 데이 앨제어 오벨리아", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143632-3JXSQ2OelHv4.png"}, {"name": "Claude de Alger Obelia", "native": "클로드 데이 앨제어 오벨리아", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136776-36ItTDd9ZSlL.png"}, {"name": "Lucas", "native": "루카스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136777-8ZGIYEBxjjkX.png"}, {"name": "Ijekiel Alpheus", "native": "이제키엘 알피어스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143629-kbBpiT5e9GFz.png"}, {"name": "Jennette Margarita", "native": "제니트 마그리타", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143630-sXMrM0Z0nxxv.jpg"}, {"name": "Felix Robane", "native": "필릭스 로베인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143631-q4scGCgW1eLm.png"}, {"name": "Roger Alpheus", "native": "로저 알피어스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143633-SMg6Evluc1aU.jpg"}, {"name": "Anastacius de Alger Obelia", "native": "아나스타시우스 데이 앨제어 오벨리아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143635-UUjDKp4IkT6B.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '107521'),
('MANHWA', 'THE BREAKER', 'The Breaker', '브레이커', 'The story of The Breaker follows Shi-Woon Yi, a timid high school student who becomes the disciple of Chun-Woo Han, a martial artist who is an enemy to the secret martial arts society known as the Murim. However, Shi-Woon is nave and unaware of his master''s shady past and the unseen underbelly of the society. How will Chun-Woo manage to teach Shi-Woon and help him survive in the world of the Murim?', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama"}', '{"martial-arts","male-protagonist","gangs","school"}', NULL, '72', '10', NULL, '2007', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 39897, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/nx38586-F697FlJkHF9z.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/38586-yI5y8YAH4Gho.jpg', '#e4aea1', 38586, '8586', '{"Geuk-Jin Jeon","Jin-Hwan Park"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/38586-yI5y8YAH4Gho.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shi-Woon Yi", "native": "이시운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21562.jpg"}, {"name": "Chun-U Han", "native": "한천우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21563.jpg"}, {"name": "Shi-Ho Lee", "native": "이시호", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n29296-IRQyT1vKHVn8.jpg"}, {"name": "Un-Wol", "native": "은월", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/38085.jpg"}, {"name": "Sae-Hie", "native": "세희", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b29427-kyiHLRLtDTMV.jpg"}, {"name": "Chang-Ho", "native": "창호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/29431.jpg"}, {"name": "Ji-Shi Yoon", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}, {"name": "So-Sul Woo", "native": "우소설", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b29697-KnLqfGiZM83J.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '38586'),
('MANHWA', 'Overgeared', 'Temppal', '템빨', 'Sin Yeong-U (a.k.a. Grid), an unlucky man in life and a low-level player in the popular VR game “Satisfy,” finds a powerful item that earns him a rare legendary class title: “Pagma’s Successor.” He’s now a skilled blacksmith who can forge unique weapons and equip the game’s most powerful gear. Grid resolves to use his new abilities to achieve fame and fortune, but as his very existence begins to stir up trouble in Satisfy, he realizes that life as a legend may be more than he bargained for….', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"video-games","virtual-world","male-protagonist","magic","kingdom-management","swordplay","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 38971, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx117460-46JbftfHSXoc.jpg', NULL, '#e4505d', 117460, '147727', '{"Dong-Wook Lee","Team Argo","Sae-Nal Park"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wwfZ6BQbIcM/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wwfZ6BQbIcM"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yeong-U Sin", "native": "신영우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181138-x6TUq6eHkRkN.png"}, {"name": "Yu-Ra", "native": "유라", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b182899-xtrJI0Uwm2e0.png"}, {"name": "Jishuka", "native": "지슈카", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b182896-YFAm5E5hmQ8h.png"}, {"name": "Irene", "native": "아이린", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b242331-NNyf0yUahvs8.png"}, {"name": "Regas", "native": "레가스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b182891-hojxvJHxQE1I.png"}, {"name": "Marie Rose", "native": "마리로즈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291295-C8JbM7f1suJ6.png"}, {"name": "Lauel", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b322615-oP4EtFs2mvFL.png"}, {"name": "Euphemina", "native": "유페미나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b182895-ksw8vYpMDV3E.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '117460'),
('MANHWA', 'The Return of the Disaster-Class Hero', 'Jaeanggeup Yeongungnimi Gwihwanhasyeotda', '재앙급 영웅님이 귀환하셨다', 'Humans call them “calamities”—the unknown, destructive creatures that suddenly appeared on earth. To challenge these calamities, the zodiac gods awakened 12 humans known as saints. But there was one more that awoke—unchosen but the greatest hero of all: Geon Lee. His allies betrayed him and left him for dead, but now, 20 years later, he’s more powerful than ever and ready to teach his fellow “saints” a lesson they’ll never forget.', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"anti-hero","male-protagonist","gods","full-color","astronomy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 38928, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx143056-MEpVxW7346jz.jpg', NULL, '#e45043', 143056, '149013', '{"HEATS","Beom-Geun Lee","Sanjijiksong"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Sy4PeK3mCrI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sy4PeK3mCrI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Geon Lee", "native": "이건", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264360-jtOQmiJBL7bO.jpg"}, {"name": "Wei Yang", "native": "양 웨이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b282882-xnY2BfvT4CE8.jpg"}, {"name": "Hugo Sudal", "native": "수달 휴고", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283901-xkRczCEuEO0Y.jpg"}, {"name": "Seong-Jae Cheon", "native": "천성재", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283902-dNgnd4kvOHZ1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '143056'),
('MANHWA', 'The Archmage Returns After 4000 Years', '4000 Nyeon Mane Gwihwanhan Daemadosa', '4000년 만에 귀환한 대마도사', 'Lucas Trowman was the greatest archmage in history until he was condemned by Demigod to spend eternity losing his mind. But 4,000 years later, he’s thrust back into this world, into the body of Frei Blake, the weakest, most un-talented student at the prestigious Westroad Academy for mages. After all this time, the world of magic has barely progressed. Could this be the work of Demigod? Determined to find out, Lucas seeks to reach the highest levels of power once again and get his revenge.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","full-color","gods","revenge","male-protagonist","cultivation","dragons","conspiracy","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 38601, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx118424-JbTApgnIP1ON.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/118424-HqPRr8BBYbzV.jpg', '#fee450', 118424, '147693', '{"Barnicle","Deok-Yong Kim","Nakhasan"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/118424-HqPRr8BBYbzV.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9lqYDD8hqT0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9lqYDD8hqT0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Lukas Trowman", "native": "루카스트로우맨", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b185995-av7GjWt937z6.jpg"}, {"name": "Isabelle Triznine", "native": "이사벨이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b185996-4VFgKoaDZP3f.png"}, {"name": "Frey Blake", "native": "프레이 블레이크", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b185997-faQ7CoqwE6LG.png"}, {"name": "Riki", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b279873-0cRhqKTxohLq.png"}, {"name": "Iris Peacefinder", "native": "이리스 피스파인더", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307239-qluieHs7yqUe.png"}, {"name": "Kasajin", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307240-7M4E7WFJ6BnB.png"}, {"name": "Ananta", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307241-kuuER6f51F0i.png"}, {"name": "Junim", "native": "주님", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b307242-UIjNanbQFObA.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '118424'),
('MANHWA', 'Tomb Raider King', 'Dogul Wang', '도굴왕', 'Mysterious tombs appeared all over the world one day, each containing a relic which grants its owner supernatural abilities. Joo-Heon Suh is a tomb explorer, excavator, and raider. Betrayed by his employer, he''s about to die at the hands of a powerful new relic when he suddenly finds himself 15 years in the past, before any relics or tombs made their debut. Driven by feelings of revenge, how will Joo-Heon use his knowledge of the future to become the Tomb Raider King?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","anti-hero","full-color","mythology","age-regression","dungeon","historical","gods"}', NULL, '411', NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 37225, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx110462-okQFIoSFvb4L.jpg', NULL, '#0d5da1', 110462, '130216', '{"Yoonz","3B2S","Sanjijiksong"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4OdwMmwU50k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4OdwMmwU50k"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ju-Heon Seo", "native": "서주헌", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141875-YxUiyxknS16n.png"}, {"name": "Irene  Holton", "native": "아이린 홀튼", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187029-dzi7JIAfPrVz.jpg"}, {"name": "Seol-A Lee", "native": "이설아", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187176-cIFczOA24i0B.png"}, {"name": "Jae-Ha Yu", "native": "유재하", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187178-COovUjQPR7lr.png"}, {"name": "Julian Miller", "native": "율리안 밀러", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187179-TM70djXpAEKR.png"}, {"name": "Chloe Laurent", "native": "클로에 로랑", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214289-gxzHWPLKXqLM.png"}, {"name": "Ilya Volgof", "native": "일리야 볼고프", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266168-idydXLkRrodq.png"}, {"name": "Crow", "native": "까마귀", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295963-Y9tcqVmexOkz.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '110462'),
('MANHWA', 'Latna Saga: Survival of a Sword King', 'Igye Geomwang Saengjongi', '이계 검왕 생존기', 'After being recently discharged from military service and just drifting through life, Hanbin Ryu is suddenly transported to another world. However, his “guide line,” the system bestowed upon him to help with his survival and growth, was filled with errors, causing him to be stuck in the tutorial stage for over 20 years. When he is finally released from this personal hell, he finds everyone has turned against otherworlders like him. Just how will this low-level, super-tutorial newbie survive?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","swordplay","isekai","full-color","magic","virtual-world"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 36416, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx114605-MYUWMsdjry6m.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/114605-TdVVCVg2jj28.jpg', '#e4ae43', 114605, '146982', '{"Gyeong-Bae Im","Sun-Gyu Gwon","Oliva Osanz"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/114605-TdVVCVg2jj28.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Han-Bin Ryu", "native": "류한빈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b156850-5B1Ikh3xxdcK.png"}, {"name": "Ephyr", "native": "에피르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b226257-EZ3hh1HrQLcf.png"}, {"name": "Atisse Bennister", "native": "아티스베니스터", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b226258-dBclAjlLkzWA.jpg"}, {"name": "Kivye", "native": "키비에", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b226259-RAyl58MxfiTF.png"}, {"name": "Leonhart", "native": "레온하르트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b351163-MIwyTwL0BTlM.png"}, {"name": "Laude Roud", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b328263-SiiGFD6c2Mb8.png"}, {"name": "Patault", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b328265-pY6YKu2B5hCW.png"}, {"name": "Zenovia", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b328266-Y3hbujb7kiGh.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '114605'),
('MANHWA', 'The Player Who Can''t Level Up', 'Level-Up Motaneun Player', '레벨업 못하는 플레이어', 'When Kim Kigyu received his invitation to become a player (a unique-ability player, at that), he thought his struggles were over. But no matter how hard he tries, he just can’t seem to get past level 1! After five years of working as a guide on the lower floors of the tower, he’s finally discovered his ability to link with “Egos” and raise his stats. As his new skills unlock adventures in unexplored gates, Kigyu gets his chance to defy expectations and show the world that rank isn’t everything.', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","male-protagonist","super-power","urban-fantasy","swordplay","full-color"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 35881, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx130511-4O6dF8oaiVJh.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130511-yhBYCJcZtJyZ.jpg', '#e45d86', 130511, '147995', '{"Aengmusae","Jeong-Jae Park","Bin-Ji Ga"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130511-yhBYCJcZtJyZ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5EOX1gzHPZo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5EOX1gzHPZo"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '130511'),
('MANHWA', 'My Blasted Reincarnated Life', 'Bireomeogeul Hwansaeng', '빌어먹을 환생', 'When the warrior Hamel sacrifices himself to protect his rival Bermut Lionhart, he makes Bermut vow to vanquish the last of the demon kings. Reincarnated with his memories 300 years later, he is shocked to find that not only are the demon kings still alive, but that he has been reborn as Eugene Lionhart, a member of his former rival’s bloodline! Now, as Eugene comes of age, he must train to prove himself as a Lionhart and eliminate the remaining demon kings once and for all.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","full-color","swordplay","magic","demons"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 35625, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx151512-q0Xddr1JNKNq.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/151512-EPskkVDBQvtC.jpg', '#5dc9e4', 151512, '149438', '{"Kiki","Jeong-Yeol Park","Mokma"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/151512-EPskkVDBQvtC.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3Yt634JSk4k/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Yt634JSk4k"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Eugene Lionhart", "native": "유진 라이언하트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283160-ocTh6z3XHrB3.jpg"}, {"name": "Bermut Lionhart", "native": "베르무트 라이언하트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b283621-ANeANpG6lWLC.png"}, {"name": "Sienna Merdein", "native": "세냐 메르데인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289784-XCvtCgWOA8gZ.png"}, {"name": "Ciel Lionheart", "native": "시엘 라이언하트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b293907-LxW1yDvAuoxi.png"}, {"name": "Carmen Lionheart", "native": "카르멘 라이언하트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b293908-WTJYphD20MPf.png"}, {"name": "Balzac Ludbeth", "native": "발자크 루드베스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294034-FGnJcUeJ0jXo.png"}, {"name": "Kristina Rogeris", "native": "크리스티나 로게리스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b325547-5m1jqt3yHY35.png"}, {"name": "Molon Ruhr", "native": "모론 루하르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b325549-b7BafnKUk8dU.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '151512'),
('MANHWA', 'Noblesse', 'Noblesse', '노블레스', 'Rai wakes up from an 820-year-long sleep and starts his new life as a student in a high school founded by his loyal servant, Frankenstein. But his peaceful days with other human students are soon interrupted by mysterious attackers known as the "Unions."', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","vampire","full-color","foreign","male-protagonist","werewolf","family-life","school","urban-fantasy","long-strip"}', NULL, '544', NULL, NULL, '2007', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 35289, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx59983-cfSjrRxuAlAD.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n59983-epdj2CSommgv.jpg', NULL, 59983, '29983', '{"Jae-Ho Son","Gwang-Su Lee"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n59983-epdj2CSommgv.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Frankenstein", "native": "프랑켄슈타인", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b48753-li5DHzOcqkuT.jpg"}, {"name": "Cadis Etrama di Raizel", "native": "카디스 에드라마 디 라이세르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b48967-JZb8UWYqYKFP.jpg"}, {"name": "Shin-Woo Han", "native": "한신우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/49077.jpg"}, {"name": "Ik-Han Woo", "native": "우익한", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/49079.jpg"}, {"name": "Regis K. Landegre", "native": "레지스 K. 란데그르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/54209.jpg"}, {"name": "Tao", "native": "타오", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b56123-Il69XOlPFGSP.jpg"}, {"name": "Yuna Suh", "native": "서윤아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/56347.jpg"}, {"name": "Su-I Im", "native": "임수이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/56349.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '59983'),
('MANHWA', 'The Lazy Lord Masters the Sword', 'Natae Gongja, Nolyeog Cheonjae Doeda', '나태 공자, 노력 천재 되다', 'After witnessing the shocking death of his mother, young Airen Farreira uses sleep to escape his painful reality, earning him the nickname, “the lazy lord”. Yet, in spite of others’ jeers and whispers, Airen has no intention of changing his ways. But when he awakens one day from a dream about a mysterious swordsman, his life’s trajectory takes a complete turn...', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","swordplay","coming-of-age","rehabilitation","male-protagonist","primarily-adult-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 34540, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx135325-YAhEGWro8zFK.jpg', NULL, '#e4a11a', 135325, '146827', '{"doip","Deung-Byeol Lee","Do-Mun Do"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Airen Farreira", "native": "아이른 파레이라", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b231042-5axELGSw6F17.jpg"}, {"name": "Ignet Crescentia", "native": "이그넷 크레센시아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297122-S0PNH1TqrrCi.jpg"}, {"name": "Brett Lloyd", "native": "브랫 로이드", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297123-m60tjpJ9iKM4.png"}, {"name": "Ilya Lindsay", "native": "일리아 린제이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297124-L5UdFZdQ0Sgw.jpg"}, {"name": "Judith", "native": "주디스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297125-drF5YaI13R6e.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '135325'),
('MANHWA', 'Solo Leveling: Ragnarok', 'Na Honjaman Level Up: Ragnarok', '나 혼자만 레벨업 : 라그나로크', 'In a world of gates, monsters, and hunters galore, Soo-Ho Sung is…well, he’s just an ordinary college student. Sure, his parents went missing right before the gates started appearing three years ago, and he occasionally had a weird dream where he could beat up monsters and level up like a video game, but other than that? There’s absolutely nothing special about him. So when a sudden monster outbreak occurs on his campus, he must fight back every instinct screaming at him to run away as he takes a page out of his dad’s book and rushes to save his classmate. The chances of making it alive are looking bleak, until—PING! [Congratulations on becoming a Player.]', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","super-power","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy","war","demons","dungeon","necromancy","college","magic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 33385, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx179445-ho0nb7baJ1a5.jpg', NULL, '#5d86f1', 179445, '172429', '{"Do Dang","JIN","REDICE"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Su-Ho Seong", "native": "성수호", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b306654-X4NPzJINty9U.jpg"}, {"name": "Jin-U Seong", "native": "성진우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129928-BCEjVaP0AQSw.png"}, {"name": "Dong-Su Hwang", "native": "황동수", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136075-M6VRrZyHpaI5.png"}, {"name": "Jin-Ho Yu", "native": "유진호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136076-D7eiE3pA9U8g.jpg"}, {"name": "Yun-Ho Baek", "native": "백윤호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136077-IIMqRmMK5Fgs.png"}, {"name": "Jin-Cheol U", "native": "우진철", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b136819-okbPuuFAefYX.png"}, {"name": "Il-Hwan Seong", "native": "성일환", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138790-i3DFMscWID9D.jpg"}, {"name": "Jong-In Choi", "native": "최종인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138794-dZNdO0pvZ659.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '179445'),
('MANHWA', 'The Stellar Swordmaster', 'Byeoreul Pumeun Swordmaster', '별을 품은 소드마스터', 'The so-called “Lighthouse of the North,” the prosperous trading town of Schoarra, hides a dark underbelly: seedy slums ruled by five ruthless crime bosses. When streetwise orphan Vlad finds the brothel he works for decimated by a disgraced knight, he turns to the path of the blade, pledging himself to the pursuit of power by sword. Blessed with the ability to seek wisdom from his sentient sword, Vlad embarks upon a journey of growth and peril as swordsman in service to the powerful House Vayezid.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","swordplay","politics","full-color","coming-of-age","magic","revenge","heterosexual"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 32805, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx170400-yMIuOIboWuoO.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/170400-EgLAQtqhdQAx.jpg', '#5dc9f1', 170400, '163116', '{"Dae-Ui Hong","Juno","Q10"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/170400-EgLAQtqhdQAx.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Vlad", "native": "블라드", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378004-wS3tTLJnFEYD.png"}, {"name": "Zayar", "native": "자야르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378001-RR67jGCK5zup.jpg"}, {"name": "Jemina", "native": "제미나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378002-JbH5BcdWTsDz.png"}, {"name": "Josef Vayezid", "native": "요제프 바예지드", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378003-zDXWHlEPku9t.jpg"}, {"name": "Alicia Hynal", "native": "알리시아 하이날", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378005-cMZQkZtxLQId.png"}, {"name": "Oepari Jack", "native": "외팔이 잭", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378059-91Vt5KAgRAvG.jpg"}, {"name": "Dice", "native": "다이스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378060-6kmvmG0EkR6O.png"}, {"name": "Geomeun Gom", "native": "검은 곰", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378061-xJnAH9d8rmI2.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '170400'),
('MANHWA', 'After Ten Millennia in Hell', 'Man Nyeon Mane Gwihwanhan Player', '만 년 만에 귀환한 플레이어', 'Oh Kangwoo the Demon King has had it with ruling over Hell and wants to return to Earth. But when he finally gets there, not only are his powers sealed, but the Earth he once knew has turned into an MMORPG free-for-all. Dimensional gates have appeared all over the world, and "players" enter them to make a living by hunting monsters. If Kangwoo wants to survive in this dangerous game, he''s going to have to level up, and fast. But for this demon king, hell on earth might be worse than Hell itself!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","magic","full-color","male-protagonist","anti-hero","demons"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 32733, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx153284-roAlRmlRM7Vs.png', NULL, '#fea150', 153284, '150210', '{"Ju-Gyeong Maeng","4PLAYER","Nabigyegok"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Kang-U O", "native": "오강우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284486-Prj4x99Xusmd.png"}, {"name": "Benigoeo", "native": "베니고어", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '153284'),
('MANHWA', 'The Extra’s Academy Survival Guide', 'Academy-eseo Saranamgi', '아카데미에서 살아남기', 'Ed Rothstaylor is a third-rate villain in a game, disowned by his family and kicked out of the dormitory for his misdeeds. One day, our main character wakes up as this very Ed, and realizes he must earn a scholarship so he can graduate and be set for life. Now living in the woods, he resolves to keep away from the protagonists, but four of the female leads just won''t leave him alone. Not only that, his presence starts to change the timeline and events of the game! Can Ed help the story progress while staying out of the limelight?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","full-color","isekai","school","magic","unrequited-love","female-harem","survival","heterosexual","yandere"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 31800, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx172619-LSoXY45QAas4.jpg', NULL, '#ff861a', 172619, '166865', '{"Green Kyrin","Korita"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ed Rothstaylor", "native": "에드 로스테일러", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b342786-tZ5BGLjyrTfQ.jpg"}, {"name": "Janica Faylover", "native": "재니카 페일오버", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b342783-mYurQdvaevp8.jpg"}, {"name": "Lucy Mayreel", "native": "루시 메이릴", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b342781-ufXg3FDIbcvF.jpg"}, {"name": "Lortelle Kecheln", "native": "로르텔 케헬른", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b342788-yXHzCMk9QWTT.jpg"}, {"name": "Clarisse", "native": "클라리스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b388135-phkQBOLFQckq.jpg"}, {"name": "Annis Heylan", "native": "아니스 헤일란", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b367051-IgExKFpuiN3H.jpg"}, {"name": "Tanya Rothstaylor", "native": "타냐 로스테일러", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b367045-yFB5RWQmwFHH.jpg"}, {"name": "Phoenia Elias Kloel", "native": "페니아 엘리어스 클로엘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b342785-vd7E6fpfZCIy.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '172619'),
('MANHWA', 'The Max Level Hero Strikes Back!', 'Mallep Yeongungnim Kkeseo Gwihwan Hasinda!', '만렙 영웅님 께서 귀환 하신다!', 'Struck by an enemy’s arrow, the powerless Prince Davey O’Rowane falls into a coma. His soul travels to a place where the greatest of the great gather—the honorable Hall of Heroes. There a thousand years pass as Davey undergoes excruciating training under their watchful eyes to become a hero too strong for his own good. Now back to his timeline and his kingdom, he’s wide awake and the enemies hiding in the king’s court better be prepared. The prince they had dismissed is now their biggest threat!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","politics","full-color","magic","conspiracy","gods"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 31785, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx125636-g0gkyLZbo3Tz.png', NULL, '#f1d6c9', 125636, '147322', '{"Yudo","Angmakkori"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Davy Al Raun", "native": "데이비 올 라운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b220162-L46O7d8Az40R.jpg"}, {"name": "Perserk von Palan", "native": "페르세르크 폰 팔란", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b220163-omfegmAzxiXG.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '125636'),
('MANHWA', 'The Novel''s Extra', 'Soseol Sok Extra', '소설 속 엑스트라', 'Wouldn’t it be a dream to wake up in a world of your own creation? For Kim Hajin, it’s nothing short of a nightmare. With no clue how or why he’s been transported into his web novel — as a mere extra, no less! — Hajin has little choice but to see his story through until the end. Lucky for him, as the author, he knows this perilous world like the back of his hand. But when discrepancies in the plot begin popping up left and right, Hajin soon realizes that things aren’t quite so simple, after all…', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","full-color","male-protagonist","super-power","tsundere","school","guns","magic","swordplay"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 30250, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx152128-hk1Dq8zlEPVn.png', NULL, '#5d86f1', 152128, '148985', '{"Seul-Gi Park","Ju-Hui O","Gap-Song Ji"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4mamlw_Z8eo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4mamlw_Z8eo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ha-Jin Kim", "native": "김하진", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297627-kIrFSwrPRGF6.png"}, {"name": "Su-Ho Kim", "native": "김수호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b297628-EBlUBrbVf2It.png"}, {"name": "Na-Yun Chae", "native": "채나윤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330181-QjkdkJWAY8hi.png"}, {"name": "Yeon-Ha Yu", "native": "유연하", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b324780-zHmHPeAisGyZ.png"}, {"name": "Rachel Louise", "native": "레이첼 엘리자베스 루이즈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330180-S1IluA9DFHbE.png"}, {"name": "Evandel", "native": "에반젤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330179-v3478F7saqmI.png"}, {"name": "Boss", "native": "대장", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330178-lZoloauwAWks.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '152128'),
('MANHWA', 'The Academy''s Genius Swordsman', 'Academy Cheonjaekaljabi', '아카데미의 천재칼잡이', 'Following a momentous battle against giants for the fate of the world, Ronan emerges victorious as the last man standing of the imperial army. As he laments this hollow victory with his dying commander, Grand Marshal Adeshan, they quickly learn that the war is far from over and an overwhelming force of giants descends from the heavens. Fearing the worst, yet seeing hope in the courageous Ronan, Adeshan uses her last time slip to send him back to the past, so that he can enroll in the prestigious Phileon Academy and become the strongest swordsman the empire has ever seen!', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"swordplay","male-protagonist","full-color","magic","school"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 29830, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx167649-8qpdNIjBdIhQ.png', NULL, '#e4506b', 167649, '162700', '{"Sichi","Gwan-Do Seo"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ronan", "native": "로난", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311221-e3DnZMixfY3p.png"}, {"name": "Aselle", "native": "아셀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311225-4i7TJLpP32af.jpg"}, {"name": "Iril", "native": "이릴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311226-vBaOJh5vRI4g.jpg"}, {"name": "Adeshan", "native": "아데샨", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311941-rrzQtNHgEJmR.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '167649'),
('MANHWA', 'The Reason Why Raeliana Ended Up at the Duke''s Mansion', 'Geunyeoga Gongjakjeoro Gaya Haetdeon Sajeong', '그녀가 공작저로 가야 했던 사정', 'Eunha Park was just a regular girl desperate to get into college, but when she finally does, her elation is cut short as she''s pushed off a roof—only to wake up as Raeliana McMillan, a character from a novel whose death serves as the catalyst for the story''s events. But Raeliana refuses to die a second time and is determined to change her fate, no matter what!', '{"Comedy","Fantasy","Mystery","Romance"}', '{"full-color","female-protagonist","isekai","conspiracy","politics","revenge","primarily-adult-cast","royal-affairs","heterosexual","fake-relationship"}', NULL, '158', '9', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 29319, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx104973-5KZSV2FK9BMt.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/104973-TzptXjVKOXqo.jpg', '#e4935d', 104973, '118646', '{"Go-Rae","Milcha","David Odell"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/104973-TzptXjVKOXqo.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6f7b589Zrz0/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6f7b589Zrz0"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Raeliana McMillan", "native": "레리아나 맥밀런", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b147510-Z9O3wnkPFAhw.jpg"}, {"name": "Noah Wynknight", "native": "노아 벌스테어 윈나이트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b147511-oDqLy4YLv99L.jpg"}, {"name": "Adam  Taylor", "native": "아담 테일러", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b169775-gaAbJcfxt4zC.png"}, {"name": "Heika Demint", "native": "히이카 데민트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b189734-9p0PIYPnK1rT.png"}, {"name": "Justin Shamal", "native": "저스틴 샤말", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b189735-jTGZfRFggGHY.jpg"}, {"name": "Beatrice Tranchett", "native": "베아트리스 트란쳇", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b189736-cmD7XQuqkrwk.jpg"}, {"name": "Francis Brooks", "native": "프렌치 브룩스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b189737-IQLjfb6KoJ73.jpg"}, {"name": "Vivian Shamal", "native": "비비안 샤말", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b290883-VCWQX2JNQL2u.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '104973'),
('MANHWA', 'Level Up with the Gods', 'Singwa Hamkke Level Up', '신과 함께 레벨업', '“Maybe Inner Gods can never defeat Outer Gods…” so thought Yu-Won Kim, a plucky, high-ranking warrior, after a bitter defeat. But Yu-Won is too tenacious to give up. His loss becomes the dawn of a new journey as a returnee. With renewed determination, Yu-Won starts back from where he began, smashing monster after monster and relearning his skills before taking on the Tower once again. But can he fight his way through the tutorials and level up once more, or will his conquest crumble before him?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"gods","full-color","male-protagonist","mythology","magic","survival","death-game","age-regression","post-apocalyptic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 29067, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx138222-PyVZk5MOWP07.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/138222-sfWXqL0VfFl9.jpg', '#e4935d', 138222, '148009', '{"O-Hyeon","Heugain","Douglas De Almeida"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/138222-sfWXqL0VfFl9.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xhObyLPUq6w/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xhObyLPUq6w"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yu-Won Kim", "native": "김유원", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266306-TelgD3HC5EhO.jpg"}, {"name": "Zeus", "native": "제우스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '138222'),
('MANHWA', 'Viral Hit', 'Ssaumdokak', '싸움독학', 'Scrawny high school student Ho-Bin Yoo is probably the last guy you’d expect to star in a NewTube channel that revolves around fighting. But after following some advice from a mysterious NewTube channel, Ho-Bin is soon knocking out guys stronger than him and raking in more money than he could have ever dreamed of. Can Ho-Bin keep this up, or will he eventually meet his match?', '{"Action","Comedy"}', '{"martial-arts","delinquents","bullying","coming-of-age","meta","yakuza","school","full-color","vtuber","fitness"}', NULL, '222', NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 29016, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b121991-hwrVszteyodi.jpg', NULL, '#f15d6b', 121991, '139164', '{"Tae-Jun Park","Jeong-Hyeon Kim","Laura Klug"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8vA6hXrM7C4/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8vA6hXrM7C4"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ho-Bin Yu", "native": "유호빈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193869-l1YoNFjOmrU7.png"}, {"name": "Ji-Hyeok U", "native": "우지혁", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193867-QB0S8Sz23Qie.png"}, {"name": "Ga-Eul", "native": "가을", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193868-Q2r8Xb3oKX6C.png"}, {"name": "Bo-Mi Choi", "native": "최보미", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193929-V80LPAzWwjZv.png"}, {"name": "Wang-Guk Han", "native": "한왕국", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b194327-LOg4XVOhEERh.png"}, {"name": "Mun-Seong Kim", "native": "김문성", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b194328-LglvTHp94MKs.png"}, {"name": "Ppakgo", "native": "빡고", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b338803-qdOvdMenIQxZ.png"}, {"name": "Ru-Mi Yeo", "native": "여루미", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b193932-sRkI32UUz02Y.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '121991'),
('MANHWA', 'Maybe Meant to Be', 'Eojjeodaboni Cheonsaengyeonbun', '어쩌다보니 천생연분', 'Jia Han, a 32-year-old freelancer with no work, is tired of her parents nagging her to get married and finally move out. When she runs into her childhood friend, Mincheol Jin, who is also feeling the same pressure from his parents, she blurts out that they should just get married to solve both of their problems. Little did she know he’d accept her suggestion, and she suddenly finds herself thrust into marriage. A story of an unexpected romance that’ll have you scrolling for more!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"marriage","heterosexual","female-protagonist","full-color","family-life","primarily-adult-cast","male-protagonist","fake-relationship","tsundere","fitness"}', NULL, '132', NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27953, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx146139-wyY4cGEYK8Kf.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/146139-VarttQD0TWHd.jpg', '#e42828', 146139, '147712', '{"Kkultarae","Damcho"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/146139-VarttQD0TWHd.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ji-A Han", "native": "한지아", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266483-oFyH2H59h74k.png"}, {"name": "Min-Cheol Jin", "native": "진민철", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266484-BjaKSoCGyQ6x.png"}, {"name": "Ji-Min Han", "native": "한지민", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b296769-O7H24PsJW2cw.png"}, {"name": "Su-Yeon So", "native": "소수연", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b296770-gFmyMuhRgWY7.png"}, {"name": "Sang-U Choi", "native": "최상우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b296771-JJE4tef6zl5l.png"}, {"name": "Yeon-Ju Choi", "native": "최연주", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b296772-pNDQNxggu43h.png"}, {"name": "Si-U Lee", "native": "이시우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b300190-1GDlHTxjPfck.png"}, {"name": "Na-Ri Ju", "native": "나리주", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b300191-3wa0eHRs8zhI.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '146139'),
('MANHWA', 'Return of the Mad Demon', 'Gwangmahoegwi', '광마회귀', 'The Mad Demon, Ja-Ha Lee, dreams of becoming the God of Martial Arts. Unfortunately, his dreams are dashed after he falls off a cliff while running from the Demonic Cult for stealing the Jade of Heaven. Yet this is not the end for Ja-Ha -- he awakens from the fall to find himself back in his 20s. With his knowledge of the future and of martial arts, he now has a chance at revenge and at getting life right this time. Will he be able to fulfill his dream this time around, or is he doomed to face the same fate yet again?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"martial-arts","male-protagonist","full-color","wuxia","anti-hero","surreal-comedy","age-regression","cultivation"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 27853, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx137304-XZ91kOmUIMQo.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/137304-6aGcY98dBeUY.jpg', '#e4935d', 137304, '147577', '{"JP","Hi Lee","Jin-Seong Yu"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/137304-6aGcY98dBeUY.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ja-Ha Lee", "native": "이자하", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b252011-VPuLLH4eZi71.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '137304'),
('MANHWA', 'The Return of the 8th Class Mage', '8 Class Mabeopsaui Hoegwi', '8클래스 마법사의 회귀', 'As a powerful 8th class mage, Ian Paige took countless innocent lives under the orders of Emperor Ragnar, a close friend and ruler of the Greenriver Empire. Yet despite their closeness, Ragnar views Ian as a threat and subsequently poisons him. Using time magic, Ian saves himself and returns 30 years to the past. Now a young boy, Ian joins an elite order of mages to hone his abilities once again. This time, he’ll get revenge on the emperor who betrayed him and reclaim glory as an 8th class mage!', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"age-regression","magic","revenge","politics","full-color","male-protagonist","conspiracy"}', NULL, '81', '5', NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27715, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx136331-cM7yJu8RtCoU.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/136331-Ag1X0lMVWk2X.jpg', NULL, 136331, '148190', '{"Tess","Ryu-Song"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/136331-Ag1X0lMVWk2X.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ian Paige", "native": "이안 페이지", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235935-NuyBtq4XFvnd.jpg"}, {"name": "Ragnar Greenriver", "native": "라그나르 그린리버", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235934-nv7IQTWnmLye.jpg"}, {"name": "Vanessa Paige", "native": "베네사 페이지", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235936-cUonseft5Zc1.jpg"}, {"name": "Douglas Hamon", "native": "더글라스 하몬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294038-lfwKDbscSwdA.png"}, {"name": "Hailey Greenriver", "native": "하이리 그린리버", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294039-mw3kLSjd3h7P.png"}, {"name": "Hayden Greenriver", "native": "하이든 그린리버", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294040-XEl1CUIm2LLF.png"}, {"name": "Oliver Raywood", "native": "올리버 레이우드", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294041-nMHCwVR7etes.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '136331'),
('MANHWA', 'The Knight Only Lives Today', 'Oneulman Saneun Gisa', '오늘만 사는 기사', 'Is dying repeatedly a blessing? Enkrid''s life-long dream of becoming a knight looked to be forever out of reach, until one day he died... and woke up at the beginning of that same day! Now that he has unlimited chances to train and engage in mortal combat, just how far can he go?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"time-loop","swordplay","war","martial-arts","curses","full-color","male-protagonist"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 27519, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx177706-3r8dnAr8Prjq.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/177706-Hss6QY0ZfzVf.jpg', '#d67850', 177706, '170427', '{"Hyeon-Min Lee","Ga Nara","An Lee"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/177706-Hss6QY0ZfzVf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sO1v04_KfOo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sO1v04_KfOo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Enkrid", "native": "엔크리드", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364720-9vsMihk0lqAv.png"}, {"name": "Rem", "native": "렘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364724-cOqhKVtePwIN.png"}, {"name": "Sachsen", "native": "작센", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364721-cx92Sf5fdVhE.png"}, {"name": "Ragna", "native": "라그나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364723-AQpvZuGfyVtF.png"}, {"name": "Audin", "native": "아우딘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364725-wN6QxU8AiNm6.png"}, {"name": "Kreise", "native": "크라이스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364727-l6SjXVEheiIZ.png"}, {"name": "Sinar", "native": "시나르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378296-RI50eHCJCaWO.png"}, {"name": "Andrew Gardner", "native": "앤드류 가드너", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364726-dADGkytC5Xk4.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '177706'),
('MANHWA', 'Beware the Villainess!', 'Geu Angnyeoreul Josimhaseyo!', '그 악녀를 조심하세요!', 'Sit back and take in this romantic tale of an angelic heroine and her devoted suitors as they vie for the depths of her love... or not. This story’s about to go through some edits! After an accident, a modern-day college student awakens as the story’s villainess, Melissa Foddebrat. She’s far from anyone’s favorite, but she IS the daughter of the duke. Determined to live it up, this new Melissa is doing things her way — antiquated society, be damned! All idiots, prepare to step aside or perish!', '{"Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","villainess","full-color","isekai","meta","heterosexual","mixed-gender-harem","kemonomimi","werewolf","long-strip","primarily-adult-cast","magic"}', NULL, '144', NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 27042, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx117540-RRDXqQJbhWTv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/117540-qBoIxW9tNXqt.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 117540, '146912', '{"Yeolmae","Blue Canna","Ppongttamatseukeuryuba"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/117540-qBoIxW9tNXqt.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LshVvCbeaCE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LshVvCbeaCE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Melissa Podebrat", "native": "멜리사 포데브라트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b171525-D2h99klPR4Yt.png"}, {"name": "Yuri Elizabeth", "native": "유리 엘리자베스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174523-WO4S4HxvgAVq.png"}, {"name": "Nine Forton", "native": "나인 포톤", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174524-FbrKa1cBY29G.png"}, {"name": "Yona Whitefall", "native": "요나 화이트폴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175940-P2bDbNNIsaWa.png"}, {"name": "Jake Podebrat", "native": "제이크 포데브라트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b278711-xCtoLJDbFsOB.png"}, {"name": "Duke Podebrat", "native": "포데브라트 공작", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b278712-KsRUwZgzGJJV.png"}, {"name": "Ian Basilios", "native": "이안 바실리오스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b278713-2Qn1fU4miqZD.png"}, {"name": "Peacock Melody", "native": "피콕 멜로디", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b278714-RXXo9CCaV5Ds.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '117540'),
('MANHWA', 'The Frozen Player Returns', 'Eoreobuteun Peulleieoui Gwihwan', '얼어붙은 플레이어의 귀환', 'When Seo Jun-Ho and his companions sacrificed themselves to defeat the frost queen, they thought they were restoring peace to Earth. But after 25 years of being frozen solid, Jun-Hho thaws out only to find that nine more floors appeared in his absence, only one of which has been cleared! As the only one who holds the key to clearing the next floor and defrosting his friends, Jun-Ho must step up once again. But has this hero been in hibernation too long to take on the world’s fearsome new foes?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","dungeon","full-color","super-power","urban-fantasy","primarily-adult-cast","magic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 26931, '74', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx130870-hRlgIlkXBgqb.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130870-O60bOpUe6LGx.jpg', '#5daee4', 130870, '148156', '{"Silsil","Studio Inus","Jerry M"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130870-O60bOpUe6LGx.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8_1PF2Ob30E/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8_1PF2Ob30E"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jun-Ho Seo", "native": "서준호", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212576-fhCzlDZvJGnQ.jpg"}, {"name": "Seoriyeowang", "native": "서리여왕", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b347973-LWxc9mmr2BVF.jpg"}, {"name": "Si-Eun Cha", "native": "차시은", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213053-q5TBzEYCkFBx.jpg"}, {"name": "Ju-Ha Gong", "native": "공주하", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213054-CodD9Q2uPpir.jpg"}, {"name": "Pil-Ho Choi", "native": "최필호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213055-uClXgvX54KQ4.jpg"}, {"name": "Chae-Won Son", "native": "손채원", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b392724-F2VhkVQmVPDv.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '130870'),
('MANHWA', 'Mythic Item Obtained', 'Sinhwageup Gwisok Item-eul Sone Neoeotda', '신화급 귀속 아이템을 손에 넣었다', 'In a world where technology and magic are almost indistinguishable from one another, monsters and creatures of myth and legend reign terror upon mankind. In humanity’s darkest moment, individuals with special god-like powers emerge to save the day. They are — the Awakened. Meet Jae-Hyun, a feeble Awakened human Raider, who struggles to make ends meet until one day a series of confounding events allow him to claim a powerful item that will change the course of history forever…', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"gods","full-color","male-protagonist","magic","urban-fantasy","age-regression","demons","swordplay","mythology"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 26276, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx151025-j7nZBNb46cv9.jpg', NULL, '#fe8650', 151025, '150561', '{"Seon-Yul Jeong","Fantera","Heseu"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jae-Hyeon Min", "native": "민재현", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305628-pfZMFZBUjwIR.jpg"}, {"name": "Yu-Jeong Kim", "native": "김유정", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305632-C8dz64ukoAn3.jpg"}, {"name": "I-Na Seo", "native": "서이나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305630-10vfF8k1TcoC.jpg"}, {"name": "Seong-Eun Yu", "native": "유성은", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305631-YNE8jSCrNlYz.jpg"}, {"name": "Hel", "native": "헬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305633-5bAL4qWrWsGy.jpg"}, {"name": "Ho-Yeon An", "native": "안호연", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305629-z4eHXF2R7sqE.jpg"}, {"name": "Jae-Sang Lee", "native": "이재상", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305627-3O78Q5BRJEH1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '151025'),
('MANHWA', 'Unholy Blood', 'White Blood', '화이트 블러드', 'All pure-blooded vampire Ha-Yan Park wanted to do was live a normal life. But the rise of half-bloods ten years ago transformed the world into a dangerous and frightening place—robbing her of her one true wish. Determined to return Korea to how it used to be, Ha-Yan teams up with local police captain Eun-Tae Hwang to wipe out the bloodthirsty killers in a tale of hot-blooded romance and revenge.', '{"Action","Drama","Romance","Supernatural"}', '{"vampire","female-protagonist","revenge","crime","full-color","amnesia","super-power","urban-fantasy","primarily-adult-cast","detective","heterosexual","terrorism"}', NULL, '93', '8', NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25923, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx115000-O6LBH4sOEU5w.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/115000-J0XOXJ8OekPb.jpg', '#6b1a35', 115000, '131843', '{"Li-Na Lim","Jeong-Hyeon Kim"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/115000-J0XOXJ8OekPb.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kGsS-fJH_uU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kGsS-fJH_uU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ha-Yan Park", "native": "박하얀", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161331-nCwtElStf6cr.jpg"}, {"name": "Eun-Tae Hwang", "native": "황은태", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b161332-gem8ZL9uDaY6.png"}, {"name": "Michael", "native": "미카엘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211379-kz68ykDuBQKB.png"}, {"name": "Ye-Rim", "native": "예림", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b216951-v9vuvVgVYfMa.png"}, {"name": "Yun-Su", "native": "윤수", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b216950-Gcmt8CXnlMVB.png"}, {"name": "Luci", "native": "루시", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211380-nFIRy0bvOpDw.png"}, {"name": "Ju-Won Seo", "native": "서주원", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211624-2bCbUIMLblmh.png"}, {"name": "Sung-Hwa Jung", "native": "정성화", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211625-tVTUTxW7F27N.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '115000'),
('MANHWA', '66,666 Years: Advent of the Dark Mage', '66666-nyeonmane Hwansaenghan Heungmabeopsa', '66666년만에 환생한 흑마법사', 'Diablo Volpir, a powerful dark mage, was defeated and sealed away in a battle against the 12 gods. He finally wakes up from his sleep 66,666 years later, however, in the body of a newborn baby, Jamie Welton! 9 years later, with a fraction of power he once held and with the loving family and peaceful environment he is now surrounded by, Jamie plans to exact revenge against the 12 gods that had sealed him away.', '{"Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"gods","religion","magic","necromancy","revenge","anthropomorphism","male-protagonist","full-color","coming-of-age"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 25913, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx137595-1m3i7vxyOqXc.png', NULL, '#865df1', 137595, '147337', '{"Ta-Ru","Team the J","Se Baek"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jamie Welton", "native": "제이미 웰턴", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b243253-4QRK5zCtFijl.png"}, {"name": "Sears Bell Welton", "native": "시어스 벨 웰턴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b243251-P6j70SUdcsZs.png"}, {"name": "Argento Welton", "native": "아르게노 웰턴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b243252-1c8IuHjKb4VY.png"}, {"name": "Sarah Welton", "native": "사라 웰턴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b243254-CYWnoLntFHcQ.png"}, {"name": "Rebecca Balle", "native": "레베카 발레", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291988-z54rbq6BU7ZD.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '137595'),
('MANHWA', 'The Skeleton Soldier Failed to Defend the Dungeon', 'Haegolbyeongsaneun Dungeon-eul Jikiji Motaetda', '해골병사는 던전을 지키지 못했다', 'Meet the Skeleton Soldier, a meager but fiercely loyal fighter who serves to protect its master, Lady Succubus. Its dream of a peaceful life with her is shattered when they''re both brutally murdered by a group of warriors one day. But what would’ve been a pathetic end to an unremarkable soul sparks a new beginning: when the Skeleton Soldier opens its eyes again, it has traveled back 20 years in time! “I must warn Lady Succubus of all the things to come!” But with no special combat skills and a history of failure and defeat, how can it stop the horrible events from unfolding again? Follow the Skeleton Soldier as it faces the most challenging quest of all—rewriting the ending to its own story.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"skeleton","time-loop","full-color","necromancy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 25863, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx103156-yTVWAW2N8uGi.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/103156-lnjlz6GLDx8S.jpg', '#e49343', 103156, '146761', '{"Sosori","Ant Studio"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/103156-lnjlz6GLDx8S.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4PfLE5PxW1Q/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4PfLE5PxW1Q"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Haegolbyeongsa", "native": "해골병사", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127208-8b4KMXD2ofng.png"}, {"name": "Rae Rubia", "native": "레이 루비아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188427-RnVbxP80vcUk.png"}, {"name": "Rena", "native": "레나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188428-ldCiLhHeF1p8.png"}, {"name": "Slime", "native": "라임", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188430-k9CxNN9Wu03o.png"}, {"name": "Isaac Bel''Homet", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b232462-7VrZhRfRtcwv.jpg"}, {"name": "Purson", "native": "푸르손", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234069-8h87yOeKmNvq.png"}, {"name": "Malphas", "native": "말파스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234070-lMMoiFT27PEn.png"}, {"name": "Gilles De Rai", "native": "기스 제 라이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234072-OP4qpbyqok8b.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '103156'),
('MANHWA', 'The Advanced Player of the Tutorial Tower', 'Tutorial Tabui Goinmul', '튜토리얼 탑의 고인물', 'After being trapped for 12 years in a tower full of regenerating monsters, Hyeon-U Kim is more powerful than just about any human or monster on Earth. Now that he’s free, he’s determined to find out who was behind his imprisonment, even if that means he has to kill hordes of monsters — and inadvertently save the world — along the way.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"urban-fantasy","video-games","full-color","male-protagonist","dungeon","magic","martial-arts","super-power","gods"}', NULL, '223', NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 25470, '68', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx119276-wqzyyB3xuPVo.jpg', NULL, '#5d78f1', 119276, '146742', '{"Baguseog Kim-ssi","Omagam","Studio Moon"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hyeon-U Kim", "native": "김현우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b204521-2oGC4dwQVDfI.jpg"}, {"name": "AV", "native": "아브", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b217821-GuIgwqq6GIDD.png"}, {"name": "Seo-Yeon Lee", "native": "이서연", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b219446-r0YROYgsvhcX.png"}, {"name": "Hanarin", "native": "하나린", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b250018-kuFiEluV8rMc.jpg"}, {"name": "Mu-Wol", "native": "무월", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b253161-VBmT8m6XABz7.png"}, {"name": "Kang-Hyeon Lee", "native": "이강현", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b254659-zTLLbdiJMfAh.png"}, {"name": "Seok-Gwan Han", "native": "한석관", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b254660-t2GZ7f2GT1K4.png"}, {"name": "Si-Hyeon Kim", "native": "김시현", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b254664-zNRe1Bsp3LhI.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '119276'),
('MANHWA', 'I Shall Master this Family!', 'Ibeon Saengeun Gajuga Doegetseumnida', '이번 생은 가주가 되겠습니다', 'The great Lombardi family was once at the top of the empire. After the death of its patriarch, the fate of the family and that of Firentia, born from a Lombardi and a peasant, fall to ruin at the hands of her useless and cruel cousins. But when she’s reincarnated as her seven-year-old self, she’ll work to protect the family’s honor, gain her grandpa Lulac’s favor, and prevent her own father’s death. In this lifetime, there’s only one way for her to win: become the head of their mighty household.', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"female-protagonist","royal-affairs","politics","age-regression","family-life","kingdom-management","long-strip","full-color","matriarchy","heterosexual"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 25383, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx130429-m3PuqOmxBgoo.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130429-AEQPOcAgJ6yU.jpg', '#e43550', 130429, '147692', '{"Mon","Roah Kim","Annabell Führes"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130429-AEQPOcAgJ6yU.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-gTDh0NHFKs/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-gTDh0NHFKs"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Firentia Lombardi", "native": "피렌티아 롬바르디", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b227251-oyqB9dKni8jF.jpg"}, {"name": "Perez Durelli", "native": "페레스 브리바차우 듀렐리", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b227252-kaoh2xeaJyAt.png"}, {"name": "Lulac Lombardy", "native": "룰락 롬바르디", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b227253-kcoAF5gzPTDr.jpg"}, {"name": "Lorraine Lombardi", "native": "라라네 롬바르디", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b227254-iWAu96dck7Wu.jpg"}, {"name": "Gallahan Lombardy", "native": "갤러한 롬바르디", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b227255-288NYOn4oa5f.jpg"}, {"name": "Astana Durelli", "native": "아스타나 네렘페 듀렐리", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b230490-ONybADlHSA0x.png"}, {"name": "Shananet Lombardy", "native": "샤나넷 롬바르디", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b230491-51XaNyRUuNqb.jpg"}, {"name": "Clerivan Pellet", "native": "클레리반 펠렛", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b230492-gr8lGJ5XOhHG.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '130429'),
('MANHWA', 'How to Use a Returner', 'Hoegwija Sayongseolmyeongseo', '회귀자 사용설명서', '[Will you join the game?] Giyoung''s suddenly thrown into a game of life and death. Not only that but he''s also the player with the lowest stats. Still, he''s got one skill on his side: the ability to read other players'' status! He finds the opportunity of his life when he discovers that Hyunsung is a returner to this world. Now all Giyoung has to do is stick next to Hyunsung and game his way out of this tutorial.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","male-protagonist","anti-hero","dungeon","magic","isekai","age-regression"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 24937, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx141007-mCfbMLgrCv1h.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/141007-3HYddNTNKPVf.jpg', '#e4bb50', 141007, '147318', '{"Domi","Heulgsujeo","Bichon"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/141007-3HYddNTNKPVf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Yg_UJFZ6Q6U/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yg_UJFZ6Q6U"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ki-Young Lee", "native": "이기영", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257373-jn8Ix0AJwyzv.png"}, {"name": "Ha-Yan Jung", "native": "정하얀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257372-HlX22XnqdYqV.png"}, {"name": "Ji-Hye Lee", "native": "이지혜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257374-MMDbllaJUuY8.png"}, {"name": "Hyun-Sung Kim", "native": "김현성", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257427-MMVFi17lBmui.png"}, {"name": "Benigoeo", "native": "베니고어", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '141007'),
('MANHWA', 'The Regressed Mercenary Has a Plan', 'Hoegwihan Yongbyeongeun Da Gyehoegi Itda', '회귀한 용병은 다 계획이 있다', 'Cecil Perdium, the Mercenary King, was killed in battle before he could avenge his family. As he faces death, he learns that Duke Delphine, the man who caused the downfall of his family, didn''t work alone. Suddenly waking up as his teenage self, Cecil must work to both overcome his poor reputation and build up his strength to save his family. With their soldiers and knights defecting due to the harsh conditions they must endure, he has his work cut out for him. Can Cecil become the mighty warrior he once was and avert his family''s fate?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"revenge","kingdom-management","male-protagonist","age-regression","swordplay","full-color","royal-affairs"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 24782, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx182066-kqOV7WW1DAH4.jpg', NULL, '#f1c935', 182066, '174559', '{"Gold Haeng","Jin-Seok Park"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pQA6i-jCZCw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQA6i-jCZCw"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Giselle Perdium", "native": "지셀 페르디움", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b361056-ggfwig1RmjBt.jpg"}, {"name": "Belinda", "native": "벨린다", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b361058-73oWvp3kUjr4.jpg"}, {"name": "Gillian", "native": "길리언", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b369058-h78SxTjksORF.jpg"}, {"name": "Rosaline Branford", "native": "로잘린 브랜포드", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b385054-JqExLRd3vQ4V.jpg"}, {"name": "Vanessa", "native": "바네사", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b369481-g5gu8YYYY8XL.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaor", "native": "카오르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b369059-I0yZtZ1z6PcX.jpg"}, {"name": "Zwalter Perdium", "native": "즈발터 페르디움", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b369060-aI1R5Ge7zrse.jpg"}, {"name": "Elena Perdium", "native": "엘레나 페르디움", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b361057-oUmNDPvB5VoR.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '182066'),
('MANHWA', 'FFF-Class Trashero', 'FFF Geum Gwansimyongsa', 'FFF급 관심용사', 'Han-Soo Kang was an average boy living in the normal world when he was suddenly summoned to Fantasia, a fantasy world run by demons. Deemed the Chosen Hero, he’s spent the last ten years building himself up to defeat the lord of Fantasia - which turned out to be a piece of cake. As he eagerly awaits his return to the real world, the “god” of Fantasia appears and throws a wrench in his plan: a report card that reveals there’s more to being a hero than just might.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","anti-hero","revenge","parody","male-protagonist","full-color","meta","elf"}', NULL, '172', NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 24683, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx113666-eemJQOpbo3qk.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/113666-WrREUUM6fXz0.jpg', '#431a6b', 113666, '147463', '{"Kkangmu","Farnar"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/113666-WrREUUM6fXz0.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Han-Soo Kang", "native": "강한수", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b185124-wrApUSlEMKZL.jpg"}, {"name": "Lanuvel", "native": "라누벨", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b251335-jIscX0YobJ9m.png"}, {"name": "Aqua", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b206959-zggFauzyhQgk.png"}, {"name": "Alex", "native": "알렉스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b206960-nZYNct9Bt1q8.png"}, {"name": "Aries", "native": "에이리스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207567-70UGupHf4GoY.jpg"}, {"name": "Archer E", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207568-H3ydbHogsgY3.jpg"}, {"name": "Devilish Queen", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208112-ZFER84HRT3mp.jpg"}, {"name": "Elfheim khan Lanuwerk", "native": "엘브하임", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208113-i6AOmBFcsbUl.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '113666'),
('MANHWA', 'Log-in Murim', 'Login Murim', '로그인 무림', 'When an interdimensional portal appeared and released countless monsters across the world, humanity didn’t take the threat lying down. Mankind fought back, defeating the monsters'' Demon King and creating a new way of life as "hunters." But when Taekyung Jin, a struggling, low-ranked hunter, accidentally logs into a game on a beat-up VR console, he finds himself trapped in an all-new world, unable to log out.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"martial-arts","cultivation","wuxia","virtual-world","male-protagonist","dungeon","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 24365, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx120385-4JYGuOR6cn72.jpg', NULL, '#7843e4', 120385, '147389', '{"Cheol-byeok Jang","Zero-BIG"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Tx3_nty2Vyc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tx3_nty2Vyc"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Tae-Gyeong Jin", "native": "진태경", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b393464-stO48hR00pha.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '120385'),
('MANHWA', 'The Reborn Young Lord is an Assassin', 'Hoegwihan Gongjakgaui Mangnaedoryeonnimeun Amsalja', '회귀한 공작가의 막내도련님은 암살자', 'Cyan Vert, illegitimate son of the Duke and the empire''s greatest assassin, is betrayed by the righteous brother whose shadow he''s always lived in. But just before the fatal blow strikes his throat, Cyan awakes to find he''s just a boy again. The young lord has been reborn, and this time, he''s not going to live in anyone''s shadow!', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"assassins","male-protagonist","revenge","age-regression","magic","anti-hero"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 24262, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx175262-shGEYbbfLHDD.jpg', NULL, '#f15dae', 175262, '167734', '{"Swing Bat","Coffee Lime"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Cyan Vert", "native": "시안 베르트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337817-yXNqteigZNaN.jpg"}, {"name": "Keiram", "native": "케이람", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337818-pv6a24TOCnsy.jpg"}, {"name": "Arin Sebelus", "native": "아린 세벨러스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b379362-Xqg1HBIcObq2.jpg"}, {"name": "Emily", "native": "에밀리", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b379361-9L7MZq5zttmR.jpg"}, {"name": "Nana", "native": "나나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b379931-ZXLhhz6tGGt7.jpg"}, {"name": "Ellis Vert", "native": "엘리스 베르트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b379360-hWVWIquGNIWM.jpg"}, {"name": "Lunav Rainriver", "native": "루나브 레인리버", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b379358-oBm3eIGdUdNN.jpg"}, {"name": "Brian Kendrick", "native": "브라이언 켄드릭", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b379359-jz4f9QKJcZPP.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '175262'),
('MANHWA', 'Dungeon Reset', 'Dungeon Reset', '던전 리셋', 'Da-Woon''s ordinary life is turned upside down when he is summoned into the Dungeon, where he must play a deadly game, outlasting dangerous monsters and life-threatening traps. To make matters worse, he''s only a mere crafter with zero combat abilities. But after Da-Woon falls into a trap and survives after a glitched reset, he''s gained random but oddly helpful skills. He''ll need to get creative to clear the game and return home, with a bloodthirsty assistant and an adorable ground squirrel along for the ride. Now that the rules no longer apply to him, what possibilities await in the tunnels below?', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","isekai","full-color","food","male-protagonist","survival","animals","environmental"}', NULL, '266', NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 23353, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx116506-D6cG2hsUzSpx.jpg', NULL, '#e48650', 116506, '147438', '{"Rio Skywalker","Daul","Jae-Hyeon Lee"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/52o93s4nDeU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=52o93s4nDeU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Da-Un Jeong", "native": "정다운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212875-rR3d5EtbUWaH.png"}, {"name": "Tokki", "native": "토끼", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212874-Z5UWWkoowfQR.png"}, {"name": "Lich Bahamut", "native": "리치 바하무트", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b273419-ZK8tCaDmMqy7.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '116506'),
('MANHWA', 'The Academy''s Undercover Professor', 'Academy Wijangchwieopdanghaetda', '아카데미에 위장취업당했다', 'Machiavelli and Gerrard are just one of the many names the new professor of Ceoren Academy uses to disguise his identity, and now he can add one more to his list, Professor Ludger Cherish. The real Ludger Cherish dies on board a train during a terrorist attack, making him the perfect target for a new identity. Little does the new professor know, Ludger Cherish was involved in something deep and secret. The new Professor Ludger has to be careful to not get caught by the school and the dangerous secret society.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"school","teacher","conspiracy","magic","full-color","male-protagonist","espionage","anti-hero","swordplay"}', NULL, '168', NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 23217, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx150836-RbhplaCkc2dy.jpg', NULL, '#1a78e4', 150836, '149801', '{"Tana","WAG","sayren"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ludger Cherish", "native": "루드거 첼리시", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284772-huRPb8AMhnD5.png"}, {"name": "Flora Lumos", "native": "플로라 루모스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284770-7Oem1ruGcjz5.png"}, {"name": "Elisa Willow", "native": "엘리사 윌로우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284771-nvtl3uNQclih.png"}, {"name": "Celina", "native": "셀리나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284773-s4dyIEkTmvU9.jpg"}, {"name": "Erendir von Exilion", "native": "에렌디르 폰 엑실리온", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284776-ImJsxnwX6dde.png"}, {"name": "Terinna Lyonhowl", "native": "테리나 라이언하울", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294551-735hgp9BT0Ky.png"}, {"name": "Violetta", "native": "비올레타", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294552-srt60rech0iS.png"}, {"name": "Sedena Plante", "native": "세디나 플란테", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b339728-HXdApPlvhbBf.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '150836'),
('MANHWA', 'I Killed the Main Player', 'Academy Player-reul Jungnyeotda', '아카데미 플레이어를 죽였다', 'Being a character of your favorite game is great! Sure, he’s just a minor NPC, but Corin knows this game like the back of his hand. With his knowledge and the main player Sihu’s abilities, everything’s going smoothly - until Corin discovers Sihu’s been murdering innocent NPCs and stealing their items. Horrified but powerless to stop him, Corin awaits the end of the game - only for Sihu to mysteriously fail at the last mission. Instantly, Corin travels three years back in time. Now, he’s determined to kill Sihu and take on his role - defeat the final boss and save the world.', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","male-protagonist","magic","isekai","female-harem","school","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 23069, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx173020-vqe5J7U1cizO.png', NULL, '#f16b5d', 173020, '165028', '{"Green Kyrin","Saramsallyeo."}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Corin Locke", "native": "코린 로크", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337916-2IlezhZ19hgd.jpg"}, {"name": "Marie Dunareff", "native": "마리에 듀나레프", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337917-M6yXhGOLAUfE.jpg"}, {"name": "Lunia Aden", "native": "루니아 아덴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337918-368NQfuHhxJR.jpg"}, {"name": "Hwaran", "native": "화란", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337919-6bxtUywaPZB0.jpg"}, {"name": "Alisha Aden", "native": "아리샤 아덴", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337920-xbHXJpdLZtnr.jpg"}, {"name": "Erin Danua", "native": "에린 다누아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b376462-hAuZKK6D9h4U.png"}, {"name": "Estelle El Ras", "native": "에스텔 하닷사 엘 라스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378697-CtM2XIn9N8nB.jpg"}, {"name": "Miriam El Ras", "native": "미르암 엘리사벳 엘 라스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378818-xGFxAcuKm9q1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '173020'),
('MANHWA', 'Kill the Hero', 'Kill the Hero', '킬 더 히어로', 'After he’s killed by the righteous leader of his own guild, Woojin gets a chance to start over. This time he’s not interested in saving the world from monsters—he’s got his sights set on revenge! His high-level kills quickly garner him notoriety among the game plebs, while boosting his stats as he masterminds his way closer to the top. But there''s something no one can figure out: whose side he’s playing for. Now that he knows how to play to win, Woojin will stop at nothing to destroy the hero!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"revenge","super-power","male-protagonist","skeleton","anti-hero","dungeon","necromancy","full-color","gods"}', NULL, '153', NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 23022, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx117536-tnTMgXV1V5KB.jpg', NULL, '#2843e4', 117536, '146979', '{"Manhwa Insaeng","D-Dart"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Woo-Jin Kim", "native": "김우진", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b188234-G7K3lynLIOzX.png"}, {"name": "Jin-A Lee", "native": "이진아", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212465-ba6ozaQLnV3F.png"}, {"name": "Ji-Hu Yang", "native": "양지후", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212455-6qpfvr8n14XQ.png"}, {"name": "Se-Jun Lee", "native": "이세준", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212460-duVGmQvqialr.png"}, {"name": "Se-Chan O", "native": "오세찬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212462-PdSsbkH2hega.png"}, {"name": "Sin-Hye Park", "native": "박신혜", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212463-GhID0Vn8hPMf.png"}, {"name": "Yong-Wan Park", "native": "박용완", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212466-bYasb07mCmUS.png"}, {"name": "Ken Tsukahara", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212467-jvszpxkC4pgI.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '117536'),
('MANHWA', 'Girls of the Wild''s', 'Sonyeo the Wild''s', '소녀더와일즈', 'Wild''s High has a 42 year history as an all-girls private high school, meant solely for the elite. The girls of this school are trained daily in some of the deadliest forms of fighting around, from boxing, to sword-fighting, to taekwondo! This specialty school is the place where the most popular sporting event in the country is held, The Wild''s League - the only place in the world where teenage girls partake in brutal fights... often to the death.

This year, Wild''s has changed to a mixed-gender school. Despite opening their doors to males, the only one to apply is Song Jae-Gu. He has been granted a full 3-year scholarship regardless of grades, which he snaps up without second thought. For the past two years, every moment of his life has been spent taking care of his younger twin siblings.

But after meeting Queen, the bloody champion of Wild''s League, drenching her in coffee and calling her a ''monster''... things are about to get messy - especially when he gets tied up with all the other unusual girls at this school!

Follow Jae-Gu''s struggle, from being the only male in school full of beautiful and deadly women to learning to fight and stand up for himself!', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"love-triangle","martial-arts","primarily-female-cast","bullying","full-color","heterosexual","male-protagonist","female-harem","boxing","primarily-teen-cast"}', NULL, '260', NULL, NULL, '2011', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22877, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b75275-6sw70Ah3Y94V.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/75275-6a0lgvW8um2T.jpg', '#e4d6a1', 75275, '45275', '{"Hun","Hye-Jin Kim"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/75275-6a0lgvW8um2T.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jae-Gu Song", "native": "송재구", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/73959.jpg"}, {"name": "In-Gwi Yun", "native": "윤인귀", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/74149.jpg"}, {"name": "Mun-Yeong Lee", "native": "이문영", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/73961-Ad0hGfi0hSfN.png"}, {"name": "Dal-Dal Choi", "native": "최달달", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b74139-dcMFbufdG7gO.png"}, {"name": "Mi-Nam Lee", "native": "이미남", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/81107.jpg"}, {"name": "Go-Seul Lee", "native": "이고슬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/84451.jpg"}, {"name": "Han-Gyeol Kim", "native": "김한결", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/123007-1gdka9Q0q9Of.png"}, {"name": "Hye-Sin Kim", "native": "김혜신", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/123008-6QeWQjFBleVP.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '75275'),
('MANHWA', 'The Villainess Turns the Hourglass', 'Agnyeoneun Molaesigyeleul Doedollinda', '악녀는 모래시계를 되돌린다', 'Aria Roscent mercilessly bullied her stepsister Mielle and paid the ultimate price for her misdeeds—but not before Mielle revealed that she’d manipulated Aria into harassing Mielle in the first place! Instead of dying, Aria is sent back in time and gifted a strange hourglass with mysterious powers. Now, Aria’s just got one goal: to embrace her role of villainess and utterly destroy Mielle’s life!', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance"}', '{"revenge","female-protagonist","villainess","super-power","full-color","ojou-sama","anti-hero","age-regression","politics","class-struggle","coming-of-age","economics"}', NULL, '125', NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22866, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx116382-EPyB5KDY9UEo.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/116382-o3f55yOakBaD.jpg', '#e4a15d', 116382, '147207', '{"Ttaelkkam","BABARA","Sansobi"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/116382-o3f55yOakBaD.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RHUZsM8cEZE/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RHUZsM8cEZE"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Aria Roscent", "native": "아리아 로스첸트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168283-ZgWbvnJXoxA4.png"}, {"name": "Asterope Franz", "native": "아스테로페 프란츠", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175473-5MD4L7mm19EX.png"}, {"name": "Mielle Roscent", "native": "로스첸트 미엘르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b216776-3z2KcgIUS7uE.jpg"}, {"name": "Lohan Croa", "native": "크로아 로한", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b237556-49oSvI4BQWoe.jpg"}, {"name": "Carin Roscent", "native": "로스첸트 카린", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b355787-63HJCSZEboRe.jpg"}, {"name": "Cain Roscent", "native": "로스첸트 카인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b355784-hlkLOwXrZLFb.jpg"}, {"name": "Roscent Baekjak", "native": "로스첸트 백작", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b355799-iuin0ORtNFV6.jpg"}, {"name": "Jessie", "native": "제시", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b355785-EYSco7OEgybr.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '116382'),
('MANHWA', 'THE BREAKER - NEW WAVES', 'The Breaker: New Waves', '브레이커NW', 'ATime has passed since the great confrontation at the Core Business tower. After Chun-woo Han destroyed Si-woon''s ki-center, depriving him of his ability to practice martial arts, Si-woon thinks his time with the Murim is done. But his status as the sole disciple of the Nine-Doors Dragon makes him a target for many clans eager for revenge! How will he cope now that he''s deprived of his ki? Meanwhile, graffiti in praise of the Nine-Doors Dragon begins appearing all around the world for all to see, and the Murim Alliance must react quickly. The Soldiers Under Command are on the move; will it be possible to stop them before the destruction of the world as we know it?', '{"Action","Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"martial-arts","gangs"}', NULL, '203', '20', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22833, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/22651.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/52651-ivC1kDtRB3wq.png', NULL, 52651, '22651', '{"Geuk-Jin Jeon","Jin-Hwan Park"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/52651-ivC1kDtRB3wq.png", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shi-Woon Yi", "native": "이시운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21562.jpg"}, {"name": "Jin-le Kwon", "native": "권지니", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/37900.jpg"}, {"name": "Un-Wol", "native": "은월", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/38085.jpg"}, {"name": "Sera Kang", "native": "강세라", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b38953-YHGTNXwJeGCv.jpg"}, {"name": "Chun-U Han", "native": "한천우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/21563.jpg"}, {"name": "Shi-Ho Lee", "native": "이시호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n29296-IRQyT1vKHVn8.jpg"}, {"name": "Sae-Hie", "native": "세희", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b29427-kyiHLRLtDTMV.jpg"}, {"name": "Chang-Ho", "native": "창호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/29431.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '52651'),
('MANHWA', 'The Reaper', 'Sasinpyowol', '사신표월', 'Pyo-Wol was an orphan who wandered around the continent until he bumped into a mysterious man and lost consciousness. When he wakes up, he finds himself in a dark, confined space with only one iron door for an exit. Wol survives the next several grueling months, trying to keep a cool head and stay in shape. When the iron door finally opens, he discovers he''s not the only one in this miserable situation. A group of masked people has kidnapped 300 children to train them into human weapons. Wol must fight and kill the others, for only a handful of the strongest will be selected. Will Wol be able to become one of the chosen and find a way to free himself from his captors?', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"anti-hero","martial-arts","survival","wuxia","male-protagonist","full-color","orphan"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 22805, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx153432-flZLVek7Ei1Z.png', NULL, '#aec9f1', 153432, '150422', '{"Mok-In","INKYO","U-Gak"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GWbrbLsLk20/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GWbrbLsLk20"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Pyo-Wol", "native": "표월", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b284592-t9UTxCIOdnYv.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '153432'),
('MANHWA', 'Jungle Juice', 'Jungle Juice', '정글쥬스', 'Su-Chan Jang is an extraordinary college student at the top of the social food chain. But underneath the perfect facade, he hides a pair of insect wings that suddenly grew when he used a mysterious bug spray called "Jungle Juice.” Su-Chan''s life crumbles when he bares his wings to the world to save someone''s life. When all hope seems lost, Su-Chan stumbles upon a hidden world of insect humans where everyone is accepted for what they are. But the law of the jungle governs this secret society and all must fend for themselves in order to survive.', '{"Action","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"}', '{"full-color","monster-girl","male-protagonist","monster-boy","college","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 22739, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx128882-UxgmKbYEjuEz.jpg', NULL, '#5df1f1', 128882, '147053', '{"Hyeong-Eun","JUDER","AH Cho"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jed0fRBKUyw/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jed0fRBKUyw"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Su-Chan Jang", "native": "장수찬", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211629-r4XFEeuXqfq6.png"}, {"name": "Hui-Jin Park", "native": "박희진", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215017-HYLspNcapOQe.png"}, {"name": "Do-Hwa Cheon", "native": "천도화", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b247987-fdANK46rOvw8.png"}, {"name": "Hye-Seong Cha", "native": "차혜성", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b343873-tyoxTTJ6mLuy.jpg"}, {"name": "Ji-Jun", "native": "지준", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215020-n5g7xKvTgbuT.png"}, {"name": "Ga-Yeon Sin", "native": "신가연", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215018-vwXiTbMTQM3Q.png"}, {"name": "Mi-Hui Kim", "native": "김미희", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211628-iw52rAlFe5m1.png"}, {"name": "Samagwi Ingan", "native": "사마귀 인간", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b215019-Wepw5CdFN8b4.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '128882'),
('MANHWA', 'Your Throne', 'Haruman Nega Doego Sipeo', '하루만 네가 되고 싶어', 'Tensions are brewing under the seemingly calm surface of the Vasilios Empire, a kingdom ruled by the Imperial Family and the Temple. Lady Medea Solon has lost her place next to Crown Prince Eros, but resolves to do whatever it will take to win back what''s rightfully hers. Will she reclaim her throne?', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"}', '{"female-protagonist","revenge","foreign","anti-hero","survival","politics","villainess","full-color","primarily-adult-cast","royal-affairs","ojou-sama","gods"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 22613, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx114542-3fUNOX8DqS5e.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/114542-4jysXXJd2vim.jpg', '#e4505d', 114542, '130832', '{"Sam"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/114542-4jysXXJd2vim.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cmv5sJ7KCq8/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cmv5sJ7KCq8"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Psyche Polly", "native": "프시케 폴리", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b159250-9GX9LLaXaGyn.png"}, {"name": "Medea Belial", "native": "메데이아 벨리아르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b159252-k0W2qpzZgTWl.jpg"}, {"name": "Helio Niccolo", "native": "헬리오 트로피움", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b159251-yfFkTyhpN8wm.jpg"}, {"name": "Eros Vasilios", "native": "이아로스 오르나 에페란토", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b159254-WL17ZEAij58X.jpg"}, {"name": "Perion Sob Vasilios", "native": "페르온소브 에페란토", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b201306-X36bZW00Ma7F.jpg"}, {"name": "Count Polly", "native": "백작 폴리", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210356-EGes5QekF4d7.jpg"}, {"name": "Nana", "native": "유모", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210357-sBSp37B8Np9s.jpg"}, {"name": "Thesion Belial", "native": "테시온 벨리아르", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210358-wL3cXXTJ6qY9.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '114542'),
('MANHWA', 'The 100th Regression of the Max-Level Player', 'Mallep Player-ui 100-beonjjae Hoegwi', '만렙 플레이어의 100번째 회귀', 'The world was embroiled in a death game involving individuals from ages 15 to 29. Thrown into a game devoid of empathy and compassion, Min Ryu had no choice but to fight for his survival. For the 99th time, he finally made it to the end of the game. Standing alone in front of the final boss’s chamber, Min Ryu was greeted with betrayal as the system killed him for not having four more players with him. On his 100th and final attempt, can Min Ryu find the help he needs to end this ruthless game?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Supernatural"}', '{"age-regression","survival","death-game","gods"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 22600, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx170894-oS4T4u9WqHoj.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/170894-8tNGPnlEI2Ec.jpg', '#f1785d', 170894, '164180', '{"Yeoun","Deokpeu","King Soda"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/170894-8tNGPnlEI2Ec.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Min Ryu", "native": "류민", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b340214-GnLmigphld0r.png"}, {"name": "Won Ryu", "native": "원류", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b340212-45UCmOXZdE9v.png"}, {"name": "Juri Min", "native": "민주리", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b340213-KI0eCWYh9tOB.png"}, {"name": "Kyung-Rok Ma", "native": "마경록", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b340215-7NYQMfolDodF.png"}, {"name": "A-Rin Seo", "native": "아린 서", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b340216-UnqqohtpxXI1.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '170894'),
('MANHWA', 'Villain to Kill', 'Villain to Kill', '빌런투킬', 'There are two kinds of people with special abilities: villains, who are driven by their evil desires, and psykers, who pursue justice and work against villains. Cassian Lee is a very powerful psyker with a good heart. But one day, when he visits his friend in Greece, things take a wrong turn. Following an unexpected chain of events, Cassian ends up in the body of a Korean high school boy... who has just become a villain! Will his sense of justice win in the end or will he end up becoming a cold-blooded villain?', '{"Action","Supernatural"}', '{"super-power","anti-hero","full-color","magic","cultivation","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 22551, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b130149-y63hveWF28Sb.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130149-a2flkGu8s6hf.jpg', '#950303', 130149, '147191', '{"Pyupin","Eun-Ji"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130149-a2flkGu8s6hf.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gH_o5KcwV04/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gH_o5KcwV04"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gang-U Kwon", "native": "권강우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b277631-mLCOXwTMD14t.jpg"}, {"name": "Cassian Lee", "native": "카시안리", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b277632-ZUDLD6jot4V6.jpg"}, {"name": "Driver", "native": "드라이버", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b274308-tzuJ1iZb7qQ7.png"}, {"name": "Kkamagwi", "native": "까마귀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295957-qdUb0WkiDVXs.png"}, {"name": "Smoker", "native": "스모커", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295958-Ka8tzj5d7LyM.png"}, {"name": "In-Seo Gu", "native": "구인서", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295959-RXDrxtMTJHbi.png"}, {"name": "Jin-A Seo", "native": "서진아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295960-mKwjAlVD2SGe.png"}, {"name": "Lyra", "native": "라이라", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295961-DZxg9SZsiUAJ.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '130149'),
('MANHWA', 'The Gamer', 'The Gamer', '더 게이머', 'Ji-Han Han is your typical high school student -- minus the fact the he’s acquired the special ability to view the world around him as a video-game. Not long after this discovery, he stumbles upon a hidden world filled with others just like him. Now, amidst juggling homework and completing quests, Ji-Han must learn how to navigate his newfound power in order to level up in life.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"video-games","super-power","full-color","male-protagonist","urban-fantasy"}', NULL, '510', NULL, NULL, '2013', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22178, '66', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/b85155-HtYBpaLAa9E7.jpg', NULL, '#2DD958', 85155, '146787', '{"Sang-Ah","San-Young Sang"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Ji-Han Han", "native": "한지한", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133530-nC1Xg7mhVJoe.png"}, {"name": "Sung-Ah Hwan", "native": "환성아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133526-WkQJF7t9LKuB.png"}, {"name": "Se-Yeong Pung", "native": "풍세영", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133527-9anyMTnBy4Ds.png"}, {"name": "Sung-Gon Hwan", "native": "환성곤", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n133528-KRE8wqievKEw.png"}, {"name": "Seon-Il Shin", "native": "신선일", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133529-S1jotKskVTuk.png"}, {"name": "Shi-Yun Kwon", "native": "권시연", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133531-UkFT26RJNhQi.png"}, {"name": "Jung-Suk Han", "native": "한정숙", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b133532-bZczlqMKFuuV.png"}, {"name": "Lolikiano Mistream", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/n133801-FJujzau9f9Oa.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '85155'),
('MANHWA', 'Weak Hero', 'Yakanyeongung', '약한영웅', 'Once the bullies target you, it’s game over. The school is run by tyrants whose favorite hobby is tormenting the weakest kids in class. But then Gray arrived. This mysterious new student threatens to dismantle the established order. He may be small in stature, but his calculative and brutal fighting leaves unsuspecting opponents lying on the floor begging for mercy. Now the school''s toughest bullies have to scramble to take down this new and unusual hero.', '{"Action","Drama"}', '{"school","bullying","delinquents","male-protagonist","gangs","full-color","kuudere","revenge","primarily-male-cast","long-strip"}', NULL, '268', '19', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22062, '78', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx113488-0ghq0eEnftk0.jpg', NULL, '#f1a143', 113488, '128231', '{"Seopass","Jin-Seok Kim"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Si-Eun Yeon", "native": "연시은", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180787-nMqLNzXE9WdD.png"}, {"name": "Hu-Min Park", "native": "박후민", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180786-lUMsUmXZiFrv.png"}, {"name": "Hyeon-Tak Go", "native": "고현탁", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b198783-HXh1EY6gv2tc.png"}, {"name": "Ga-Yol Jin", "native": "진가욜", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b198784-ayxUOJSiNtTd.png"}, {"name": "Tae-O Jin", "native": "진태오", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180788-d2TMOBoPhTrG.jpg"}, {"name": "Su-Ho Ahn", "native": "안수호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b198785-VA76W2uRYGdB.png"}, {"name": "Ju-Yang Im", "native": "임주양", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b198786-F4i4MOUJvXzz.png"}, {"name": "Jun-Tae Seo", "native": "서준태", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b198787-naJ7p13uT4zA.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '113488'),
('MANHWA', 'Shotgun Boy', 'Yeopchongsonyeon', '엽총소년', 'While running for his life in the woods, bullying victim Gyu-Hwan stumbles upon a shotgun and just enough shells for his classmates. It’s a recipe for disaster. But fate takes an unexpected turn when he returns to find his classmates under attack by brain-eating creatures. Now, the only thing that stands in the way of their ravenous feast is a boy with a shotgun.', '{"Action","Horror","Psychological","Supernatural","Thriller"}', '{"bullying","male-protagonist","guns","school","survival"}', NULL, '69', NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 22048, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx130229-w8eYyQnAaPh8.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130229-bW9PX9pxC6iZ.jpg', NULL, 130229, '146751', '{"Carnby Kim","Pil Hong"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/130229-bW9PX9pxC6iZ.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gyu-Hwan Han", "native": "한규환", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213759-jLRlTmB1QyTN.png"}, {"name": "Seong-Bin Yu", "native": "유성빈", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b219016-tVWVmx3aXpl3.jpg"}, {"name": "Shin-Yeong Kang", "native": "강신영", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b219017-wlD3Dr6GoBb3.jpg"}, {"name": "One", "native": "원", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b310690-lGrrp3T4YfF3.png"}, {"name": "Zero", "native": "제로", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b275427-HU9pIbz3fe8f.png"}, {"name": "Jayden", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b310688-h8BM7WhIkpxu.png"}, {"name": "Suyeon Kim", "native": "김수연", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b310689-orTf1yUTthik.png"}, {"name": "Hyun-Su Cha", "native": "차현수", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127415-iNPETf5ihn9j.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '130229'),
('MANHWA', 'Leviathan', 'Simhaesu', '심해수', 'The world is submerged, and sea monsters rule the earth. Will Bota and his family ever make it to safety and escape this aquatic hell? And who in the world is Kana?!

- Includes six extra chapters.

- Originally published on Toomics where chapters 1-3 were subsequently combined to form chapters 1-2 on Naver.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"post-apocalyptic","kaiju","survival","male-protagonist","full-color","dystopian","gore","female-protagonist","revenge","cosmic-horror"}', NULL, '115', '9', NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 21836, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx110605-GFEUCygfbntb.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/110605-z2rE1AVM4auL.jpg', '#e4c9a1', 110605, '148137', '{"Kyung-Tak Lee","Mi-Young No"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/110605-z2rE1AVM4auL.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Bo-Ta Ma", "native": "마보타", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213135-PiXR6WnCvWyQ.png"}, {"name": "Ri-Ta Ma", "native": null, "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213136-R1RyV6D70m0p.png"}, {"name": "Kana", "native": "카나", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213137-diLfp7yQb6f3.png"}, {"name": "Te-On Ma", "native": "마테온", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b213139-GB2AZwHnrwrB.png"}, {"name": "Brune", "native": "브룬", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b387939-AxwWUEactia7.png"}, {"name": "Sea Monkey", "native": "바다원숭이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b387941-3grZ2VYTzXV1.png"}, {"name": "Poid", "native": "포이드박사", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b387942-7LOEwXdlmLJp.png"}, {"name": "Ki-Ho Lee", "native": "이기호", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b387943-4iI82cAEYXQi.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '110605'),
('MANHWA', 'My S-Class Hunters', 'Naega Kiun S-Geupdeul', '내가 키운 S급들', 'Yu-Jin is an F-ranker overshadowed by his little brother, an S-ranker. All he does is get in his brother’s way, causing trouble wherever he goes. When a seemingly routine dungeon raid goes wrong and costs Yu-Jin his brother’s life, Yu-Jin decides to use the wish granted by clearing the dungeon to reset his timeline. The plan was to lead a quiet life from now on… but now it turns out he can help other people become S-rankers?! Maybe this is Yu-Jin''s chance at building his own entourage of powerful metahumans… but it may be easier said than done.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"found-family","urban-fantasy","dungeon","full-color","male-protagonist","age-regression","super-power","primarily-adult-cast"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 21762, '75', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx141958-y46ASozodVNW.jpg', NULL, '#e48650', 141958, '147202', '{"seri","Biwan","Geun-Seo"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iAg_R96Cnko/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iAg_R96Cnko"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yu-Jin Han", "native": "한유진", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272851-JdFI7qtzfbUP.jpg"}, {"name": "Yu-Hyeon Han", "native": "한유현", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272852-cnxQyAlwFwO0.jpg"}, {"name": "Ye-Rim Park", "native": "박예림", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272853-97VXOPdIslOY.jpg"}, {"name": "Myeong-U Yu", "native": "유명우", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272854-0UYS2PQmcfmd.jpg"}, {"name": "Peace", "native": "피스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b272855-OgaYply10SP4.png"}, {"name": "Hyeon-Je Seong", "native": "성현제", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b294434-5WM2d27k5BEE.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '141958'),
('MANHWA', 'Blink Master of the Magic Academy', 'Mabeop Hakgyo Apjeommyeol Cheonjae-ga Doeeotda', '마법학교 앞점멸 천재가 되었다', 'In the game Aether World, Baek Yuseol is considered the most useless character because he can''t use magic like everyone else. His only skill, Blink, is a short-range teleportation ability most players consider worthless. But when he’s tasked with reaching the game''s true ending, Baek Yuseol decides to use his unconventional skill to achieve this impossible goal. Can this so-called "trash" character outsmart his powerful peers, form unlikely alliances, and ultimately master the game?', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","isekai","video-games","male-protagonist","magic"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 21498, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx178379-dokda9kEw3Ns.jpg', NULL, '#f1d65d', 178379, '170974', '{"Yu Seo","Milhi Eun"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Yu-Seol Baek", "native": "백유설", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344205-5MY8zON1WtHV.jpg"}, {"name": "Flame", "native": "불꽃", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344206-U4lXCcWl5rmZ.png"}, {"name": "Aiselle Wolf", "native": "아이셀 몰프", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344207-KdSIuYe7TIVK.jpg"}, {"name": "Bi-Yeon Adolebit Hong", "native": "홍 비연 아돌레빗", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344208-ggL9PJsUQvGR.jpg"}, {"name": "Yu-Seong Ma", "native": "마 유성", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b344209-h2DAqvCHF1j8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '178379'),
('MANHWA', 'Dungeon Odyssey', 'Dungeon Gyeonmullok', '던전 견문록', 'When the war between the aboveground and underground ended, humanity was joined by so-called "dungeon babies," those gifted with supernatural abilities and an obsession with the labyrinths below ground. Despite being a dungeon baby, Kim Jin-U suppressed his instincts, choosing to live an ordinary life as a guide and caring for his family. But when an expedition goes wrong and he somehow ends up becoming the new owner of a labyrinth, he discovers that he cannot ignore his instincts forever...', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","magic","survival","politics","kingdom-management","video-games","male-protagonist","necromancy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 21491, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx155485-YlWPkBFvWG3v.jpg', NULL, NULL, 155485, '152405', '{"Min-U Son","Glump"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jin-U Kim", "native": "김진우", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b301170-d5BmLeQQbmO4.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '155485'),
('MANHWA', 'The Sound of Magic: Annarasumanara', 'Annarasumanara', '안나라수마나라', 'Yun Ai wanted to be a magician when she was little. But now in reality, she is a high school student who cannot even afford new stockings. Since the day she met a real magician at a fair, she desperately wants to follow her dream.', '{"Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Supernatural"}', '{"philosophy","coming-of-age","magic","female-protagonist","school"}', NULL, '28', '3', NULL, '2010', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 21449, '79', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx60079-m0IndfC9eHAJ.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/60079-wyw8YyNbvo0Z.jpg', '#f143a1', 60079, '30079', '{"Il-Kwon Ha"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/60079-wyw8YyNbvo0Z.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "A-I Yun", "native": "윤아이", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b58981-poyvBaKN64Bs.png"}, {"name": "Lee Eul", "native": "ㄹ", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b61021-mLfqQw2E4POP.jpg"}, {"name": "Il-Deung Na", "native": "나일등", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/66285.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '60079'),
('MANHWA', 'Surviving the Game as a Barbarian', 'Game Sok Babarian-euro Saranamgi', '게임 속 바바리안으로 살아남기', 'After spending nine years on Dungeon and Stone, the role-playing game that no player has ever beaten, Han-Su Lee finally reaches the dungeon of the final boss. As soon as he opens the gate, however, he suddenly sees a message that says his tutorial has been completed and finds himself in the body of Bjorn Yandel, a real barbarian within the game. An exciting adventure awaits him as he endeavors to abide by the laws of the fictional world!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"dungeon","survival","male-protagonist","isekai","video-games","travel","full-color","kemonomimi","magic","dystopian","elf","nekomimi"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 21330, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx164857-MVeV0leMZb0m.jpg', NULL, '#fea150', 164857, '158296', '{"Taesu Han","Team The Jick","MIDNIGHT STUDIO"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7w96iqfB0RQ/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7w96iqfB0RQ"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Bjorn Yandel", "native": "비요른 얀델", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305569-DMupmma7813M.jpg"}, {"name": "Einar Pnellin", "native": "아이나르 프넬린", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305570-nxSUu5b10xZH.jpg"}, {"name": "Erwen Fornacci di Tercia", "native": "에르웬 포르나치 디 테르시아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305571-3im6AFxRUIkn.jpg"}, {"name": "Amelia Rainwales", "native": "아멜리아 레인웨일즈", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326049-dP9PaXLNyPzi.png"}, {"name": "Misha Karlstein", "native": "미샤 칼스타인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326119-NYriTHNriaQ1.png"}, {"name": "Arua Raven", "native": "아루아 레이븐", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326120-lKwjBZHKMsk6.jpg"}, {"name": "Riol Dwalkie", "native": "리올 워브 드왈키", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326121-KsRJnCSxGrCn.png"}, {"name": "Brown Rotmiller", "native": "브라운 로트밀러", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326122-cRcxGJv0lLb8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '164857'),
('MANHWA', 'Roxana', 'Yeojuingongui Oppareul Jikineun Bangbeop', '여주인공의 오빠를 지키는 방법', 'Kidnapping, murder, and risqué relationships! Within the scandalous pages of The Abysmal Flower, the downfall of Roxana Agrece''s criminal family is already foretold. So when Cassis Pedelian, the heroine''s older brother, is kidnapped by Roxana''s father, she can either wait for the heroine''s revenge... or take matters into her own hands, since Cassis is the key to her survival. But with deceitful characters on all sides, can Roxana and Cassis trust each other enough to bring down the brutal Agreces?', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Psychological","Romance"}', '{"villainess","full-color","female-protagonist","isekai","body-horror","foreign","royal-affairs","gore","survival","assassins","ojou-sama","anti-hero"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 21182, '80', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx129210-3QmLApie5gYJ.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/129210-EWwjla5kQTeT.jpg', '#e43550', 129210, '147454', '{"Mongdang","Yoreumppit","Kin"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/129210-EWwjla5kQTeT.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Roxana Agriche", "native": "록사나 아그리체", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207021-lOPtlS198pEn.png"}, {"name": "Cassis Pedelian", "native": "카시스 페델리안", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207019-YnvZjm5n0XBG.png"}, {"name": "Sierra Agriche", "native": "시에라 아그리체", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207016-iBzBZyRkGqRU.jpg"}, {"name": "Lant Agriche", "native": "란트 아그리체", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207017-hTismQ7yQsiQ.png"}, {"name": "Jeremy Agriche", "native": "제레미 아그리체", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207018-ThSgoDuPCpwZ.png"}, {"name": "Dion Agriche", "native": "데온 아그리체", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b207020-7ArinjRnGgdJ.jpg"}, {"name": "Sylvia Pedelian", "native": "실비아 페델리안", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b228778-rhM5wWSw8sdd.png"}, {"name": "Noel Vertium", "native": "노엘 베르티움", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286353-xF5cjNKLGpLf.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '129210'),
('MANHWA', 'The Art of Reincarnation', 'Hwansaengui Jeongseok', '환생의 정석', 'Despite having only one arm, Daven had finally proven his worth after defeating his cousin Kazin in honorable combat. But Kazin took advantage of Daven’s mercy, stabbing him in the back and imprisoning him for life. 500 years later, the minor god Yulian is reborn and unknowingly summons Daven’s soul into the body of a young boy named Vincent Adenka. As the pair work to reveal the truth of Daven and Kazin, Vincent must relearn the art of combat while Yulian discovers the art of reincarnation.', '{"Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"}', '{"full-color","male-protagonist","swordplay","revenge"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 20924, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx153880-60zEJbCK4yQL.png', NULL, '#5d93e4', 153880, '150549', '{"Blue Jaengi","Sang-Kyeong Lee","Pyeong-Beom Kim"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Vincent Adenka", "native": "아덴카 빈첸", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b285404-2r0PiHZXkWGE.png"}, {"name": "Yulian", "native": "율리안", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b317866-YQXt47xep1oq.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '153880'),
('MANHWA', 'The Remarried Empress', 'Jaehon Hwanghu', '재혼 황후', 'Navier Ellie Trovi was an empress perfect in every way -- intelligent, courageous, and socially adept. She was kind to her subjects and devoted to her husband. Navier was perfectly content to live the rest of her days as the wise empress of the Eastern Empire. That is, until her husband brought home a mistress and demanded a divorce. “I accept this divorce… And I request an approval of my remarriage.” In a shocking twist, Navier remarries another emperor and retains her title and childhood dream as empress. But just how did everything unfold?', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"royal-affairs","female-protagonist","marriage","full-color","politics","cheating","shapeshifting","ojou-sama","heterosexual","long-strip","primarily-adult-cast","unrequited-love"}', NULL, '247', NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 20904, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx113055-pGB4A5nzhFdF.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/113055-DBbT3IccXVqx.jpg', '#a15d35', 113055, '123475', '{"Hieori","Sumpul","Alpha Tart"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/113055-DBbT3IccXVqx.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ryaFeiQxIPo/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ryaFeiQxIPo"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Navier Trobi", "native": "나비에 엘리 트로비", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b173730-T5kspK6DZFbt.png"}, {"name": "Henry Ales Lazlo", "native": "하인리 알레스 라즐로", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b173729-YZoXN8waQqnI.jpg"}, {"name": "Sovieshu Trobi Victo", "native": "소비에슈 트로비 빅트", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b190660-Q5Yvn53277wB.jpg"}, {"name": "Rashta Iskua", "native": "라스타 이스쿠아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b190661-E2lATYJOt8YP.jpg"}, {"name": "Koshar Trobi", "native": "코샤르 릴더 트로비", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b208374-RuEcTibkNfaD.jpg"}, {"name": "Kaufman", "native": "카프멘", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214643-enCH6fQu1r7v.jpg"}, {"name": "Christa", "native": "크리스타", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214651-0S9fAr1gJELN.png"}, {"name": "Paul McKenna", "native": "폴 맥켄나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b214652-XNH6NMiiJbE7.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '113055'),
('MANHWA', 'How to Win My Husband Over', 'Nampyeoneul Nae Pyeoneuro Mandeuneun Bangbeop', '남편을 내 편으로 만드는 방법', 'I thought I’d finally escaped my hellish life when I died in an airplane crash, but I fell into another nightmare when I awoke as Rudbeckia de Borgia, a minor villain from a historical novel destined to die at the hands of her husband, Iske van Omerta. Surviving with the dysfunctional Borgia family is hard enough, but now I have to marry the man who will kill me! Still, it’s okay, I just have to convince Iske, his family, and all his countrymen that I’m completely harmless! How hard can that be?', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"primarily-adult-cast","female-protagonist","marriage","full-color","heterosexual","bullying","isekai","villainess","suicide","arranged-marriage","demons","royal-affairs"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 20852, '81', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx141013-YZhKrs2IqxWY.png', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/141013-B21WXInAL6AM.jpg', '#d6ae5d', 141013, '148234', '{"Si-Ru","Tteok","Jjondik"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/141013-B21WXInAL6AM.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NXLdQpI0KbI/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NXLdQpI0KbI"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Rudbeckia de Borgia", "native": "루드베키아 데 보르히아", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b254452-uOYFcJV4JYc3.png"}, {"name": "Iske van Omerta", "native": "이스케 반 오메르타", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255954-bVBoPKAujYLj.png"}, {"name": "Cezar de Borgia", "native": "체시아레 데 보르히하", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315358-qOo3vK2qRZvT.png"}, {"name": "Elenia Van Omerta", "native": "엘레니아 반 오메르타", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315359-kLhVXwGE76Ba.png"}, {"name": "Freya Van Furiana", "native": "프레야 반 퓨리아나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b315360-RU3pTsDsmOYE.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '141013'),
('MANHWA', 'Descended from Divinity', 'Cheonmaneun Pyeongbeomhage Sal Su Eopda', '천마는 평범하게 살 수 없다', '“Is this a mission I was sent on by the gods? Or is this just divine punishment?”

Jung-Hyeok Baek, divine demon overlord of Murim, finds that he’s been reincarnated into the body of Roman Dimitri, the dim-witted son of a baron who’s obsessed with the luxuries of the aristocratic lifestyle. But with his new status, Jung-Hyeok is ready to shake things up on the continent of Salamander. Will the divine demon accomplish what he’s set out to do? And will he finally get the answers to this mysterious reincarnation?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"male-protagonist","isekai","full-color","war"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 20660, '77', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx136204-D4ON9gggIHeX.jpg', NULL, '#d6931a', 136204, '147847', '{"ZAINO","Cheol-Bum","Altoran"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A7ofWS9o2sc/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A7ofWS9o2sc"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Roman Dimitri", "native": "로만 드미트리", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b234864-Vwpxjmmr0zzv.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '136204'),
('MANHWA', 'A Stepmother’s Märchen', 'Eotteon Gyemonimui Marchen', '어떤 계모님의 메르헨', 'The marchioness Shuri Von Neuschwanstein is no stranger to hardship: her husband dies when she’s still a teenager, leaving her to manage his lands and raise his semi-grown children herself. Her stepchildren never warm up to her, and other nobles disparage her behind her back. Years later, however, it seems her efforts have finally paid off: her eldest stepson is to be married and take over the estate, freeing her of many responsibilities. But shortly after learning the cruel truth that she’s not invited to his wedding, she dies and wakes up on the day of her husband’s funeral seven years earlier! If Shuri is to live these seven difficult years all over again, she’s going to do things differently. Can she write her own fairy tale ending this time around?', '{"Drama","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"family-life","age-regression","female-protagonist","full-color","foreign","royal-affairs","politics","found-family","parenthood","heterosexual","ojou-sama","long-strip"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 20391, '82', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx111075-ZSqT1Z2XASRp.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/111075-nhA8EyUwQeBh.jpg', '#e4ae5d', 111075, '131008', '{"ORKA","Nyangiwa Hyangsillyo","Lauren Na"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/111075-nhA8EyUwQeBh.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Shuri von Neuschwanstein", "native": "슈리 폰 노이반슈타인", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167216-aOFKIBbRqvvm.png"}, {"name": "Jeremy von Neuschwanstein", "native": "제레미 폰 노이반슈타인", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b167217-Q0yDTgfn9pZM.png"}, {"name": "Norra von Nürnberger", "native": "노라 폰 뉘른베르", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168830-N2RxiSMtFdfT.png"}, {"name": "Theobald von Baden Bismarck", "native": "테오발트 폰 바덴 비스마르크", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168831-BNGTGKQzRYl2.png"}, {"name": "Elias von Neuschwanstein", "native": "엘리아스 폰 노이반슈타인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168832-bo3siPvWgV8g.png"}, {"name": "Rachel von Neuschwanstein", "native": "레이첼 폰 노이반슈타인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168833-jqh2GMb7RpLu.png"}, {"name": "Leon von Neuschwanstein", "native": "레온 폰 노이반슈타인", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168834-cNWw7VCXj9EP.png"}, {"name": "Ohera von Heinrich", "native": "오하라 폰 하인리히", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b168835-ailRIX9OB3NH.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '111075'),
('MANHWA', 'Seasons of Blossom', 'Cheongchun Blossom', '청춘 블라썸', 'Oh, to be young and in love. Oh, to be wild and carefree. The springtime of life is intense, tumultuous, and at times, oh so confusing. Spring, summer, fall and winter -- love blossoms in all seasons.', '{"Comedy","Drama","Romance"}', '{"ensemble-cast","primarily-teen-cast","coming-of-age","heterosexual","school","full-color","family-life"}', NULL, '130', '12', NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 20361, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx121565-JaDVhpjegXvw.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/121565-XOo9IHjQSYvK.jpg', '#f1c9bb', 121565, '145539', '{"HONGDUCK","NEMONE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/121565-XOo9IHjQSYvK.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jin-Yeong Choi", "native": "최진영", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210935-KjfvvhnE64jl.png"}, {"name": "Seon-Hui Kang", "native": "강선희", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210936-x9AzOOnqMfEn.jpg"}, {"name": "Bo-Mi Yun", "native": "윤보미", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210937-KBOgwutHX9gu.jpg"}, {"name": "Jae-Min Lee", "native": "이재민", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210938-6vO4jiig6xFN.png"}, {"name": "Ha-Min Lee", "native": "이하민", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210939-QDoWYZDFqnNB.png"}, {"name": "So-Mang Han", "native": "한소망", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210940-5OZXRdNHFIsg.png"}, {"name": "Jae-Hyeon Kim", "native": "김재현", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b210943-KdmxNBU4HgpR.png"}, {"name": "Ga-Eul Jin", "native": "진가을", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b287198-8jB4ep7muD6c.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '121565'),
('MANHWA', 'Return to Player', 'Return to Player', '리턴 투 플레이어', 'Ten years ago, a group of gods turned everyone on Earth into players of a sadistic game that forced them to kill monsters in real life -- or be killed themselves. Sehan Kim has already seen how this game will play out: everyone in the world dies except for him. When he’s given the chance to go back in time and start a second playthrough, Sehan is determined to change the course of events and beat the gods at their own game.', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"gods","male-protagonist","full-color","death-game","urban-fantasy","primarily-adult-cast"}', NULL, '250', NULL, NULL, '2020', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 20203, '72', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx124577-UkF19gsGyBoG.jpg', NULL, '#5d78e4', 124577, '147538', '{"UMKY","Sehon","Index"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IpGaKU0D4CU/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IpGaKU0D4CU"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Se-Han Kim", "native": "김세한", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b251540-1v3SoH675amO.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '124577'),
('MANHWA', 'The Martial God Who Regressed Back to Level 2', '2 Level Hoegwihan Musin', '2레벨로 회귀한 무신', 'Earth lost the fight for survival in the BattleNet system and humanity now faces eradication. However, Jihan Seong is given another chance. He has returned three years into the past before BattleNet became a life-or-death game. With his knowledge of the future, he’s determined to become the strongest player. Will Jihan be able to change the fate of humanity? And more importantly, can he protect the ones he loves from those who want him to fail?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"age-regression","death-game","male-protagonist"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 20110, '73', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx167834-QgyPJ7tOMGqA.png', NULL, '#e45d50', 167834, '161374', '{"Anyeonseong","Yoon-Goo Lee","Yeombi"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jihan Seong", "native": "성지한", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311528-cUlcHMteSMSz.png"}, {"name": "Gayeong Lim", "native": "임가영", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311526-cUjcRw8YPdLp.png"}, {"name": "Se-Ah Yoon", "native": "윤세아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311527-hHw2rvm06GPc.png"}, {"name": "Sejin Yoon", "native": "윤세진이", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311529-qxmVBLlJJF1K.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '167834'),
('MANHWA', 'Myst, Might, Mayhem', 'Goeryeok Nansin', '괴력 난신', 'All Jeong wants is a second chance – for revenge! His grandfather’s gruesome death has transformed him into the bloodthirsty and ruthless Scythe Demon. He will stop at nothing until he has killed the man responsible. Yet rage and determination alone are not enough. He must train in martial arts if he ever wants to stand a chance against such a formidable foe. Will he succeed in his revenge on the murderer of his grandfather?', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"anti-hero","male-protagonist","martial-arts","demons","wuxia","gore","ghost","long-strip","swordplay","full-color"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 20100, '83', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx175946-rx6eIfakvWYV.jpg', NULL, '#ffe435', 175946, '168980', '{"Mad Bird","Tae-Hyeong Kim","Hanjung Worya"}', '[{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2G0LozquT_Q/hqdefault.jpg", "kind": "trailer", "caption": "Trailer", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2G0LozquT_Q"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Gyeong-Un Mok", "native": "목경운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330105-uUBAWNBgLuf1.png"}, {"name": "Cheong-Ryeong", "native": "류소월", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b374629-xwuIUeP21dM2.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '175946'),
('MANHWA', 'My Bias Gets on the Last Train', 'Nae Choeaeneun Makchareul Tanda', '내 최애는 막차를 탄다', 'Every night, Yeo-Un takes the last train home—same route, same time, same routine. But one thing keeps catching his eye: a girl with a guitar and a presence that lingers in his mind. When a shared love for the indie band Long Afternoon sparks a conversation, their late-night encounters begin to turn into something more. But Hae-In isn’t just another fan—she’s the voice behind the band, a secret she can’t afford to reveal. As music draws them closer, the truth may threaten to pull them apart. When the final note plays, will their story end in harmony… or heartbreak?', '{"Drama","Romance"}', '{"heterosexual","primarily-adult-cast","band","work","long-strip","classical-music","full-color","urban","trains","female-protagonist","male-protagonist"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 19797, '85', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx187944-gzNbL7zeY7Ma.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/187944-G78YqHH7LkrR.jpg', '#e45da1', 187944, '178671', '{"JIXKSEE"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/187944-G78YqHH7LkrR.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Hae-In Sin", "native": "신해인", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b358012-uW8gARTJn4KQ.png"}, {"name": "Yeo-Un Lee", "native": "이여운", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b358013-KzYrn2V07cWg.png"}, {"name": "A-Reun Han", "native": "한아른", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b376294-1hxSIzhM3BWG.png"}, {"name": "Hyeon-Jae Seong", "native": "성현재", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b376296-RchmHAJgO8hA.png"}, {"name": "Yu-Ju Oh", "native": "오유주", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b376292-wxvQJz20LzbT.png"}, {"name": "Sin-Yeong Won", "native": "원신영", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b376293-qUuEdbbRyozE.png"}, {"name": "Hyeon-Seung Sin", "native": "신현승", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b376295-KjHOnSAy6Lnr.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '187944'),
('MANHWA', 'I Am the Sorcerer King', 'Naneun Madowangida', '나는 마도왕이다', 'Sung-Hoon Lee is nothing but a victim of a changing world, a powerless man in a land infested with beasts and magic. Monsters from another world invaded earth, and they brought with them a sickness that pushes Sung-Hoon’s mother into an endless sleep. To pay off her medical bills, he braved a dangerous job as bait used by powerful superhumans called Awakeners to hunt monsters. But when he found himself at death’s door, the image of his past life flashes through his mind. There, he found his truth: he is the reincarnation of the Sorcerer King!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"magic","full-color","survival","dungeon","cultivation","male-protagonist","isekai","gods"}', NULL, '143', NULL, NULL, '2019', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 19644, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx110042-cHMKKa0lxiaJ.png', NULL, '#f1780d', 110042, '148040', '{"MIRO","Decaspell"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Sung-Hoon Lee", "native": null, "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140758-z3QIy4RBlfSi.png"}, {"name": "Aina", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b203668-95SUhab2j7rf.jpg"}, {"name": "Ye-young Min", "native": "민예영", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b203669-jdcIzt2xMBA9.png"}, {"name": "Ye-Rim Seong", "native": "성예림", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b285180-6omIA6xlHa3l.jpg"}, {"name": "Donald Trump", "native": "도널드 트럼프", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b187219-QJU0SAKVoqdw.png"}, {"name": "Angela Merkel", "native": "앙겔라 메르켈", "role": "BACKGROUND", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b243485-LTrQBZ2Tr9WP.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '110042'),
('MANHWA', 'Her Summon', 'Geunyeoui Sohwansu', '그녀의 소환수', 'Due to a misuse of a word joke on live TV broadcast, girl group otaku, ''Jin-Kyung'' ended up becoming doxxed and labeled as a "child predator", and ended up getting Social Anxiety Disorder. 3 years later, because of his past incident from the 3D world, his love for only the 2D world manifested, and ended up becoming a "Shut-In Otaku"! Then one day, as Jin-Kyung was no-lifing as usual, he was summoned to ‘Another World’, and came face-to-face with a bright-eyed, hopeful Summoner… Interesting enough, in the world that Jin-Kyung was summoned to, his Social Anxiety Disorder disappeared, and he was also able to wield immense power, and became the strongest summoned being there ever was!! The story of a former girl group otaku turned powerful 2D otaku, and the story of a weak and feeble Summoner commences now!!!

- Chapter count includes a prologue. 

- The official English translation is 117 chapters as Toomics English platform tends to split chapters. Our total chapter count follows the Korean release.', '{"Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Mystery"}', '{"full-color","isekai","hikikomori","male-protagonist","magic","chuunibyou","demons","kaiju","otaku-culture","parody","assassins"}', NULL, '62', NULL, NULL, '2018', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 19635, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx107720-nIiuP9q4R1Uh.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107720-Ngc03SdYGiMG.jpg', '#43c9f1', 107720, NULL, '{"Jin-Jun Park"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107720-Ngc03SdYGiMG.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Jin Kyung", "native": null, "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b189796-XIISAsECIlZa.png"}, {"name": "Benny", "native": null, "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199255-XSN1R8frGWDi.jpg"}, {"name": "Ai Haze", "native": null, "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199258-yX0KEfNqXVPY.jpg"}, {"name": "Ayka", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199247-fcAfyDKvy39o.jpg"}, {"name": "Gria", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}, {"name": "Ronian", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199249-nyvwefhhrFiS.jpg"}, {"name": "Jake Maese", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199250-MVLMxWVhscz8.jpg"}, {"name": "Lua", "native": null, "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b199251-vglUEElgRY82.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '107720'),
('MANHWA', 'Time-Limited Genius Dark Knight', 'Sihanbu Cheonjae Amheukgisa', '시한부 천재 암흑기사', 'When there is no way out, the way is in. Doomed to die next month, our terminally ill protagonist Chan is too frail and defeated to try anything at all. No wonder he chooses to plunge himself into an RPG world he is only too familiar with. Why should this run be any different? Well, other than the fact that he will wake up inside the game and get struck with an existential epiphany that will make him fight tooth and nail to give Nox, his equally ill-fated RPG persona, a better chance? Maybe, it’s not over until it’s over.', '{"Action","Fantasy"}', '{"isekai","full-color","male-protagonist","magic","swordplay"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 19528, '71', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx165182-k4Jfk2XMkylP.jpg', NULL, '#c9c9f1', 165182, '159015', '{"Seon-Yul Jeong","Nagi","Fantera"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Nox von Lienhaber", "native": "녹스 폰 리인하버", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311373-DbAfe6nea1S7.jpg"}, {"name": "Zitri de Lobilia", "native": "지트리 드 로필리아", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311385-PNcrpRBB6xha.jpg"}, {"name": "Thalia von Stilliner", "native": "탈리아 폰 스틸라이너", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311386-UY6rdwFZIWeq.jpg"}, {"name": "Lona de Nero", "native": "로나 드 네로", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311384-Gc7EW1vZQP0b.png"}, {"name": "Eleanor de Rivalin", "native": "엘레노어 드 리발린", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b364155-0TeffG5kpCVp.jpg"}, {"name": "Luna", "native": "루나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378970-emIG4GKx5uTG.jpg"}, {"name": "Penelope von Ackheim", "native": "페넬로페 폰 아크하임", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378969-A5pXUi2KX6UQ.jpg"}, {"name": "Elina", "native": "엘리나", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b378967-0DCTYf7B3PXP.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '165182'),
('MANHWA', 'Doctor Elise: The Royal Lady with the Lamp', 'Oegwauisa Elise', '외과의사 엘리제', 'Jihyun is a master surgeon at the peak of her medical prowess. She’s made it her life’s mission to save lives in order to atone for the sins of her past life, but her dreams are cut short when her plane crashes in the middle of the Pacific. When Jihyun wakes up, she finds herself back in her first life as Elise de Clarence - the haughty nightmare of a girl who brought on her own tragic end. The new Elise, however, still has time to set things straight - with her newfound medical knowledge, the reformed Elise sets out to right the wrongs of her tragic first life!', '{"Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"}', '{"medicine","female-protagonist","war","full-color","isekai","heterosexual","love-triangle","royal-affairs"}', NULL, '156', '10', NULL, '2017', NULL, 'MANGA', 'FINISHED', 19507, '76', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx107918-dScBgkOyp8Rv.jpg', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107918-QjcaFhgXTNIe.jpg', '#f1bb5d', 107918, '130806', '{"Yu-In","mini"}', '[{"url": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/107918-QjcaFhgXTNIe.jpg", "kind": "banner", "caption": "Key visual"}]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Elise De Clorance", "native": "엘리제 드 클로랜스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135657-S5oHYHHVJnGa.jpg"}, {"name": "Linden De Romanoff", "native": "린덴 드 로마노프", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b135658-EZVU5Y0Rggfo.png"}, {"name": "Graham De Fallon", "native": "그레이엄 드 파론", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b322806-dJddplx6qndK.png"}, {"name": "Lenne De Clorance", "native": "렌 드 클로렌스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165374-eu1GvIIwbvWG.jpg"}, {"name": "Chris De Clorance", "native": "크리스 드 클로렌스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b165375-Sf3TaF7gg1uh.png"}, {"name": "El De Clorance", "native": "엘 드 클로랜스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b327833-S3VxFsNU0wJq.png"}, {"name": "Emily De Clorance", "native": "에밀리 드 클로랜스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b327836-3fk26yh9WpR4.png"}, {"name": "Yulian De Childe", "native": "유리엔 드 차일드", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b322802-u0sBrfG7KKwm.png"}]'::jsonb, 'anilist', '107918'),
('MANHWA', 'The Legendary Spearman Returns', 'Yeokdaegeup Changgisaui Hoegwi', '역대급 창기사의 회귀', 'Joshua Sanders, the legendary spearman who ended the brutal civil war, shattered the belief that one must wield a sword to be a master knight. He fought in the service of his friend, Emperor Caesar Van Briton, but it is all for naught when his fearful comrades try to kill him. He’s on the brink of death when his trusty weapon, Lukia, shines and propels him back to the stables of his childhood. With his mighty spear in hand, Joshua is dead set on revenge in this life!', '{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}', '{"age-regression","spearplay","revenge","male-protagonist","full-color","magic","necromancy"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021', NULL, 'MANGA', 'RELEASING', 19484, '67', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx141479-9h8eyaxyRZP8.jpg', NULL, '#f15d28', 141479, '149163', '{"Hu-Sang Jo","Studio Inus","Cho-seonsaengnim"}', '[]'::jsonb, '[{"name": "Joshua Sanders", "native": "조슈아 샌더스", "role": "MAIN", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b325756-iqsouBybQauZ.jpg"}, {"name": "Iselin Jean Rebrecca", "native": "이셀린 진 레브레카", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b392074-GOZneQDdXtvW.jpg"}, {"name": "Icarus", "native": "이카루스", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/default.jpg"}, {"name": "Cheryl De Fontie", "native": "샤를 디 폰티에", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b392072-DimJKN2Uar60.jpg"}, {"name": "Cerciarinne ben Britton", "native": "세르시아린 벤 브리튼 황녀", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b392075-tn2YpQVLZEMA.jpg"}, {"name": "Aphrodite Lilith", "native": "릴리스 아프로디테", "role": "SUPPORTING", "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298451-HqvXCNQGbvyD.png"}, {"name": "Seiren", "native": "세이렌", "role": "SUPPORTING", "